  ('zcrm_1579374000054764112', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647053', 'Lester Tang', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  Referral mentioned.  I am going to help them find the best cost and for thyroid lab work for Amy by comparing directlabs.com and hcbb sites for best price.  I told them it would be either tonight or tomorrow, they are just happy for the help. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-29 17:58:22', '2020-07-29 17:58:22'),
