  ('zcrm_1579374000054764102', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032016379', 'Maurine Killough', NULL, 'she wanted her plan....in writing and not just the notes that she took.  I told her I would reach out to Jennifer at RCI and ask for some guidelines. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-29 17:04:25', '2020-07-29 17:04:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054776026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881141', 'Nathan Butryn', NULL, '7-29-20 Nate left vm stating his wellness visit is 1x year and dr. fee is only $79! So, not worth the MEC he thinks. I agree.  I''ll let him know in vm now. Done, left vm telling him to leave as is without the MEC. He''s all set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-29 16:48:48', '2020-07-29 16:51:02'),
