  ('zcrm_1579374000054744084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044842532', 'Todd Bremner', NULL, 'Per Kelly''s request I called this member who was confused about his children going on the plan.  I advised that they would be on the plan eff 8/1 and that he was charged the $638 on 7/22 to reflect that change.  I also gave him the Redirect number for 1st point of contact.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-29 12:58:58', '2020-07-29 12:58:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054764062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010059019', 'Lewis Farrell', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  Mentioned Referral!  Sent preventative care templates and directlabs.com info. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-29 12:53:37', '2020-07-29 12:53:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054776011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779188', 'Jason LaPointe', NULL, '7-29-20 I just received an email with many of the same questions as Kelly mentioned above. But, it looks like she''s made progress with doing her pap screening. Next is mammogram and colonoscopy at the moment her membership is all changing. I will explain via email answering her questions.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-29 12:37:45', '2020-07-29 12:37:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054764057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045539150', 'maria molina', NULL, 'heard back from Jennifer- all but two line items in lab bill were diagnostic.  The bill has already been reprocessed so instead of paying for $1200 worth of bloodwork, Maria will be paying for $350.  She said in her email that she understands, but then asked if the "wellness"visit attached to the labwork would be covered because that is something that is due to her.  I again broke down the differences between preventive and diagnostic and how it all depends on the reason behind her visit and the conversation that she has with the doctor.  I asked her to send in the bill and EOB, and Jennifer and I would take a look at it to confirm what type of visit it was and if she will be responsible for the cost. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-29 12:17:04', '2020-07-29 12:17:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054764052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013677493', 'Caroline McClure', NULL, 'missed welcome call, voice mailbox full, sent her an email right away asking her to either get back to  me right away for her call, or to reschedule her call. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-29 12:11:20', '2020-07-29 12:11:20'),
