  ('zcrm_1579374000054776006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030706054', 'Sandra Haber', NULL, '7-29-20 Just talked with Sandra and she chose to add the MEC for wellness and HSA benefits. Realized the tax savings are worth the extra money, plus the wellness. She already tallied mammogram and wellness visit would be $220 each. Then was trying to determine cost of labs. Realized even if they cost $100, it''s still worth the MEC for the additional tax savings. I sent her the HSA set up instructions and told her to call Concierge is she has any questions while setting it up. She''s all set moving forward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-29 11:22:17', '2020-07-29 11:22:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054772008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000053968006', 'Michael Jones', NULL, 'Mike called because he wanted to know if he is still active because payment has not come out yet. I told him that the payment will be coming out in the next few days and he is still on for August 1 start. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-29 11:03:30', '2020-07-29 11:03:30'),
