  ('zcrm_1579374000054772003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007637033', 'Nancy Elgie', NULL, 'Nancy called in and asked what is going on with her plan because she did not make a choice. I was not made aware that if you do not fill out the conversion form that the member will be cancelled so I told her that she would just roll over. Not the case.  She said that Analisa her agent told her to call into here. When I said that I was going to put her back to Patti she screamed at me and said "No no no! I refuse to speak to her, is there anyone else I can speak to?" I told her what I thought that she would just roll over. I gave her name and number to Guillermo to call her back and let her know that she HAS to fill out the conversion form and make a choice otherwise she is going to be cancelled. She has been emailed 7 times and has not opened any of the emails about the change over. Guillermo or John is going to reach out to her and get it figured out. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-29 10:17:34', '2020-08-04 11:31:13'),
