  ('zcrm_1579374000054719016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012871160', 'Katie Roth', NULL, '7-28-20 Katie had an unexpected gynecological health event after she completed her conversion. She may need a surgery soon. Just did a bunch of blood work and ultrasound. She needs to stay on Sedera Access Plus since she''s already incurred a bunch of costs and possibly a lot more. I updated her app and sent it to Patti, John and Guillermo to adjust her account. Will be $1000/$534. They didn''t seem to think they''d been charged yet.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-28 17:33:05', '2020-07-28 17:33:05'),
