  ('zcrm_1579374000054661035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054986001', 'Ken Trombley', NULL, '7-27-20 Karen is interested in MPB CareZ as Individual! She is mostly unemployed now with just a small PT job as CNA but paid as W2. So, she can''t join Worksite. She doesn''t have any health issues or meds or anything. $1000/$324 best since turning 60 soon and price doubles with Sedera. Household income will be about $58K annualized for 2020. That gives them a $298 APTC and Bright Health Bronze Plus will be about $305.95. He wants catastrophic plan and to pay lowest monthly amount. Their total cost will be less than $650 while their income remains low. Planning to enroll on Monday Aug. 3rd.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-27 15:00:31', '2020-07-27 15:00:31'),
