  ('zcrm_1579374000054660033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009850101', 'Elizabeth Spano', NULL, 'Member submitted Member change form to update her address.  I will update in CRM and FTNI.  Member enrolling in Zion so this needs to be checked in E123 for correctness.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-27 13:20:21', '2020-07-27 13:20:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054628058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013798144', 'Erin La Grassa', NULL, 'Welcome call complete.  Mentioned referral.  Member insisted that she had the time for me but sounded like she was actively taking care of a busy household.  Member apologized for "being rude" and when I would pause and try to wait for whatever was happening with her kids...she would tell me to "go on, I''m listening."  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-27 13:17:58', '2020-07-27 13:17:58'),
