  ('zcrm_1579374000054661019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009850101', 'Elizabeth Spano', NULL, '7-27-20 Lizzie is choosing MPB CareZ without MEC $1000/$234. Wants wellness but will pay on own for that since she''s young and it shouldn''t cost more than that. She also updated her address on the separate Cognito form. She now understands how to use the membership. She was confused. Tried to get a COVID test for free and was charged. She needs to go back to the provider to fix that. She also did annual skin check and didn''t realize it''s not part of ACA compliant wellness items.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-27 11:16:36', '2020-07-27 11:22:14'),
