  ('zcrm_1579374000054661003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033102', 'Scott Byrne', NULL, '7-27-20 Scott is on blood pressure meds AND he had A-Fib March 2019. So, we agreed it''s too risky to move. He will choose Sedera Access Plus for next 3 years. He did not submit his A-Fib as need to Sedera. But, it''s on his medical record. He realizes it''s not worth the risk to move to MPB CareZ. He said he''s friends with Jamie Lagarde who follows him on Instagram. He decided for that reason too, perhaps he should keep Sedera.  $1000/$534. Complete.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-27 10:22:44', '2020-07-27 10:26:28'),
