  ('zcrm_1579374000054582155', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017925108', 'Cari Adams-Waneka', NULL, '7-24-20 Cari will choose $1000/ $199 MPB CareZ with DPC! Joining Dr. Lee''s practice. Will complete app tonight and join with Dr. Lee next week. She will encourage Em to join as well. She thinks she''s 1099 and W2 employee so price likely the same at $199 for her. Cari should be set assuming she can get the site to work.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-24 17:32:10', '2020-07-24 17:32:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054576128', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045539150', 'maria molina', NULL, 'called to see if shingles vax was covered, and is going to send me and EOB of bld wrk that was taken at a preventative care obgyn visit. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-24 17:24:24', '2020-07-24 17:24:24'),
