  ('zcrm_1579374000054576118', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010342011', 'Marta Vera Wenokor', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!   This was not an easy welcome call, they kept pressing me about needs submission and did NOT like the fact that I couldn''t give them the logistics behind Zion''s process....I apologized and told them that Wendy would only be able to tell them the same thing, unless she found out more today.  I also got this fun question - "In this uncertain climate of Covid 19 is Zion prepared to handle the financial hit?"  I told them, that they would need to ask Wendy this question because I was a Concierge/Welcome call employee. I am going to share my notes with Wendy....I think that they are probably difficult for her as well.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-24 17:07:50', '2020-07-24 17:07:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054576113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028177427', 'James Wilson', NULL, 'James called in with a strange email from Sedera...I forwarded it to Patti to take a look at.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-24 17:01:26', '2020-07-24 17:01:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054582142', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054641074', 'Kerek Swanson', NULL, '7-24-20 Kerek is 42 and runs own biz as LLC for past few years. No pre-x, no tobacco, no meds, only does annual wellness occasionally and no HSA. Wants the $234/$1000 IUA level worksite MPB CareZ No MEC. Paying $450-$500 with Anthem now and cancelling for end of Aug. This will begin Sept. 1st, 2020. He''s all set to go!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-24 16:40:55', '2020-07-24 16:40:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054577199', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011307064', 'Thomas White-O''Connor', NULL, 'Called back to confirm that they knew ...no preventative was available with new plan.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2020-07-24 16:26:04', '2020-07-24 16:26:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054582137', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521486', 'Ryan Ashley', NULL, '7-24-20 Ryan and family have a membership with Nextera! His monthly cost will now be $492 a month at $1000 IUA plus cost of Nextera. Completed application again bc it didn''t go through the first time. Worked out better since he didn''t know about discount with DPC. He''s all set now moving forward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-24 16:17:45', '2020-07-24 16:17:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054582132', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014189260', 'Quentin Green III', NULL, '7-24-20 Quentin wants the most basic option and no wellness/no HSA. He just wants this in case of accident. MPB CareZ without the MEC at $2500/$159. Send him instructions and he''ll complete it when he gets home.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-24 15:57:15', '2020-07-28 12:38:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054576108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008639011', 'Ken Parsons', NULL, 'Fran called wondering why an amount was deducted from her account.  I told her that it was because she had a plan with us.  She said that they had assumed that by not renewing- they would be cancelled.  I sent her a cancellation form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-24 15:52:38', '2020-07-24 15:52:38'),
