  ('zcrm_1579374000054582122', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012535018', 'Rodney Brandenburg', NULL, '7-24-20  Sara Brandenburg had put in a separate application that we need to disregard. Sara is eligible to remain on Rodney and Lori''s membership for one more month before she turns 26. She is still a dependent on her parents taxes and without a job. She will either cancel or convert to her own membership by Aug. 20th. Sorry for the multiple changes. This is the final decision.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-24 15:19:23', '2020-07-24 15:19:23'),
