  ('zcrm_1579374000054582029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521534', 'Steven Russell', NULL, '7-24-20 Lauren had a bad fall and broke her neck! She just had another surgery last week to finish treatment. Done with PT and still have bills flowing in from everything. They''ve been really happy with Sedera thus far!  I suggested they stay with Sedera until neck issues and bills are complete. He doesn''t believe there will be any more issues with neck now moving forward. He will hold tight until they are confident it''s all done. Will complete conversion now to Sedera Access Plus.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-24 10:55:54', '2020-07-24 10:55:54'),
