  ('zcrm_1579374000054582003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610440', 'Kreston Rohrig', NULL, '7-24-20 Kreston is choosing MPB CareZ with MEC $1000/$636 ES. Kelli has some autoimmune issues and no diasnosis. They want the best membership. They are working with a Naturopath now and think traditional medicine is crap.  He''s less worried about paying the IUA again than having the best plan and HSA compliance and wellness.  He''s happy with his choice.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-24 10:14:23', '2020-07-24 10:18:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054539159', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610440', 'Kreston Rohrig', NULL, 'Member called into to speak to Wendy about making a decision.  He wanted to get enrollment done so I answered some questions for him.  He shared that his wife had an ongoing need so I told him that he must stay w/Sedera.  Gave him pricing &amp; explained changes that Sedera will be going through in the future.  He to speak to Wendy before submitting.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-24 10:04:27', '2020-07-24 10:04:27'),
