  ('zcrm_1579374000054539061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011509108', 'Sunday Phillips', NULL, 'Got a call from this member and she was wondering why she got charged for her service when she hadn''t made a decision as of the time of billing.  She made many excuses for not making a decision.  She finally told me that she would be cancelling her plan.  I will refund her the Aug Pmt.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-23 13:04:49', '2020-07-23 13:04:49'),
