  ('zcrm_1579374000054562118', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740178', 'Rebecca Near', NULL, '7-23-20 Spoke with Becky regarding her daughter who needs coverage for a month or two before she gets a FT job. She''s earning about $15K-$20K now, so I recommended C4. She was thankful and wants to discuss with husband if they want help. It may not be worth my time. She seems to want to do it alone. I also sent her the Needs Processing doc to know what to do if/when have a new Need. They want to be dialed in. All set and thankful for the help!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-23 12:59:31', '2020-07-23 12:59:31'),
