  ('zcrm_1579374000054518003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003413005', 'Jennah Synnestvedt', NULL, '7-22-20 Jennah had chosen an Anthem plan for $328.31 Bronze Pathway X HMO HSA with $6850 ded. She now understands that won''t be better for her long run. She now chose the MPB CareZ without MEC and knows she will pay self-pay if/when does her annual physical. It should cost less than $720! So, makes sense. She will pay from HSA but not fund HSA. She was billed already for MPB group at old price. Asking Patti to stop that payment and update it to new membership. Also asking to wait until Friday to make sure she has the money in that account!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-22 17:50:23', '2020-07-22 17:50:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054494071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990490', 'Megan Clark', NULL, 'I called Megan it went to vm, she called me back.....she hadn''t filled out the form yet because she was getting stuck on the technical end of things.  She was in the car, or else I would''ve helped her through the process.  I told her to call Guillermo tomorrow and that he would help her fill out the form.  She was thrilled about that.  Just a really busy lady!  I am sending her another welcome call scheduler in the mean time. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-22 17:25:57', '2020-07-22 17:25:57'),
