  ('zcrm_1579374000054494046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019362044', 'Therese Antonino', NULL, 'I have been trying to contact Therese all day because she had scheduled a welcome call but there was no form filled out.  I reached out to her earlier in the day about this and sent a link so that she can fill out the form and we could do her welcome call.  She never emailed me back, nor filled out the form as requested.  I just tried calling her at the time slot she requested and it sounded like she picked up the phone and ended the call.  I reached out to Jane about this, but I got a response on the fact that she will be out of town for the next 7 days.  Waiting on member to fill out form....or not.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-22 15:13:50', '2020-07-22 15:13:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054494041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010857037', 'Ilan Brown', NULL, 'I called Ilan for his welcome call, but he wanted to add back on the MEC.  He wanted to reschedule the call until he knows how to make that happen.   I reached out to Patti for some advice on what he can do and what he needs to do. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-22 14:43:26', '2020-07-22 14:43:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054494036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919089', 'Nancy Hoglund', NULL, 'Nancy called in and thought her appointment was for today, but it is in a week from now.  I told her I could give her a call after my last scheduled call, but that isn''t going to work for her and she''ll keep her appointment for next week. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-22 14:27:27', '2020-07-22 14:27:27'),
