  ('zcrm_1579374000054499003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028448053', 'Jonathan Brumbaugh', NULL, '7-22-20 He''s deciding to remain with Sedera in case there''s anything more related to his hospital stay and migraine diagnosis. He''ll feel it out for next few months. If everything remains clean and clear, he''ll consider moving later. But, safest to stay with Sedera since Need is open and will not be considered pre-x. He''s all set and will convert to MPB Sedera Access Plus for $281/$1000.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-22 12:42:04', '2020-07-22 12:42:04'),
