  ('zcrm_1579374000054452054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990181', 'Beatrice Buchholz', NULL, 'Welcome call complete.  Paul Cholak was checking on Naturopathic for her but didn''t hear anything back. I provided her Zion Health phone number and from what on saw in guidelines on Zion health site is sharable pending written approval from  Zion Health. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-07-22 12:00:32', '2020-07-24 09:47:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054463013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042007131', 'Kristin Smith', NULL, '7-22-20 Kristin was super frustrated by Redirect bc she did her annual wellness visit yesterday and the provider hasn''t been paid yet. Today she went in to do her mammogram and followed the procedures exactly. Redirect told her to call them when she was in the office to make payment but they didn''t answer the phone when she called. She wasn''t allowed to proceed until they received payment. So, she anxiously awaited for Redirect to return her call which they finally did and made the payment. It was too stressful for her to be required to sit in waiting room until Redirect called back to complete the payment and hold up the entire process.  She wants to review her options for changing membership. She is part of Assoc and I told her renewal will be coming up soon. She can switch then if she wants. She was happy with that answer.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-22 11:43:45', '2020-07-22 11:43:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054452049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019362002', 'Deb Bear', NULL, 'Spoke to member she said she spoke to Jane Kassel already and she said she needed to speak to John Kach about questions that she had. Member did''t want to do her scheduled call she wants to Speak to John when he is available. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-07-22 11:30:29', '2020-07-22 11:30:29'),
