  ('zcrm_1579374000054463008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028448053', 'Jonathan Brumbaugh', NULL, '7-22-20 Jonathan might choose MPB CareZ without the MEC. Filing his wellness visit with the MEC was a huge hassle last time to get the bills coded correctly and he wasted a ton of time on that. So, he''ll likely forego that and pay cash if chooses to do another annual wellness visit. He has a hospital visit in April which they now diagnosed as migraines. Originally thought mini TIA but further looking they decided migraines. He also has stomach issues which they call IBS, but just changing diet to address that. He''s going to ponder if he wants to stay with Sedera for $275 and grandfathered with new health issue, ie. no pre-x or move to MPB CareZ without MEC at $234/$1000. Will submit app today. Was out of town until now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-22 10:42:26', '2020-07-22 10:42:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054445018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830079', 'Jose Hernandez', NULL, 'Jose called in and was wanting to go see a doctor about a pain that he is having and I tried explaining to him that he is currently in the conversion time and that either way he would have to pay out of pocket because it is a injury/illness type of situation. I tried explaining to him this and he was not understanding. Patti came up to me and said to put Jose into her and she will explain what he needs to do. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-22 10:39:21', '2020-07-22 10:39:21'),
