  ('zcrm_1579374000054445013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049898077', 'Debbie Thibault', NULL, 'Earl called in and said that he got an email from Sedera saying that for the age up of turning 60 their payment amount was supposed to go up and nothing has happened yet. I let Patti know and she said she will look into and get back with him when she can. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-22 10:13:35', '2020-07-22 10:13:35'),
