  ('zcrm_1579374000054340018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014508197', 'Jose Ernesto Rodriguez aleman', NULL, 'Spoke to Joanna.  Ernesto is having neurological issues - 2 hospital visits due to partial paralysis.  No diagnosis yet.  Recommended she stay in the MPB group until they have a diagnosis.  Will convert in August for Sept. 1st.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2020-07-21 12:32:11', '2020-07-21 12:32:11'),
