  ('zcrm_1579374000054343003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610622', 'Leif Anderson', NULL, 'called for his 15 min welcome call- left message on machine, I will send out another scheduler if I do not hear back from him soon. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-21 12:03:51', '2020-07-21 12:03:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054340003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052659223', 'James Julian', NULL, 'Stephanie called in and said she is new to this and came from regular Insurance. She is filling out paper work for her son to play football and the form is asking for all sorts of info from us. An Id number, group number, Insurance name, ect.. I put the call back to Patti and she let her know that with what she has there is none of that because it is NOT insurance.  Patti told her that she can send her a letter that Sedera has put together for situations like this. It is a waiver for insurance to the organization that the member is signing up their child for and it explains why she has chosen this type of health care. She also said this is the 2nd month she has been billed for her plan and she has gotten nothing from us, as a card, ect.. Patti let her know that we are still currently revamping the emails that go out and she will get a QR Life Code card from us and everything she will need in the near future. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-21 11:56:00', '2020-07-21 11:56:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054339003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610190', 'Andrea Lowery', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-07-21 11:54:58', '2020-07-21 11:54:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054330006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034059029', 'Michele Westmoreland', NULL, '7-20-20 Michele is staying with Sedera bc of husband''s pending knee surgery within the next year, hopefully before he turns 60 and price doubles. That''s their goal at least. Then they might switch bc they really want HSA and wellness back. She''s also cancelling Callie off of membership bc CSU won''t allow MCS even though all classes are online this semester. So sad.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-21 11:54:44', '2020-07-21 11:54:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054309018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862262', 'Pete Scifo', NULL, '7-21-20 Pete is choosing the MPB CareZ w/ MEC for wellness and HSA compliance. Has early onset diabetes and is taking meds and changing diet. Moving to Medicare in Dec. 2020. $344/$1000. Wife is 65 already.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-21 11:40:17', '2020-07-21 11:42:30'),
