  ('zcrm_1579374000054290058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044342154', 'Samantha Jansky', NULL, 'I had a Kalen Osterwich call in and he said that he was refereed by Samantha to call in and see about getting something with us for just a child, I let him know we do not do just children and then he asked about him and his child. I said of course and took down his info and called Wendy, who is Samantha''s agent, and gave all his info and she said she will work on giving him a call back as soon as she can. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-21 10:57:06', '2020-07-21 10:57:06'),
