  ('zcrm_1579374000054290048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243610', 'Paula Chavez', NULL, 'Paula called in and asked for me to look up a prescription that she needs to get for her colonoscopy. It is a Suprep Bowel Kit. She said at King Soopers they are quoting her $107 and I found at a CVS for $94.44. She said she would just go with King Soopers and thanked me for looking that up for her. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-21 10:32:43', '2020-07-21 10:32:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054309003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011910001', 'John Singleton', NULL, '7-20-20 Spoke with Ann again and she was frustrated bc the new membership sounds crappy compared to what they had previously. BUT, her son will need an eye surgery and they are waiting to get through the pre-x waiting period to pass year 3 into year 4 to gain unlimited sharing. Then she wants to switch to MPB CareZ with MEC and HSA. Was super bummed to lose both of those. Wished they could split the family but it''s not allowed.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-21 10:32:34', '2020-07-21 10:32:34'),
