  ('zcrm_1579374000054258015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059494057', 'Randall Wilson', NULL, 'Angela called in again for about the 5th time now. She has called multiple times saying that she now refuses to speak to Rick Willard who  is her Agent because he did NOT clarify  what an IUA is or anything about the plan to her. When Patti told her to speak wit Rick that is when she got upset and said she will not and she wants clarification from someone here. Kelly Cheever called her yesterday to set up and have a Welcome Call and she said she pretty much had the welcome call right then and there on the phone. I guess that was not good enough for her so she called in today again saying she HAS to get clarification of what a Need is and what the IUA is and how it works. Patti explained it to her and she thinks she gets it and she is just complaining that she does not have any material, specifically a "Card".  She is not understanding this at all. Guy Travis spoke with Rick yesterday and told him that he needs to call Angela and get all of this figured out because she is not happy.  After Patti spoke with Angela a few minutes ago she called Guy to see if he spoke with Rick and apparently he did but Angela refuses to deal with him... -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-21 09:01:45', '2020-07-21 09:01:45'),
