  ('zcrm_1579374000054206043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013822067', 'Christian Bates', NULL, 'Christian called in again with more technical questions I couldn''t answer.  I gave him Patti''s phone number to reach out to her tomorrow.  He asked for one more day and I told him he could have it.  He has been working so hard all day trying to understand this, and I know that because he has a pre x that this is not an easy  decision.  I let Paul and Patti know about all of this. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-20 19:09:38', '2020-07-20 19:09:38'),
