Sent by Patti Baron on 7/20/2020', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-20 12:57:02', '2020-07-20 12:57:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054155038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003899005', 'Jane Kassel', NULL, 'Jane let me know that she would like to cancel her Redirect plan and now go on the ASi MEC.   Also raise her IUA to $1500.  I will let Sedera know cancel her Redirect and bill her accordingly', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-20 12:38:47', '2020-07-20 12:38:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054186003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047282132', 'Amanda Hoskins', NULL, 'Ticket was made, member is all set. Here is what was said:
Called Amanda back and she said she was just trying to make an appointment for something going on with her back. I explained to her how that works and that is considered Injury/Illness. She is responsible for the first $500 of her IUA and after that if there are going to be multiple appointments and over the $500 she is to keep all of her receipts and bills and submit those into Sedera and open up a "Need". She pays the $500 out of pocket and then submit everything else into Sedera and they will take care of the rest of the bills and appointments. I told her I would email her an email that describes how she goes about submitting her bills and starting the Need process. She was perfectly ok with that and than I explained the other portion of her plan on what is 100% covered as preventative. She has no MEC so there are only 3 things that Sedera will cover and reimburse her for Colonoscopy screening, mammogram screening, and childhood immunizations. I told her that yes she does pay out of pocket but she is to also submit the billing into Sedera and they will 100% reimburse her the full amount that she paid, she does not have anything to do with the IUA or anything like that, she gets the full amount reimbursed. She understood everything and was very sweet and said it all makes sense to her and will call Sedera shortly to tell them about her back issue because she did say it will be multiple appointments. Ticket Closed, member is all set and fully understands what to do. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-20 12:32:47', '2020-07-20 12:32:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054155033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055816005', 'Christopher Coppage', NULL, 'Sales Lead found out about us from Forbes Article', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-20 12:21:22', '2020-07-20 12:21:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054174051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054542379', 'Michael Vactor', NULL, '7-20-20 Most interested in tax benefits. She''s going to call husband now and call me back to proceed.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-20 12:15:48', '2020-07-20 12:15:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054174046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939079', 'Patricia Mitchell', NULL, '7-20-20 Patricia has a bulging and herniated disc and knows pre-x clause re back. Take meds to keep inflammation down. Hasn''t been treated for past few years.  She is 64 and will hope not to have any problems. Choosing MPB CareZ with MEC $1000/$344 for wellness and HSA.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-20 12:02:31', '2020-07-20 12:02:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054174041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054286201', 'Brian Pierce', NULL, '7-20-20 Brian joined  MPB CareZ as Individual $1000/$274.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-20 11:51:17', '2020-07-20 11:51:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054174036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862412', 'Joy Lanzano', NULL, '7-20-20 Joy is member of Nextera. She''s converting to MPB CareZ with DPC at $199 month.  She''s going to get letter from Nextera showing proof of membership and she should be good to go.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-20 11:49:39', '2020-07-20 11:49:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054174031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054286250', 'Sean Barrett', NULL, '7-20-20  Brian is joining MPB CareZ Worksite since self-employed. He chose $1000/$209 MPB CareZ to avoid near future price increase by Sedera and bank account, etc.  Understands no wellness included.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-20 11:27:30', '2020-07-20 11:27:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054176013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011809076', 'Phil McGee', NULL, 'Tried to reach out to member no response. Left detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-07-20 11:17:01', '2020-07-20 11:17:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054155028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881351', 'Ronald Stear', NULL, 'Member called in with questions.  I answered and she to submit.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-20 11:06:55', '2020-07-20 11:06:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054174023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675034', 'Faith Ketterer', NULL, '7-20-20 Faith is bummed about the $50 price jump. She will opt into MPB CareZ with MEC $1000/$344. She may shop around and I told her to talk with me first if she finds something because some of the options I wouldn''t recommend.  She''s super nice! No pre-x except cholesterol meds.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-20 11:01:05', '2020-07-20 11:04:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054174018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919520', 'Dechen Hawk', NULL, '7-20-20 Laura and Dechen will close out their Needs over the next few months, by Oct likely at the latest. Choosing $500 IUA / $575.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-20 10:52:30', '2020-07-20 10:52:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054174013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521350', 'Shane Michael Sorensen', NULL, '7-20-20 Shane chose price for EF by accident, not ES. I changed the app to reflect ES $1000/$636, NOT $806.50.  He''s all set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-20 10:34:36', '2020-07-20 10:34:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054176008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610380', 'Laura Watson', NULL, 'Tried to reach out to member no response. Left detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule the call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-07-20 10:32:33', '2020-07-20 10:32:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054155023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054154038', 'Brady Barela', NULL, 'Member Only $500 18-29 MPB Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-20 10:30:57', '2020-07-20 10:30:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054174008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013590042', 'Donald J. Hinz Jr.', NULL, '7-20-20 Don called and I coached him through the process. No pre-x. Never used membership. He will likely choose MPB CareZ with MEC. $344/$1000.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-20 10:03:02', '2020-07-20 10:03:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054155018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016570002', 'Michael Wisner', NULL, 'Member called in and needed to be stepped through the plan.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-20 09:39:31', '2020-07-20 09:39:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054178003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059494057', 'Randall Wilson', NULL, 'I called Angela per Patti to schedule a welcome call, I had the time and though I would just offer to do one on the spot with her.  She was very pleased with this, very hungry to learn but there was a problem right off of the bat.  She agreed that the $2500 was her IUA- she added "yes $2500 deductible, one for my husband and myself, after that everything is covered."  I corrected her and she was in shock, she kept saying over and over "NO! this is unacceptable, this is unacceptable, that was never what I heard." 
I told her that it may be best to transfer her to her Health Care Advisor- she said that it wouldn''t make a difference because he would direct her back to us anyway.
The member told me that she would have never cancelled her traditional health insurance if she knew how the $2500 IUA worked, I told her that I didn''t know for certain, but there may be a possibility that the IUA could be lowered, she really liked that idea.  I told her that I would need to speak to Patti about this first however and that I wasn''t promising anything concrete.
I spoke to Patti and she told me that was a no go,  she also asked that I speak to Guy about this matter as well, Guy will be reaching out to Rick after the conference call.  I am going to check in with Patti and Guy when I am back on shift later this afternoon, so I know if I will continue with a welcome call or not. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-20 09:37:39', '2020-07-20 09:37:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054176003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521590', 'Sherrie Lynne Vantongeren', NULL, 'Spoke to member rescheduled call for Wednesday, August 12, 2020 at 12:00 noon est. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-07-20 09:07:40', '2020-07-20 09:07:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054174003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919812', 'Mary Beth Hassett', NULL, '7-20-20  Playing phone tag with her to help with conversion.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-20 08:48:52', '2020-07-20 08:48:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054155013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059494057', 'Randall Wilson', NULL, 'Member called because since we were having issues with outgoing email we were unable to send her the Payment update form &amp; her credit card was charged.  Also she is waiting to be sent the Welcome Call scheduler', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-20 07:56:51', '2020-07-20 07:56:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054155008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052755252', 'Jared Burbidge', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation form.  I will cancel with Sedera &amp; billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-20 07:50:01', '2020-07-20 07:50:01'),
