  ('zcrm_1579374000054132013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862130', 'Marion Steed', NULL, 'called for some assistance getting through the conversion form.  I told her that she can call me back if she gets stuck. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-17 17:47:33', '2020-07-17 17:47:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054132008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659360', 'Rachel Brenneman', NULL, 'I sent Rachel the member change form for her last name change, I let her know that she will go over with her present name and after we get everyone enrolled next month we can change it.  I told her to add in the comments section "name change" per Patti- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-17 16:38:19', '2020-07-17 16:38:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054132003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447017', 'Carmen Denise Patryas', NULL, 'Denise called in for some help getting through the conversion form but her computer kept freezing at odd places on the agreement page and not letting her move forward.  I felt bad.  She refreshed the page 4 times and then finally I told her I would speak to John and then give her a call back.  John said that it may be due to her browser, or because she needs to delete the cookies in the browser.  I called her back and she was in the car, I told her what John said, she is going to try working on it after a few things she needs to do for work right now.  I told her that I would be here until 9est, and that she should give me a call to keep me in the loop, and between myself and Wendy- we''ll figure out a way to help her. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-17 16:25:34', '2020-07-17 16:25:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054116072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010342011', 'Marta Vera Wenokor', NULL, 'called Bill to let him know that we were sorry for the glitch that happened with a welcome call that they were on, but didn''t show on our end.  I offered to help him reschedule the call, but he told me that they already had done it.  I found it scheduled for next Thursday at 1:30 which made him very happy that we were both on the same page with that.  I called his vm after, per his request and left our main line if he had any troubles, I also told him that this would not be a video call but a phone call. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-17 14:48:31', '2020-07-17 14:48:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054116067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659360', 'Rachel Brenneman', NULL, 'Rachel asked for a bit of help getting through the online form, and I walked her through it.  She also wanted to change her last name because she has gone through a divorce.  The new last name is Brenneman.  I am seeing if Patti can make this change without a form or not.', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-17 14:39:35', '2020-07-17 14:39:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054116062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919118', 'Ellen Denny', NULL, 'called to make sure that her conversion form was submitted.  I searched for it and let her know that it was. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-17 14:37:41', '2020-07-17 14:37:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054126023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993452', 'Holly Wiese', NULL, 'Member called in w/questions about the filling out of the form.  I stepped her through it.   Explained the #4 attestaion.  She will submit.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-17 14:09:58', '2020-07-17 14:09:58'),
