  ('zcrm_1579374000054129003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033139', 'Kim Rew', NULL, '07.17.20:  Kevin Popps called.  Had more questions about the conversion plans. Discussed getting MEC or not. He asked for list of preventive services - emailed link to him.  Said he''d make a decision and enroll by the 20th.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-07-17 13:52:27', '2020-07-17 13:52:27'),
