  ('zcrm_1579374000054116057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740129', 'Julia (Wieck) Hardy', NULL, '7-17-20 Followed up bc never saw app. Redid it bc browser was just spinning. All set now. $2500/$561 ES with MEC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-17 13:10:19', '2020-07-17 13:10:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054116052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011910001', 'John Singleton', NULL, '7-17-20 Ann has sleep apnea that is an open need. Son may need eye surgery by the time he''s 13 and he''s 7 now. Choosing $500/$817 EF 40-49.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-17 13:05:16', '2020-07-17 13:05:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054126008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752067', 'Michael Brown', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  They have been cancelled w/Sedera &amp; billing cancelled.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-17 12:58:17', '2020-07-17 12:58:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054092033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521183', 'Samuel Conklin', NULL, 'Debbie called in and Patti answered the phone. She had some questions about what to choose for the new conversion that is going on. Patti led her to the right choices and she will be filling the form out asap. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-17 12:56:52', '2020-07-17 12:56:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054116047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919591', 'James Jordan', NULL, '7-17-20 James is healthy and wife has colitis. Just treating with diet now. Might need colonoscopy as preventative. Told him to include the MEC for that. He''s thinking of going with $2500/$436 to bring cost down. They never go to doctor but want wellness and HSA.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-17 12:50:41', '2020-07-17 12:50:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054116042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740129', 'Julia (Wieck) Hardy', NULL, '7-17-20 Julia is all set. Just finished applying she said.  But, I don''t see her app yet. Keep an eye out...', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-17 12:38:47', '2020-07-17 12:38:47'),
