  ('zcrm_1579374000054116037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830168', 'Laura Zaunbrecher', NULL, '7-17-20 ES $1000 MPB CareZ $536 with MEC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-17 12:30:54', '2020-07-17 12:30:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054116032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752067', 'Michael Brown', NULL, '7-17-20 Linda and husband chose to go with Altrua. They like the offerings better and not having to be self pay. She has heard Altrua may take a while to reimburse. They told her 65 days. She said a friend had troubles getting all $ from Sedera supposedly. I don''t know. Not worth arguing with her. Her mind was made up. Told her to complete cancellation form and she was doing it now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-17 12:19:20', '2020-07-17 12:19:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054116024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830414', 'Ann Wilkinson', NULL, '7-17-20 Ann is choosing MPB CareZ with MEC EC $636/$1000 IUA. Left her a vm to select that.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-17 12:09:23', '2020-07-17 12:11:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054116016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083191', 'Greg Haarburger', NULL, '7-17-20 Greg is choosing MPB Sedera Access Plus at $1000/$333 EO.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-17 11:51:13', '2020-07-17 11:51:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054092028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001853007', 'Scott Swannie', NULL, 'Monica called in and just wanted to know what are the services that come with the $50 charge a month. I explained to her and she said that she doesn''t really use any of those and when she tried signing up with Teladoc 6 months ago they had no clue who they were and did not have any of Monica or Scott''s info on file and it was just a nightmare. She then talked about how god awful Liberty is and that is has just been terrible with them and she just wanted to know what the cancellation process is. I explained it to her and she said to send the cancellation form and she will hold on to it for now. She asked if there were any possible other options for her and I said of course we here at MPowering offer many other options. I told her that she would need to get  back in contact with Wendy who is their agent and she can defiantly go over the best options for them. I gave Wendy''s phone number and I let Monica know I would send Wendy an email as well just letting her know their situation and to contact Monica and Scott when she has a moment to discuss other options for them. Monica said I was very helpful and nice to give her the info that I could give. I let her know it might be a few days until Wendy would get in touch because of this new conversion we are going through right now. She said no worries and not to rush, just wanted to speak about other options. Very sweet lady. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-17 11:33:45', '2020-07-17 11:33:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054116008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165413', 'Irene (Renee) Barbeau', NULL, '7-17-20 Renee is working for a company that does target ads and wants to know if I''m interested. I told her no, I have more business than I can handle now. Renee is interested in referring her friends to me. She has Kaiser through work now. I''ll send her MPB Care+ and MPB CareZ emails.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-17 11:32:30', '2020-07-17 11:32:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054112013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000053968006', 'Michael Jones', NULL, 'Spoke to member rescheduled call for Thursday, August 6, 2020 at 10:00 a.m pacific time/1:00mp.m. est. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-07-17 11:08:55', '2020-07-17 11:08:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054116003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007427003', 'Timothy Nichols', NULL, '7-17-20 Tim is 58. He has a neck issue and paid for MRI on his own. Hasn''t submitted anything to Sedera. Paid for wellness as self-pay. Didn''t understand to show card it sounds like. He funds an HSA and paid for it that way. He thought he had a $5K or $7K ded. Was surprised to hear it''s only $1000 per incident. He''s going to choose MPB Carez with MEC $1000/$344. He will call me shortly to enroll. Tim understands the pre-x clause and he''s ok with it. He has lateral stenosis and doesn''t plan to do any surgery.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-17 10:54:31', '2020-07-17 12:03:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054112008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779589', 'Jennifer Anderson', NULL, 'Spoke to member rescheduled call for Monday, August 3, 2020 at 12:00 noon est. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-07-17 10:47:27', '2020-07-17 10:47:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054092023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059494057', 'Randall Wilson', NULL, 'Angela called in twice today and has no clue about anything. I first gave her Redirect''s phone number because that is always a member''s first point of contact. She called them and left a message. She said she does not have a medical need that needs to be taken care of. She needs information about this plan and she has nothing that tells her anything. She was told by Rick Willard her agent to call into here to get that. I was very confused on what she was asking and put the call back to Patti. I sent her via email a Welcome Call Scheduler to fill out so someone can call her on a day and time to go over the whole plan with her. Patti is also sending her out a member change form for banking info I believe. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-17 10:29:45', '2020-07-17 10:29:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054092018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049815007', 'Aniko Toth', NULL, 'Someone called on behalf of Aniko and asked if we could cancel her out because she is going to be leaving the country until January.  I let him know I will send her a cancellation form for her to fill out and send back to us and we will cancel her out. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-17 10:27:00', '2020-07-17 10:27:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054092013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010288007', 'David Martin', NULL, 'Carey called in and has a question about the conversion and to explain about opening a separate bank account with Zion. Put back to Patti. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-17 10:08:26', '2020-07-17 10:08:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054112003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610380', 'Laura Watson', NULL, 'Tried to reach out to member no response left detail message. on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule the call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-07-17 09:13:18', '2020-07-17 09:13:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054092008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032064118', 'Catherine Broad', NULL, 'I got a call from an emergency room provider calling on behalf of Catherine. The lady asked if they are to send the billing to us here at MPowernig Benefits and if not where to send it. I told her that for this type of emergency visit Catherine is to present herself as a cash pay patient and is responsible for the first $1500 out of pocket of her IUA. The provider said she DID do that. So I explained that the member is to get the rest of the billing and submit that into Sedera and open up a "Need" with them.  I then explained what will happen after Catherine does that and how the rest of the payment is going to work. The provider ( I didn''t catch her name) took down Sedera''s name and number. She thanked me very very much and will relay all that info to Catherine. All Set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-17 08:56:54', '2020-07-17 08:56:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054092003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830414', 'Ann Wilkinson', NULL, 'Ann called in and said that she has left Wendy a message this morning but Ann is on the website now and just wants to get the conversion plan changes done since she is already looking at everything now. I put her back to Patti to help her along. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-17 08:13:05', '2020-07-17 08:13:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054069003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014508197', 'Jose Ernesto Rodriguez aleman', NULL, 'Took a call from the wife of Jose (Joann).   She is concerned about the conversion options with  Sedera.  She said she called Sedera who told her they knew nothing about the letter MPB sent out to the members.  She also had concerns about her husband or recently had some sort of medical situation in which the doctors are still having them going through testing to determine what it is.  In my conversation, she said that John Kach enrolled her and wants to speak with him.  I told her I would send an email to John and ask him to call Joann asap.    I added her mobile phone number to the CRM file (480-276-2668.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2020-07-16 18:45:53', '2020-07-16 19:56:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054066036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004711271', 'Robert Weyrauch', NULL, 'called to update payment info- sent him a form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-16 17:48:23', '2020-07-16 17:48:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054047076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019362080', 'David Kimble', NULL, '7-16-20  "So I chatted with David Kimble on SalesIQ for a bit, and thought you would want to know that he seems to be struggling with this.  It does bring up the question- does Zion have a letter of sorts to give university''s and schools in place of insurance?  Just thought I''d give you the heads up!  Thanks for being a bad-ass!

