  ('zcrm_1579374000054047071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752018', 'Kim Rust', NULL, '7-16-20 Kim does NOT do her annual wellness visits and she doesn''t have an HSA. Therefore, we chose the MPB CareZ without the MEC EO$1000/$284. She''s very pleased. She''s never used it before. Still feels confused but she knows to do her Welcome Call. Very nice.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-16 16:25:42', '2020-07-16 16:25:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054066031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052755252', 'Jared Burbidge', NULL, 'Jared''s father called to cancel, I sent him the online form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-16 16:16:35', '2020-07-16 16:16:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054047066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055125026', 'Matthew Bennett', NULL, '7-16-20 MPB Care with MEC most likely $1000/$731.50. Matt will find out when last meds for hypertension were taken and Elena will call Cigna to inquire about cancelling for end of the month. We are going to enroll on Monday. They are in their 40''s and have 2 kids.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-16 15:39:07', '2020-07-16 15:39:07'),
