  ('zcrm_1579374000054047028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007902007', 'Natalie Wood', NULL, '7-16-20 Chose MPB CareZ $1000/$344 EO.  Natalie had a pain in her right side which was determined as a fatty liver but no real diagnosis. She had a clear MRI and clear CAT scan. This was all at the end of 2019 into early 2020. She has since changed her diet, lost 15 lbs and decided to deal with it holistically. She understands the cap of $25K for pre-x in first 2 years. She will jump off membership Sept. 2021 when turns 65. She''s all set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-16 12:05:53', '2020-07-16 12:13:16'),
