  ('zcrm_1579374000054047023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000907023', 'Melinda Niemczyk', NULL, '7-16-20 Melinda has an open Need with Sedera. She was diagnosed with breast cancer. She chose to do double masectomy and therefore hasn''t needed chemo or radiation! She has another surgery on July 30th. She was very disappointed to see group disbanded and new pricing for her will double. She knows she needs to stay with Sedera in case any further complications. She was pondering $5000 IUA but is now leaning towards $1500 just in case. She will have to finagle funds and move money around to make room in her budget. She will need to be seen every 6 months to check on status. She will likely remain with Sedera until age 65 at this point. Says she has a 15-20% chance of recurrence in next 15-20 years. She will complete app online and call only if she has troubles.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-16 10:46:33', '2020-07-16 10:46:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054048008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052476986', 'Michelle Dow', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-07-16 10:36:41', '2020-07-16 10:36:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054047018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015086209', 'Samantha Creach', NULL, '7-16-20 Rod says we can''t split the family and move only part of the family now and part later. They must move as one. She will remain with Sedera until her knee issue is resolved. They will hold off on wellness until this fall anyhow. She''s hoping to be able to move in time to get wellness and HSA back for family by fall.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-16 10:25:27', '2020-07-16 10:25:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054010028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752344', 'Judith Anderson (Knizewski)', NULL, 'Member called in with questions as Andrea is on vacation.  She put in Member change form to add new husband.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-16 10:16:36', '2020-07-16 10:16:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054047013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062415357', 'Jill Leonard', NULL, '7-16-20 Left vm for Jill for our appt now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-16 10:03:19', '2020-07-16 10:03:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054047008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830079', 'Jose Hernandez', NULL, '7-16-20 I UPDATED Jose about new discovery that colonoscopy and mammograms are NOT included unless you add the MEC. He went back and forth and was going to try to do the colonoscopy in July while it''s included, but then at the final moment decided to include the MEC. So, chose MPB CareZ with MEC $1000/$344. He also cancelled his son Jose Rafael Hernandez who is going on Florida Blue. He thought he could cancel effective immediately and I told him that''s not possible. He''s already paid for the entire month of July and they don''t do partial month memberships. He''s going to talk with the other broker to make sure it''s not a problem. I''m surprised they could join mid month anyhow. He will inquire.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-16 09:35:34', '2020-07-16 09:35:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054048003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052653020', 'Mehdi Izadikamouei', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-07-16 09:33:59', '2020-07-16 09:33:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054047003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010656126', 'Kevin Lever', NULL, 'Paul confirmed that Kevin wanted the $1,000 IUA for his new plan', 'Guillermo Vega-Perez', 'Guillermo Vega-Perez', '2020-07-16 09:31:01', '2020-07-16 09:31:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054010023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012578069', 'Karla Degginger', NULL, 'Member called in and I answered some questions for her.  She has determined that it would be cheaper to split off son.  She also has been under the care of a DPC for a period of time.  She will be going on w/ her son then 1st month I will have Guy enroll her son in the Zion Ind Plans.  We will waive the $100 enrollment.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-16 09:30:50', '2020-07-16 09:30:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054046003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043575365', 'Leonard Hunt', NULL, 'Regina called with questions regarding preventative care.  Explained ReDirect, sent instructions and plan description.  Sent link to Spruce app.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2020-07-16 09:14:42', '2020-07-16 09:14:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000054040003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030706004', 'Kathleen Duke', NULL, 'Kathleen called in and said she has not received anything about her plan in the mail and no cards. So she is asking about how to get information and a card for her plan. Put her back to Patti.  I sent numerous emails for general education for her plan.
