  ('zcrm_1579374000054010013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044486075', 'Iris Fernandez', NULL, 'Member submitted a cancellation form in error to remove her son from the plan.  I spoke the her and sent the Plan change for, which she will submit and I will remove son.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-16 08:28:44', '2020-07-16 08:28:44'),
