  ('zcrm_1579374000054010003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083214', 'Jesse Chatham', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I will notify Sedera &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-16 08:07:14', '2020-07-16 08:07:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053996003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005636371', 'Laurence Jacobs', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation form', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-16 07:48:53', '2020-07-16 07:48:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053946063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054027098', 'David Sheldon', NULL, '7-15-20 Jonathan enrolled for David. David is son. Jonathan enrolled in MPB Carez Individual Member at $274+$50 for tobacco. Showed as $319 and informed Jonathan correct price is $324. He understands. Told him to look for emails within a week or so to welcome him and to complete Welcome Call. He will let me know if he doesn''t receive those. He will complete Welcome Call and relay information to son, other wise son will never get on the call. He will also encourage son to download the app for virtual healthcare and coach him on it. He''s happy this is much more suitable for son than Anthem. Also David is self employed but currently has no work. So, he''s filing for unemployment. Therefore, we put him on the Individual member platform. I received email confirmation.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-15 17:50:50', '2020-07-15 19:25:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053946058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012594156', 'Arthur Schwadron', NULL, '7-15-20 Art chose Sedera for Aug. $1000/$333.  From Art, "I like that you charge tobacco users more. Next please add charges for alcohol and overweight!"', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-15 16:54:32', '2020-07-15 16:54:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053946053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003848025', 'Jennika Wildau', NULL, '7-15-20 MPB Carez EC $2500/$436 with MEC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-15 16:27:22', '2020-07-15 16:27:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053946048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740178', 'Rebecca Near', NULL, '7-15-20 MPB CareZ ES $2500/$561 w/ MEC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-15 16:26:05', '2020-07-15 16:26:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053946043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032454006', 'Georgannna Garrison', NULL, '7-15-20 Cami was very frustrated by the changes. She wants to keep her low $500 IUA but can''t if switches. Also wants to keep wellness with Sedera but can''t. Doesn''t understand why Sedera wouldn''t include all wellness. Has an open Need for wife Susie who is doing allergy treatments ongoing. Turns out the shots are only $22 each time. So, not worth staying with Sedera for that. Keeping the HSA was her breaking point. She feels is vital to keep that. They will save about $100 per month by switching to MPB Carez which can easily pay for the shots every month. Plus it will save them $1080 for the year which can also assist with the higher IUA if they have a Need.  She''s choosing MPB CareZ with MEC $5356/$1000 ES.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-15 15:53:24', '2020-07-15 15:53:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053946038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054542087', 'Dorothy Stoner', NULL, '7-15-20 Sara and husband are 62 and 61, healthy, no pre-x, no tobacco. Cobra will cost them $800 (per person?). They are self-employed. Gave her pricing options for MPB CareZ with and w/o MEC. She wanted to understand how to fund an HSA. Explained and she will decide which one is best. They used to do annual wellness visits but are thinking of not doing them anymore. I''m not sure why. Wants me to send them information via email explaining membership.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-15 15:20:12', '2020-07-15 15:20:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053946033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005291664', 'Janice Shayne', NULL, '7-15-20 Vic ia 63 and Janice is 61. They are super healthy and haven''t had any health issues pretty much ever. Vic is doing some PT now for various stretches and such. Didn''t elaborate, but realized it''s best to pay cash for those. Deciding on MPB Carez Worksite without MEC since they don''t do their annual wellness visits ever. Pondering highest IUA''s. $531/$1000, $456/$2500, $381/$5000. We are talking on Monday to enroll.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-15 14:24:17', '2020-07-15 14:24:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053946028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830079', 'Jose Hernandez', NULL, '7-15-20 Jose will choose $284/$1000 without the MEC. He doesn''t do wellness visits but will need to do colonoscopy in PHCS network. Told him to call Concierge for assistance with that when he''s ready to go. He also asked for link to cancel his sons membership. Son''s mom will cancel son and sounds like put him on her plan now. I will help Jose tomorrow morning to convert.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-15 14:03:30', '2020-07-15 14:03:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053946023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012594156', 'Arthur Schwadron', NULL, '7-15-20 Art has a doctor''s appt next week. He will stay with MPB Sedera Access Plus for Aug. If he gets a clean bill of health, he will switch to MPB CareZ as soon as he''s clear.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-15 13:50:02', '2020-07-15 13:50:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053931048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085237002', 'Marie Pond', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel with Sedera and cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-15 13:46:17', '2020-07-15 13:46:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053929053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012594156', 'Arthur Schwadron', NULL, 'Called in and said that he needed to speak with someone about the new plan changes. I asked if he has spoken to his affiliate about this and his response was no. I said well that is who you need to speak with. He said would that be MPowering Benefits?  I said no that is who you are speaking with and his affiliate is the person that sold him the plan. As I was pulling up his profile here he said that he got an email from a Wendy Scipione. I said yes that is your affiliate and who he needs to speak with. He said Ok I will give her a call now then. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-15 13:46:01', '2020-07-15 13:46:01'),
