  ('zcrm_1579374000053946018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016038124', 'Isabelle Laak', NULL, '7-15-20 Isabelle chose ES $2500/$561 with MEC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-15 13:17:50', '2020-07-15 13:17:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053946013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012223122', 'Elizabeth Daly', NULL, '7-15-20 Elizabeth''s family has 3 open Needs. 1 for some pain daughter is having, 2 son has auto immune disease and 3 husband has lump in neck. They will choose the MPB Sedera Access Plus $1000/$863. She suspects it will be about 1 year until all of these are resolved. Told her she will have to pay for wellness items now on own except mammogram and colonoscopy.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-15 13:15:55', '2020-07-15 13:15:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053946008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257116', 'Colt Brunson', NULL, '7-15-20 MPB CareZ MF $731.50 / $1000. All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-15 12:55:21', '2020-07-15 12:55:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053946003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447370', 'Richard Watkins', NULL, '7-15-20 MPB CareZ with MEC EO $1000/$344. All set to go with Welcome Call Scheduled.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-15 12:39:29', '2020-07-15 12:39:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053929048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008973029', 'Julian Gonzalez-Becerra', NULL, 'Got back Julian''s 1095-b form in the mail today all the way back from the beginning of the year. The mailing address we have on file is the same that is on the letter. He is cancelled so I am NOT going to send update address form because he is cancelled. If he ever calls for it (which he would have by now, tax season is over ) I will ask for correct address to send out. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-15 10:56:45', '2020-07-15 10:56:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053931033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012429101', 'Karyn Burke Whitcomb', NULL, 'Member called in to ask about billing for new plan.  I advised her that she would be billed at the same time as previous plan.  She wanted to also confirm amount.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-15 10:39:31', '2020-07-15 10:39:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053927013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012273746', 'David Peck', NULL, 'Spoke to member rescheduled call for Tuesday, August 4, 2020 at 11:00 a.m mountain time/ 1:00 p.m. est. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-07-15 10:37:11', '2020-07-15 10:37:11'),
