  ('zcrm_1579374000053931013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993065', 'Johanna Lindau', NULL, 'Spouse Joel called in asking about Preventative Colonoscopy.  Said he has family history and has had some polyps removed previously.  he is 45.  I advised that that would be a diagnostic procedure and shareable under the Sedera portion of the plan.  Told him that he would be responsible for 1st $1500 then shareable.  He to be in contact w/Sedera closer to when it will be done.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-15 10:03:04', '2020-07-15 10:03:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053931008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000053916881', 'John Plowman', NULL, 'Per John this member will be backdated to start on 5/1/20.  Enrolled 7/10/20.  All commissions paid out of E123.  Sedera ok with member in IL.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-15 09:36:23', '2020-07-15 09:36:23'),
