  ('zcrm_1579374000053882079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000167692', 'Andrew (Andy) Ioele', NULL, '7-14-20 Andy is deciding between MPB CareZ options and will convert likely tonight. Understands differences. No real pre-x. He had a shoulder issue last fall with a pinched nerve. He paid cash and didn''t quite reach $1000. Also had COVID and is better now, no lasting effects to his knowledge. Also didn''t quite reach $1000 assuming he can get some costs negotiated down a bit which he''s working on. He does not fund an HSA.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-14 17:07:20', '2020-07-14 17:08:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053882074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000167692', 'Andrew (Andy) Ioele', NULL, '7-14-20 Andy is calling me back shortly. He''s turning 59 in Aug. 2020', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-14 16:31:14', '2020-07-14 16:31:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053882066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027283234', 'Kristen Le Peau', NULL, '7-14-20 Kristen uses NP Thyroid 120 mg and still needs to call Concierge to see if they can get a better price. She will also call Citizen''s RX to find out why it''s not listed as Tier 1 generic which should be at no cost to her or super low cost. She will do her homework and hopefully not pay $36 for something that used to be $0 or $3.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-14 16:07:26', '2020-07-14 16:07:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053882058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005995075', 'Daniel Yechout', NULL, '7-14-20 Chose MPB CareZ with MEC EF $731.50 /$1000 IUA.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-14 15:55:10', '2020-07-14 15:58:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053882053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521486', 'Ryan Ashley', NULL, '7-14-20 Ryan was super nice! He will go with MPB CareZ to keep HSA and wellness. Their cost will decrease significantly from $865 down to $731.50 w/ MEC / $1000 IUA.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-14 15:28:49', '2020-07-14 15:28:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053882048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257237', 'Ken Bechtel', NULL, '7-14-20 Ken chose MPB CareZ w/ MEC to include wellness and has an HSA account. His price went down by $1 but IUA is $1000/$344. He''s happy and can keep doctor since network is the same. Conversion complete.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-14 15:20:50', '2020-07-14 15:20:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053882043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819577', 'Nanci Alpert', NULL, '7-14-20 Nanci just enrolled in Sedera Access w/ DPC $230/$1500 to close out two open needs.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-14 15:00:41', '2020-07-14 15:00:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053884003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005636371', 'Laurence Jacobs', NULL, 'called to make sure he was cancelled.  He didn''t realize that he needed to fill out any sort of form.  I sent him another link, and also asked Patti to see this so that there is no penalty for late payment. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-14 14:59:49', '2020-07-14 14:59:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053882038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028177182', 'Anna Thexton', NULL, '7-14-20 Left vm for Anna just now to assist.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-14 14:40:18', '2020-07-14 14:40:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053882033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819577', 'Nanci Alpert', NULL, '7-14-20 Nanci has 2 open Needs, one is a digestion issue and the other is neck/back/shoulder issue that was put on hold bc of COVID. She will remain with Sedera for now at $230 month, plus $119 with Cloud. When that is all healed then she can move to MPB CareZ with DPC which is $199+$119.  We will convert her now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-14 14:19:35', '2020-07-14 14:19:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053882023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919419', 'Leo Goodman', NULL, '7-14-20 Leo was quite nervous about the changes. He has an open Need and is currently doing PT for a while longer. Not sure how much longer. He also has acid reflux and may need an endoscopy soon. He''s reticent to move. He''s going to find out how much his annual wellness visit cost. He LOVES the $500 IUA and really doesn''t want to move to $1000 IUA! His cost will go down from $330 to $281. That can help pay for his annual wellness visit. I suspect he''ll stay put long term but will reconsider his options in Oct. Nov. depending on how injury and health is at that point. He has the opportunity to jump on his wife''s plan in March but chose to stay. He is self-employed actor and tour guide. He was a W2 tour guide also but that job ended. He was appreciative of my help but a very nervous sounding individual. He''s clear on what he wants to do now. He will fill out conversion and stick with Sedera.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-14 14:02:02', '2020-07-14 14:02:02'),
