  ('zcrm_1579374000053854018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165363', 'Adrian Denise Farley', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation will notify Redirect &amp; Sedera &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-14 13:36:46', '2020-07-14 13:36:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053853026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165363', 'Adrian Denise Farley', NULL, 'Adrian called in and wanted to make sure we got her cancellation form and we did, Patti is working on right now as we speak. She was happy to hear and she has plenty of time for it all to be cancelled by the 20th of the month before charged for next months coverage. She was very happy to hear that. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-14 13:34:34', '2020-07-14 13:34:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053865002', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919419', 'Leo Goodman', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with MPB Concierge', 'Visit ID : 754 
Question : My current membership is with the $500 IUA, and I would like to continue with that, meaning I''d get the MPB Care + Sedera Access Plus.  From the look of this chart the new system would actually make it a little cheaper for me, as I currently pay $330 a month and this would make it $281 (I''m 39 years old).  I want to make', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2020-07-14 13:31:29', '2020-07-14 13:31:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053853018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028384233', 'Gregory Tatham', NULL, 'Gregory called in and asked it we have and send out 1099-A forms for tax purposes. I put him back to Patti.She explained to him that we do not have those types of forms and he is most likely talking about the 1095-b forms. She let him know that that is not something that you NEED to have for your taxes. The individual mandate has ended so that is no longer necessary. She let him know she will try and dig it up for him and will send it if so. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-14 13:11:52', '2020-07-14 13:16:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053853013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038689003', 'Eric Lemasters', NULL, 'Eric called in to change the banking info that is used for his monthly premium. Sent to Patti to send him the change form. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-14 12:50:58', '2020-07-14 12:50:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053854013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005986341', 'Mary Pennino', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel &amp; refund', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-14 12:49:50', '2020-07-14 12:49:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053854008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036530509', 'Franklin Alier', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will notify Sedera &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-14 12:43:14', '2020-07-14 12:43:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053853008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083052', 'Machelle Evans', NULL, 'Also as I am skimming the notes that have been in about her calling in, Patti told her multiple times that she needs to contact Wiley Long her affiliate. Her responses have been "Ok I will call him now". So you knew who Wiley Long is yesterday and a couple days ago, but when I just told her to contact him she said she has no clue who that is and has never heard his name before? That makes absolutely no sense what so ever. She seems to be one of those people that when you tell her something she completely forgets the next day.... Not a good. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-14 12:37:59', '2020-07-14 12:37:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053854003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601325', 'Ellen Marciano', NULL, 'Cancellation request submitted I will inform Sedera. Billing has been cancelled', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-14 12:36:03', '2020-07-14 12:36:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053853003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083052', 'Machelle Evans', NULL, 'Machelle called in today and said where is there that she can see all the different choices and pricing for this conversion. I gave her the website www.gotomybenefits.com. She called back and said that the website is not working and what to do. I asked her if she has spoken to her affiliate and she said "Who is my affiliate". Not a good sign. I let her know that it is Wiley Long. She said she has never heard that name before and has no clue who that is. She then said isn''t that you guys? Aren''t you guys my affiliate? She also then said John Kach has always been the one to help her and though he was her affiliate. I said no, he works here but he is not an affiliate. I gave her Wiley''s phone number to contact and let her know that he is the one she is supposed to speak to about the renewal going on. She did not seem to happy when I told her that we and John are not her affiliate and never heard of Wiley before. Not a good sign at all. I let her know if she can not get a hold of him than Patti here can steer her in the right direction. When I told Patti this she said that she has already spoken to Machelle yesterday multiple times and went through everything with her. SO if she calls back saying she can''t get a hold of Wiley I will put her through to Patti. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-14 12:33:39', '2020-07-14 12:33:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053799160', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010340009', 'James Marciano', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I will submit to Sedera &amp; ASi &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-14 11:47:19', '2020-07-14 11:47:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053836003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023155021', 'Jill Enriquez', NULL, '7-14-20 Jill asked me all of her questions and is deciding MPB CareZ with or w/o MEC. She''s going to find out the cost of the wellness visits and figure out what makes sense. She already can fund an HSA through husband''s plan. They do have some outstanding pre-x but she understands she will need to pay the IUA again and then costs are shared up to $25K right away.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-14 11:19:46', '2020-07-14 11:19:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053833013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779377', 'Jack Bowlin', NULL, 'Jack called in and asked about the COVID testing that is being done and how to go about that. I told him the only way that it would be covered at 100% and not out of pocket is if he got the testing done during his annual wellness visit. Other than that he would be presenting himself as a cash pay patient and he only pays up to his $1000 IUA. He then asked about the whole change over process that is going on and I told him that he needs to speak with his affiliate Darius Kohanim. He said that he has and I let him know that the form he needs to fill out for this is due by the 20th of the month for an August 1st start date. He understood and knows what he needs to do. I looked up his name in the email search box and when typing in his full name Jack Bowlin, his form for the renewal came up, so he already submitted his form in. He is all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-14 11:02:24', '2020-07-14 11:04:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053799155', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034059029', 'Michele Westmoreland', NULL, 'Member submitted change form to remove daughter Haley from plan.  I will let Sedera &amp; ASi know.  No change in billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-14 10:36:36', '2020-07-14 10:36:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053833008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044006573', 'Wahida Aryan', NULL, 'I emailed Wahida to let her know that her PDF and Hard copy of her RCI MEC card has been sent out. She should get the PDF copy by the end of the day at the latest. Every other time I have send out a request the PDF copy has always been sent the same day by 4pm. The hard copy should be to her mailing address (which I did confirm with her yesterday) within 5-7 business days. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-14 10:07:30', '2020-07-14 10:07:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053799150', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044006573', 'Wahida Aryan', NULL, 'Per Kelly I sent this member copy of RCI Card &amp; ordered her a new card sent.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-14 09:35:03', '2020-07-14 09:35:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053795013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052653020', 'Mehdi Izadikamouei', NULL, 'Spoke to member rescheduled for Thursday, July 16, 2020 at 9:00 a.m. mountain time/ 11:00 a.m. est. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-07-14 09:06:55', '2020-07-14 09:06:55'),
