  ('zcrm_1579374000053834003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830450', 'Debbie Eubanks', NULL, 'sent email to reschedule conversion welcome call. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-14 08:36:10', '2020-07-14 08:36:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053833003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716823', 'Rae Wayne', NULL, 'Rae called in and said asked if there is a way that I can see which welcome call is for her because she put in 2  of the renewal applications and she said one call is for tomorrow but the "official" one is sometime next week. I asked Patti about this and she said to just tell Rae to ignore the one for tomorrow and just go on the one for next week sometime. That is all Rae needed and thanked me very much for figuring that out for her so  quickly. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-14 08:12:37', '2020-07-14 08:12:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053799140', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010340009', 'James Marciano', NULL, 'Member emailed and said that he would be cancelling both him and his wife''s membership.  I advised that this change did not effect his wife''s membership.  He told me that he spoke to Sedera and that he would be enrolling directly with them. with us getting commissions.  I let Rod know this and sent out cancellation Link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-14 07:58:28', '2020-07-14 07:58:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053798036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017330183', 'Gregory Brooks', NULL, 'called to cancel, sent online form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-13 16:22:12', '2020-07-13 16:22:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053798031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005663233', 'Jason Lewis', NULL, 'Jason called to cancel his membership.  I sent him the online form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-13 15:55:11', '2020-07-13 15:55:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053798026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779589', 'Jennifer Anderson', NULL, 'called for help in completing conversion form- she is going to take a day or two to think about her options some more. I told her to give us a call if she needs us! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-13 15:51:01', '2020-07-13 15:51:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053799135', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013330029', 'Mary Suzanne Brauning', NULL, '7-13-20 Sue/Mary is likely choosing MPB CareZ with MEC at $344/$1000. They will read through it and decide tonight or tomorrow and submit app.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-13 15:42:02', '2020-07-13 15:42:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053799130', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521660', 'Teresa Robertson', NULL, '7-13-20 Teresa chose to use MPB CareZ with MEC to fund the HSA. That was important to her even though she can get most of her wellness on her own since works in the healthcare field. BUT, she''s super excited to get a thermogram and plans to go to this place bc they use the same technology that her NP friend recommends - http://www.coloradolaserwellness.com/thermography.html.  She also mentioned  tider tests to check  markers for certain antibodies to avoid needing additional immunizations. She says many include aluminum and she also gets sick every time she get one as an adult. Chose MPB CareZ w/ MEC $1000/$344.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-13 15:35:22', '2020-07-13 15:35:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053799125', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012630005', 'Michelle Badger', NULL, 'Member had questions about plan selection  and wanted to take spouse off the plan.  I told her to put in Member change form and fill out form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-13 15:02:34', '2020-07-13 15:02:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053799120', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659334', 'Kaye Reich', NULL, 'Kaye''s only health issue is she takes thyroid meds and has for 40 years. Totally healthy in her 60''s. She chose MPB CareZ without MEC $1000/$284. Doesn''t fund an HSA. Already pays for blood tests. Doesn''t do mammogram and does Ultrasound instead which she pays for on own also.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-13 14:57:34', '2020-07-13 14:57:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053799115', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083191', 'Greg Haarburger', NULL, '7-13-20 Greg has an open Need for a neck complaint and broken or ankle issue. He will close those out in the next few months. Will stay with MPB Sedera Access Plus for $378. He will try to squeeze in his wellness visit over the next few weeks if possible. Then he will decide if he wants to include the MEC or not. He''s already funded his HSA for the year. So, might want to keep that for future as well. He will call me later today or tomorrow to walk through application conversion process.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-13 14:38:43', '2020-07-17 11:47:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053811018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083052', 'Machelle Evans', NULL, 'Machelle called in and has questions about the renewal. I asked if she spoke to her affiliate because that is who she needs to speak to about this. She said she did and her affiliate directed her back to me here at the home office Concierge. I put the call back to Patti and she will call after the conference call is over that we are all on right now. She said she just wants to make sure that she can still have  preventative because she has appointments that are coming up and she can not loose them. Patti will call shortly after the call. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-13 13:53:36', '2020-07-13 13:53:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053811013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012630005', 'Michelle Badger', NULL, 'Michelle called in and said that she does want to do the Renewal but wants to take husband off the plan and wants to make sure that is not going to ruin anything or interfere of her renewing. Patti is the Affiliate technically. All is says at the top where the affiliates name would  normally be is MPowering Benefits and then when you scroll down there is a section that says Affiliate: Patti Baron. Gave message over to Patti and will call back after conference call. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-13 13:50:23', '2020-07-13 13:50:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053799107', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031359241', 'Ramiro Peru', NULL, 'New daughter added eff 6/22/2020 I have notified Sedera &amp; RCI.  No price Change.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-13 13:26:28', '2020-07-13 13:26:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053799102', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016005105', 'Suzanne Neal', NULL, 'Received cancellation request from member I will cancel', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-13 13:10:56', '2020-07-13 13:10:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053799097', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015086209', 'Samantha Creach', NULL, 'Member called in and was asking about a previous need that is being sheared by Sedera.  She is not haooy with the outcome and would like a second opinion.  I put her in contact with Sedera to contact 2nd MD.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-13 13:05:25', '2020-07-13 13:05:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053799092', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015086209', 'Samantha Creach', NULL, '7-13-20 Samantha has a current knee issue and doesn''t like her dr. She wants a 2nd opinion and she will call MPB Concierge to get help with that at no extra cost.  They are moving to SD soon and then living in an RV for a few years. Not interested in a HSA account and willing to pay cash for wellness visits most likely. She may stay with MPB Sedera Access Plus and move rest of family to MPB CareZ $1000 IUA. Without MEC $431 + Sedera Access Plus for Sammie $284 = $715 for now. Then later whole family without MEC pay $596.50 MPB CareZ $1000 IUA.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-13 13:03:41', '2020-07-13 13:03:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053799084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447148', 'Marie-Christine Carel', NULL, '7-13-20 Marie-Christine has colitis and last flare up was Nov. 2018. She understands it is pre-x but costs should be $500 for stool sample, $1000 for 3 months steroids and specialist visits, nowhere close to $25K. She wants to move to MPB CareZ with MEC for wellness and HSA compliance. Asked about making sure she won''t have issue with wellness if goes out of network bc of her bad experience first time around. Told her she can go in and out of network and it will still be share as long as it''s coded as wellness. She can use PHCS network card if wants or pay cash price. She gets bio identical hrt and told that it''s still her responsibility to pay for.  $1000/$344. Hoping husband is on Medicare starting Aug. 1st! But, she''s waiting for confirmation from broker about that. He turns 65 on Aug. 30th. If need be he will stay with Sedera Access Plus for month of Aug.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-13 12:32:32', '2020-07-13 12:32:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053799079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016101049', 'Naomi Sandoval', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I will cancel in Sedera, ASi &amp; FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-13 12:27:45', '2020-07-13 12:27:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053799074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039419008', 'Dean Sawyer', NULL, 'Member will be aging up to 50 age band eff 8/20.  I will send out email &amp; update billing.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-13 12:15:39', '2020-07-13 12:15:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053798021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033139', 'Kim Rew', NULL, '07.11.20:  Kim and Kevin called.  Discussed plan options w/them.  They think they''ll take the MPB CareZ plan w/o MEC.  They will further discuss it and let me know.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-07-13 11:57:33', '2020-07-13 11:57:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053799069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010656162', 'Darryl Lyles', NULL, '7-13-20 Darryl chose MPB CareZ with MEC and was asking about how to get colonoscopy done. Told him to call Concierge for assistance. He''s totally willing to drive to Grand Junction or even Denver if necessary to get high quality care at fair price for that. He chose $2500 / $319 w/ MEC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-13 11:53:58', '2020-07-13 11:53:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053798013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013233147', 'Karl E. Schoepflin', NULL, '07.10.20:  Karl called.  Discussed options with him.  He thinks he''d like the MPB Carez w/o MEC but said he''ll review it this weekend w/Cathy and then we can discuss it again on Tuesday. Recvd.  an email from Cathy asking to schedule a call for Tuesday at 10:30 am., which we did.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-07-13 11:53:31', '2020-07-13 11:54:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053799064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016411075', 'Nancy Levinson', NULL, '7-13-20 Spoke with Nancy and she''s annoyed that the price is going up and wellness dropped unless she pays more. Her wellness visit is supposed to be in Aug. She might try to squeeze it in if possible before change of membership. Her IUA is $1500 and I priced out $1000 at $284 or w/ MEC $344. She will likely go without MEC. Knows of deadline.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-13 11:48:03', '2020-07-13 11:48:03'),
