  ('zcrm_1579374000053799049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447370', 'Richard Watkins', NULL, '7-13-20 We will talk on July 15th at noon when he''s not in the field.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-13 11:29:45', '2020-07-13 11:29:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053799044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010656162', 'Darryl Lyles', NULL, '7-13-20 Left vm for Darryl at 11:25 am. Playing phone tag.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-13 11:25:52', '2020-07-13 11:25:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053811008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044006573', 'Wahida Aryan', NULL, 'Wahida called in and she had no clue how anything works and kept calling this Insurance. Every time I stopped her and said this is NOT insurance she was very confused and thought this was regular Insurance because that is what her affiliate told her. Andrea Hinman did not explain to Wahida that is this NOT insurance. I told her what it is which is Medical Cost Sharing. She has/had not clue at ALL what any of this is and like I said she get really upset when I told her this wasn''t insurance. She said "Well that is this than, the insurance I had before was much better than." She was so confused on what to do and everything I explained to her was the first time she heard any of what I said. I asked her is Andrea explained anything of this to her and said no she did not. SO I pretty much gave Wahida a welcome call on the phone for 20 mins. I explained everything in fine detail so she will understand it. She initially was calling in to get a doctor for a Wellness Visit.  I looked up providers for her and sent her the list. I explained in detail what her next steps are with her RCI card and how to present. She was not ever sure if she has the RCI card so I told her when she looks thorough her purse to email me or call me back if she found it or not. If not I told her I can put out a request to have a PDF and hard copy emailed and mailed to her. She kept saying that she was told she can go to any doctor of her choosing for anything and that is why her other insurance she had before this was good, because now she can''t go to whoever she wants. When I told her that she CAN go to anyone she wants to with Injury/Illness, there is no network and can go to anyone of her choosing. When I explained that she instantly said "Ohhhhh ok now I get it, I understand.". Which is great. She fully understands now what she needs to do when it come to all aspects of her plan. Preventative and Diagnostic Injury/Illness. I sent her 2 different providers list and she only wants a Female Provider, which is perfectly fine. For the search of Internist''s there were 225 Female Only results. So she is good to go with that. I sent her an email that explains how to present herself and her RCI card upon arrival to her appt, Welcome Call Scheduler for sure was sent to her, 5 Steps on how to avoid surprise bills when going to a Preventative Appts. the list of the 64+ Preventative Services that are covered with her plan under the ACA. Lastly I send her the email that explains how to submit bills and start a "Need" with Sedera when or if the time comes with Injury/Illness. She felt a LOT LOT better at the end of out conversation. I lastly told her to get in contact with her Affiliate and have her explain some things to her that I may not be able to, especially the fact that Wahida had zero clue what she has because Andrea did not tell her anything of what I told her. They need to be on the same page in my opinion. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-13 11:23:53', '2020-07-13 11:23:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053799039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830414', 'Ann Wilkinson', NULL, '7-13-20 Left vm for Ann around 11:00. Playing phone tag.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-13 11:23:24', '2020-07-13 11:23:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053799031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054542379', 'Michael Vactor', NULL, '7-13-20 Lisa called and I had already explained the membership to her for MPB Carez. I refreshed her memory and gave her pricing for EF $796.50 or $931.50 w/ MEC. She will talk with Michael to determine if they want to include MEC for HSA ability. She''ll let me know and we have enrollment date set for Thursday, July 16th. Wants Aug 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-13 11:21:13', '2020-07-13 11:21:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053799026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054542379', 'Michael Vactor', NULL, '6-29-20 Lisa is 50, husband Michael is 53 and kids 16 and 13. Lisa has her own chiro office so she''s focused on more alt healing. They are all healthy, no tobacco, no meds. Wants the $1000 IUA on MPB CareZ. As self-employed price for EF = $796.50 or $931.50 with MEC. Live in PA so no Sedera.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-13 11:08:39', '2020-07-13 11:21:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053799021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048549095', 'Sean Frankhouse', NULL, 'Member will be aging up to the 40 - 49 age group eff 8/1.  I will send out email &amp; adjust pricing in FTNI.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-13 10:18:51', '2020-07-13 10:18:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053799016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045438095', 'Charlene Buffington', NULL, 'Member will be aging up to new age band eff 8/1/20.  I sent email and adjusted pricing in FTNI.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-13 10:17:03', '2020-07-13 10:17:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053799011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051635017', 'Robert Weinstein', NULL, 'This member was enrolled in the MPB Select Grp from 6/1/18 to 6/1/20.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-13 09:57:28', '2020-07-13 09:57:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053811003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013330029', 'Mary Suzanne Brauning', NULL, 'Mary and her husband called in to get some answers about new plans for Mary. Her husband is the one that is speaking for Mary as he said Wendy told him that he could do that. Mary was also on the phone just the husband speaking. I asked if they tried to contact their affiliate which is Wendy and they said yea bout 20 mins ago and she did not answer and are waiting for a call back and called into me to see if I could answer their questions. I unfortunately can not because I would know know what is best for Mary, only Wendy would know. I let them know that I will also email Wendy to let her know to call them ASAP. They were very nice and calm and did not get upset when I couldn''t help them and deferred them back to Wendy. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-13 09:21:22', '2020-07-13 09:21:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053795008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030706054', 'Sandra Haber', NULL, 'Spoke to member rescheduled call for Thursday, August 20,2020 at 9:00 a.m. mountain time/ 11:00 a.m. est .Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-07-13 09:10:24', '2020-07-13 09:10:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053799006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016005105', 'Suzanne Neal', NULL, 'Received notification that this member will be turning 65 this month.  I emailed her to let her know she will be cancelled.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-13 08:59:49', '2020-07-13 08:59:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053798008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779506', 'Susan Weiner', NULL, 'sent email to reschedule conversion welcome call. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-13 08:52:55', '2020-07-13 08:52:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053798003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011509065', 'Joy Kelley', NULL, 'sent email to reschedule conversion welcome call. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-13 08:50:25', '2020-07-13 08:50:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053795003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052815104', 'Alisa Shepherd', NULL, 'Spoke to member rescheduled call for Wednesday, July 29, 2020 at 10:15 a.m. est Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-07-13 08:24:30', '2020-07-13 08:24:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053770013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037788057', 'Jean Thompson', NULL, 'Jean called in and said that she just fell off a mountain bike incident a few days about and she wen to the get a splint on her either her leg or ankle. Regardless she just wanted to make sure she was doing the right thing. She was asked to go and get a cast and wanted to make sure where she is being sent to is in the network. I explained to her that for something like this is injury/illness not preventative. There is not network she needs to stay in, she can go anywhere she wants to for this type of incident. I told her to present herself as a cash pay and she will get a cash discount and that she is responsible out of pocket for the first $1000 if her IUA. Anything after that she is to get in contact with Sedera and open up a "Need". She is to keep all of her receipts and bills that show proof she has met her IUA and Sedera will then help cover the rest of the cost. I gave her Sedera''s phone number directly and let her know I will send an email that explains how to submit her bills and star the need process. She was very thankful for the info I gave her and she 100% understands and will contact Sedera asap to let them know what is going on and that she is most likely going to have some on going appointments with this and they will walk her through the whole process. I told her to call them asap to get the ball rolling sooner than later. Jean was very nice and thanked me greatly and will do all that I said. She is all set and good to go, very understanding. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-13 08:14:03', '2020-07-13 08:14:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053773008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005291299', 'Chad Garner', NULL, 'This member emailed info and told us that he wanted to cancel HES because Liberty was not paying any bills and her had gone into collections.I refunded him the July pmt and cancelled. I emailed him requesting him to fill out the cancellation request.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-13 07:49:27', '2020-07-13 08:54:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053777003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023370023', 'Heather Seasonwein', NULL, 'Spoke to member rescheduled her call for Monday, August 24, 2020 at 9:30 a.m. est. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-07-13 07:38:10', '2020-07-13 07:38:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053770008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005291299', 'Chad Garner', NULL, 'This is an email that as sent to us over the weekend. Patti asked me to copy and paste the email into the notes because she is still have a few issues with the emails. Chad said to not charge his account again because Liberty has not been paying their bills and are sent to collections, if charged again he will dispute with AMEX. -KF

Liberty has not been paying our bills and we have been sent to collections. Do not charge my again. If my card is charged again, I will dispute the charge with AMEX.

Thanks,

Chad Garner
801-547-7514', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-13 07:35:23', '2020-07-13 07:35:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053773003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011508208', 'Donna DeFede', NULL, 'Member called in and was confused about what plan was most like present plan.  I asked if she had a HSA that she would like to continue to fund she said yes.  Told her that her only option was CareZ w/MEC.  She also said that she had a colonoscopy scheduled for Aug which I asked her to postpone.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-13 07:28:43', '2020-07-13 07:28:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053770003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011508208', 'Donna DeFede', NULL, 'Donna called in and needed help with choosing the plan that she wants to choose with the new renewal''s. She is one of Ron''s clients and she could not get a hold of him. I put the call to Patti. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-13 07:21:31', '2020-07-13 07:21:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053716003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000053678297', 'John Burchmore', NULL, 'Spoke to this enrolle''s spouse and she directed both of their app to be cancelled.  I will refund', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-10 17:32:20', '2020-07-10 17:32:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053697013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000053678193', 'Jill Burchmore', NULL, 'This member called in after ours to cancel with Kelly I will cancel in Admin &amp; refund and notify Sedera not to activate.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-10 16:36:04', '2020-07-10 16:36:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053697008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012024204', 'Vipul Kumar', NULL, 'Vipul called today to discuss the conversion letter.   We discuss the family''s current health needs.  Vipul is dealing with some eye issues but said the costs are very low and is not an issue.  We discussed the plans choices and ended up the best recommendation was Care Z/with MEC.  He also uses his HSA.    He may need some assistance with vision and dental plans in the future.  I instructed him to enroll by the 20th.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2020-07-10 15:21:34', '2020-07-10 15:21:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053689057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023370023', 'Heather Seasonwein', NULL, '7-10-20 Heather is planning to choose the MPB CareZ EC $536/$1000 w/ MEC. She''ll complete on her own.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-10 15:17:29', '2020-07-10 15:17:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053689046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716025', 'Richard O''Krepki', NULL, '7-10-20 Rick is moving to Medicare in Sept. so advised him to stay with Sedera for the one month. He chose MPB Sedera Access Plus $5000/$380 and won''t do wellness unless reaches Medicare. He was willing to gamble with the high IUA. All set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-10 15:06:10', '2020-07-10 15:06:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053689041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034059029', 'Michele Westmoreland', NULL, '7-10-20 Derek may need knee replacement soon. Told her to keep him with MPB Sedera Access Plus since not pre-x bc happened while with Sedera. Derek may get a new job soon too. Either way, he should stay and they are considering moving to MPB CareZ. She''s going to discuss with Particia Bedell as well. They may still battle CSU to get it approved. Now the newest stipulation is they don''t want to allow any pre-x limits. Schools are doing everything to disallow folks from making their own choices. She''s waiting to hear back from CSU since approved last year but possibly not again this year. She knows of deadline.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-10 14:51:00', '2020-07-10 15:09:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053689036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165363', 'Adrian Denise Farley', NULL, '7-10-20 Very indecisive bc not earning $ now and doesn''t want to keep paying. Wants family store to help pay by joining their group. She will talk it over with family over weekend. She didn''t seem eager to tell me her income. Store she''s hoping will pay all or part of cost. But, I also let her know she might still have to pay for doctor visits depending on the plan. She''s just really overwhelmed by lack of income.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-10 14:25:24', '2020-07-10 14:25:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053689031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752067', 'Michael Brown', NULL, '7-10-20 Linda and Michael are DPC members and pay $70 a month each. The price for both of them with MPB CareZ is $361 / $1000 IUA ES. She will decide and I told her to call me or just type in price when asked on application.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-10 13:55:33', '2020-07-10 13:55:33'),
