  ('zcrm_1579374000053689021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054027098', 'David Sheldon', NULL, '7-10-20 David uses tobacco on occasion and his dad is willing to pay the extra $50 fee to remain compliant. Total cost looks to be $234/$1000 +$50 = $284 for MPB CareZ without MEC. Going to complete app on July 15th at 4:30 pm.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-10 12:24:11', '2020-07-10 12:24:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053684033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000053678193', 'Jill Burchmore', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA 50-59 Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-10 12:13:42', '2020-07-10 12:13:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053697003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012791050', 'Phillip Mauger', NULL, 'Phil called me requesting assistance regarding the conversion letter.   We discussed his current health needs and he contributes to his HSA on a regular basis.  I also discussed using a DPC for wellness and other medical needs.   Phil is currently using a DPC so I recommend he switch to the Care Zw/MEC.  He agreed and he went online today and enrolled.  Questions that I confirmed for him:
1.  Fee for smoker (John said $45, the price on-line says $50', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2020-07-10 12:05:20', '2020-07-10 12:05:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053689013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011307064', 'Thomas White-O''Connor', NULL, '7-10-20 Tom moves to Medicare Sept. 1 and Beth Jan. 2020. Keeping both on Sedera Access Plus for at least Aug. But, they are now going to ponder again once they saw the double increase in price! Beth has an eye injury she''s tending to and now premature vitria detachment and might need vitrectomy but may wait until Medicare to deal with it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-10 12:01:51', '2020-07-10 12:02:38'),
