  ('zcrm_1579374000053636033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034162541', 'Harry Shaffer', NULL, 'Harry wanted to know if he needed to do anything to his plan because he is moving to Texas.  I asked if he was going to go to a DPC establishment there and he told me that he planned too. I told him that he would probably need to fill out a new DPC form for Patti, but that I would reach out to her for her expert opinion about this. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-09 16:25:09', '2020-07-09 16:25:09'),
