  ('zcrm_1579374000053636028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010954128', 'Brent Toevs', NULL, 'I was on a welcome call when Sandra called in,  I called the number back and got Brent.   I shouldn''t of had.  He was in a fowl mood....asked me questions about his HSA and how he is going to close it out, and wanted to know how the payments to the bank that Sedera is having him open will work.  I told him that unfortunately those were extra questions for Darius.  He told me that speaking to Darius made him confused,  speaking to me made him more confused and then said "I apologize for being a prick".   I told him that I would reach out to Darius with these questions.  I tried calling Darius but got his vm.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-09 16:19:40', '2020-07-09 16:19:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053636023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052659223', 'James Julian', NULL, 'On the fly Welcome Call Complete.  Stephanie called in confused and clueless.  I offered her a welcome call and now she is feeling better.  I told her she can contact us anytime for support. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-09 16:02:59', '2020-07-09 16:02:59'),
