  ('zcrm_1579374000053638013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012871160', 'Katie Roth', NULL, '7-9-20 Spoke with Katie and she has her mammogram coming up at the end of the month. Dr. Kaufman is not in network but she uses Boulder Community Medical Center to get it done. Told her to use the card and sent her the search tool. Told her it MUST be coded as wellness not diagnostic. She''s used Dr. Kaufman before and didn''t have a problem. She self paid and got reimbursed by ASi apparently. She due for a colonoscopy and I gave her the list of place NOT to go. I also gave her the cheapest labs to use if she needs labs. She was very open. She didn''t get her answers resolved with the Concierge Team yesterday regarding doctors and networks, etc.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-09 13:16:02', '2020-07-09 13:16:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053631021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013233147', 'Karl E. Schoepflin', NULL, '07.09.20:  Called Cathy - explained reason for call (Select Conversiion) and l/m to c/b.  Followed up w/an email to explain situation. Asked to contact me.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-07-09 13:03:30', '2020-07-09 13:20:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053638008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659598', 'Christina Bremner Anderson', NULL, '7-9-20 Christina just joined Nextera with me on phone. She was also at our in person meeting a while back with Dr. Flanagan and wants to try them out. She chose MPB CareZ with DPC for $199 and Nextera $99 with $79 set up fee. Nextera has Zion as an option on their site. Christina is going to update her banking information to now pay since Todd had been paying for her and kids. Todd will move kids over to his membership on PDHC which will be $638 a month at the $1000 IUA level. Sent her the form for Todd to add the  kids and I told Patti what to expect. We should be good to go.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-09 12:49:36', '2020-07-09 12:49:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053638003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610190', 'Andrea Lowery', NULL, '7-9-20 Andrea was super nice and easy to work with. She''s choosing MPB CareZ with MEC and has an HSA and does her annual wellness visits. She has well managed high blood pressure. She does cross fit and runs. She''s 53 now and choosing $1000/$344 EO.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-09 12:46:25', '2020-07-09 12:46:25'),
