  ('zcrm_1579374000053538151', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716932', 'LouLou Piscatore', NULL, '7-8-20 MPB CareZ EO $1000/$344 w/ MEC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-08 20:28:48', '2020-07-08 20:28:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053538143', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610171', 'Melinda Grabau', NULL, '7-8-20 Mindy was very happy with Sedera for the few things they did through Sedera. They don''t have any pre-x. But, Meghan does have an open need that will be handled by end of month. Meghan had the HPV vax and it caused weird problems. Mindy saw one of our videos in our emails touting more holistic care solutions which they chose to do. Then they submitted to Sedera for sharing and Sedera originally said No. Once they understood it was from a video sent by MPB they were willing to share the cost up to 80% after paid IUA. Mindy was thrilled and felt well taken care of. Also really wants MEC and wellness and HSA. Willing to move for that but sad price is increasing and IUA increasing to $1000.  Chose MPB CareZ EF $1000/$931.50. All Set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-08 19:10:42', '2020-07-08 19:11:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053520048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096791017', 'Peter Lehmann', NULL, 'I assisted Peter in trying to find the best price on his daughter''s medication called Spravata- I wasn''t able to help him.  The cost is over 1000 and it is controlled.  I am also in the middle of looking for the best prices on an echocardiogram, telt table test and a sudo motor test- all for his daughter.- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-08 19:10:26', '2020-07-08 19:10:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053520043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779530', 'Jaelynne Lay', NULL, 'Jaelynne has many questions concerning this conversion.  She is relieved to hear that she doesn''t need to "start over" with pre-ex years and Sedera.  But she has waited close to 3 years to get some very expensive pre x surgery done.  I gave her all of Ron''s contact info, as well as reached out to Ron and asked him to call her asap because this is really heavy on her at the moment. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-08 18:52:45', '2020-07-08 18:52:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053520038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990158', 'Loren Jinkins', NULL, 'helped member through the compliance and renewal form.  She was very overwhelmed and could hardly type out gotomybenefits.com I gave her a helping hand and encouraged her to keep her apt with Anallisa in a few days to make sure it''s the right one for her. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-08 17:50:35', '2020-07-08 17:50:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053538135', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257159', 'Michele Schwadron', NULL, '7-8-20 Michele has no pre-x and needs to do annual wellness soon. Put it off bc of COVID. Choosing MPB CareZ w/ MEC and price going down by $1. $1000/$345 EO. All Set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-08 17:48:53', '2020-07-08 17:57:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053538130', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521512', 'Daniel Kaplan', NULL, '7-8-20 MPB CareZ EO $1000/$234.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-08 17:40:36', '2020-07-08 17:40:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053538125', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011537076', 'Maria (Chris) Comfort', NULL, '7-8-20 Chris is in 60''s. Just had detached retina surgery. Working with Rachel as Needs Coordinator. She will have a follow up appt in September and it will be $220 and fine with paying for that cash. Because of COVID they did slightly different surgery that made cost go from $11K down to $4K! Should be all set moving forward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-08 17:37:22', '2020-07-08 17:37:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053538120', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881640', 'Meghan Grabow', NULL, '7-8-20 Left vm at 5:26 pm to help assist her.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-08 17:28:53', '2020-07-08 17:28:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053538115', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257159', 'Michele Schwadron', NULL, '7-8-20 Michele called and left vm on 6th. I called back today and left vm at 5:15 pm to assist her.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-08 17:23:45', '2020-07-08 17:23:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053538110', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243070', 'Felicia Balderston', NULL, '7-8-20 She goes by Felecia and Felicia. She was enrolled as Felecia but is changing now back to Felicia moving forward. I changed it in the account and added old spelling to Nickname for searching purposes.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-08 17:22:19', '2020-07-08 17:22:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053538105', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830450', 'Debbie Eubanks', NULL, '7-8-20 MPB CareZ with MEC $1000/$344 EO. She has a hip issue which she is NOT going to have surgery on unless it''s dire. Did 2 joint injections which were awful. They think it''s bursitis but she''s not really sure of that. Her naturopath prescribed celery juice bc of adaptogens. She was doing PT and is done with that as well. Wasn''t really helping. Knows of pre-x clause. Wants HMA information.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-08 17:18:45', '2020-07-08 17:18:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053520033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052659143', 'Kristina Razma', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  Kristina is THE sweetest thing! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-08 16:55:05', '2020-07-08 16:55:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053538100', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012429101', 'Karyn Burke Whitcomb', NULL, '7-8-20 Karyn and Rick are looking to move to MPB CareZ. Rick will move from PDHC to Karyn''s membership. Karyn had a finger injury in Jan. 2019 and 2nd surgery in April was cancelled due to COVID19. So, she needs to time it so that she can function in life. Therefore, she may wait 6-12 more months until she''s ready and able to deal with it. It will likely cost $15K is her estimate, below the $25K threshold. First surgery cost $70K! Karen is 53 and Rick is 59. Rick''s notes are in his account. They are pondering all options and may just hold off on the surgery since can''t disrupt life for the surgery. She can''t wash her hands after surgery which isn''t an option during pandemic she said.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-08 16:32:15', '2020-07-08 16:32:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053538095', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447059', 'Florie Glusman', NULL, '7-8-20 Called Zion to get approval for CentreSpringsMD pseudo DPC. Shelby is calling to make sure they qualify for their requirements. She can''t give me a straight answer about how to deal with COVID via DPC since they will need to doctor''s note, diagnosis, treatment methods, etc. first. Waiting to hear from Patti about DPC discounted price for EF MPB CareZ $1000 IUA.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-08 16:20:45', '2020-07-08 16:20:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053538090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447059', 'Florie Glusman', NULL, '7-8-20 Florie''s family is all super healthy. But, Florie got COVID 19 and that created fatigue and other symptoms. Sedera is separating out her COVID 19 with the other symptoms that it spurred on as two separate Needs even though it''s all related! She''s brought it to upper management and she''s tired of fighting it. She is a member of Qualified Quacks now but wants to switch to Centre Springs MD with Dr. Taz. Monthly fee is $195 1st year or $165 thereafter. She''s open to having her whole family join and then get the DPC discounted rate. Then she can take care of her COVID through the DPC as best as possible. She''s tired of Sedera at this point and wants to switch and willing to start new Need since Sedera is making her start a new Need anyhow. Plus she needs her kids to do their annual wellness visits possibly before school starts. So, wants to MEC also!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-08 16:15:34', '2020-07-08 16:15:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053520028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740178', 'Rebecca Near', NULL, 'I helped her find a reasonable priced facility for screening colonoscopy that is in network AND in Littleton! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-08 15:05:28', '2020-07-08 15:05:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053538085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043128097', 'Richard Whitcomb', NULL, '7-8-20 Rick is moving to Karyn''s membership in conversion to join MPB CareZ. Rick did have prostate cancer in Oct. 2017 and treated in Jan. 2018. Had quarterly surveillance to do PSA tests which are now coming back really low and great. Moving to annual checks next. I read him the Cancer clause from Zion''s Guidelines and he knows of $25K pre-x amendment.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-08 14:56:00', '2020-07-08 14:56:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053520023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521312', 'Cheryl Schack', NULL, 'Cheryl called to see if she should keep her thyroid labs separate from the preventive  coded blood work her doctor wants for her wellness visit.  I told her that she should, and I gave her the web address to directlabs.com so she can either use that service, OR use it when negotiating a cash price with Quest. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-08 14:34:22', '2020-07-08 14:34:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053520018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990092', 'Andrea Perrault', NULL, 'Andrea called to update her address- I sent her the form.  I also sent her a Welcome Call scheduler so she could schedule sometime after Aug 1. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-08 14:27:27', '2020-07-08 14:27:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053538077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027361787', 'Cammy Dwyer-Abbey', NULL, '7-8-20 Cammy was diagnosed in Jan. 2020 with a super rare autoimmune disease with a very long name. It effects many aspects of her health and is expensive. She will stay put on MPB Sedera Access Plus and will continue to work through her open need. Rebecca is her case manager.  She''s working on conversion now but x out of it by accident. Will complete on own for $1000/$333 50-59 EO.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-08 14:10:05', '2020-07-08 14:10:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053531048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037540001', 'Yolanda Ferrer', NULL, 'Joe called in and said that he has never started a Need before and his Dr. wants him to get a few test done because of something that is going on with his Spine and pain in his leg I believe he said. I explained to him how starting a Need works and that  he is responsible for the first $500 out of pocket of his IUA. Once he is getting close that that $500 he is to contact Sedera and they are the ones that deal with the Need process. I told him to make sure he keeps all his bills and receipts as proof to Sedera that he met his IUA. I sent him an email that explains how to submit his bills into Sedera with their contact number at the bottom. He then asked about how Preventative Colonoscopy would work aside from a Diagnostic Colonoscopy he might be needing to get per his Dr. about the pain and Need he would be needing to start. I was not too sure about that so I had Patti explain to him that he would just pay out of pocket and Sedera will then reimburse him.  Joe got all the info he needed and is all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-08 14:04:16', '2020-07-08 14:04:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053538072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993227', 'Catherine Young', NULL, '7-8-20 Have missed call from her but her vm is full and I can''t leave vm. She didn''t leave me a vm.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-08 13:53:17', '2020-07-08 13:53:17'),
