  ('zcrm_1579374000053538062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023155021', 'Jill Enriquez', NULL, '7-8-20 Left vm for Jill. She wants assistance with choices.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-08 13:46:10', '2020-07-08 13:46:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053533038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028322508', 'Kirk Marshall', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation form I advised her that I would be unable to backdate cancellation to requested 6/1/2020.  I will process cancellation.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-08 13:42:50', '2020-07-08 13:42:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053538057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740129', 'Julia (Wieck) Hardy', NULL, '7-8-20 Julia asked for recommendation which I sent via email. They are super healthy and go to annual wellness every year. She had a parasite this year and that''s it. Dunbar had nothing. So, recommending MPB CareZ with MEC for $636/$1000 ES.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-08 13:00:07', '2020-07-08 13:00:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053520013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013798036', 'Russell Jewell', NULL, 'I called Russell, he said that moving plans were very straightforward and he was happy with his choice.  I told him that I would send him a rescheduler so he can schedule after Aug 1. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-08 12:55:56', '2020-08-03 06:47:47'),
