  ('zcrm_1579374000053538049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752368', 'Jill Fields', NULL, '7-8-20 Jill has no thyroid and is hypothyroid. She now has a lymph node issue under arm/breast that she has an open Need for now.  She''s going to stay put until she gets this resolved and is confident it''s nothing serious and is all set. She''s working with a Needs Coordinator who''s telling her the mammogram is now going to be a new Need but it''s all part of the same issue. She will discuss with Needs Coordinator  again. She is interested in switching if/when her Need is complete. She''s also fine with paying for the low cost wellness items since she''s done that before. Cost is only increasing by $5 for now. MPB Sedera Access Plus at $1000/$284.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-08 12:27:51', '2020-07-08 12:30:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053533033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521636', 'Aaron Clawitter', NULL, 'This member called in and was upset that Ron had not gotten back with him .  He had many questions about Zion vs Sedera main question was that he is having surgery next week and wanted to know if Sedera would pay if he cancelled.  Per Rod &amp; John I will be send him an email advising him to stay on Sedera until need is closed and them we could change him.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-08 12:15:37', '2020-07-08 12:15:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053520008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012630119', 'Kelly Eaton', NULL, 'I called Kelly to ask if she was comfortable in making the switch onto a different plan.  She said she was, that it was pretty straight forward.  I told her that we were just wrapping up our welcome calls for this group and asked that she reschedule sometime after the 1st.  She was happy to oblige and I sent another scheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-08 12:10:54', '2020-07-08 12:10:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053538044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026675058', 'Anthony Peck', NULL, '7-8-20 Anthony was confused as to how to submit a Need and has one for skin cancer for $3800 that he never submitted. Told him to call Concierge Team to help him. He''s not sure if it was Jan. 2020 or Jan. 2019. Told him about 6 month rule. He will try either way. 
He just chose MPB CareZ with MEC for $636/$1000 moving forward. He likes the idea of having the card and not needing to be reimbursed and having it paid directly.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-08 12:03:40', '2020-07-08 12:03:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053531043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521636', 'Aaron Clawitter', NULL, 'Aaron called in and is extremely upset because he has been trying to get in contact with Ron Patterson about the whole renewal change that is happening. He said he called multiple times, left multiple voicemails, sent multiple emails and has gotten NOTHING back from Ron. She he called into here to get some answers because he does not understand anything about what was sent out to him. He is worried because he has an open Need going with Sedera and is afraid that will all go away. I put the call back to Patti and better explain what she can. Guy took down Aaron''s name and number and will speak to Ron and have him call his member. Aaron is just very upset he couldn''t speak to Ron. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-08 11:56:30', '2020-07-08 11:56:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053533028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016038161', 'Karee Watson', NULL, 'Member called in and was unsure weather she should go with the MEC.  I explained the differences in the plan and she will be going with the MEC.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-08 11:44:04', '2020-07-08 11:44:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053538036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819577', 'Nanci Alpert', NULL, '7-8-20 Nanci is a member of Cloud Medical! She never knew of discount option with DPC. So, instead of having her convert Patti recommended I have her just enroll in MPB Direct and fill out cancellation of MPB Group as easiest way to proceed. Her new cost is only $230 a month with the discounted rate! UPDATE - Patti is asking Dania how best to proceed with the conversion.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-08 11:39:25', '2020-07-08 11:43:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053531038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016038161', 'Karee Watson', NULL, 'Karee just called in about the renewal email that went out about changing plans and she needs someone to walk  her through to make sure she is doing everything correctly. She has Analisa Cleland and the last time someone went to speak to her she redirected the member back to us and stated that she doesn''t know anything and has no pricing or anything to help out so that is why Analisa directed her members to us, which is wrong. She said she had no clue an email was going out which is incorrect, Analisa was tagged on every single email that went out to her all of her clients AND was on the call last week when this was talked about and she asked a couple questions about it. So i transferred the call with Karee to Patti to help her out.  -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-08 11:29:56', '2020-07-08 11:29:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053538028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054286201', 'Brian Pierce', NULL, '7-8-20 Brian is 32 and wife is 34. Both healthy, no tobacco, no meds except some anxiety meds but not constantly. Told him the mental health cap of $3000 and explained Concierge for meds. He missed open enrollment and has no coverage. Aug. 1st is good. He is working but they don''t offer coverage. Send email describing MPB CareZ with or w/out MEC. I did not explain Sedera this time.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-08 11:26:59', '2020-07-08 11:27:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053538023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052396397', 'Helen Zivelonghi', NULL, '7-7-20 Helen was confused about receiving a code which we figured out is likely the QR Life Code. The packets have not been sent so she doesn''t have that yet. I gave her the Concierge phone # to call to help her set up her Virtual Healthcare. She hadn''t done that yet.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-08 11:23:16', '2020-07-08 11:23:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053533023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011537031', 'Maureen Mulkey', NULL, 'Member called in b/c she tried to call Kevin however he was on vacation.  I went thru what the differences between No MEC &amp; MEC.  Went thru HSA differences.   She will be making her decision in the next couple of days.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-08 10:47:16', '2020-07-08 10:47:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053533018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026391226', 'Pam Buderus', NULL, 'Spoke to member rescheduled her call for August 11, 2020 at 10:30 a.m. mountain time /12:30 p.m. est. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-07-08 10:44:08', '2020-07-08 10:44:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053538018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011537054', 'Michael Sharpe', NULL, '7-7-20 Mike is getting ready to have a back surgery and working on getting all the proper approvals with Sedera. He''s well into the process already. The surgery isn''t scheduled yet but the plan is to have it done in Aug. So, he panicked. But, guided him to stay put with MPB Sedera Access Plus. He''s choosing $500/$378 EO.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-08 10:40:47', '2020-07-08 10:40:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053538013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447059', 'Florie Glusman', NULL, '7-7-20 Left vm for her just now. She wants help.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-08 10:26:20', '2020-07-08 10:26:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053538008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021624001', 'Rachel Holden', NULL, '7-7-20 MPB CareZ EF $731.50/$1000 30-49.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-08 10:16:32', '2020-07-08 10:16:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053538003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001060051', 'Matthew Ross', NULL, '7-7-20 MPB CareZ EO $1000/$344 w/MEC', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-08 10:11:43', '2020-07-08 10:11:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053531033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004687005', 'Lisa Kulig', NULL, 'Lisa called and she said that she was told by Jan Capodi to call into us and we will negotiate pricing before she even goes to her appointment for a sinus issue. Jan seems a little confused because she told Lisa about HCBB and that we can send her different providers and negotiate the price before she goes. That is not the case, HCBB is ONLY for major surgeries and procedures. I sent the call back to Patti to straighten it out and made sure she got the correct info she needs. Patti also told her to get back with Jan about the new renewal that needs to be done by the 20th of the month for Aug 1st start date.  Patti took care of it and gave her the correct info she needed. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-08 09:52:12', '2020-07-08 09:52:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053536003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521569', 'Kymberlee Simantel', NULL, '07.08.20:  Emailed Jacque, to notify her about my call with Kymberlee.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-07-08 09:16:28', '2020-07-08 09:16:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053531028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015086178', 'Kristine Smith', NULL, 'Kristine called in and said that she needs to get something on her arm looked at the is becoming bumpy and raised. She has seen a dermatologist before and just wanted to make sure she was doing the right thing. I told her that she is to pay out of pocket up to her $1000 IUA and that''s it. If there is going to be ongoing treatments and the billing is going to be more than her IUA she is to then contact Sedera and open up a Need. I sent she all the info via email that she will need to start the process. She also thinks we have the wrong mailing address so I sent her the form to fill out for change of address. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-08 09:09:31', '2020-07-08 09:09:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053531023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716823', 'Rae Wayne', NULL, 'I spoke to this member she had some questions she indicated that Ron was too busy to talk to her. . She asked about the MEC and the pros &amp; cons of having it.  I told her what would be covered by Zion rest would be out of pocket.  Explained Pre Ex to her.  She also called back and asked about HSA and the funding there of.  Explained if she did not have MEC she could not continue to fund but use exsisting monies.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-08 09:06:21', '2020-07-08 09:06:21'),
