  ('zcrm_1579374000053498075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010342011', 'Marta Vera Wenokor', NULL, '7-7-20 Bill has a throat condition which is either allergies or auto immune. He also might possibly need a cataract surgery and will ONLY use Dr. Carl Hanson. Dr. Hanson is who referred the Wenoker''s to me. So, it''s non-negiotiable on many fronts. He''s showing as a red provider in HCBB. So, we need to find out if the Bluebook Care Connect will negotiate the rate down and if we are ready to use the BBCC yet. Also email them the HMA info.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-07 18:08:32', '2020-07-07 18:08:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053518026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830324', 'Terry Thomsen', NULL, 'I called Terry asked if she was comfortable with the decision that she made with her new health plan, asked her to reschedule a full welcome call after Aug 1 - she was happy to oblige. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-07 17:45:49', '2020-07-07 17:45:49'),
