  ('zcrm_1579374000053518021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675007', 'Michelle McGimpsey', NULL, 'Michelle''s Dad, that manages her account, called and wanted a general overview of the plans, I told him that he should speak with Wendy, but he declined.  I gave him just the general sense of the plans. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-07 16:42:10', '2020-07-07 16:42:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053498070', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062415357', 'Jill Leonard', NULL, '7-7-20 Jill is 45 and just moved from UT to CO. She''s healthy, no meds and no tobacco but has allergy shots 1x per month for $40. We are meeting next week to discuss Zion hoping it''s available. I explained MPB Care+ and told her what parts are not included in MPB CareZ. She will wait and doesn''t need to read info until we know which direction to go with membership.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-07 16:27:50', '2020-07-07 16:27:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053498062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010954027', 'Lynn Ryan', NULL, '7-7-20 Lynn is joining the MPB CareZ for $931.50/$1000 to keep MEC and HSA compliance. One child may move off membership soon. But, rest will stay put and no pre-x. All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-07 15:50:47', '2020-07-07 15:51:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053498057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521569', 'Kymberlee Simantel', NULL, '07.07.20:  Recvd. call from Kymberlee. She recvd. email w/my name notifying her she has to change her Sedera Select group plan. I explained Sedera''s changes, all plan options and pricing to her.  Said she has to consider which plan she wants and will get back to me.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-07-07 15:38:19', '2020-07-07 15:38:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053498052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010342011', 'Marta Vera Wenokor', NULL, '7-7-20 Marta and William called and I just left them a vm now to help them.  Both are in their 60''s.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-07 15:30:40', '2020-07-07 15:30:40'),
