Question : Hi I have a very stupid question..so bear with me.  On the pricing we are thinking of the MPB CareZ with MEC for my husband and I.  We are in the 50-64 age group.  So for the $2500 IUA it would be $561/month correct?  Thank you', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2020-07-07 15:26:57', '2020-07-07 15:26:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053518016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011497108', 'Kathleen Walsh', NULL, 'missed call while on phone.  gave her a call back and left a message. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-07 15:21:19', '2020-07-07 15:21:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053518011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035547277', 'Flora Schule', NULL, 'Flora called in wanting give and urgent care the name of her provider.  I told her that it wasn''t insurance, that she needed to present herself as a self pay patient, ask for the best cash discount, and make sure to grab the detailed medical receipt on the way out in case the medical need somehow ended up over $5000.  I told her that I would send her instructions on how to open up a new medical need with Sedera.  She was thankful for the call back. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-07 15:19:39', '2020-07-07 15:19:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053498042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028384181', 'Tess Weaver', NULL, '7-7-20 Talked with Tess and explained options and they want the cheapest option and she''s not sure if they fund an HSA, so likely they don''t. She understands they will pay for low cost wellness and only one of them went this year. She will go online and read through it all and will choose MPB CareZ without the MEC for $596.50 at $1000 IUA. She''ll let me know if she has any troubles.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-07 15:12:14', '2020-07-07 15:12:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053498037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028177143', 'Heidi Piper', NULL, '7-7-20 Wants to keep the MEC for the HSA compliance. She has not used the wellness component and wants to use it. Sent her the link to gov site. She''s joining MPB CareZ at $344/$1000.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-07 15:01:45', '2020-07-07 15:01:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053498029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028177143', 'Heidi Piper', NULL, '7-7-20 Talking to help decide on options.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-07 14:46:46', '2020-07-07 14:51:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053498021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018451062', 'Patricia Bedell', NULL, '7-7-20 2 kids in CU and still being difficult about approving MCS. She''s going to decide whether to try again for waiver even though CU said only once or file 22 yr old as independent and get him on ACA. She''ll ponder it all over the next week. CU will cost $3800 for two kids per semester.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-07 14:45:37', '2020-07-07 14:46:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053520003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000168084', 'Michael Horwitz', NULL, 'When  I spoke with Micheal earlier I was not able to give him the info he needed because I did not have access to his account with MeMD and we do not work with Liberty anymore. I did not tell him that part but I apologized and said I would relay the message to John. He then started being very very disrespectful and downgrading my job skill and that I even have a job here if I can''t help him. Questioning why I was the one to call him back if he was calling John and why I would call back if I don''t have the answers and stating that I should know everything because that is what a concierge does. I told him that when anyone leaves a message with out messaging service for call backs that EVERYONE can see it and it is mine and Kelly''s job to call members back, and if we can''t provide answers for them we direct them to the correct person that can. I felt very upset with the way he was talking to me down grading me and pretty much calling me stupid. I feel very uncomfortable speaking with him every again. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-07 14:34:19', '2020-07-07 14:34:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053498016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990335', 'Charles Grigsby', NULL, '7-7-20 Talked with Shirley. Charles just had a back surgery in Jan. 2020 and may need more work. Also may need hip surgery I think she said. He''s moving to Medicare in 9 months. They may wait to do anything else until on Medicare but not certain. They are also deciding if he will get colonoscopy soon or wait. Told her to keep him with Sedera since he''s grandfathered into the membership and they are done with pre-x clause as of Dec. 2020. She hasn''t seen dr. for anything and is likely going to move to MPB CareZ and likely without the MEC and pay for low cost wellness on her own. She''ll decide. She''s 20 months away from Medicare. Also deciding if she gets her mammogram now or waits. Likely will wait since doesn''t need it until Nov. technically.  They will split membership with MPB Sedera Access Plus for Charles and MPB Carez for Shirley.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-07 14:27:14', '2020-07-07 14:27:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053518003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000168084', 'Michael Horwitz', NULL, 'he called in very upset that no one was able to help him regarding MeMD- I searched his emails and found that John had reached out to him about this last Oct.  He said that it wasn''t the issue- that for the last 2 months he has been getting charged $60 and all of the sudden NOT able to use the service.  He demanded that I tell him if his service has changed again, and I told him not to my knowledge and that the only one who could see the back end of things was John.  It is worth noting that I did offer to transfer him from the start but he declined and stated that as concierge I should know what is going on, and help him gain more clarity than the concierge  gave him earlier.  He wasn''t the nicest but he also is sick and needs to use the service. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-07-07 14:14:48', '2020-07-07 14:17:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053498011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055125026', 'Matthew Bennett', NULL, '7-7-20 Moved meeting to next week to wait for MPB CareZ.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-07 14:09:05', '2020-07-07 14:09:05'),
