  ('zcrm_1579374000053503003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001060051', 'Matthew Ross', NULL, 'I contacted member about a ticket he created, he advised he would wait for Wendy to contact him back.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-07 12:58:21', '2020-07-07 12:58:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053498003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012273746', 'David Peck', NULL, '7-7-20 David just called and confirmed he chose MPB CareZ with  MEC $1000/$636. Told him to call Concierge to set up Virtual Care next.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-07 12:49:37', '2020-07-07 12:49:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053459026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028354156', 'Amy Moore', NULL, '7-7-20 Chose MPB CareZ w/ MEC $636/$1000 and lives in PA. All set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-07 12:33:31', '2020-07-07 12:33:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053459018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054286250', 'Sean Barrett', NULL, '7-7-20 Weighing his options of Sedera vs Zion. MPB Care+ is $203/$500 vs $209/$1000. BUT prices as Individual might be slightly different when Zion is ready.  He''s a PT himself so not helpful that Zion has more visits for that kind of therapy. Told him price with MPB Care+ is going up in a few months and don''t know price yet. MPB CareZ will be stable. He''ll just decide based on price and lowest IUA. He may even join MPB Care+ until they increase the price and then switch. Need to determine if we have same $125 up front fee.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-07 12:19:20', '2020-07-07 12:19:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053463018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011537009', 'Jeanine Ford', NULL, 'Jeanine called in and said that she got the email about the renewal and had a few questions. I told her that she is to call her affiliate Wiley Long about this. She than said well why would you guys put your 800 number on the email if I am not supposed to call you guys. I said she certainly can call here but we advise you speak to your affiliate to be able to go over what is best for you. That is not what I do, I am not a sales rep. She said she wanted to know what all the MO MC MF MS is. I told her what each one means and she said thank you that is all I needed and hung up. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-07 12:11:25', '2020-07-07 12:11:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053459013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020350047', 'John Knowlton', NULL, '7-7-20 John''s meds Levemir are going from $90 for 1 vial 100 ml a month with Welldyne RX (Co-Pay Network) to $500+ on new Citizen''s RX. Plus test strips are going from $20 to $160! With Zion MEC with Planstin they work with OptumRX and told him to create an account to test pricing there for possible move to Zion.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-07 11:51:31', '2020-07-07 11:51:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053459008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010282165', 'Alicia Turbidy', NULL, '7-7-20 Alicia has to choose MPB Sedera Access Plus bc of pre-x and upcoming breast surgery in Sept. She knows of price increase and knows she doesn''t really have a choice. Already completed renewal for $1163/$500 I think.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-07-07 11:42:03', '2020-07-07 12:26:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053463013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028384181', 'Tess Weaver', NULL, 'Greg called in and said that he has  been have an issue with his eye and that he knows he is responsible for the first $1000 of his IUA but he wanted to know if everything accumulates with different doctors he is going to. I told him yes anything that is pertaining to that issue goes towards his IUA, once he is close to the IUA than that is when he needs to get in contact with Sedera and open up a Need. He fully understood and just wanted to make sure he is doing the right thing. I sent him the email that explains how he submits his bills and starts a Need with Sedera. I told him once he is close to the IUA to contact them ahead of time to let them know what is going on and they can help him  with opening a Need. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-07 11:33:22', '2020-07-07 11:33:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053464008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010954128', 'Brent Toevs', NULL, 'Directed this member to Darius called in with questions about conversion', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-07 11:12:04', '2020-07-07 11:12:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053468008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881700', 'Thomas (Tom) Traxler', NULL, 'Spoke to member spoke to Andrea Hinman already. Will reschedule call in August for refresh of new plan. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-07-07 11:09:04', '2020-07-07 11:09:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053463008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881658', 'James Lynch', NULL, 'James called in in regards to the email that went out about changing plans. I stopped him and said that he needs to contact his affiliate. He said he did and she directed him back to us and told the member that "She is pretty pissed about this letter going out because she was not told anything and has no info to give him and to call us." I told him that she should have known about this but I took down his name and number and per Rod to Patti to have Guy or Ron call him about this. He also told me that he has surgery this Thursday 7/9/20 and that Analisa told him to stay with what he has other wise it will not be covered. I confirmed this with Patti and she said that is correct. If he changes now the surgery will not be covered. He also said that Analisa told him that to get the 2ndMD is through us. Which is incorrect. All of that is through Sedera. I gave him Sedera''s phone number. He has already started a Need to all of this because he has had several other appointments that led to him needing this surgery.  He was afraid that they won''t have any info to give him and how is everything being documented. I told him that since he has started a Need about all of this they will certainly have his info and to give Sedera a call and they will walk him through the 2ndMD process. He was very happy to hear that and is looking forward to hearing back from someone about the Renewal email that just went out. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-07 10:59:09', '2020-07-07 10:59:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053468003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001207493', 'Eben Grace', NULL, 'Spoke to member suggested to call his advisor Wendy to go over new plan options. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-07-07 10:33:53', '2020-07-07 10:33:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053464003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716704', 'Dawn Olson', NULL, 'This member called in and got the Concierge asking for information about the change in plan.  Said that Analisa had no information, did not know the emails were going out and directed her back to us.  I spoke to the member and she is funding an HSA so CareZ is her only option.  She will contact me if she has any questions.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-07 10:28:28', '2020-07-07 10:28:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053463003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716704', 'Dawn Olson', NULL, 'Dawn called in and she said she was calling in regards to the email that just went out about the renewal that is going on . I told her that she is to speak with her affiliate about this to help her enroll and tell her about all the options and what would be best for her. She said she did call Analisa and her response was she did not know there was an email going out, she does not have any of the pricing, and had no information to give her and directed Dawn back to us... I gave the call to Patti. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-07 10:26:57', '2020-07-07 10:26:57'),
