  ('zcrm_1579374000053387028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011809076', 'Phil McGee', NULL, 'I contacted member and he had questions.  He is not cover under another plan and would like to retain his wife on the plan.  He advised that she is in the middle of a need I told him that she would need to stay with Sedera.  He said that he would look ove the Sedera guidelines and be in touch with me.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-06 11:52:20', '2020-07-06 11:52:20'),
