  ('zcrm_1579374000053408003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029348121', 'Kristen Stephen', NULL, 'Kristen called in and Patti spoke to her. She got bit by a snake and had to go to the ER immediately of course and she just got a bill for $22,000. She called in freaking out because she was thinking she needs to pay all of that. Patti explained to her what needs to be done with opening a Need with Sedera. Patti let her know she is only responsible for $500 of her IUA. As son as she said that is all she needs to pay she was instantly  relieved that she is not going to have to pay the whole $22,000. Patti gave her Sedera''s phone number and told her to give them a call and let them know that she needs to open up Need and Sedera will walk her through the whole process. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-07-06 10:13:23', '2020-07-06 10:13:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000053387013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029348121', 'Kristen Stephen', NULL, 'Member called in and told me that she has just received a bill in the mail for $22K from a hospital bill for a snake bite.  She was very upset.  I told her that all she would be responsible for would be her $500 IUA.  I directed her to call Sedera and someone there would step her through the process.  She was much happier after we spoke.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-07-06 10:12:12', '2020-07-06 10:12:12'),
