  ('zcrm_1579374000052834018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055125026', 'Matthew Bennett', NULL, '6-23-20 Elena is 40 and Matt is 43 and live in Gunbarrel. Using Cigna now at $1000 month with $6500 Ded. They are self-employed, healthy. Matt had hypertension about 36 months ago, he''s going to check. Listened to full audio. We are going to wait to see if Zion is ready to go since only a 24 month pre-x look back and price is cheaper per month and won''t have to re-enroll or set up new bank account, etc. Super nice and open to my thoughts when new option is ready. I didn''t send follow up emails as to not inundate them with too many options.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-06-23 13:59:10', '2020-06-23 13:59:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052808055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529351', 'Rebecca Stirling', NULL, 'Member emailed me letting me know that she wanted to cancel for the next period.  I sent her the Cancellation link &amp; copied Wendy on it.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-23 13:00:53', '2020-06-23 13:00:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052834013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052864149', 'Catherine Brown', NULL, '6-23-20 Joining the MPB Secure which I kept referring to as Provider Directed Healthcare by accident. Only pre-x is asthma and allergies for one kid and Jeff''s car accident which he''s still getting chiro for about every 3 months. So, this is great option for them for now. I told Cathy the price may change in Aug or thereafter. We can revisit if Zion looks to be better solution at that time. She''s open to that. They have nothing for the month of July and Cobra opt in period ends at end of June. Will want to get Epi pen through our MPB Concierge not through Redirect for best price. Choosing $953/$1000 IUA.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-06-23 12:37:18', '2020-06-23 12:37:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052808050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052815104', 'Alisa Shepherd', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA 50-59 MPB Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-23 12:36:27', '2020-06-23 12:36:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052834008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041906068', 'Sue Lepping', NULL, '6-23-20 Sue went in for annual wellness visit and just did online check in. She put MPB as provider and bill is $461 or so. She didn''t ask for cash price she just got a bill. She now understands she did it wrong. She will call Redirect and see what they can do for her.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-06-23 11:13:43', '2020-06-23 11:13:43'),
