  ('zcrm_1579374000052808025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041406092', 'Pratik Patil', NULL, 'Member notified me that July pmt reverted back to previous pmt information.  I made sure payment was assigned to new info and deleted old info.  Hopefully problem solved.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-23 08:53:57', '2020-06-23 08:53:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052808011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601403', 'Christine Kennedy', NULL, 'I gave Christine a refresher on how to handle Preventative Care.  She will be getting yearly check &amp; Bone Density.  I advised that Bone Density was for members over 60 she said that it had been shared last year.  I reiterated that everything must be coded as preventative (she is a cancer survivor) or it will nt be shared,  She also noticed that her address needed to be updated, I looked thru our Member Change forms and did not have one for her so I sent out one for her to update her address.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-23 08:22:00', '2020-06-23 08:23:31'),
