  ('zcrm_1579374000052794003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041599062', 'Alexander Allison', NULL, 'Received an email from this member that said that he "signed up for new benefits early in the year" and just noticed he was paying us.  I responded with the link to the cancellation form  letting him know that I could refund him the July MCS.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-23 07:03:50', '2020-06-23 07:03:50'),
