  ('zcrm_1579374000052695013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050504066', 'Deborah Madsen', NULL, '6-19-20 I just noticed this account was never moved to July 1st per Bill and Deborah''s request. Their employer kept them on their employer group coverage through the end of June. They''ve already been charged for June and inquired about a refund immediately following the charge to their account last month. Patti and I had talked at the time and we both thought it had been fixed since. But, it doesn''t appear any change or refund has been made. Start date is still showing June 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-06-19 12:07:02', '2020-06-19 12:07:02'),
