  ('zcrm_1579374000052697003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610303', 'Lauren Rathbun', NULL, 'Lauren''s mother called in and said that she is trying to help Lauren navigate who she needs to call and what she needs to do about a procedure that Lauren had. her mother said they have only paid $300 out of pocket and they just got another bill in the mail for $1500. Lauren has a $1000 IUA. I let her know that she has to pay the remainder of her IUA and then submit the rest of the billing into Sedera and open up a "Need". I gave her mother Sedera''s phone number and sent and email that explains how to submit her bills to Sedera. I also highly recommend that Lauren have another Welcome call because her mother said they have no clue how to use anything or who to call for what. Lauren has not ever used anything with her plan up until now, so I sent out a Welcome Call Scheduler. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-06-19 11:35:57', '2020-06-19 11:35:57'),
