  ('zcrm_1579374000052695003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030706004', 'Kathleen Duke', NULL, '6-19-20 Kathy just enrolled for MPB Care+. I waived the $100 enrollment fee bc she was already a member just a few months ago with MPB Group. She thought she was going to have employer coverage here on out but that didn''t happen. It''s ending June 30th. I helped her enroll from her cell phone! It worked well since she doesn''t have internet service yet while she''s moving. It was quite easy from a phone. I mirrored her on my end to see what it was like. She signed the form with her finger which is easier than a computer with a cursor. She chose the $2500 IUA for $419 at age 64.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-06-19 11:27:23', '2020-06-19 11:27:23'),
