  ('zcrm_1579374000052619075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052659258', 'Adriane Olson', NULL, '6-18-20 Adriane listened to audio and just has hypothyroidism and takes meds to manage it. She gets blood work done about 1x a year and already pays for that on her own. She''s 46 and is losing work coverage July 1st. We started enrollment but there was a glitch. John has fixed glitch but she ran out of time. She will enroll tonight and let me know. We walked through the entire application already so she knows how to complete it and choose the correct $1000/$296 PSDHC for CA clients. She''s getting her wellness visit done this week and won''t need it for another year so not currently worried about the PHCS network. But, she knows it''s important for next year.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-06-18 13:35:06', '2020-06-18 13:35:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052619070', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052617079', 'Merryl Rothaus', NULL, 'member Only $1500 IUA 40-49 MPB Direct Care', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-18 12:52:44', '2020-06-18 12:52:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052619065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029364176', 'Andrew Bibb', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I will cancel RCI &amp; Sedera &amp; billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-18 12:36:45', '2020-06-18 12:36:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052619060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052617079', 'Merryl Rothaus', NULL, '6-18-20 Listened to audio. We only had 20 minutes and she got questions answered and enrolled in MPB Direct bc she''s a member of Cloud Medical already. She also a LHS member and was super eager to jump ship bc they are such a mess right now. She just had a nasal septum surgery last week and 2 others. She is done with surgeries. He surgeon just moved to FL. She knows it''s a pre-x. She asked about Lyme disease and I told her the guidelines are newly limiting care for Lyme disease. She hasn''t been treated for a few years and isn''t sure if she will get treated again, but knows there are major restrictions. Cloud can help a bit but they aren''t experts on that by any means. She is 49 and DOB is 11/11/1970, so turning 50 in Nov. I gave her the new rates for 50. She chose $1500 IUA at $192 and will be $230 when turns 50.  She will cancel LHS via their new cancellation link.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-06-18 12:36:45', '2020-06-18 12:36:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052635003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043013016', 'Tranquilino Padilla', NULL, 'A doctor called in from a a doctors office asking to verify Tranquilino''s benefits. It was an orthopedic appointment so Patti let them know that he is to present himself as a cash pay patient. That is something that is not covered as Preventative. He is responsible for the first $2500 of his IUA out of pocket. So Patti let them know how he is to present himself as cash pay and then the doctor asked if he is to send all his receipts into us. No he is to submit everything into Sedera only if the appointments are more than his $2500 IUA. Other than that no he keep''s everything until he goes over the IUA and then contacts Sedera to open a "Need". Tranquilino has been told this numerous time over and over again. Another member that never seems to remember anything about his plan. He constantly needs to be told the same thing over and over again. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-06-18 12:21:04', '2020-06-25 12:51:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052619003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091048002', 'Jessica Couch', NULL, 'I am cancelling this member as she has always had a poor payment history.  She owes us for May &amp; June.  I sent her an email with no response.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-18 10:27:30', '2020-06-18 10:27:30'),
