  ('zcrm_1579374000052552008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041823048', 'Mary Marchwinski', NULL, 'I just sent Mary all of the info and some smart suggestions she can utilize for her Vitrectomy surgery.  All set. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-06-17 16:34:40', '2020-06-17 16:34:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052552003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024355002', 'Linda Reely', NULL, 'Linda called stating that she is getting so many bills and notices and she just wants to know when she will get paid.  She sounded pretty grumpy, I told her that I would need to transfer the line to Sedera.  I transferred the line to Megan. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-06-17 15:32:01', '2020-06-17 15:32:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052501042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052500143', 'Andrea Henderson', NULL, 'Member &amp; Child $1500 IUA 40-49 MPB Care+', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-17 13:12:58', '2020-06-17 13:12:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052527003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674272', 'LeAnn Gunnell', NULL, 'LeAnn called in and said that she needed to walked through how her plan works because she has yet to ever use anything with her plan. I put the call over to Patti to better explain because I am not to familiar with the Co-Pay plan. LeAnn was very very thankful for Patti explaining what she needed for now and said she feels a lot better. She needs to go to a Dermatologist, have a Mammogram done, and have her annual wellness visit. Patti explained everything needed. I sent LeAnn lists of providers for those 3 things and some general educational emails to help her out better as well. Presenting herself upon arrival, the provider search for in the future if she wants to do it herself, and 5 steps on how to avoid surprise bills with preventative visits. I also sent her a welcome call scheduler to have a welcome call which I highly recommend for her to have since she knew nothing on how her plan works and is using it for the first time. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-06-17 13:01:47', '2020-06-17 13:01:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052501037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674272', 'LeAnn Gunnell', NULL, 'Member called in to ask about Preventative Care, Dermatology &amp; Mammogram.  How do they all work on her plan.  I explained how  office visits and preventative care are handled.  Kelly will send her list of PCP, Dermatologists &amp; Imaging Centers.  I also gave her the option of having another Welcome Call Kelly will send that email also.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-17 12:43:03', '2020-06-17 12:43:03'),
