  ('zcrm_1579374000052480003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009604129', 'Lori Frisbie', NULL, 'second welcome call complete!  Lori said that she had much more understanding and that I did a really good job!  horray! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-06-16 17:53:46', '2020-06-16 17:53:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052461018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026991117', 'Ryan Dunlap', NULL, 'Ryan called in because he was trying to register for CirriusMD and it was not letting him in and saying that he can not be found. I let John know and he looked into it and said that Ryan was missed for some reason and John created a Ticket with Cirrius and as soon as we hear back from them we will give Ryan a call to let him know he is all set. I apologized to him and said we will get back to him asap. No one is sick in the house and there is not emergency, he was very thankful for looking into this for him and was not upset. Very nice gentleman. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-06-16 14:17:20', '2020-06-16 14:17:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052461013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009604129', 'Lori Frisbie', NULL, 'Lori called in and stated that she did not like the internist''s that Kelly Cheever sent as a list of providers yesterday and gave me a list of providers for me to search and see if they are in the Network. 3 out of the 5 providers she gave me ARE in the PHCS network. I sent her an email explaining so and with the 3 providers attachments with their information to call and address. I also sent her a Welcome Call Scheduler because she does not understand this plan what  so ever. She has no clue who is who and what is what. She is very very confused about everything, she then asked what would happen if she does not stay in the network and I told her that ASi might cover 130% of Medicare allowable but no one will know how much that will be because we don''t know the cost of her appointment. I told her she would need to submit the billing into ASi and see what they say. It is not a guarantee that they will cover anything. I strongly advised she stay in the network. I also sent her an email that has the Wellness Visit Instructions on how to present herself and her ASi card upon arrival. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-06-16 14:05:19', '2020-06-16 14:05:19'),
