  ('zcrm_1579374000052452018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024784709', 'Paul Knaysi', NULL, 'Member called in asking about a colonoscopy.  I advised that since he is amamber of a DPC that this is something that Sedera would share.  I told him that he was to get the best pricing and that he would pay out of pocket and that he would be reimbursed for the expense.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-16 12:29:37', '2020-06-16 12:29:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052461008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024784709', 'Paul Knaysi', NULL, 'Paul called in and asked what he needs to do because his doctor suggests that he get a colonoscopy. I had Patti inform him on what to do since I was not quite sure and wanted to give him the correct info. He will present himself as a cash pay patient and then he is to submit everything into Sedera and they will reimburse him. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-06-16 12:28:56', '2020-06-16 12:28:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052462003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045539150', 'maria molina', NULL, '6-16-20 I spoke with Analisa about Maria. Analisa had an in-person meeting with Maria and enrolled Maria during their 2 hour in-person meeting. Analisa did NOT take her credit card information. Maria actually enrolled with ACH. Analisa did help Maria enroll via Analisa''s computer. Maria gave Analisa the banking information to enter at the time of application in-person. Maria did NOT disclose any pre-existing conditions to Analisa nor at the time of enrollment on the application. Analisa did a full qualification of the client prior to choosing PSDHC as the best option for the client. Maria also speaks English well in spite of her claiming not to understand.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-06-16 11:24:09', '2020-06-16 11:24:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052461003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650322', 'Kathryn McGaughey', NULL, 'Katherine called in and said she is filling out some paper work and it is asking her for her Insurance ID number. I pulled up her profile here and she has Redirect and I let her know that she is to get in contact with them for anything pertaining to her plan. She then asked me what we are here. She said she is confused and new to this so she doesn''t understand what MPowering is to her if she is supposed to contact Redirect for everything. I let her know what we do for her, the Concierge Services, Prescription quotes, ect. She then asked if she is to put down on whatever paperwork she is filling out Redirect or us MPowering Benefits. I told her she would put down as her "Insurance" Redirect Health and she confirmed their phone number with me which she had it correct. She is going to call them now for any other questions she has. I let her know that she is to call them always for her first point of contact for anything medical and pertaining to her plan. She understood after I explained it better for her. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-06-16 11:01:50', '2020-06-16 11:01:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052452013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045889059', 'David Norris', NULL, 'Received Payment update, I will update in CRM', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-16 10:35:29', '2020-06-16 10:35:29'),
