  ('zcrm_1579374000052419003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919395', 'Michael (Mikhail) Kaspin', NULL, 'still working on billing issue with Michael- the provider is being difficult.  Here is an email I got back from Nancy at ASI and then shared with Michael.- 
