  ('zcrm_1579374000052395008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043491144', 'Margaret Sherman', NULL, 'I spoke to members spouse and explained to him that there was a difference in the plan that they both were on and the plan that his wife was on.  Explained that old plan was no longer available.  He understood.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-15 09:09:25', '2020-06-15 09:09:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052401008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043491144', 'Margaret Sherman', NULL, 'Micheal the husband called in and asked when both him and his wife were on the plan together they were paying about $600 something and when he aged out and turned 65 and now it is just his wife, why is the amount per month still 600 something bucks. Wondering why the amount did not lower when it became just his wife. I let him know Patti is going to look into that for him and give him a call back because we are all on a conference call right now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-06-15 08:34:58', '2020-06-15 08:34:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052401003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034425101', 'Ranya Malouf DeLapine', NULL, 'Emailed about cancelling her membership due to getting insurance through her job now. I sent the cancellation email with the link to the online form. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-06-15 07:41:04', '2020-06-15 07:41:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052395003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005322038', 'Kelley Winovich', NULL, 'In looking over this members account this hasn''t been paid in almost 2 yrs ows $950.  Do not understand why Sunny would let this go so long.  I cancelled without notifying member.  No excuse for this.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-15 07:20:43', '2020-06-15 07:20:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052351028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050550098', 'Sarah Price', NULL, 'Staff from "Mindful Pediatrics" called because Sarah told them that we were going to pay for the visit.  I explained that the member has Redirect Health and gave the woman their number. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-06-12 16:54:29', '2020-06-12 16:54:29'),
