  ('zcrm_1579374000052209011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000077957004', 'Amber Rego', NULL, '6-10-20 Amber is the boss of James Kreitman and James got her to set up a group with Sedera. The group was accidentally given to Martin Eguagu (sp?) at Sedera. They forgot to look to see if the client was connected to anyone. They''ve trained Martin now so it won''t happen again. They have moved the Group back to MPB and to me. But, billing was already set up as far as I know. I will leave well enough alone at this point. It''s a small group of 5 at the moment. See notes in James Kreitman''s account.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-06-10 20:36:52', '2020-06-10 20:36:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052207016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012630172', 'Jessica Lynn Showalter', NULL, 'I tried calling the family to get David''s personal email, per John.  I left a message as well as emailed them with that request and tagged Kelly F and John so that we can get all of this resolved asap. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-06-10 18:29:48', '2020-06-10 18:29:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052207011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012630172', 'Jessica Lynn Showalter', NULL, 'still waiting on getting this family''s Teladoc issue resolved.  I reached out to Dania after a day of "dead air" and she emailed me "instructions"  they seemed pretty confusing to me, but I tried to login as David- it wouldn''t let me go any further than that because it never gave me a Sedera option.  I took screen shots and sent them along with the email that Dania sent me and forwarded all that information over to John to see if he could help. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-06-10 16:00:52', '2020-06-10 16:00:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052209003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035268055', 'Earl Henderson', NULL, '6-10-20 Earl called to ask about Conversion note on his annual renewal policy. Once he understood converting will cost more money he decided he wants to leave it alone for now. He has until 2029 to convert. He has LTC already, so less interested in converting for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-06-10 15:29:13', '2020-08-03 16:21:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052207003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049368070', 'Holly Singer', NULL, 'called and left detailed message (for welcome call)  I told her that if now wasn''t a good time for her she could call me back later since I will be here on shift until 9:00 est.  I also explained that I would send out a re-scheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-06-10 15:18:36', '2020-06-10 15:58:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052204011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037438063', 'James Kreitman', NULL, 'Hi Luke,

I''m bummed to report that my client James Kreitman just called in to ask how to cancel his Individual membership because he now has 5 members of his company enrolled in Sedera directly as a group for July 1st. His Assistant Amber helped him sign up the group. She said she called into Sedera directly and was transferred to Martin Egwuagu to set up his group. Unbeknownst to me, Martin has set them up and completed the process, effectively bypassing me. I educated and enrolled James back in Aug. 1 of 2019. Now I have lost the client since his assistant called Sedera directly and Sedera transferred the group to Martin.  I thought there were methods in place to make sure Sedera''s members remain with their original Advisor and partner company.

Any insight and solution to this will be greatly appreciated!

Thanks,

Wendy Scipione

Hi Wendy,

We do all we can to support affiliates to keep their client relationships. However, in the end It is up to the affiliate and/or the group itself, not up to Sedera, to ensure that you keep your clients. I''m curious why this group did not go to you directly when they were ready to move to Select rather than call us? 

The good news is.. Martin is a Sedera rep, there is no affiliate allocated to this account. I see no reason why we cannot add you as the referral affiliate to this group So that you can continue the ongoing admin support and receive referral fees. I will be getting with Bill to make sure I haven''t overlooked anything here and get right back with you!

Luke Facker

Sorry about this one all.  I passed this lead to Martin (rookie) while Luke was out and did not know they were with you all.  I will make sure the team is aware to check if someone looking to sign on as a group is part of the community.  

Luke - Please add MPB as the Referral Affiliate.


Bill

All set! Wendy is listed as RA, MPB listed as SA. Thanks Bill.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-06-10 14:37:13', '2020-06-10 14:37:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052204003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610603', 'Robert Morey', NULL, '6-10-20 Rob needs dental work. He has pain in his tooth. He had a root canal 12 years ago and now there''s an infection which needs antibiotics and maybe his tooth pulled and then an implant done over 3-6 months which will cost $5K. He sees Dr. Corey Johnson at 81601 in Glenwood Springs. I called dentist office and asked what insurance plans they accept for Individuals and talked with Natalie who was super nice. She said you can''t win the dental insurance game. The cost isn''t worth the coverage that you get which is exactly what I had told Rob. She and I were on the exact same page. Delta Dental Premier PPO Plus Preventative is the only one they accept, but again not worth the money after the waiting periods and limits that exist. Dental discount cards don''t help either, except for potential chain around the country. Rob will work directly with dentist to figure out payment solution.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-06-10 14:22:36', '2020-06-10 14:33:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052171023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029000316', 'Symone Sandquist', NULL, 'After receiving returned mail back from RCI for this member, I contacted her for an updated address.  House # was wrong shoud be 4345  I ahve updated in CRM &amp; RCI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-10 14:08:15', '2020-06-10 14:08:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052171018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043265090', 'Janet Thomson', NULL, 'Received returned EOB form RCI to send to this member.  Address not updated in RCI Portal.  I will send to this member.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-10 13:42:55', '2020-06-10 13:42:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052171013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044006639', 'Ashley Semidey', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to update address I will update.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-10 12:52:44', '2020-06-10 12:52:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052183008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045438095', 'Charlene Buffington', NULL, 'Called in to see what the process is because her son had an allergic reaction to something and her pediatrician gave her a list of doctors to use and she just wanted to make sure she was doing the right thing. I explained to her how the process goes with anything that is injury/illness and that she would present herself as a cash pay patient up to her IUA of $2500. I told her she can go to any provider of her choice there is no network she needs to stay in or specific provider. It is all up to her choice. I told her I will send her an email that explains how to open up a "Need" with sedera and how to submit her bills along with their phone number she can call anytime if she has any questions on how the process works and what not. She was very very thankful for the information and she said we are soooo much better than any traditional insurance she has ever been on and loves us to much. She said we are always so quick and always answers her questions with ease. Very happy member with our services. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-06-10 12:46:44', '2020-06-10 12:46:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052184003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052185004', 'Brian Keith', NULL, 'Completed Presentation on MPB Care + product: 2500 IUA/Family Plan....Will discuss with wife and possibly enroll on 6/10/2020', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2020-06-10 12:36:35', '2020-06-10 12:36:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052183003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031476065', 'Michelle Sangster', NULL, 'Michelle called in and said that she has yet to use preventative services with us because she hates going to the doctor. She has used Teladoc for small things but she said it is time to have her woman''s wellness visit. I explained in detail what she needs to do and how that works and making sure everything is covered at 100%. She was very thankful for all the info I told her and will be looking up OBGYN''s in her area and send her the list and general education emails for preventative care. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-06-10 12:35:15', '2020-06-10 12:35:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052171008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014900054', 'Terry Talley', NULL, 'Member submitted payment update request I will update info.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-10 12:25:11', '2020-06-10 12:25:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052171003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011508227', 'Debra Heap', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel all vendors and billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-10 12:15:52', '2020-06-10 12:15:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052163003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052185004', 'Brian Keith', NULL, 'Client changed presentation to 2:00pm on 6/10/20.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2020-06-10 11:31:38', '2020-06-10 11:31:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052161003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011508227', 'Debra Heap', NULL, 'Debra called into cancel with us, she said she was looking as a cancellation survey, I told I am not sure if that is correct one but I will send her the email with the link to the cancellation form and to just fill it out and click submit and to make sure to get the form in BEFORE the 20th of the month because that is when we start billing for the next month''s payment. She said that is fine and will have it in today. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-06-10 10:58:24', '2020-06-10 10:58:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052129013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028177004', 'Aaron Barnwell', NULL, 'Linda called in and requested cancellation I will send out link for Cancellation request', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-10 10:12:40', '2020-06-10 10:12:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052129008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014900054', 'Terry Talley', NULL, 'Member called and wanted to update Payment info.  I will send out link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-10 08:00:02', '2020-06-10 08:00:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052129003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011508227', 'Debra Heap', NULL, 'Updated Payment info', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-10 07:32:43', '2020-06-10 07:32:43');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000052115003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610603', 'Robert Morey', NULL, 'Robert called to see if he had any dental benefits.  I told him that I would reach out to Wendy and ask that she give him a phone call.  I also explained our structure and how his plan works. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-06-09 16:34:57', '2020-06-09 16:34:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052114003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031044058', 'Samantha Midler', NULL, '6-9-20 Samantha tried to get bills negotiated on her own and neither the clinic or lab is helping much and it may take many weeks for them to respond. She was told by Sedera that the Karis Group won''t negotiate her bills since they are less than $1000. I asked her to forward that email to me from Sedera to work with Dania to get the Karis Group to help.  She will send it along.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-06-09 15:29:40', '2020-06-09 15:29:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052062063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047153215', 'Marcel Tuerlings', NULL, 'Charged Luis late for the June payment due to issues in Admin 123.  Emailed him to let him know', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-09 13:54:05', '2020-06-09 13:54:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052084013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002469017', 'Floyd Trujillo', NULL, 'Floyd called in and stated that he went to go have his Preventative Colonoscopy and he made very clear that it has to be Preventative only and because of what has been going on with the COVID-19 they had Floyd do Color Guard take home test. That is NOT something that is covered as preventative. John got on the line and asked Floyd to take a picture of the bill he got from the laboratory for his test he did and send it over to John''s phone and he will try and see is ASI will make an exception because of the pandemic that has been going on. Normally insurance companies would not cover because there are too many false negatives and false positives, it is not very reliable. John will get back with Floyd tomorrow with the response from ASI if he gets one. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-06-09 13:05:44', '2020-06-09 13:05:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052106003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052086002', 'Judy Aponte-Randall', NULL, 'Call Judy today and discussed her needs.  She is 64 and looking for something to provide her some inexpensive coverage until she can apply for Medicare.  I briefly discussed Care products.  We are scheduled to talk again', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2020-06-09 11:20:01', '2020-06-09 11:20:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052062058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029364233', 'Chelsea Bibb', NULL, 'Member cancelled', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-09 11:08:07', '2020-06-09 11:08:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052062053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002065001', 'Rob Winings', NULL, 'cancelled Member', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-09 11:01:15', '2020-06-09 11:01:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052062048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034859046', 'Bryan Potter', NULL, 'member cancelled', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-09 10:53:57', '2020-06-09 10:53:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052084008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049368070', 'Holly Singer', NULL, 'Daniel Zaborowski, Holly''s agent, called in today and asked about telemedicine. I looked in her emails and she was just sent at 11:59AM today the CirrusMD registration email. I told him this and to have her look at her email and to follow what the email says to register. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-06-09 10:47:32', '2020-06-09 10:47:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052062043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034059109', 'Hanan Al Hajry', NULL, 'Member cancelled', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-09 10:38:08', '2020-06-09 10:38:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052062038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028459001', 'Jessica Tabachnik', NULL, 'Member cancelled', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-09 10:26:26', '2020-06-09 10:26:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052062033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016626048', 'John Cutshall', NULL, 'Member cancelled', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-09 10:23:41', '2020-06-09 10:23:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052062028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035227061', 'Marie Folsom', NULL, 'Marie emailed me and informed me that she will now be able to pay going forward.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-09 10:20:12', '2020-06-09 10:20:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052084003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028384340', 'James Frohman', NULL, 'I had a Jesse call in and was with James and was calling on behalf of him and just wanted to figure out how his plan works with certain appointments that James needs to have done. There are 3 different procedures he listed to me and they are ALL Injury/Illness and he needs to have done. I explained to Jesse how that all works and for each procedure they are all 3 separate "Needs" and he is to present himself as a cash pay patient up to his IUA of $2500. I gave him Sedera''s number and told him to call Sedera ASAP! He understood and I told him I will email him the 64+ List of Preventative procedures that are Preventative and covered but his plan of RCI. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-06-09 08:52:32', '2020-06-09 08:52:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052062023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041770021', 'Sarah Sumner', NULL, 'Redirect will reactivate eff 7/1', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-09 08:36:32', '2020-06-09 08:36:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052062018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041770021', 'Sarah Sumner', NULL, 'Notified by member that she is ready to reactivate for 7/1.  I will notify Sedera &amp; Redirect', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-09 08:11:00', '2020-06-09 08:11:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052062013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027654206', 'Elizabeth Burlingame', NULL, 'Member called in and asked how to change bank account being drated, I sent her the Payment update link and she submitted.  I will upodate', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-09 08:05:03', '2020-06-09 08:05:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052062008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990225', 'Joel Wallach', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel all vendors', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-09 07:55:29', '2020-06-09 07:55:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052062003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041659491', 'Jeffery Nolte', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I will submit to all vendors.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-09 07:48:49', '2020-06-09 07:48:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052020018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012630172', 'Jessica Lynn Showalter', NULL, 'members are having issues with getting registered with Teladoc- Dania has been trying to help. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-06-08 18:19:47', '2020-06-08 18:19:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052020013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041823048', 'Mary Marchwinski', NULL, '2nd welcome call completed!  Mary had many questions for me and I am going to try to assist her with some medical services through HCBB. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-06-08 18:17:00', '2020-06-08 18:17:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052020008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045539150', 'maria molina', NULL, 'member called in by first stating "I have a lot of medical problems, and the in network list that you sent me is out of my area."   
This is when I remembered the conversation we just had not too long ago below.  So then, began the same conversation we had before, I even reminded her that it was the same conversation.  She said that she wouldn''t have signed up for the plan if she wasn''t "entitled" to an annual care visit.  I told her that I would have Analisa give her a phone call.  Maria wanted me to send her a corrected list.  I called Joan for input- she suggested that I call Analisa.  Analisa has tried explaining this as well and it doesn''t seem as though anything is getting through.  I brought up Redirect and that Wendy had thought it was a good idea last month, to which Analisa said "who''s going to explain it to her?"  I told her that I would reach out to Ali and see if she can reach out to Maria sometime tomorrow. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-06-08 17:04:57', '2020-06-08 17:04:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052033018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012630172', 'Jessica Lynn Showalter', NULL, 'John was able to find Jessica in the Teladoc system with Jessica''s info, the only thing is they need to put the whole zip code in not just the first 4 numbers, and when they get to the site since she is already in the system to just click forgot password and she can get a new password set up and log in. I called David back to let him know this and gave him Teladoc''s number because they still did not get the email I sent. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-06-08 14:27:46', '2020-06-08 14:27:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052033013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012630172', 'Jessica Lynn Showalter', NULL, 'David called in and was asking about telamedicine services with his plan. I asked him if he or his wife who is the primary, remember registering with Teladoc and he said she kinda remembers it but would have no idea what the log in info would be. I sent them an email that has the Teladoc registration link and a step by step on what to do. I also let them know if they have any issues that Teladoc''s phone number is in there and they can call them if there is something wrong. John came up to me when I hung up the phone and had me try and login with Jessica''s info on teladoc.com and her info was not coming up. I slacked Sedera with Jessica''s name and DOB to see if she is in the system or not. Waiting for a response. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-06-08 14:12:55', '2020-06-08 14:12:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052043003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049368070', 'Holly Singer', NULL, '06.-05.20:  Called Holly.  Left message explaining reason for my call (to ask if I could clarify any aspects of her Self-directed program).  Requested that she return my call at her convenience.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-06-08 12:05:26', '2020-06-08 12:05:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052035012', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011509046', 'Greg Jenkins', NULL, 'Member left a ticket to ask if mammogram would be covered.  I explained that yearly "screening" Mammogram would be.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-08 11:58:28', '2020-06-08 11:58:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052033008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010857102', 'Kimi Mischke', NULL, 'Kimi called in and said that she needs to have a colonoscopy done and needs to find  a provider in the Network. I told her that I would send her an email that has the link to use the provider lookup website with the step by step instructions on how to navigate the site. I also sent her the Wellness Visit Instructions. Even though she knows the preventative process, I just wanted to send that to her to have it fresh in her mind on how to present her card and herself upon arrival. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-06-08 11:51:19', '2020-06-08 11:51:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052034011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000167691', 'Catherine Dailey', NULL, '6-8-20 Cat called bc she has an annual physical with PCP and separate annual pap screening with Gyn scheduled. She wanted to make sure she knows 100% what will and will not be shared. I sent her the verbiage from the sharing guidelines. She knows it says 1 visit per year and max of $400. So, she will have her PCP do all of the blood tests and code everything as wellness. She will submit pap screening and see what happens. But, she will also require BCH to give her the full cost of pap screening and visit up front. She''s nervous bc of money and her job situation right now. She''s open to the new MCS solution when we have it ready. She''s willing to pay a little more if it gives her a peace of mind.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-06-08 11:36:52', '2020-06-08 11:36:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052034003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030706004', 'Kathleen Duke', NULL, '6-8-20 I missed calling Kathy at 10:15 am! We moved our appt to 2:00 ish today. She''s in the middle of moving furniture right now and needs to find time to sit in front of the computer.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-06-08 11:25:30', '2020-06-08 11:27:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052033003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021903103', 'Jodi Anglin', NULL, 'Jodi called and asked about a few different vaccines if they are covered or not with her plan. Patti had a list that says which vaccines are covered and the 3 Jodi asked about are on that list. She told Jodi to reach out the RCI directly to get the specifics of which ones are and aren''t. Jodi will call RCI now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-06-08 11:04:48', '2020-06-08 11:04:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000052020003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048586020', 'David Kanning', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Will call us if he did not receive QR Life code card. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-06-08 07:54:17', '2020-06-08 07:54:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051964011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001520013', 'James (Jim) McCreight', NULL, '6-5-20 Played phone tag since she didn''t answer for our appt. She didn''t leave me a vm later when she called back and I didn''t reach her on my 2nd attempt. But, she might be a good candidate for Living Benefits in case cancer were to come back! It''s about 4-5 years past now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-06-05 15:19:15', '2020-06-05 15:19:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051953023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810847', 'Sally Hammond', NULL, 'I got a Claim form form Tricia that we received for this member.  It was for a Preventative office visit.  I followed up with the member and was assured by her and spouse that they went through Redirect and bill was paid.  They were happy with the process.  I will scan &amp; attache claim for future reference', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-05 13:52:24', '2020-06-05 13:52:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051964003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001520013', 'James (Jim) McCreight', NULL, '6-2-20 Wendy is cancer free from super rare cancer called something like waldenstrom lymphoma..... Only 2 people in world have it I think she said. So, she doesn''t know if it''s apt to come back or not. But, I haven''t found non ACA plans to will allow for previous cancer. She wants to join MPB Care+ and move family from LHS. Paying $550 now for rest of family and she has no insurance at the moment! They can do MPB Care+ for only $687 and $1500 IUA.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-06-05 12:02:24', '2020-06-05 12:02:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051953018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051949076', 'Michelle Smith', NULL, 'Member Only $500 IUA 30-32 MPB Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-05 11:48:48', '2020-06-05 11:48:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051953013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051949042', 'Aeja Dik', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA 50-59 MPB Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-05 11:30:09', '2020-06-05 11:30:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051953008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044061030', 'Denny Lewenkamp', NULL, 'Checked in Redirect Portal for Kelly''s addition she''s there', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-05 10:38:55', '2020-06-05 10:38:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051950008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044758303', 'Stephanie Hart', NULL, 'Stephanie thought this number she called reaching me was Redirect. I said it was not and gave her their phone number. She was very sweet and apologized and said she will be giving them a call now. She initially said she called a few days ago left a message and no one has called her back yet in regards to having a mammogram. I did let her know for future times she is always supposed to contact Redirect first with anything. She full understood. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-06-05 10:17:33', '2020-06-05 10:17:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051953003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043608110', 'Kevin Shah', NULL, 'Member submitted ticket asking how Covid testing &amp; antibody testing would be handled  Told him just like .any other injury/illness subject to IUA.  He also asked about insurance amount  to claim on PPP from gvt.  I gave him MEC amount since that is only portion that is insurance.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-05 08:36:13', '2020-06-05 08:36:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051952003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051951001', 'Randy Conoway', NULL, 'New Employee at Voelker Surveying...needs to be added for July 1, 2020 start date...need to contact employee to go over plan specifics.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2020-06-05 08:31:58', '2020-06-05 08:31:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051950003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716761', 'Bruce Talley', NULL, 'Laura called in and just wanted to make sure the places that she has used with us the last few years are still in the network before she goes and makes an appt. for her mammogram and yearly wellness visit. I looked up the facility and all that and everything is all good and still in the network. She even said she knows that we don''t cover the mammogram for density and the 3D ones. She knows its just the screening. Before she got off the phone (which I knew she would say yes since she has been doing all of this for a few years with us) if she knew how to present her ASi card and she yes she knows it all and knows about the billing coding and being submitted to the right places. She knows everything without being told when she calls in. She just double checks everything is still the same and in network providers. She is a VERY smart and mpowered member. She was very thankful for me checking up on everything for her. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-06-05 08:22:07', '2020-06-05 08:22:07'),
