  ('zcrm_1579374000051877013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037438063', 'James Kreitman', NULL, 'We received email back from this member stating "that he is transferring to his Sedera Corporate Account".  I reaced out to Wendy and told her this and she expressed to me that he was a member of Cloud Medical who has a relationship w/Hint and that maybe some of them formed a group.  She will be following up.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-04 11:41:05', '2020-06-04 11:41:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051906003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037438063', 'James Kreitman', NULL, '6-4-20 Left vm for Jim to help him cancel. Sounds like he''s joining a group and keeping Sedera.

Email I''m sending to Luke...

I''m bummed to report that my client James Kreitman just called in to ask how to cancel his Individual membership because he now has 5 members of his company enrolled in Sedera directly as a group for July 1st. His Assistant Amber helped him sign up the group. She said she called into Sedera directly and was transferred to Martin Egwuagu to set up his group. Unbeknownst to me, Martin has set them up and completed the process, effectively bypassing me. I educated and enrolled James back in Aug. 1 of 2019. Now I have lost the client since his assistant called Sedera directly and Sedera transferred the group to Martin.  I thought there were methods in place to make sure Sedera''s members remain with their original Advisor and partner company.

Any insight and solution to this will be greatly appreciated!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-06-04 11:38:44', '2020-06-04 12:24:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051891018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051410215', 'Ann Medina', NULL, 'Ann called in and was looking for Kelly Cheever. I let her know that Kelly does not start working until 4pm but that me and her have the same job so I can help her out. She was just confused on what Kelly had told her about app.sedera. I explained that she has Redirect and that Redirect is ALWAYS going to be her first point of contact but for anything injury/illness that is when she get Sedera involved to open up a need. I told her how she would be cash pay up to her IUA of $1000, anything more than that is when she would upload her bills and whatnot to Sedera through that app Kelly C was telling her. She also then asked what Spruce is. I told her that is just another form of getting in contact with Redirect as an app on her phone. She understood and said that that makes perfect sense. She had the wrong phone number for Redirect so I gave her the correct one and told her she needs to contact Redirect first always. They are the ones that deal with making appointments and everything about her plan other than Sedera for injury/illness. Always has to contact them first. She seemed a lot more clear about everything. She said when she was talking to Kelly C she did not have good service so she didn''t really hear what she was saying. I will let Kelly C know. But for now the member Ann is all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-06-04 11:14:40', '2020-06-04 11:14:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051902003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049368070', 'Holly Singer', NULL, 'Spoke to Joan.  Ticket opened, Joan to reach out.', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2020-06-04 10:59:46', '2020-06-04 10:59:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051891013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026675058', 'Anthony Peck', NULL, 'Called in and thought that his payment for us did not go through and wanted to make sure it did. Patti said everything is all set and it did go through. I tried transferring to Patti but my phone hung up by accident. Patti tried calling him back and left him a voicemail stating everything is up to date and all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-06-04 10:56:04', '2020-06-04 10:56:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051877008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026675058', 'Anthony Peck', NULL, 'Member called in asking if his June payment went through.  We got disconnected.  So I called him back letting him know that his payment went through.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-04 10:53:21', '2020-06-04 10:53:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051891008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037438063', 'James Kreitman', NULL, 'James called into Sedera and was wondering how to cancel his membership. I had Mady from Sedera message me letting me know that James contacted them. I sent him and email that has the cancellation form for him to fill out and submit back to us. I also let him know that once he submits it in it will come straight to us and once everything is cancelled out he will get a confirmation email. I also let him know that it is very important that he send in the form BEFORE the 20th of the month because that is when we start billing for next months coverage. He should be all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-06-04 10:09:12', '2020-06-04 10:09:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051891003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610380', 'Laura Watson', NULL, 'Laura called in and needed to know what the process is of having her preventative wellness visit. I told her what she needs to do and find a provider in the PHCS Network, which I searched for GP''s in her area and sent her that list. I also explained what she needs to do about presenting her ASi card to the front desk and sent the Wellness Visit Instructions to her as well that explains that and what to do and say upon arrival. I told her to just really stress to the provider that everything is strictly Preventative only and needs to be coded as such on the billing. She was looking at her ASi card while on the phone with me and I told her that the front desk will call the number on the front bottom of the card to confirm her services and on the back of the card there is a P.O Box address and that is where the claims and billing HAVE to be sent to, not to send them to her or anyone else. Has to be submitted to ASi. She fully understood everything I told he and she seemed very into making sure she does the right thing and doesn''t want to mess anything up. She thanked me very much and was very happy with the info I gave her and am emailing her. She is all set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-06-04 09:19:42', '2020-06-04 09:19:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051877003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051348118', 'Teresa Howitt', NULL, 'Proof of DPC received &amp; sent to Sedera.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-04 08:07:54', '2020-06-04 08:07:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051786073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026209114', 'Kelly Shafer', NULL, 'I received an email from Analisa stating that this member''s dependent was having issues at a providers office saying that daughter Danielle was not on the coverage.  I looked into it and Danielle was not listed on the RCI portal.  I added her and let Analisa know of the mistake.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-03 13:40:57', '2020-06-03 13:40:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051786068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037008015', 'Kellie Whitney', NULL, 'Kellie called in and asked how to update her payment to avoid the Processing fee.  I sent her Patment Update Link.  She also told me that her DPC was closing her practice and asked if we had a list.  I told her that we did not however searched "DPC Providers Near me" and cam up with a map of DPC providers for her.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-03 12:40:31', '2020-06-03 12:40:31'),
