  ('zcrm_1579374000051806064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650438', 'Anthony Osborn', NULL, 'Jennifer called get instruction as to what the next steps were for her husband.  He has been going to an ENT and they are recommending surgery.  I gave her Sedera''s phone number and transferred the line to Megan.- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-06-02 17:04:08', '2020-06-02 17:04:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051806056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041659491', 'Jeffery Nolte', NULL, 'Jeffery called because he got a bill for his annual exam that he already paid $20 for with his copay because it wasn''t a straight forward preventative care visit- he has a thyroid issue that he takes meds for and has labs drawn to monitor.  He also stated that he will be cancelling with us soon because he got a new job, he asked if it was possible to reinstate if the job doesn''t pan out.  I told him that it was, but there will be variables as to sign up fee''s and changes in plans.  Sent him the cancellation form. The statement he sent showed that the doctors office never submitted the bill to RCI, I told him to give them a call tomorrow and ask that they submit the bill with the information that is on his card- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-06-02 16:51:50', '2020-06-02 17:01:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051806051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030706004', 'Kathleen Duke', NULL, '6-2-20 Kathleen was never able to join her employers group insurance and then shopped around and was mortified about how much it cost. She wants to rejoin. I explained MPB Care+ since she wants most catastrophic version. Lives in Carbondale but is moving to Durango area soon. Can use this anywhere. We are connecting on Monday to enroll once her internet is functioning again.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-06-02 16:02:35', '2020-06-02 16:02:35'),
