  ('zcrm_1579374000051806028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051949076', 'Michelle Smith', NULL, '6-2-20 Michelle is 32 and is getting laid off as we speak bc of CO-VID. She''s covered through June 30th and needs start date July 1st. She''s healthy, no tobacco, no meds. She thinks he current cost if $230 and possibly employer $230. Therefore, Cobra is likely $460+. Unemployment she''ll get an additional $600 from CO-VID. She listened to audio 3x to understand. She''s also a yoga teacher on the side and may do that full time. Also wants dental and I''m looking at New Era Dental with Careington network which includes Ashleigh Harrison with Cherry Creek Modern Dentistry.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-06-02 14:01:20', '2020-06-02 14:10:22'),
