  ('zcrm_1579374000051806013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899058', 'David Pritekel', NULL, 'Called in to see how the cancellation process works because he is turning 65 next month and his medicare will be starting July 1st. I told him its just an email I send him with a link for him to click to bring him right to the cancellation form and just fill it out and click submit and it will come straight to us. Once everything is cancelled and done I told him he will get a confirmation email. I stated to make sure he gets it in before the 20th of the month otherwise he will be charged for the next months coverage and it can take a little while for refunds. He fully understood and will fill it out asap. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-06-02 11:00:17', '2020-06-02 11:00:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051806008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014508197', 'Jose Ernesto Rodriguez aleman', NULL, 'JoAnna called in and just wanted a break down of how everything works when it comes to billing and payments and who is who. She gave me a bunch of information when all in all she just needed to know to contact to get a progress report on her opened Need with Sedera. She said she has been working with Mady and Priscilla over at Sedera but she does not have either of their direct lines. I let her know we don''t have direct lines but I can message them on our messaging service with Sedera and ask them to give JoAnna a call asap or whenever they can soon. JoAnna has Sedera''s phone number and will just keep trying to call them and get in contact. She has uploaded all of her bills and knows how to do that and knows how to open a Need, she just needs an update on what is going on. I slacked Mady and Priscilla and gave JoAnna''s phone number. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-06-02 10:43:39', '2020-06-02 10:43:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051806003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028466001', 'Alyona Tsutskova', NULL, 'Called in and asked how the cancellation works and what requirements there are. I told her she needs to get the cancellation form back in before the 20th of any month to not be billed for the next months coverage. I am emailing her the email with the link to the cancellation form and once everything is cancelled she will get a confirmation email stating so. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-06-02 10:11:02', '2020-06-02 10:11:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051786008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012429064', 'Christina Bell', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I have notified ASi &amp; Sedera &amp; refunded June pmt.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-06-02 08:02:16', '2020-06-02 08:02:16'),
