  ('zcrm_1579374000051734003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050550098', 'Sarah Price', NULL, 'Called in and said that she never got her welcome call email and wants to set that up asap so she knows everything about her plan. I told her I would email her the welcome scheduler and one of our wellness coordinators will give her a call. She also had a question about her daughter having a Dr''s appt. next week and was asking if we here do anything about that. I told her that she has Redirect and that they are always her first point of contact with anything to do with her plan and gave her their phone number and will call them now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-06-01 11:15:09', '2020-06-01 11:15:09'),
