  ('zcrm_1579374000051671018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051715171', 'John Howell', NULL, '5-29-20 Johnny 47 and Jenny 45 are super nice. Johnny is an acupuncturist and Jenny recently quit her job and is helping with Johnny''s practice. They don''t have health insurance now at all. I just sent them an link to enroll in VBA''s accident policy for at least June for up to $25K. She will review and enroll. They just enrolled in MPB Care+ for $390/$1500 for July 1st start date. They are healthy and rarely go to the dr. Rarely do their wellness visits. Johnny did have a knee replacement 2 years ago and it''s doing really well, no problems. He''s aware if he has any recurrence with that knee stemming from the knee replacement that it''s his responsibility year one. He''s confident in it. Johnny''s DOB is 4/29/20.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-05-29 13:33:46', '2020-05-29 13:33:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051637074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037016068', 'Mary Heiberger', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel with all vendors', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-29 13:29:42', '2020-05-29 13:29:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051637069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810387', 'Valerie Ross', NULL, '5/29 June pmt decline with msg Insufficient Funds sent out 1st notice had email chain with payor Don Ford who said that there was only enough $ for one payment.  He sent in a CC that he wants used only one time.  I contact Wend y to see how she wants me to handle as this payor declines most months.  She will contact JC and get back with me.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-29 13:01:50', '2020-05-29 13:01:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051637064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024355042', 'Babak Bashar', NULL, '5/29-June pmt declined with msg Insufficient Funds sent 1st notice  6/1 - final notice sent', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-29 12:39:20', '2020-06-01 13:40:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051637059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026202179', 'Erin Graham', NULL, '5/29 June pmt declined with msg Account Closed.  I received email back from member saying that she now has other coverage and "tried to cancel".  I emailed back and asked how she tried to cancel and sent her out cancellation link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-29 12:15:06', '2020-05-29 12:15:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051671013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051715135', 'Sylvia Theisen', NULL, '5-29-20 Enrolling now in MPB Care+ for $2500/$419 at age 60. She broke her humorous in Feb. and she''s been paying cash to PT and doctor visits. Knows it''s pre-x. Willing to pay for x-rays as well. Takes anti-depressant meds for many years. Has hypothyroid issue that takes meds for as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-05-29 11:30:31', '2020-05-29 11:30:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051637051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529781', 'Robert Johnston', NULL, '5/29-June payment declined with message of Payment Stopped I sent out 1st notice &amp; left a vm for member One of our scholarshipped members 6/1 - sent out final notice.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-29 11:20:38', '2020-06-01 13:36:57'),
