  ('zcrm_1579374000051637026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037016068', 'Mary Heiberger', NULL, 'I called member and let her know that her CC declined she said that her husbands job was havint Open Enrollment and that she could get on his plan.  Wants to cancel.  I will send out Cancellation form.  No refund needed', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-29 10:48:48', '2020-05-29 10:48:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051669003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521288', 'Robert Glowczewsky', NULL, 'Cindy called in and just wanted to make sure she was doing the correct things for her annual Woman''s wellness visit. She checked and made sure that her provider she uses all the time for this IS on the PHCS Network Multi plan website, so that is good. I told her next she just needs to make sure when she makes her appt. that she makes it very clear this is only just her Preventative woman''s wellness visit and nothing diagnostic. I told her is she is having any issues she needs to keep that a completely separate appt. so the coding doesn''t get messed up or the provider can make the whole visit coded as diagnostic, it is however their billing process is. She fully understands and will not bring up any issues she is having for a different appt. I told her about having her ASi card and she said yes she has it and I went over how presenting the card works and what to say and where the claims are submitted to is on the back of the card with a P.O. Box address. She is all set and understands the whole process. I will send her an email that explains in further detail how to present her card upon arrival. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-05-29 10:35:47', '2020-05-29 10:35:47'),
