  ('zcrm_1579374000051637003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017307107', 'Robert Weinstein', NULL, 'Member re-enrolled in MPB Secure Care.  I will cancel Select plan enroll member in Redirect to start 7/1.  Am making separate contact , will merge later.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-29 07:02:09', '2020-05-29 07:02:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051605045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020299149', 'Grant Hudson', NULL, 'Grant called to get the date of his last annual wellness visit with his doctor, I told him that this wouldn''t be some information that we have but that I could go through the notes to see if he had called in mentioning it.  I told him that he had called last June about the visit- he didn''t think that he had.  He said he would just call his doctors office.  I told him that it would be a good idea and apologized for not being able to help him further.  Then he asked since he had me on the phone about all of the steps involved with his wellness visit.  I told him that first he needed to make sure that his doctor was in network, he complained that he never had to do that before, that his doctor has just always been his doctor.  I told him that RCI would not reimburse him for the visit if the doctor was out of network- then he asked how he could find out if she was.  I offered to do a search for him and I could not find her as in network with a 50 mile radius.  I then told him that once you find a doctor that is in network you would present them with your RCI card.....to this he said NO NO NO that is never how I had to do things before, I would pay them, I would submit the bill and then get reimbursed- he said that he thought the whole point was that there wasn''t any networks.  I told him that it was the case for accident/injury/illness care but not the case for preventative care.  He then asked me if he was assigned to someone personally  to manage just his "stuff". and just as soon as I was going to answer him my power went out.  He called back on my cell and answered like he was simply going to ignore our conversation and asked to speak with John Kach- I told him that John wasn''t available, it was after hours.  He said that he would call back tomorrow.  After reading the notes I figured I would call and ask Guy to speak to this person because he has in the past under similar circumstances.  Guy spoke to him and laid out how things work. I am sending Grant an email with lists of primary care doctors in Grant''s area, a contact number of whom to speak to concerning possibly needing another RCI card, and Guy''s contact info. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-28 16:53:31', '2020-05-28 16:53:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051605040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810025', 'Kellie Stafford', NULL, 'called to update payment- sent online form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-28 15:30:28', '2020-05-28 15:30:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051605035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819397', 'Lynette Prosser', NULL, 'Spoke to Lynette via phone and Sales IQ concerning a bill and it was quickly realized that it was not for a well visit. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-28 15:29:52', '2020-05-28 15:29:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051605030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046762183', 'Stephen Berry', NULL, 'Evie called in to update payment info- I grabbed her email address and sent her the online form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-28 14:37:59', '2020-05-28 14:37:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051612104', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009926276', 'Jaime Raaj', NULL, 'Jaime called in and said she got a message from Patti about payment and is calling back to pay. Sent to Patti. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-05-28 14:00:54', '2020-05-28 14:00:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051612079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007096195', 'Nancy Topoozian', NULL, 'Nancy called in and said she needs a copy of her Contract. I put her on hold and asked Patti and John about this and John said to verify her email address and we will get it out to her. I confirmed if we have the correct email and we do. Should be sent out to her shortly. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-05-28 13:42:24', '2020-05-28 13:42:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051612067', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012871127', 'John Taylor', NULL, 'John called and wanted a list that has all the preventative services that are included with his plan. He just wants a better understanding of what is covered and what is not. I told him of course I can send him the 64+ Preventative Services List that we have here for any member to take a look at. I told him I will send that right away to him. I also sent him an email that explains how to present himself and his ASi card upon arrival to any preventative appointment and one other email that explains how to submit bills to Sedera and their phone number to call them when he needs to start a "Need" with them. He is currently going to an optomologist (appt. for his eyes), and I told him that is not preventive and how he will present himself and he only pays the first $500 of his IUA anything after Sedera comes into play. He fully understood and thanked me for all the help and emails I have sent out. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-05-28 10:59:27', '2020-05-28 10:59:27'),
