  ('zcrm_1579374000051605003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015979037', 'Ryan Nelson', NULL, 'I received Cancellation request from this member.  Said that wife told him that she cancelled us thru Connect for Health Colorado.  I explained in an email that we are not insurance and that would not be possible.  I told him that I would be refunding him June payment. Then will cancel w/Sedera &amp; ASi', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-28 08:11:07', '2020-05-28 08:11:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051570033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006617067', 'Robert Picheco', NULL, 'Helen called because she had just gotten to Costco to use a coupon that Kelly F was going to send her only to find that she never received an email.  I looked up the medication and stayed on the line with her to get her two scripts of Doxycycline 100 mg 60 tabs- one for tablet form and the other for capsule since she didn''t remember what form they were in-I had them texted to her phone.  She thanked me for my time. -KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-27 16:55:40', '2020-05-27 17:00:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051570028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015979037', 'Ryan Nelson', NULL, 'Patti gave Ryan a call and sent the online cancellation form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-27 14:37:51', '2020-05-27 14:37:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051564013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006644205', 'Martha Rybak', NULL, '5-27-20 She called to ask if we have an option without wellness visits. I shared with her the MPB Care+ for $687/$1500 or $1000/$738. She will discuss with husband and get back to me. Likes the sounds of this. I told her about price increase in Aug as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-05-27 14:14:53', '2020-05-27 14:15:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051582003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015979037', 'Ryan Nelson', NULL, 'I spoke to member Ryan and he told me that he had other coverage and that he was still being billed for our coverage.  Told me his wife had "spoke to someone" and tried to cancel but it never happened.  I advised that we had no record of any intentions to cancel.  No Cognito Form.  Last call in 11/19/2018.  I will send him cancellation link email.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-27 13:58:32', '2020-05-27 13:58:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051570023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015979037', 'Ryan Nelson', NULL, 'called in regarding a bill- I took a look at Wendy''s note and told him that I would reach out to Patti Baron and ask that she give him a call back.  I reached out to Patti about this on Slack. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-27 13:47:15', '2020-05-27 13:47:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051570018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165363', 'Adrian Denise Farley', NULL, 'welcome call complete.  Denise (she goes by her middle name) was nervous about the max out of pocket for IUA''s that she is responsible for AND concerned that her physical therapy that she has been receiving for an injury diagnosed a year ago will not be shared by Sedera.  She is a bit anxious, but I told her that she could call in anytime for answers to her questions. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-27 12:37:00', '2020-05-27 12:37:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051574075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030491006', 'Trent Buttars', NULL, 'New plan eff 6/1/2020: Member Only  $500 IUA 40-49 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-27 12:31:13', '2020-05-27 12:31:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051574070', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659455', 'Emily Kassel', NULL, 'Emily called in and wanted to know if a non emergency surgery to remove 2 bunions on her feet would be covered if not what is and what does she need to do. I explained to her that any sort of surgery and anything leading up to it she is responsible for the first $1000 of her IUA and then she needs to go through a 2ndMD program with Sedera and that Sedera is the who to call in the first place regardless about this because they are who come into play after her IUA is met, she would have to open up a "Need" with them. She said ok that fine and I gave her Sedera''s phone number and to call them asap and tell them exactly what she told me and they will help guide her through the process and what she needs to do. She was perfectly fine with everything and thanked me very much for helping her and getting her to the right place and the right info. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-05-27 12:24:53', '2020-05-27 12:24:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051574065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030491006', 'Trent Buttars', NULL, 'Trent submitted a Plan change form to remove his children off the plan.  I will inform RCI &amp; Sedera &amp; adjust billing &amp; refund difference.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-27 12:22:02', '2020-05-27 12:22:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051574060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006617067', 'Robert Picheco', NULL, 'Helen called in and needed a coupon for an prescription her husband Robert needs. I found her the least expensive coupon I could find at a Costco for $17.76. She was very happy to hear that because CVS would have charged her $50 she said. Thanked me very much for the help. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-05-27 10:37:39', '2020-05-27 10:37:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051574055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043354017', 'Buddy Johnson', NULL, 'I ran payment with new CC we''ll see if it goes through', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-27 10:25:29', '2020-05-27 10:25:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051574050', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041823005', 'Angie Ward', NULL, 'Angie called in and said she had some questions on some health care. I pulled up her profile and she has Redirect so I let her know that Redirect is always going to be her first point on contact. She than asked me well I have this card with your phone number on it and to call with help. I told her that i can help her with anything to do with Sedera, injury/illness and directing her to the correct dept. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-05-27 09:42:24', '2020-05-27 09:42:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051574045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043354017', 'Buddy Johnson', NULL, 'I spoke to member and he wants to make a one CC payment and then change to a bank account for the July Payment.  I advised he would need to submit new Pmt Change Form', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-27 09:14:56', '2020-05-27 09:14:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051574031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048549095', 'Sean Frankhouse', NULL, 'Member declined due to Insufficient funds, I will send 1st notice', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-27 08:16:29', '2020-05-27 08:16:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051574023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030403126', 'Amanda Singer', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel w/Apex &amp; Sedera &amp; billing.  Refunded June payment.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-27 07:48:54', '2020-05-27 08:12:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051574018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047423507', 'Casey Howard', NULL, 'Received a phone call from Tony Maranca checking up on this member and asking why he was not paid on them.  I advised that they would have had to come thru Charles enrollment platform.  received an email from Charles that this member was indeed Tonys.  I update Affiliate.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-27 07:46:35', '2020-05-27 07:46:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051574013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051348075', 'Jack Shell', NULL, 'Proof of DPC submitted to Sedera.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-27 07:32:07', '2020-05-27 07:32:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051574008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043608110', 'Kevin Shah', NULL, 'Member submitted payment update form, changed back to original acct.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-27 07:25:39', '2020-05-27 07:25:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051574003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007096195', 'Nancy Topoozian', NULL, 'Member emailed in saying that she has called 5 times trying to cancel.  there is no record of those calls or emails.  I emailed her the cancellation form if she wants to cancel.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-27 07:03:39', '2020-05-27 07:03:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051570013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165363', 'Adrian Denise Farley', NULL, 'called in because she had no idea how her plan worked and wanted some direction!  I told her that was because she hadn''t had her welcome call yet, I offered to do one on the fly, but she didn''t have time.  I sent her a scheduler and she told me that she could make it in the next day and a half.  I also gave her Redirect''s phone number just in case she needed anything medical. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-26 15:15:45', '2020-05-26 15:15:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051570008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018451062', 'Patricia Bedell', NULL, 'called to see if her daughter could use Teladoc for her acne.  I told her that she could use the discounted derm specialty service at a discount.  She was hoping that it would be no charge.  That her daughter could just call in and that would be that.  I told her that we can get her access to some of the more expensive medicated topicals on the market through WorldMeds if that is a route she chooses. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-26 15:08:46', '2020-05-26 15:08:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051570003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046294019', 'Melany Matheson', NULL, '2nd Welcome call complete.  Melany typed out so many notes and answers to her questions. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-26 14:59:24', '2020-05-26 14:59:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051566008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030403126', 'Amanda Singer', NULL, 'Amanda called in to ask why she was continuing to be billed after she requested suspension.  I told her we did not have any record of her calling in.  Last contact via phone or email May of 2019.  She wants to cancel.  I sent her cancellation link.  Also wants to remove her children from ex spouse''s plan since they are all now on Medicaid.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-26 14:10:54', '2020-05-26 14:10:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051566003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030491006', 'Trent Buttars', NULL, 'Per Amanda Singer she needed to take her children off of her ex spouses plan.  I sent the Cancellation form in error.  Called &amp; left VM for Trent to fill out Plan Change form.  Sent link to form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-26 14:07:55', '2020-05-26 14:07:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051551013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032809035', 'Michele Manna', NULL, 'Michele called in to ask a few questions on how she can go about getting an STD Panel done. I had to make sure something like that is covered and it is as long as she is getting the script written out to her during a annual woman''s checkup. I forgot to ask her is that is how she is wanting to go about getting her script, cuz if not than it will NOT be something preventative or covered. Patti called her and left her a voice mail to call back asap to let us know how she wants to go about getting her script. I want to make sure I give her the correct answer so I am waiting to hear back from her before I go and do anything. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-05-26 11:22:00', '2020-05-26 11:22:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051523031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047153147', 'Tara Weaver', NULL, '5/27 -June pmt declined, I sent out the 1st notice. 5/28- member resubmitted same pmt info I had to submit via FTNI as payment is showing up as approved in Admin 123.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-26 11:03:30', '2020-05-28 10:20:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051523023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015086068', 'Janet Nichols', NULL, 'Wendy requested 1095B be resent out to this member.  I sent via email.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-26 10:29:22', '2020-05-26 10:29:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051551003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036593010', 'Suzanne Martinek', NULL, 'Suzy called in and wanted to know what she would have to do to possibly switch over to a plan that she can have an HSA with it. I put her over to Patti. She took care of it and said everything is all good now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-05-26 10:08:06', '2020-05-26 10:08:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051523018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041271309', 'Liesa Smith', NULL, 'Member submitted payment update form.  I will change', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-26 09:56:34', '2020-05-26 09:56:34'),
