  ('zcrm_1579374000051523003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049780121', 'Diana Posey', NULL, 'Member called in and told me that she could no longer afford.  I will send cancellation.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-26 06:55:29', '2020-05-26 06:55:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051517003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650615', 'Naomi Gagnon', NULL, 'From Dania, replying to the notes I shared with her regarding the member-
Thanks, Kelly - will add notes to her file.  It looks like, from the case notes, that they have been having difficulty getting information needed to process their sharing.  In addition, they contacted us on 5/1 and asked for upfront sharing for 5/4, a timeline we can’t possible meet and I’m sure that was frustrating.', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-25 11:07:53', '2020-05-25 11:07:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051516006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029616225', 'Valerie Tanswell', NULL, 'Member submitted Payment Change Form.  Pmt was updated', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-25 08:50:09', '2020-05-25 08:50:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051507018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650615', 'Naomi Gagnon', NULL, 'called to ask when deadline is to cancel.  Then she wanted to let us know that Sedera wasn''t making it very easy for needs reimbursement and that they weren''t happy with the girl that was helping them and wanted to know if they would get reimbursed soon, I told her that she would need to ask Sedera.  She then was upset because she thought "we" were nicer.  I asked if she had reached out to upper management at Sedera to let them know about all of the trouble that they had been having and she said no...I told her to call and ask for Dania.  I offered to reach out on her behalf and she declined.  She said that maybe it wasn''t the girl helping her but the way that they do things there.  She said that she would give them a call and I sent a cancellation form. She is getting a cheaper option through her new employer, but she really loved it with us. sending this over to Dania via private Slack now. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-22 17:25:21', '2020-05-22 17:25:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051507013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012871127', 'John Taylor', NULL, 'Helped John get started in opening up a need with Sedera, also helped he and his wife get much better deals on their meds than what they were used to by using their Liberty RX card.  They were absolutely thrilled!  -- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-22 17:08:23', '2020-05-22 17:08:23'),
