  ('zcrm_1579374000051492013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041953021', 'Barbara Batt', NULL, 'I was copied on an email to Wendy that this member wanted to cancel.  I have cancelled FTNI proactively and will wait for form to notify Sedera/Redirect', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-22 13:08:12', '2020-05-22 13:08:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051507008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027529238', 'Mark Hanna', NULL, 'Mark called to make sure Kelly F had gotten his email regarding part of a colonoscopy bill.  I told him that I would reach out to her but that she would more than likely get back to him when she is back in the office on Monday.  I slacked her this message. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-22 13:00:42', '2020-05-22 13:00:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051493013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045805015', 'Autumn Ricksecker', NULL, 'Added member into RCI portal missed back in February.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-22 12:17:07', '2020-05-22 12:17:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051507003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045805015', 'Autumn Ricksecker', NULL, '5-22-20 Autumn''s account is showing as SDHC and was supposed to be PSDHC per the above notes. I called Jodi Ayers and she knew Autumn is getting charged correct amount of $243 for PSDHC because she pays her daughter back every month. Patti dug further and sees they are getting charged the correct amount. Therefore, Patti is going to make sure everything is correct and current with RCI. I suggested that Jodi tell Autumn to hold off for a week while the records are updated to make sure there are no problems. She agreed. Patti will take it from here.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-05-22 12:10:40', '2020-05-22 12:10:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051492008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028130609', 'Peggy Richards', NULL, 'Stan, Peggy''s husband, called in and said that Peggy is experiencing tremendous pain in her leg and he is worried that she might have broken something. He just wanted to make sure that he was not jeopardizing anything by doing the wrong thing. I explained to him what type of situation this is. It is Injury/Illness so they are going to be responsible for the first $5000 of their IUA. There is no network that he needs to stay in, they can go to any provider of their choosing. I told him if this is going to be an ongoing thing and multiple visits than he needs to get in contact with Sedera and open up a "Need" with them. I told him that I will be sending an email that explains how to start the "Need" process and to give them a call when he gets off the phone with me and let them know what is going on so they can start sooner than later. I told him Sedera''s phone number will be at the bottom of the email I sent. He was very thankful and fully understood everything I told him and will be taking Peggy to and Orthopedic right away and will call Sedera asap as well. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-05-22 11:12:32', '2020-05-22 11:12:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051493008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009715039', 'Patty Carlson', NULL, 'Received cancellation form this member I have cancelled ASi &amp; Sedera. Billing previously cancelled', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-22 10:39:03', '2020-05-22 10:39:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051493003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042007069', 'Kendall Williams', NULL, 'I called in to Kendall asking why he wanted me to change the CC back to the one I changed yesterday.  Said he "was moving money around"  I reminded him that every month this happens and that what we needed to move forward was a CC that we could charge every month to eliminate all of this.  He asked why I was "complaining" that he paid late fees every month.  I will cancel if he does not give us good CC.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-22 10:05:04', '2020-05-22 10:05:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051492003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020603129', 'Amber Kingsley', NULL, 'James called in and asked if there is any sort of stop payment due to COVID-19. I got Patti on the line and she explained that Sedera was that for a few people for the months of April, May, and June and have extended it for one more month but that was only for the few people that were already on the list. Unfortunately Sedera is not taking any new people on. So Patti said pretty much the only thing we can suggest is cancelling the plan and then coming back on when things get better. James said he can''t go without Health Benefits. So he is just going to have to stay on for now and will let us know if he changes his mind. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-05-22 10:00:29', '2020-05-22 10:00:29'),
