  ('zcrm_1579374000051433016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046762183', 'Stephen Berry', NULL, 'helped with script quotes. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-21 14:45:11', '2020-05-21 14:45:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051437008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045798068', 'Lawrence Shammo', NULL, '5-21-20 Called me to learn how to use plan. They watched the videos again and understood it reasonably well but definitely needed hand holding one final time to understand the process. He has a hand issue right now that he needs to see a doctor for. He will start with his DPC to get referred onward. Told Teresa who is helping Lawrence to call Concierge if DPC doesn''t refer him to an affordable specialist or imaging, etc. as cash pay.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-05-21 14:04:06', '2020-05-21 14:04:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051437003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006644205', 'Martha Rybak', NULL, '5-21-20 Martha is ready to move away from LHS to Sedera. We discussed PDHC now MPB Secure for their family at $910/$1500. Looking to move for July 1st. She will call me next week once she talks with her husband over the weekend to confirm.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-05-21 12:57:12', '2020-05-21 12:57:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051433011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033509132', 'Brandi Webber', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I will cancel Sedera &amp; RCI and in FTNI.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-21 12:42:57', '2020-05-21 12:42:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051433003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051294087', 'Thomas Boyce', NULL, 'Welcome call complete- first call not using online checklist and it went really smooth, great welcome call. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-21 12:29:45', '2020-05-21 12:30:11'),
