  ('zcrm_1579374000051411013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051410109', 'Steven Lodge', NULL, 'Member Only $5000 IUA 60-64 Redirect', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-21 10:41:38', '2020-05-21 10:41:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051411008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051410043', 'Franco Malagisi', NULL, 'Member Only $5000 IUA 40-49 SD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-21 10:32:33', '2020-05-21 10:32:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051419008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042007069', 'Kendall Williams', NULL, 'Kendall called in and needed to update their payment information. I send the payment change form to him via email. Also Patti wanted to me know that this member would call in every month and give a cc number for payment and that is stopping as of today. That is why I sent him the Payment Update Form so it will be on file and charged automatically instead of waiting for Kendall to call in and chase them down for payment. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-05-21 09:29:10', '2020-05-21 11:37:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051419003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011019014', 'Caroline Kava', NULL, 'Caroline called in and stated that she needed to make sure she was using the correct website to look up providers in the PHCS Network for her to get a mammogram done. The place that she normally goes to I looked up for her because she was having a little bit of difficulty with using the website. It was a hospital that she had me look up and I asked her if that is where they preform the mammogram. She wasn''t exactly sure about that. I could hear the hesitation in her voice. So I explained to her how it normal works and that the hospital will either do it right there or refer her to an imaging facility. I told her once she finds that out to look up the facility on the multiplan website or call me and we will figure out if it is in the network. I sent her the email that has the link and instructions for navigating the Multi plan website. She also asked me about what the procedure would be for having a "Link" that monitors her heart rate or something along those lines and her Dr has said she does not need it anymore. I told her what she needs to do and how she will present herself as a cash paying patient up to her IUA of $1000, nothing more than that out of pocket. If it will be more than her IUA than she needs to get in touch with Sedera and start a "Need" with them. I sent her the email that explained how she will submit her bills and start the "Need" with them along with Sedera''s phone number to call them ahead of time and walk her through the process if need be. I lastly sent her the Wellness Instructions that explain how she will present herself and her ASi card upon arrival to her preventative appointments and her Mammogram. She was very very thankful and said everything I told her and helped her with was wonderful and very helpful. She will be calling me back if she can not find her ASi card and I told her I will put a request in for a PDF copy to be sent to her email that she can print out and use and a hard copy that will be mailed to her. Very thankful for everything I helped her with. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-05-21 08:57:27', '2020-05-21 08:57:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051411003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810493', 'Michael Lutfy', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel RCI, Sedera &amp; Billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-21 07:06:06', '2020-05-21 07:06:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051386023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049780037', 'Adriana Rojas Vargas', NULL, 'called confused about billing- she is going to give Patti a call in the morning about this. I gave her the direct line. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-20 17:37:27', '2020-05-20 17:37:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051386018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048347128', 'T. Michele Armstrong', NULL, 'Michele called to cancel a completely different plan from us!  She apologized, she was embarrassed. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-20 17:11:47', '2020-05-20 17:11:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051386013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045539150', 'maria molina', NULL, 'member called in to get a list of in-network doctors, then she told me that she had visited her obgyn and had blood work done and now her obgyn said that she appears to be "very sick" and wants her to go to a primary doctor.  I then went over and over why she didn''t NEED to be in the network,  and why it wouldn''t be a covered expense.  She said that she was "entitled" to a free exam from a primary doctor- and then I explained over and over why it doesn''t have anything to do with what her plan does or doesn''t say- but everything to do with how the doctor codes things.  I hope that it sunk in...the way we left it was that I would send her all preventative educational emails while I look for in network doctors- I told her that just because she goes to someone on the list, it will not ensure that she isn''t charged for a diagnostic visit.  Also helped her with QR Life code, member sounded very overwhelmed by this plan. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-20 16:22:06', '2020-05-20 16:22:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051386008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051294009', 'Erin Brennan', NULL, 'Welcome call complete.  She knows that if she has any questions that come up during her enrollment to give us a phone call. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-20 15:47:06', '2020-05-20 15:47:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051388003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048462261', 'Brian Tilley', NULL, '05.20.20:  Called Brian. Left message that I was calling to make certain they were satisfied with their plan and to call me for any further clarification or questions.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-05-20 15:26:18', '2020-05-20 15:26:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051386003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020299015', 'Brittany Perrotto', NULL, 'called in with questions regarding pregnancy benefits- transferred her to Benjamin over at Sedera- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-20 14:52:40', '2020-05-20 14:52:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051383013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051410215', 'Ann Medina', NULL, '5-20-20 Ann is 58 and healthy, just takes thyroid meds and pays $10 for 3 months now. Doesn''t have health ins since 2020 since Kaiser left their area. Cost was going to be $600-$800 a month through exchange. Earns too much for  a subsidy. Joining MPB Secure bc of location in Redcliff and occasional visits for thyroid meds, actually usually completed at annual wellness visit. Daughter is Dorothy Ann and is helping Ann to enroll.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-05-20 14:37:07', '2020-05-20 14:37:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051350038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051348118', 'Teresa Howitt', NULL, 'Member Only $1500 IUA 50-59 MPB Direct Care', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-20 12:13:55', '2020-05-20 12:13:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051350033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041770021', 'Sarah Sumner', NULL, 'Sarah has had her account on hold for May &amp; now wants to extend this for month of June.  I have advised JC that this will be the last month that this will be available and that I would need a decision in June.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-20 11:03:37', '2020-05-20 11:03:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051368013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046294019', 'Melany Matheson', NULL, 'Melany called in and said that she has yet to use her plan and wanted someone to go over how everything works with her. She said she has all these different papers and cards and just wants to know what to do just in case something happens. I told her that what I can do is send her a Welcome Call Scheduler and she can pick out any day and time that works best for her and one of our wellness coordinators will call her on the day and time she choose and will go over all the different aspects of her plan with her. Melany was very very happy to hear that and will be looking forward to have the Welcome Call. She thanked me very much and said that is very helpful for her. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-05-20 10:56:14', '2020-05-20 10:56:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051383008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050370005', 'Arian Shirakhoon', NULL, '5-20-20 Arian called in to see what she needed to show proof for SEP. She doesn''t want to show termination letter from GE. She''s fine with showing unemployment benefits letter showing amount and start and end date. She will try that first. She can also choose SEP for Covid but she couldn''t find the letter showing that information. She''ll cc me on the email to Cigna.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-05-20 10:49:42', '2020-05-20 10:49:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051368008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257594', 'Emily Taylor', NULL, 'Emily called in and said that this is going to be the first time they are using their plan. She wanted to know what the process is for her husband that needs to get extra scar tissue on his esophagus that needs to be removed from a procedure that was done to stretch his esophagus 7 years ago. I explained to her that it would not be a pre existing condition because it was more than 3 years ago. So all she needs to do is treat this like any other injury/illness process. I told her what her IUA is and that is all she would be paying for out of pocket, nothing more than that. If this is going to be more than that she then needs to get in contact with Sedera and open up a "Need". I explained to her how that works as well and what Sedera will then do to help out. I sent her the email that explained how she will submit her bills and start the Need. I told her that is would be a good idea to call Sedera now a head of time to let them know what is going on because it will probably be more than her IUA of $500. She was very very happy that I helped her out and explained everything to her with ease. Thanked me very much. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-05-20 10:38:11', '2020-05-20 10:38:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051350028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051348075', 'Jack Shell', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $5000 IUA 60-64 MPB Direct Care', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-20 10:01:30', '2020-05-20 10:01:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051350023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051348024', 'David Kellers', NULL, 'Member Only $500 IUA 30-39 MPB Care +', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-20 09:50:04', '2020-05-20 09:50:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051378013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048586020', 'David Kanning', NULL, 'Left detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 30 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-05-20 09:36:57', '2020-05-20 09:36:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051378008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047612079', 'Meena Puri', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 30 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-05-20 09:27:52', '2020-05-20 09:27:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051378003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047519124', 'Forrest Coleman', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the 30 minute welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-05-20 09:24:46', '2020-05-20 09:24:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051368003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035227061', 'Marie Folsom', NULL, 'Marie called in to make sure she was going about he preventative woman''s appointment she has set up for tomorrow. I explained everything in detail about making sure the provider and facility are in the PHCS Network which she said she is but wanted me to send her the link to the multiplan website so she can double check. I explained how she needs to present her RCI card, which she does have and understands. I sent an email that further explains how she will present herself and the card. I also let her know about really making sure that the bills and everything is coded as Preventative and not Diagnostic. Anything that is Injury/Illness she has to pay out of pocket up to her IUA of $1500. I sent her an email that explains how to start a need if need be. She then asked well what is during my exam something is found what happens then? I explained the same thing as her needing to pay out of pocket up to her IUA. I sent educational emails for her and she thanked me very much for all the help and she better understands everything. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-05-20 08:46:32', '2020-05-20 08:46:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051350013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000024784709', 'Paul Knaysi', NULL, 'Update Pmt Method', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-20 07:55:10', '2020-05-20 07:55:10');
