  ('zcrm_1579374000051323056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031307083', 'Darcy Beard', NULL, 'called to cancel- sent form and told her to have it completed by end of day to meet the deadline. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-19 14:09:42', '2020-05-19 14:09:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051332003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659241', 'Michele Kean', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  She was one of the scholarshipped members for month of 5/20.  I followed up with her and she is still having financial issues so needs to cancel.  I will cancel w/ ASi &amp; Sedera.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-19 12:57:29', '2020-05-19 12:57:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051325008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037871013', 'Dawn DeAno', NULL, 'Called to update address, what we have is incorrect. I told her I sent out a address change form and to fill it out and submit it back to us so we can change it in all of our systems. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-05-19 11:21:35', '2020-05-19 11:21:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051328003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045841227', 'Theresa Goins', NULL, '5-18-20 I spoke with Terri and she said she''s all set now. She appreciated the fact that I called and Kelly C called to make sure she had everything she needed. She was pleased to be well taken care of.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-05-19 10:35:18', '2020-05-19 10:35:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051295033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919591', 'James Jordan', NULL, 'Membercalled inand advised his CC was hacked and need to update pmt info.  I email Cognito form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-19 10:18:31', '2020-05-19 10:18:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051325003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028384340', 'James Frohman', NULL, 'James called in about the EXACT same thing that he called Kelly Cheever about on May 13th. Literally word for word the same exact thing that Kelly and him spoke about. Me and Patti told him the same thing Kelly did that he is a cash pay patient and is responsible for out of pocket his IUA of $2500. If this is going to be an ongoing situation and multiple appointments than he needs to get in touch with Sedera and start a "Need" with them, not us. He keeps thinking he needs to call us here every single time he goes the dr for this. I re sent him the same email Kelly did that explains how to open a need with Sedera and it has their phone number in there so he can call them and get everything sorted out the right way. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-05-19 09:45:02', '2020-05-19 09:45:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051295028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051294135', 'Joshua Watson', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $5000 30-39 MPB Secure Care', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-19 09:24:10', '2020-05-19 09:24:10'),
