  ('zcrm_1579374000051295008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051294009', 'Erin Brennan', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA 50-59 MPB Direct', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-19 08:38:30', '2020-05-19 08:38:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051295003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035227061', 'Marie Folsom', NULL, 'Per Rod we will be scholarshipping this member for one more moth (June) then member responsibility.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-19 07:43:41', '2020-05-19 07:43:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051292008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023785064', 'Joshua Pentkowski', NULL, 'I got back with Jane after speaking with Sunny about this.  Member was paying for this while in the waiting period.  After that Employer was paying via 3rd party payor arrangement.  At some time member leaves employment and employer give him option of retaining membership if he take over paying.  This never happened nor was MPB notified of this change.  I advised Jane that I would take a cancellation from employer as he was paying it .', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-19 07:39:05', '2020-05-19 07:39:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051292003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447085', 'Ian (Gary) Van Houten', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel ASi &amp; Sedera.com', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-19 07:22:05', '2020-05-19 07:22:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051281013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045841227', 'Theresa Goins', NULL, 'Good afternoon Terri,

I just wanted to reach out and let you know that I have been thinking about your dilemma in regards of getting a referral for the 3D mammogram you wanted to get.  I just wanted to let you know that if you did need some help finding an in-network, or out of network doctor that offers the highest quality care, I would love to help!  If you are interested,  please let me know what type of doctor you are looking for so I can get started on a list for you. 

-KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-18 16:06:50', '2020-05-18 16:06:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051285008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051294087', 'Thomas Boyce', NULL, '5-18-20 Enrolled today for PDHC $311/$500. All set to go.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-05-18 14:36:13', '2020-05-18 14:36:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051285003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051294087', 'Thomas Boyce', NULL, '5-14-20 Tom is 39 and lives in Minturn, CO. He''s healthy, no tobacco, no pre-x. Choosing $500 IUA and $311 PDHC. DOB 3-18-1981. Works with Andy Ioele.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-05-18 14:35:33', '2020-05-18 14:35:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051281008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050956740', 'Brian Huft', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  Brian knows that we understand he may not remember everything between now and when his plan starts, and that he can call on us whenever with whatever questions or concerns he may have. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-18 13:57:12', '2020-05-18 13:57:12'),
