  ('zcrm_1579374000051281003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521312', 'Cheryl Schack', NULL, 'called for a "re-fresher" course in all things preventative care.  I went over everything verbally, as well as sent her all educational emails.  I tried to find their gastro dr in network, but couldn''t, I told Cheryl if she wants she can call me for some more help! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-18 13:28:42', '2020-05-18 13:28:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051270008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002469017', 'Floyd Trujillo', NULL, 'Received cancellation request I will cancel w/ ASi &amp; Sedera &amp; set up for 1 more pmt in FTNI.  Then to cancel.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-18 13:20:46', '2020-05-18 13:33:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051272003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023785064', 'Joshua Pentkowski', NULL, 'The payment for this should have been switched from Employer to member Nov. 27, 2019. 
I called Patti to see if it happened.  Was being paid by VISA ending in 3044.  Then paid by bank draft Desert Financial Credit Union ending in  5632.  Cannot tell when payment was changed.  She shows last payment as DEC 11, 2018.
Josh originally came on paying for it himself until his wait period was over, then Employer started paying for it.  Employer says he is still being billed.  
Patti will research status with Sedera. Still shows active HES.', 'Jane Kassel', 'Jane Kassel', '2020-05-18 11:52:32', '2020-05-18 11:52:32'),
