  ('zcrm_1579374000051219033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045841227', 'Theresa Goins', NULL, 'So Terri Goins gave me a call back and all she wanted from us was essentially to find a loophole, somewhere, anywhere that would make it so she DIDN''T need to see ANY doctor- at all.  I offered to find her a doctor that was in network at Ridgeland Family Medicine (where her old doctor was) she told me that she may not even want to see a doctor there, or a doctor from the PHCS network that doesn''t match up to her taste in doctors.  She realizes that she may have to pay out of pocket for all of it, but she doesn''t seem to care.  I even offered that she send me a list of names from the suggestions she finds via word of mouth and online to see if they were in network and she told me that she could do that on her own.  She was disappointed that Cirrus could not give her the referral, and disappointed by the fact that we didn''t have any other options for her that would simply put a referral in her hand.

"no....it''s ok, it''s ok I''ll just cancel my appointment at Salley Jobe (the mammogram facility) until I find a doctor for myself." 

I said ok, and told her that if she needed any at all assistance from us that we''re available and eager to help!', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-15 17:55:28', '2020-05-15 17:55:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051233003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036209103', 'Jeanie Thomas', NULL, 'Jeanie is cancelling because she is enrolled in Blue Shield of CA', 'Robin Kemp', 'Robin Kemp', '2020-05-15 17:33:26', '2020-05-15 17:33:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051232003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051294009', 'Erin Brennan', NULL, '5-15-20 Erin just enrolled in DPC with Dr. Stefano Lee and MPB Direct. Chose $1000/$245 plus $80 for total $325. Knows of price increase when turns 60. I mentioned waiving the fee which I shouldn''t have since she was referred by Casey Hebb not by Dr. Lee. But, I had to ask John to refund the fee since I had already mentioned it. He''s working on it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-05-15 14:39:23', '2020-05-15 14:39:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051219028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049932072', 'Akiaahia Proctor', NULL, 'called to cancel, sent form - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-15 13:38:37', '2020-05-15 13:38:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051219023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047907018', 'Stephen Tonguis', NULL, 'I let Stephen know why he was unable to register with MPB Virtual care, I told him that John was putting he and his family on a spreadsheet as we speak and they should be up and running late afternoon. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-15 13:25:53', '2020-05-15 13:25:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051219018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045841227', 'Theresa Goins', NULL, 'Called Terri and left a voice mail, asking for more specific information so I can begin doing  a provider search for her. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-15 12:37:56', '2020-05-15 12:37:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051219013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044118245', 'Christopher Villinger', NULL, 'Chris called in and just wanted to know what he needs to do in regards to an appt he has tomorrow for a 6 month follow up for some blood work and sleep apnea he had done before he was on the plan. I told him that would be considered an out of pocket expense and I told him about his IUA of $1000. He then wanted to get another RCI card sent to him for his preventative appointments. He knew how to go about that and knew about staying in the PHCS Network. He already looked up his Dr and he is in the network. I sent him instructions on how he will present his card and stressed to him that he needs to make sure his appointments are strictly preventative and to tell the provider this and that the bills have to be coded as such. I had Patti send him new RCI cards and the email about presenting his card. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-05-15 12:28:33', '2020-05-15 12:28:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051219008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257276', 'Jacqueline Martinez', NULL, 'Called to see if we had the correct mailing address on file and we do not. I sent her the address change form to fill out and send back to us. I told her Patti Baron will get that once she submits it and will change in our system and will let RCI and Sedera know to change in their system as well. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-05-15 11:12:46', '2020-05-15 11:12:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051219003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049932072', 'Akiaahia Proctor', NULL, 'Zach masters called in (Her Agent) and stated that Akiaahi just found out on May 6th that she is pregnant. So his question is if it would be covered. I put him through to Patti to explain what the pregnancy guidelines are. It will NOT be covered because the guidelines are the delivery due date has to be 11-12 months after applying for this plan. It is kind of a sketchy situation. He asked for me to send him the cancellation email with the form so he can send that to her because she is going to want to cancel since nothing will be covered for the pregnancy. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-05-15 10:52:56', '2020-05-15 10:52:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051212003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049054188', 'Chris Larson', NULL, 'Welcome call complete.  Waiting on the QR Life Code cards to come in mail. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-05-15 10:12:30', '2020-05-15 10:12:30'),
