  ('zcrm_1579374000051163003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041152084', 'David Butler', NULL, '5-14-20 Called to share newest experience with his wellness visit. Mike Bechtol told him to just go and they''d take care of cost. But, when went Dave had to pay pu front at kiosk $205 on his own and wants to know what to do with bill now. I told him to put everything in writing in an email, including the receipt and EOB from Boulder Medical and send it to Mike and cc me on the email. Mike will send it to the right person. Dave was appreciative of the assistance and he''ll do that.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-05-14 16:14:36', '2020-05-14 16:14:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051161003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003037201', 'Maxine Gower', NULL, 'Member called in response to my VM said she left msgs for me however I received none.  Said she cancelled back in late Dec and did not have access to a fax to send it in I told her that she only needed to hit submit button.  Asked for all those months back I told her no that I could reimburse her 1 month.  She ok with this.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-14 13:29:53', '2020-05-14 13:29:53'),
