  ('zcrm_1579374000051150003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036963048', 'Drostan Baker', NULL, 'Drostan called in and asked if his HSA account had to be with HSA Bank. Patti let him know that no it can be with any bank that has HSA''s. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-05-14 10:36:58', '2020-05-14 10:36:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051125013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049898077', 'Debbie Thibault', NULL, 'Client (Earl) called back with questions and Patti was able to assist in answering them -- he also had questions regarding his Health Matching Account. We advised him to contact Bevery Garretson and she would be able to assist. Per client''s request, I sent him an email as confirmation that his billing information had been updated, as well as a summary of our call, theearl2@yahoo.com', 'Accounting Office', 'Accounting Office', '2020-05-14 09:26:10', '2020-05-14 09:26:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051125008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049898077', 'Debbie Thibault', NULL, 'Called client, Earl (husband), and left a voicemail that their billing information has been updated to his checking account ending in -3641, per our phone discussion on 5/13/2020.', 'Accounting Office', 'Accounting Office', '2020-05-14 07:38:01', '2020-05-14 07:38:01'),
