  ('zcrm_1579374000051115018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257276', 'Jacqueline Martinez', NULL, 'Jacque sent me the bills and EOB- I am sending them over to Jennifer Chasteen to see if the pap smear was ever submitted because it appeared that only the exam was. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-13 17:27:32', '2020-05-13 17:27:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051115013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028384340', 'James Frohman', NULL, 'James called in because his primary doctor wants him to see an oncologist.  James seemed pretty overwhelmed with what his steps needed to be- I went over them generally as well as sent him an email going over how he needs to open up a need with Sedera.  I suggested that I try and transfer him over to someone at Sedera that could go over this process and give a bit of hand holding.  I ended up transferring him to Josh over at Sedera- I filled Josh in on all of the details. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-13 15:42:25', '2020-05-13 15:42:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051115008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049898077', 'Debbie Thibault', NULL, 'Earl called in to change his billing info- I escalated the call to Tricia and Patti and they will work on the changes in the morning. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-13 14:52:00', '2020-05-13 14:52:00'),
