  ('zcrm_1579374000051089013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048122065', 'Christopher Darling', NULL, 'Vanessa called me and said that she just got done with Christopher''s and his wife''s Welcome Call and they stated that they never got their QR Life Codes that I sent out March 31st. I assigned them 2 new cards and will be mailing them out tomorrow morning. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-05-13 11:25:53', '2020-05-13 11:25:53'),
