  ('zcrm_1579374000051089008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026447231', 'Susan O''Bryan Kinney', NULL, 'Susan called in and said that she needs to cancel for the time being because her work is putting her on insurance with them. She said she loves us and we are always amazing to her and that she might come back because she does not know how long her employee is going to keep her on for. She stated that they keep people on for short periods of time so she is hoping that won''t happen but if it does she will come re enroll with us because she loves this plan and how we handle things. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-05-13 10:32:47', '2020-05-13 10:32:47'),
