  ('zcrm_1579374000051089003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003670029', 'Irene Edgar', NULL, 'Irene called in and wanted to cancel. She said that she has been cancelled with Liberty for quite a while and didn''t know that cancelling with Liberty wouldn''t cancel the $50 charge. She was not upset and did not ask for a refund. I told her I will send her the cancellation form via email and once Patti Baron receives the form she will send a confirmation email letting Irene know she is all set and cancelled. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-05-13 09:46:32', '2020-05-13 09:46:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051080003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012474377', 'Lynette (Lynn) Arena', NULL, 'Lynn called in and asked if getting tested for the antibody for the COVID-19 falls under preventative or not. I said it would not and that is something that is Diagnostic Injury/Illness. I explained to her that she has her $500 IUA and that she is responsible for that amount out of pocket and anything over that is when she needs to get in contact with Sedera and start a "Need". I sent her the email on how to submit bills to Sedera along with their contact number if need be. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-05-13 09:09:57', '2020-05-13 09:09:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051079003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048122065', 'Christopher Darling', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Putting in request to Kelly F. to send out replacement QR Life code cards to Christopher and wife Rachel. Verified address. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-05-13 09:08:40', '2020-05-13 11:06:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051066008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051053034', 'Robert Arce', NULL, 'Member Only $5000 IUA 60-64 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-13 08:45:29', '2020-05-13 08:45:29'),
