  ('zcrm_1579374000051023013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003037201', 'Maxine Gower', NULL, 'called pretty upset because she believes she cancelled back in Dec- I told her that I did not see a cancellation form from her but that she needed to speak with Patti Baron directly.  she is requesting money refunded from Dec.  I told her that wasn''t up to me and I sympathized at her frustration and that I would contact Patti on her behalf. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-12 16:18:58', '2020-05-12 16:18:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051023008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257276', 'Jacqueline Martinez', NULL, 'called because she received a bill from last Oct from what she thought was a preventive care visit.  She is going to take a picture of the bill as well as the EOB from RCI and send it to me. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-12 16:03:51', '2020-05-12 16:03:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051023003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038170085', 'Jeffrey Dickinson', NULL, 'called because accountant is requesting a 1095 form- I sent Tricia this request via Slack. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-12 14:42:15', '2020-05-12 14:42:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051021003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051348024', 'David Kellers', NULL, '5-12-20 Spoke again and he''s going to see if his PCP is still practicing and will ask for cost of annual wellness visit. It''s most likely cheaper to pay cash for that and to choose SDHC for him.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-05-12 14:20:23', '2020-05-12 14:20:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051005018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659241', 'Michele Kean', NULL, 'I spoke to member about financial hardship and she doesn''t see any way that she will be able to afford member for the foreseeable future.  I told her that plan was changing and that we would waive $100 when/if she were to re-enroll.  I will send her cancellation email.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-12 13:50:29', '2020-05-12 13:50:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051005013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035227061', 'Marie Folsom', NULL, 'I left a VM to check on financial status.  Member still is in need.  I will pass this info along to Rod/Robert', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-12 13:26:52', '2020-05-12 13:26:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051005008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521590', 'Sherrie Lynne Vantongeren', NULL, 'Left VM to get update on member financial status', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-12 13:22:53', '2020-05-12 13:22:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051005003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610208', 'Marc Krawatsky', NULL, 'Called Marc as he had some further questions about son obtaining student Visa.  Said he would need proof of coverage.  I advised that preventative would be going away was ok with this.  Also advised that there would be a higher price point in the near future.  I will send him MCS College letter and see if it works.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-12 12:59:21', '2020-05-12 12:59:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000051000003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610208', 'Marc Krawatsky', NULL, 'called to speak with Patti, I told him that she would call him back later after she got home. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-12 12:23:32', '2020-05-12 12:23:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050957058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042221180', 'Lisa Watson', NULL, 'Per the request of Josh Smith this member''s commissions have been changed over to Ron.  Josh will be made inactive as he cannot sell in the State of WA.  Didn''t want to continue to pay E&amp;O', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-12 11:09:33', '2020-05-12 11:09:33'),
