  ('zcrm_1579374000050986003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048544005', 'Daniel Soleja', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 30 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-05-12 09:19:55', '2020-05-12 09:19:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050957053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650515', 'Ashton Harvey', NULL, 'Ashton called in and said she got bills from her preventative visit and for her lab work. She stated that she went and had all this done BEFORE her Welcome Call. She said she handed the provider her RCI card. I told her that is correct but before any appts. are made she needs to go to a provider that is in the PHCS Network. If the provider is not in the network nothing will be covered and it will be an out of pocket expense. She gave me the providers name and facility and they are NOT in the network that I could find. I let her know this and asked her to send me everything she got bill''s wise and I will send them over to someone at RCI and tag her so she can stay in the loop with what she needs to do next. When I told her that if it is not in the network and she will have to pay for it she was not upset  at all because she knows she did this before she was explained on how everything works. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-05-12 08:51:05', '2020-05-12 08:51:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050957048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012429064', 'Christina Bell', NULL, 'Christina called in and she said that she has never used her plan yet. So I gave her the run down on how everything works preventative and Diagnostic wise with Injury/Illness. I told her about having her ASi card and she does not have that so I sent a request for her to get a PDF copy and a hard copy sent to her. I let her know that she should schedule another Welcome Call to refresh her on how her plan works. She was perfectly ok with that and I sent her all the general educational emails to help better explain what I told her. She will schedule a Welcome Call asap. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-05-12 08:47:54', '2020-05-12 08:47:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050957043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050956740', 'Brian Huft', NULL, 'Member Only $500 IUA 18-29 Copay', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-12 07:41:59', '2020-05-12 07:41:59'),
