  ('zcrm_1579374000050842003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032122001', 'Eileen Fagan', NULL, 'Spouse called in and was asking about availability of HSA compatability with the current DPC option.I told him that he could not have both.   I told him that he could only fund his HSA if he had a HDHP MEC plan.  I also advised that he could use the HSA funds for Medical related expenses however could not fund HSA anymore.  He also asked if MEC was more expensive I said yes.  Member said they would stay with present option.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-08 09:12:32', '2020-05-08 09:12:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050833003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049472193', 'Tihana Harriman', NULL, 'Member submitted change of payment form. A123 updated and May processed', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-05-08 08:49:33', '2020-05-08 08:50:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050828003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047238523', 'Jennifer Ranabargar', NULL, 'Jennifer called in and her first words were "I am very confused, so I have this insurance with you guys and I am currently at the doctor and apparently the card you sent is the wrong insurance card." I pulled up her profile here and she has Redirect. I let her know that she has Redirect and her response is "Redirect??" As in she had no idea what that is. I told her yes that is the plan you have, Redirect. You''re first call is ALWAYS going to be with them. I provided their phone number and she said ok thank you and is calling them now. She was very confused by everything and did not even know what Redirect is when I said that. Seems to be another member that has no clue what was sold to her and no clue on how to use it.... -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-05-08 08:17:29', '2020-05-08 08:17:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050800026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005591031', 'Bryan Holland', NULL, 'called to give us an update on his payment, stating that he changed the expiration date and it went through just fine, and asked that we don''t charge him again as the email had stated we would.  He also said that the address was incorrect, so I sent him the online form for that as well as contacted Sunny asking not to charge the card again. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-07 17:29:44', '2020-05-07 17:29:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050800021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082183', 'Eliot Hinshaw', NULL, 'Eliot''s boss Ryan Ashley called in because Eliot needs to cancel.  I told Ryan that I would send Eliot a cancellation form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-07 15:24:32', '2020-05-07 15:24:32'),
