  ('zcrm_1579374000050800008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028459096', 'Monica Violante', NULL, 'Monica called in upset that nothing was getting paid- when I asked what the bills were for, she told me allergy shots, one last year and one this year- I told her that allergy shots are not one of her covered services.  She then asked if the office visits would be and I told her most likely yes.  She said that she was just going to give the case to her lawyer- I told her what she needed to do instead is make sure RCI gets the bills first.  I told her that I would give her an RCI employee that is very helpful and that she could trust so I gave her Jennifer Chasteen''s number.  She thanked me, and wanted to make sure that her husband was removed from the plan.- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-07 13:12:09', '2020-05-07 13:12:20'),
