  ('zcrm_1579374000050774013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028459096', 'Monica Violante', NULL, 'Monica called in and said that she needs to figure out how her "Insurance" is going to pay for 2 bills she has gotten. 1 for March of 2019 and the other for March of 2020. Neither of the bills have any sort of adjustments on them from RCI paying anything. We asked her if the bills have ever been submitted and she said she didn''t know. Patti told her to send the bill to me at info@mympb.com and we will send them over to RCI to see if they were ever submitted or not. Patti let Monica know that the one for March of 2019 will not be paid if it was not submitted because bills have to be submitted no longer than 6 months. Once I have gotten the bills I will send them to someone over at RCI and see what the deal is and will tag Monica in the emails so she will get the responses as well to stay in the loop on what is going on. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-05-07 11:13:00', '2020-05-07 11:13:00'),
