  ('zcrm_1579374000050774003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047084073', 'Nicole Garth', NULL, 'Member called in and has absolutely no clue how anything works. She was asking how to go about using a virtual care for her annual physical. Me and Patti let her know that with her type of plan that will be an out of pocket cost because she has no MEC. She seems to think she can use virtual medicine for her preventative visits. She doesn''t seem to understand you can''t use that. Apparently her doctor is doing virtual primary care and than started to say that she is paying $230 for nothing. Patti ended up saying no that is not true and that she needs to get back with her agent Zach Masters and she needs to speak to her doctor that she mentioned is doing the virtual care and see how that works. -PB/KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-05-07 10:03:18', '2020-05-07 10:03:18'),
