  ('zcrm_1579374000050719008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054986001', 'Ken Trombley', NULL, '5-6-20 Ken is best on traditional insurance. Had a triple bypass March 26, 2018. He''s 60 and wife Karen Sherry is 59 and turning 60 in Nov. Both no tobacco, wife healthy, no meds. Ken takes 3 meds. Atorvastatin 40 mg, 1x daily, lisinopril 2.5 mg/1 1x daily, metopropol ER Succinate 25 mg tablet cut in half 1x daily. Wants to use Dr. Kari Uusinarkaus for PCP and Dr. Clinton Malone as cardiologist because Dr. David Rosenbaum is not in same network. Bright Health has Dr. U and Dr. Malone. Cost at Silver 1 is $764.06 for Ken and wife at 59 is $335 at $1500 IUA = $199.06. When turns 60 it''s $507 at $1500 IUA = $1271.06.  He''s on Cobra now for 6 months through wife''s company that laid her off. Company is paying most of cost except $178 for medical, dental and vision. Once Aug. hits Ken and wife will pay $1200 and the September and beyond they will pay $1600+ for the two of them.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-05-06 16:15:23', '2020-05-06 16:16:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050721013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026391005', 'John Colver', NULL, 'John called to ask about vaccines being covered by his plan.  I told him that they were, I suggested that he present his RCI card to one of his local pharmacies because his primary care dr doesn''t carry any.  I told him that they should directly bill RCI- or if he had to pay out of pocket he could submit the bills to RCI himself for reimbursement. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-06 16:14:58', '2020-05-06 16:14:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050721008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257237', 'Ken Bechtel', NULL, 'Kenneth called in again about Teladoc and said he still was having issues.  I told him to call Teladoc directly for support. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-06 15:27:54', '2020-05-06 15:27:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050721003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027361747', 'Monika Flurer', NULL, 'see ticket. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-06 13:14:00', '2020-05-06 13:14:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050719003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027361747', 'Monika Flurer', NULL, '5-6-20 I spoke with Heinz (Heins) and he''s the one that pays the bills. He talked with ASi initially and ASi said they''d pay for it but now they are sending him the bill. The pathology lab is saying he should have negotiated the cash price up front not after the fact. BUT, he had his own colonoscopy done at the same lab within a weeks time and the Medicare rate was $97 not $473 that he''s getting charged. I suggested he offers to pay them the Medicare reimbursement rate of $97 to close it out. The service was done in July of 2019 and the lab just sent them a bill now in May of 2020! He will try his best and I asked him to let me know how it turns out.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-05-06 12:19:54', '2020-05-06 12:19:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050700013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521288', 'Robert Glowczewsky', NULL, 'Cindy called in and asked since there are no Gyn doc in her area could she go to an Out of Network provider and get reimbursed?  I told her yes that she would be reimbursed 130% of Medicare allowable and that I could not tell her what that was.  She asked for the Network search Instructions which I sent to her.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-06 11:31:17', '2020-05-06 11:31:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050700008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048586070', 'Brandon Johnson', NULL, 'Member called in asking about invoices and how much his plan costs.  He said that he needed an invoice every month as MCS was being paid out of a trust fund.  He conferenced in someone that manages the Trust fund who told him to change pmt method to bank acct and that they would deposit funds in his account.  I sent him the Pmt Change form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-06 11:00:46', '2020-05-06 11:00:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050714013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045821700', 'Judith Snyder', NULL, 'Judy called in and said that she was on the phone with Teladoc for over and hour and then they just hung up on her, and then she tried doing it online and said Sedera was not there for an option to choose for the "Insurance" part of it. She said she doesn''t need it immediately right now but she will in the future due to the COVID-19 stuff. I asked Patti about this and what to do, we pulled up her profile here and she has Redirect, so she does not get Teladoc with Redirect, they have their own tela-medicine. Patti informed her of this and gave her Redirect''s phone number and let her know to speak with them and give her the info for their app along with letting her know that anything medical her first call is always going to be Redirect. She said that she got an email saying to sign up with Teladoc specifically and that''s why she was trying to do that. She was thankful for the info and will be calling Redirect asap. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-05-06 10:44:34', '2020-05-06 10:44:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050714003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035116005', 'Carol Smith', NULL, 'Member submitted change of payment form. FTNI updated', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-05-06 10:08:04', '2020-05-06 10:08:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050700003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257237', 'Ken Bechtel', NULL, 'Member emailed into the Concierge asking about TeleDoc.  I copied TeleDoc registration instructions and emailed out to him.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-06 07:46:58', '2020-05-06 07:46:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050665016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027361747', 'Monika Flurer', NULL, 'Wendy had asked me to help member with a "labs" bill- it turned out the bill was for 3 polyp removals and 3 microscopic examinations.  I spoke to Guy about this, he said he will call her tomorrow. SEE TICKET. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-05 17:07:17', '2020-05-05 17:08:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050667021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027361747', 'Monika Flurer', NULL, '5-5-20 Wendy,

