  ('zcrm_1579374000050658003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005663637', 'Wells Brockbank', NULL, 'Called in to cancel due to being 65 and he is now on medicare. I sent him a cancellation form to fill out and submit back to Patti Baron who will then send a cancellation confirmation email once everything is all cancelled and completed. He was perfectly fine with that and thanked me very much. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-05-05 10:25:06', '2020-05-05 10:25:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050649003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006447028', 'Margaret (Maggie) Webster', NULL, 'Member called and updated her payment info. Zoho Subscriptions updated', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-05-05 09:21:01', '2020-05-05 09:21:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050642008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004771011', 'Karen Baker', NULL, 'Received cancellation request I will cancel subscription', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-05 08:47:57', '2020-05-05 08:47:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050642003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004771011', 'Karen Baker', NULL, 'Member called in to cancel.  I will send her out link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-05 07:56:30', '2020-05-05 07:56:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050608021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048462261', 'Brian Tilley', NULL, 'Welcome call completed- but member stated "Analisa said that if we wanted to use our Primary Doctor that would be fine.  We would just call you and you would reach out to the Doctors office and negotiate down a price."  That''s when I had to pause and make sure that they were on the right plan.  Especially because they seemed so confused at first.  In the end I asked if they wanted me to reach out to Analisa, because I told them I wanted to make sure that they were as happy and comfortable in their choice.  It took awhile and lots of explanation, but in the end they were sure that they were on the PSD plan, I told them that if they were still thinking about wanting to change to speak to Analisa and/or give us a call. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-04 17:25:17', '2020-05-04 17:25:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050602028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055331022', 'Scott Fliegelman', NULL, '5-4-20 Scott is 52 and getting divorced. His wife and kids will remain on their plan and he''s going onto his own. Not sure when his insurance will end. Meeting with mediator on May 15th and will ask. Quoted him trad ins and starts at $435 best price for Bright Health Bronze. PDHC is best for him with MPB and $335 for $1500, $350/$1000, $378/$500. Has thyroid issue and takes NP Thyroid. Was paying $30 for 90 days and just paid $100 for 90 days through Cigna. Can get it for $30 for 90 days on Good RX and maybe cheaper with World Med RX. Also takes Wellbutrin XR 300 mg for anxiety which is $27-$39 for 90 days supply on Good RX. He''s fine with that.  He knows of 20th deadline and will call me when he ready to make the switch. Told him of up front fees as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-05-04 17:11:00', '2020-05-04 17:11:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050602023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045798106', 'richard rosin', NULL, '5-4-20 Hey Mike,

Just looked into this and here is what you need to know:

    Richard originally called in because his wife Rita was referred to an Endocrinologist and needed us to guide her
    There is nothing in Richard or Rita’s chart reflecting that members have Sedera so was put this through normal process with fair pricing with Specialists.  Confirmed this is updated now.
    Richard called back and spoke with Kayla Knight and was frustrated and then mentioned that they had Sedera, so information was sent to Membership Team to confirm
    I did find Richard and Rita both active on the current Sedera Master Roster, but information is not in Care Cloud charts – they’ve been active since 2/2020, this was a technology error, confirmed it is corrected.

I am going to call Richard right now and clarify Sedera process and also discuss breakdown.

Thanks,

-Liset

UPDATE: Just spoke with Richard and he is good and understands how Sedera works. I also sent email to Membership and confirmed that charts are updated.

Thanks!

Wendy,

Our care team leader reached out to Richard and got it all back on track with him.  Looks like a technology error where the Electronic Medical Chart didn’t reflect the correct enrollment.

We listened to the call and member wasn’t told ‘no coverage’ but that it was out of pocket.  I hear this a lot, that members hear out of pocket and then refer back, no coverage.

We have confirmed that all charts are updated and Richard is good. Below is a quick update.

Mike', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-05-04 16:10:57', '2020-05-04 16:10:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050602018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045798106', 'richard rosin', NULL, '5-4-20 I called Richard and he''s totally back on track. He freaked out when Richard Rosin called into Redirect and asked about the process of going to a specialist and the Redirect Customer Care Logistics Team told him sorry, you don''t have coverage for that. He knew his friend had been set when they had a $40K knee surgery. So, he couldn''t understand why he''s being told specialists weren''t "covered." He called and Kelly C talked him off the ledge and she and he alluded to. He''s fine with paying the first $500 IUA for an incident and understands that part is through Sedera not Redirect. He thought they were one in the same. I''ve emailed Mike Bechtol to work on better educating his Customer Care Team.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-05-04 15:38:18', '2020-05-04 15:38:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050608016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885296', 'David Steiner', NULL, 'Called to find best MRI and Xray facilities price wise.  I asked if he had the doctors order or scripts and he told me no, but that he could get them.  I said as soon as he gets them to call Sedera and tell them the CPT codes so they can find the best facility. also sent email with instructions on opening up a need. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-04 14:35:16', '2020-05-04 14:35:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050608008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045798106', 'richard rosin', NULL, 'Richard called in spitting mad because he was confused about his plan and what he had- he thought Redirect and Sedera were one in the same and didn''t like the fact that Redirect told him that his wife''s specialist visit wasn''t covered when he had his referral tell him that "they" had "covered" her knee surgery.   I just stayed on the line and let him vent- I told him I was sorry he felt so frustrated and then began to explain until he laughed and said that I was "talking him off of the ledge"  I went over everything until he understood and had a much better mood.  I sent the Sedera app template and told him to call us back for any further questions. Letting Wendy know.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-04 14:17:22', '2020-05-04 14:17:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050610003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650716', 'Daniel Coates', NULL, 'Received notification from Sedera that dependent Savannah will be aging out eff 6/1/2020.  I will remove from RCI as well.  No change in billing.  Emailed Wiley Long to follow up wit member re; dependent coverage.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-05-04 13:52:30', '2020-05-04 14:05:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050602013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885296', 'David Steiner', NULL, '5-4-20 Dave has a femoral hip impingement issue he''s had about 8-10 months but no official treatment. Just talking with Dr. friend who''s advising x-rays or mri''s now. He called bc he thought he wanted a better plan that includes co-pays for these items. Re-explained how membership works and that all eligible costs associated with this hip issue will count towards IUA. He also felt like it didn''t matter where he got his MRI and X-ray bc assumes cost will exceed IUA. I told him otherwise, it matters for his cost and for the rest of the members sharing the cost. For example MRI could be $400 or $4000! Why pay $4000 when you are getting the same service for $400 and may never exceed his IUA. He understands now and will call Concierge for assistance with seeking high quality, fair priced services and coaching on creating a Need.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-05-04 13:40:03', '2020-05-04 13:40:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050608003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027654432', 'Sarah Mandell', NULL, 'Wendy called me directly to ask if I could reach out to Sarah and help her schedule a time for another welcome call.  I called Sarah and left a message for a call back. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-05-04 11:30:44', '2020-05-04 11:30:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050593018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005929297', 'Lana Meell', NULL, 'Lana called in to make sure that she was still a member and we had the correct address. She is and the address IS correct. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-05-04 10:31:35', '2020-05-04 10:31:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050587028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003967007', 'Jennilee Chapman', NULL, 'Robert Chapman called and wanted to update payment info. Update Zoho subscription and let him know he also needs to update the payment info with Liberty. Gave him Liberty Number', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-05-04 10:07:51', '2020-05-04 10:07:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050593013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020482017', 'Steven Thomas', NULL, 'Steve called stating he has a question about a 1095-B form that he said it looks like it doesn''t belong to him. Sent to Patti. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-05-04 10:06:20', '2020-05-04 10:06:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050593008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003967007', 'Jennilee Chapman', NULL, 'Called to update his bank info. Sent over to sunny. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-05-04 10:05:19', '2020-05-04 10:05:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050595003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050050205', 'Eric Cohen', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Went over plan several times with member and wife Jill. Also changes primary email. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-05-04 09:42:14', '2020-05-04 09:43:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050587020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000167691', 'Catherine Dailey', NULL, 'Did some digging and found out she did fill out a form on 2.3.2020. The payment info was updated on our end for HES. However, she meant to update her monthly share amount and got angry because that wasn''t updated. Sent her  an email explaining that she would have to contact them directly. CCed Wendy', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-05-04 09:32:59', '2020-05-04 09:32:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050587015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031476065', 'Michelle Sangster', NULL, 'Called member and left her a VM. Also sent her an email including the payment update form.

