  ('zcrm_1579374000050593003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031476065', 'Michelle Sangster', NULL, 'Called in and needed to change her bank account info for the direct deposit we take out for her monthly premium. I told her that we, including Sunny who she would need to speak to, were all on a conference call and Sunny will call her back once the call is over. I emailed Sunny Michelle''s info to call her back. Sunny did get it and will be calling her. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-05-04 09:02:26', '2020-05-04 09:02:26'),
