  ('zcrm_1579374000050536013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049780121', 'Diana Posey', NULL, 'John spoke to that member, we were unable to process a partial refund, therefore he processed a full refund ($346) and then charged the owed amount ($212). Member had some questions as she did not see the refund so I called and spoke to her in detail that the authorization for the charge usually shows right away as it would do with a credit card swipe purchase and that the refund usually takes 3-5 business fays (from 4/30). Gave her my direct line and told her to call me if she has any issues', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-05-01 11:16:51', '2020-05-01 11:16:51'),
