  ('zcrm_1579374000050521008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049472075', 'Thomas Loftus', NULL, 'A ticket was made stating: He stated that he needs assistance adding his family members to his virtual teladoc. He would like a call today. He said he was at his wits end.

My response was: I sent the email template that John has just recently created about registering with CirrusMD that has a link to bring him to the registering page. I also let him know in the email that in the bottom right hand corner of that page there is a chat option to where he can speak with the Technical Support team if he is having any issues or questions. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-04-30 11:27:49', '2020-04-30 11:27:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050505033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050504066', 'Deborah Madsen', NULL, 'Tracking #10006860
Sent by Patti Baron on 4/30/2020.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-30 10:37:56', '2020-04-30 10:37:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050505028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050504066', 'Deborah Madsen', NULL, 'Member Only $500 IUA 60-64 Redirect', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-30 10:28:27', '2020-04-30 10:28:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050505023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610208', 'Marc Krawatsky', NULL, 'Member called in and asked about coverage for his son that will be attending college in Israel. I advised that I would pose question to Sedera to see what their response would be reply below from Dania:
I think it would depend on the child.  Sharing is not limited to treatment within the U.S., but the member has to be willing to translate all bills, etc… into English if submitting a Need.  As well, we would want the child to advocate for themselves as a cash pay patient in order to help save the Community as much funds as possible, since negotiating would probably be limited. So if child is super responsible, MCS might make sense.  If not, then perhaps what the college offers would make more sense for her/him.
I called & left VM for Marc about this and asked him if he had any further questions to contact me.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-30 10:20:34', '2020-04-30 10:20:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050529018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048122121', 'Adam Grochowsky', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 30 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-04-30 10:00:44', '2020-04-30 10:00:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050529013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048462222', 'Ann Apfelbeck', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the 30 minute welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-04-30 09:52:41', '2020-04-30 09:52:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050532003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012906034', 'Holly Dougherty', NULL, 'Made 2 phone calls and left messages to rectify payment issues with provided banking information....additionally, sent email requesting immediate contact for possible May 1, 2020 start date....waiting on response from client....', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2020-04-30 09:49:12', '2020-04-30 09:49:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050529008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048462261', 'Brian Tilley', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the 30 minute welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-04-30 09:47:06', '2020-04-30 09:47:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050529003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048462299', 'Devon Scholl', NULL, 'Not able to leave message. Sent email to book 30 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-04-30 09:42:38', '2020-04-30 09:42:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050521003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610208', 'Marc Krawatsky', NULL, 'Marc called in and had a bunch a questions. His initial question was needing some sort of mental health services due to home schooling all of his children and everything going on with COVID-19. Patti explained to him that there are about 2 phone sessions that he can have with Sedera. We provided Sedera''s phone number to him to reach out and get that explained and set up. His last question was about some sort of proof of his coverage for his son that will be going to Israel for college. He said that over there they are offering some sort of "Insurance" in the country, not from the school itself, it would be coverage from the country of Israel. So he wanted to know how he can get some sort of paper work or something along those lines. Patti said that she is not sure about out of the country coverage and will get in touch with him after she has gotten more info from Sedera. Patti said personally she would rather have what ever coverage that is being offered because using Sedera will still be an out of pocket cost and he would be reimbursed and it would be a lot of back and forth. Patti told Marc she will be back in touch with him once she gets some more info. Other than that Marc is all set and greatly appreciated the info and answers for his other questions and will call Sedera about the mental health portions. -KF/PB', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-04-30 09:14:13', '2020-04-30 09:14:13'),
