  ('zcrm_1579374000050006008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028459096', 'Monica Violante', NULL, 'Monica called in heartbroken because she and her husband are getting a divorce, he told her that he didn''t want health coverage- "just the cash".  I told her that I would send her a member update form to fill out, and told her that would reach out to Patti about pushing this through before billing. I told her that I was sorry she was going through all of this.  She cried and said thank you.  Poor thing. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-04-20 13:12:18', '2020-04-20 13:12:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050003028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040737053', 'Angelina Kalianda', NULL, '4-20-20 Enrolled Xavier Martinez Nogue just now for Self Directed at $1500/$203. Price will increase to $212 in June bc of age going from 39-40. They are all set to go!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-04-20 12:33:41', '2020-04-20 12:33:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000050003018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050050205', 'Eric Cohen', NULL, '4-20-20 Explained how to use membership again discussed Redirect''s portion and Sedera''s portion, pcp, chiro and wellness vs specialist and ER. They have advocate working on their behalf to negotiate rates. Jill and Eric seem to understand one final time and will decide what to do today. This is a VERY difficult concept for Jill, Eric gets it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-04-20 11:47:47', '2020-04-20 11:47:47'),
