  ('zcrm_1579374000049975058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043575482', 'Christina Brown', NULL, 'Christy called in and had a rupture and was taken by ambulance to the hospital. She wanted to know what to do with this situation and explained to contact Sedera ASAP and explained the whole injury/illness process with her paying the first $1500 of her IUA and then start a "Need" with Sedera. Provided Sedera''s phone number and sent the email on how to submit bills, she has not gotten any bills as of yet. Also sent an email for a Welcome Call scheduler to have another Welcome call because she says she did not have one and we advise greatly for her to have one asap. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-04-20 11:37:13', '2020-04-20 11:37:13'),
