  ('zcrm_1579374000050003013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051294009', 'Erin Brennan', NULL, '4-20-20 
I would highly recommend looking into Harmony Health for $80 a month - https://harmonyfamilypractice.com/ or Nextera for $99 a month which has multiple locations in which the closest is Boulder - https://nexterahealthcare.com/our-solution/

Both practices are about 20 minutes from downtown Lafayette. Both DPC''s are fantastic.

If you choose Harmony Health with Dr. Stefano Lee it will be $230 a month at the $1500 IUA level, plus $80 to equal $310 a month. If you choose Nextera it''s $230+$99 = $329 plus an enrollment fee of $79.  There''s a separate $100 MPowering Benefits Enrollment fee which Harmony Health or Nextera will waive.  I will have to help you enroll in order to waive that fee.

