  ('zcrm_1579374000049829013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048514334', 'Jordan Lubin', NULL, 'welcome call completed- big fiasco of member asking for a price through the "back door" after signing up.  I sent all of my concerns to Patti, the member asked me even after I warned on several occasions that I may not be speaking about the right plan, that I go on.  I did because I thought he may have ties with Robert through Hip Nation and lives in GA.  members were thrilled and in good spirits at the end of the call.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-04-15 18:07:29', '2020-04-15 18:07:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049829008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032679258', 'Karin Schwarz', NULL, 'Karin reached out via Sales IQ to log into her account and get 12 months worth of invoices for her taxes.  I emailed Sunny and asked her to follow up with this. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-04-15 15:40:25', '2020-04-15 15:40:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049829003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038206005', 'Marie Brennan', NULL, 'Brien called to cancel, I sent him the form and tagged Guy to give the heads up. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-04-15 15:38:44', '2020-04-15 15:38:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049778053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049815023', 'Andrew Vick', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA 50-59 Redirect', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-15 13:25:50', '2020-04-15 13:25:50'),
