  ('zcrm_1579374000049801008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047519124', 'Forrest Coleman', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule the 30 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-04-15 09:51:04', '2020-04-15 09:51:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049801003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048462355', 'Karen Martorana', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-04-15 09:19:21', '2020-04-15 09:19:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049778013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028384181', 'Tess Weaver', NULL, 'Receipts for last 12 months sent out to greg.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-15 09:04:00', '2020-04-15 09:04:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049778008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028384181', 'Tess Weaver', NULL, 'Member called in again and requested last 12 months of receiopts.  I reminded him that he receives receipts every month when billed.  Said that his wife''s email was on account I changed that for him as he is the one that pays.  I will also send out receipts.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-15 08:55:40', '2020-04-15 08:55:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049778003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012429101', 'Karyn Burke Whitcomb', NULL, 'I spoke with this member after writing the last note.  She told me that she had not saved any of her receipts from us.  I agreed to email her the receipts from 4/19 to present.  That was emailed out of FTNI.  Member very appreciative.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-15 07:08:58', '2020-04-15 07:08:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049730028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610284', 'Donna Ericson', NULL, 'Donna called in because she had a question about how she needed to answer one of the questions on the medicare form she is filling out.  It is asking her if she was part of "group insurance"- she called Sedera and they told her to call us with that question, I told her that the answer may be ASI- but that it is a MEC plan, and maybe not the type they are looking for, so that I would reach out to Patti and ask that she contact Donna tomorrow.  Also she wanted to know about cancellation deadlines...I told her the 20th of the month, and sent her the online form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-04-14 16:41:21', '2020-04-14 16:41:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049730023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012429101', 'Karyn Burke Whitcomb', NULL, 'I received an email from Wendy &amp; this member.  She is applying for assistance from the SBA and was asking if we could supply her with documentation for this.  I am unsure if the whole amount would qualify for this or just what she paid for "insurance.  I told her that she receives a receipt from us every month which would be the only documentation.  I told her when and the subject line to look for.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-14 14:47:09', '2020-04-14 14:47:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049740008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026291070', 'Alex Lutterbein', NULL, 'Spoke to Patricia again, their invoices for Alex Lutterbein come in saying ''PAID'' so it is confusing to them. Working on fixing QB but I did let her know what is due and what is paid.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-04-14 14:08:36', '2020-04-14 14:08:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049749003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012906034', 'Holly Dougherty', NULL, 'Spoke to client and walked her through enrollment....client completing enrollment today....', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2020-04-14 13:57:01', '2020-04-14 13:57:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049730018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028384181', 'Tess Weaver', NULL, 'Greg called requesting invoices for the last 12 months.  I emailed the request to Sunny. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-04-14 13:41:51', '2020-04-14 13:41:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049740003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016111199', 'Michael Procaccini', NULL, 'Member contacted Kelly C. requesting a monthly share amount. Sent him an email explaining specifics on monthly payments and his most recent invoice.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-04-14 12:36:28', '2020-05-06 10:11:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049730013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919520', 'Dechen Hawk', NULL, 'prescription quote form request done.  Gave Dechen 2 options, one at local pharmacy and the other via Reid. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-04-14 12:33:39', '2020-04-14 12:33:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049730008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016111199', 'Michael Procaccini', NULL, 'called and asked for a document that goes over his monthly payment per month/year- sent to Sunny. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-04-14 12:28:02', '2020-04-14 12:28:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049730003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011537031', 'Maureen Mulkey', NULL, 'called to ask if MPowering Benefits was offering free Covid blood tests to it''s members, she shared that she may have had it a few months back and it would make her LESS anxious if she could just have a test done to clear her.  I told her that I understood the stress and anxiety but the only way the test would be covered is if it were positive and the amount above her IUA paid.  I also told her that we DO offer a free service by a liscensed Dr via telemedicine.  She didn''t like that idea and said she was "looking" to have the blood test done.  She thanked me for my time. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-04-14 12:16:25', '2020-04-14 12:16:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049691051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043491714', 'Douglas Bush', NULL, 'Doug emailed me in regards to his daughter Megan pertaining to her birth control and her benefits through her RCI card, I sent him my answers. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-04-14 11:48:44', '2020-04-14 11:48:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049691043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904638', 'Kevin Schemers', NULL, 'Received the following email from Patricia Georges about this employee.  I have responded and asked for her to fill out the Term/Change Form for the group.  I have cancelled RCI and will eamil Sedera and let Tricia Know.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-14 11:18:17', '2020-04-14 11:24:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049691038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904638', 'Kevin Schemers', NULL, 'HELLO PATTI,

CAN YOU PLEASE TERMINATE KEVIN SCHEMERS AND HIS WIFE FROM SEDERA, RCI AND MPOWERING BENEFITS ASAP?  KEVIN IS VERY DISAPOINTED IN ALL THE COVERAGE AND HE DOES NOT FEEL THEY ARE PAYING FOR ANYTHING.  IF YOU HAVE QUESTIONS, FEEL FREE TO CONTACT ME AT 623-979-7565.



Thank You,

Patricia Gorges', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-14 11:16:53', '2020-04-14 11:16:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049691033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048586070', 'Brandon Johnson', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-04-14 10:51:33', '2020-04-14 10:51:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049691028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862412', 'Joy Lanzano', NULL, 'Had another Q&amp;A session with Joy about how her plan works.  She told me that she had to have another Pap and would that be "covered".  I asked why she has had 3 in the past year and told her that it should be part of her DPC fees.  Advised her that if not included it would be out of pocket.  I started to tell her of the changes in the wind for the Select plan and the choices of either Redirect or the DPC program.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-14 08:49:09', '2020-04-14 08:49:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049701013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048228151', 'Jennifer Wright', NULL, 'Member reached out to Concierge with some financial questions. I sent her an email, giving her all the info she needed and options to reach out to us should she need anything else.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-04-14 08:19:40', '2020-04-14 08:19:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049691023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047612079', 'Meena Puri', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the 30 minute welcome call.  Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-04-14 08:19:06', '2020-04-14 08:19:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049701008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012906034', 'Holly Dougherty', NULL, 'Call her at 3:30pm to finalize enrollment.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2020-04-14 08:18:31', '2020-04-14 08:18:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049691018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447059', 'Florie Glusman', NULL, 'Member called in and advised that she is Covid-19 positive. Said that has spent about $3-400 and that they are talking about her needing a RedLLight Machine.  I advised her to contact Sedera immediately and they will step her through the process of opening a need', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-14 08:18:14', '2020-04-14 08:18:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049691013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048283052', 'Abbod Attallah', NULL, 'Not able to leave message. Member''s mailbox is not set up yet. Sent email to book online the 30 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-04-14 07:58:44', '2020-04-14 07:58:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049691008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000255524', 'Ana Leighton', NULL, 'Received notification form ASi that they have returned mail for this member.  I have emailed member for an update.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-14 07:41:26', '2020-04-14 07:41:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049691003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027741461', 'Michael Tyburczy', NULL, 'Member submitted change of address.  I submitted it to Sedera &amp; updated in FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-14 07:37:17', '2020-04-14 07:37:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049638043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018451131', 'Adria Moshe', NULL, 'After speaking with Rod and determining that we will not be making any changes to these member since we will be transferring them to Access around June timeframe.  I spoke to Roy to let him know this and then Adria. She was unaware that she had 30 days to put her newborn on the plan.  I told Roy &amp; Adria that the options were either Redirect or the DPC plan.  I went over each.   I told her that the Pre Ex would not reset. She will let me know. what she wants to do.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-13 14:02:35', '2020-04-13 14:02:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049638038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027741461', 'Michael Tyburczy', NULL, 'With John''s help we searched on Healthgrades and found 2 providers for this member.  John then crafted a template to be sent out with the physician recommendation.  I then called member to follow up and make sure he understood how to present and his IUA.  Member was ok with everything.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-13 13:31:54', '2020-04-13 13:31:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049638033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000051294009', 'Erin Brennan', NULL, '4-13-20 Erin is healthy and just turned 59 in Jan. Told her the price increase for 60-64. Takes fluoxitine for anxiety and it''s super cheap $6 month. Discussed PDHC and DPC. Looking into Take Two Health with Dr. Litto for $180 a month! Told her others are $99 or so. Needs coverage to begin June 1st when husbands ends. He''s 65 on Medicare.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-04-13 13:17:56', '2020-04-13 13:17:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049660003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015086178', 'Kristine Smith', NULL, 'Member submitted change of payment form. FTNI updated', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-04-13 12:35:26', '2020-04-13 12:35:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049653008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027741461', 'Michael Tyburczy', NULL, 'Called John Kach to see what the next step is when helping Micheal with finding a Dermatologist in his area as CirrusMD has directed him to do. We are going to use healthgrades.com to do so and copy and paste the best providers we see with high star rating and a lot of reviews. Put everything in a word document and send it to Micheal explaining everything and to let him know to call if he has any other questions. Make sure to send the link''s to the couple very good providers we found and the link to the actual website Healthgrades. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-04-13 11:42:07', '2020-04-13 11:42:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049653003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027741461', 'Michael Tyburczy', NULL, 'Michael called in and said he just had a consultation with a provider on CirrusMD and was advised to see a dermatologist and to contact the care team, which is us. I had no clue what to do so I asked Patti and she said to just take down his information and tell him we will get back with him. Guy came to me and said to put Micheal back to him and he will get the info needed and go from there. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-04-13 11:29:54', '2020-04-13 11:29:54');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000049638028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049780068', 'Sofia Gomez Villafane', NULL, '4-13-20 Sofia just joined the PSDHC for $243/$1500 and reminded her she needs to go in network for Wellness visit and show card for that visit only. All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-04-13 11:15:07', '2020-04-13 11:15:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049646013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047084073', 'Nicole Garth', NULL, 'Member decided to stay where she was for immediate future.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-13 10:56:26', '2020-04-13 10:56:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049646008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047084073', 'Nicole Garth', NULL, 'Received ticket that this member wanted to upgrade to Redirect. on 4/6.  I emailed Zach that I needed a detaild email with what member wanted to do.  I followed up today advising of the deadline on 4/17.  Zach to follow up.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-13 10:41:24', '2020-04-13 10:41:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049646003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005095199', 'Glen Bevell', NULL, 'Spoke with member as she had submitted ticket.  She said that she had been contacted by Collections and that she had given the contact number to LHS who said that they would contact collections to let them know that payment was coming.  This was not done so she continues to be contacted.  I directed her to contact LHS again as they were the ones that were responsible.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-13 10:34:11', '2020-04-13 10:34:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049638023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048544005', 'Daniel Soleja', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 30 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-04-13 09:31:12', '2020-04-13 09:31:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049638018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048549215', 'Cheryl Kouns', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 30 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-04-13 09:26:48', '2020-04-13 09:26:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049638013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048549313', 'April Mestas', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the 30 minute welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-04-13 09:21:32', '2020-04-13 09:21:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049638008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048586020', 'David Kanning', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the 30 minute welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-04-13 09:17:13', '2020-04-13 09:17:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049638003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048586070', 'Brandon Johnson', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the 30 minute welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-04-13 09:12:48', '2020-04-13 09:12:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049621003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012024351', 'Eric Thomsen', NULL, 'Theresa from Bowtie medical called in on behalf of Eric to ask how a "Need" works. He got into a bad accident over the weekend and just wanted to know how it works through Sedera. I told her what he needs to do and that he is responsible for the first $1000 of his IUA and present as a self pay. She said he knew that part  just didn''t know what to do after. I gave her Sedera''s phone number to give to him and to let him know I sent him an email that explains the submitting of bills to Sedera. She thanked me very much and said this all helps a lot. I told her to let Eric know to call Sedera ASAP since this is going to be a pricey situation because how badly injured he is. I let her know Sedera will be more than happy to walk him through the process when he calls. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-04-13 08:10:40', '2020-04-13 08:10:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049589023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012906034', 'Holly Dougherty', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 665 
Question : Hi trying to get a copy of your comparison guide but the system said there is a subscription error. IHow can I compare your products?', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2020-04-13 04:46:13', '2020-04-13 04:46:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049598008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003267049', 'Deborah Bentley', NULL, 'I got a phone call from Deborah Bentley.  She told me that her bank account was drawn from when it should''ve been a different form of payment.  She sounded kinda rattled about it, so I thought I might be able to reach out to Sunny.  I told her that "home office" was closed for the day but that I would reach out anyway, but told her that we may not be able to help her until Monday.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-04-10 16:18:25', '2020-04-10 16:18:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049598003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018451131', 'Adria Moshe', NULL, 'Member called in because she needed to add her 7 week old baby to her plan, but she needed to know the price first.  I told her that it would be Patti Baron''s job to do, and that she could get back to her later on Monday.  She then said that her dad does a lot of work for us and that he spoke with the CEO about having $4000 off of her plan "like a deductible" and that she didn''t trust her needs coordinator Marquis to understand what that meant. She also wanted to complain that she hasn''t heard anything back from Marquis in the last 2 months- I told her that I would reach out to his manager regarding this and that she should expect a call from someone there.  She also complained about how the medical service line items are laid out- the charged amount/the paid amount and that "it wasn''t going to work with her."  I told her that she could speak to someone at Sedera when they contact her about it.  She said that only one bill got paid at it was only for around $80.  I reached out to Dania- who reached out to member services to get a call over to her speedily.  I told Dania that if they have further questions to give Patti a call later on Monday.  I am sending Adria an email and copying Patti to let Adria know that Patti will get back to her by late afternoon on Monday. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-04-10 15:12:31', '2020-04-10 15:12:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049593008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002568035', 'Julie Tokar', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation form', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-10 13:06:06', '2020-04-10 13:06:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049593003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002469017', 'Floyd Trujillo', NULL, 'After Kelly asked me to contact this member he finally called me back.  His conceres all center around his preventative appt.  He had one 2 yrs ago and ended up oaying app $300.  I told him with much certainty that this was most likely due to a coding issue.  I explained to him that ASi cannot pay anything that is not coded "preventative".  Told him he has to instruct provider that it must be coded as preventative.  Told him not to talk about any chronic health issues.  I expressed to him that I wanted to answer all of his questions so that he would not have to continue to call everyday.  He told me that since he pays us $300 per month that it was his "right". These questions have been answered by the Kellys & John and all emails have been sent to him.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-10 13:02:35', '2020-04-10 13:02:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049583003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002469017', 'Floyd Trujillo', NULL, 'I told Patti to give him a call because I do not know what else can be said to him. I have told him everything that needs to be done several times over and over again. There is literally NOTHING else that can be said to him, idk what more he wants. I have slacked John about him and haven''t gotten a response. So I told Patti to give him a call. Same thing as yesterday half of a ring and straight to voicemail and it is full so can not leave a message. She is going to email him... Nothing else we can tell him, he is doing everything the correct way so I don''t know what more he wants. -KF

Floyd called back and Patti is giving him the rundown, AGAIN........ He said I didn''t answer what he needed so w.e Patti will deal with it. She said to him lets clear up all your questions so you don''t have to keep calling, so this should be the very last time he calls. Ticket Closed. -KF/PB', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-04-10 11:57:23', '2020-04-10 11:57:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049576003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002469017', 'Floyd Trujillo', NULL, 'This member continues to call everyday after Kelly has spoken with him on the phone and sent him many email about Scheduling his preventative appt.  I tried to call him and his mailbox was full so I could not leave an VM.  I will email him and ask him to call me.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-10 11:47:42', '2020-04-10 11:47:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049564029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002568035', 'Julie Tokar', NULL, 'Member called in and asked what she needed to do to cancel her membership.  I will send her the cancellation forn', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-10 11:16:30', '2020-04-10 11:16:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049564021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028177385', 'Angela Nail', NULL, 'Member submitted a ticket saying that she needed some questions answered re; her son.. She needed to know when her son was covered until as they are enrolling him in TriCare.  He will be going into the National Guard.  I told her he was effective until 5/1/2020.  I told her I would send out the Member change form and she needed to fill it out prior to the 20th.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-10 10:30:34', '2020-04-10 10:37:59'),
