  ('zcrm_1579374000049564003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659241', 'Michele Kean', NULL, 'Member called in and told me that she was experiencing a financial Hardship.  I asked her to send me an email outlining her situation and that we would be back to her prior to the billing.  When I receive I will put it in hardship folder.  She also said that she called in and spoke to someone prior to last months billing which I could not find a record of.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-10 08:09:09', '2020-04-10 08:56:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049540017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521590', 'Sherrie Lynne Vantongeren', NULL, 'Patti with covid-19 money is very tight I don''t even know how I am going to make payroll this week any help would be appreciated I have never used the program so if I have to cancel I will
Thanks
Sherrie Vantongeren', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-09 14:56:18', '2020-04-09 14:56:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049540012', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521590', 'Sherrie Lynne Vantongeren', NULL, 'I was contacted by Kayla frm Sedera who received an email from this member who is having financial issues at the time.  I contacted her and asked for an email with details and told her that we would be back with her prior to the billing date with  a strategy  for financial help.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-09 14:15:36', '2020-04-09 14:15:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049556008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659334', 'Kaye Reich', NULL, 'Kaye called in because the Teladoc Dr told her to go to an urgent care in regards to her having some "chest issues"  she asked me to walk her through what that process would look like, I explained in great detail and sent the email template with a link and instructions on how to open up a need with Sedera. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-04-09 13:28:04', '2020-04-09 13:28:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049556003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015086178', 'Kristine Smith', NULL, 'called to update her payment info. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-04-09 12:14:02', '2020-04-09 12:14:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049555003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605393', 'Ian McLendon', NULL, '4-9-20 Ian called to determine when his membership began and how much he can claim on taxes. I just called him back and left vm that $105 month fits within the Affordable Care Act Guidelines as MEC to be able to claim on taxes.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-04-09 12:06:13', '2020-04-09 12:06:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049553003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002469017', 'Floyd Trujillo', NULL, 'Floyd called back and said when he called in a little while ago a woman answered and told him that John was going to give him a call back. He really needs and wants to speak with John about giving the correct ID number to the providers office he is going to have a physical with. Because the last time he had one was back on 6/4/18 and he was charged $400 something and and he let it go to collections and what not. He is just very confused and said he seems to be going in circles and needs to speak to John. I explained to him what needs to be done to make sure everything is covered as preventative. He picked a provider from the list I sent him a while back and has his ASi card and all the educational emails sent. He still would like to speak to John. I gave him John''s direct line and will message John as well to let him know Floyd is going to call and to give him a call back please. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-04-09 11:37:16', '2020-04-09 11:37:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049537003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046605028', 'Donald Spiegel', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Was in front of computer at time of call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-04-09 08:05:17', '2020-04-09 08:05:17'),
