  ('zcrm_1579374000049526008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009850101', 'Elizabeth Spano', NULL, 'Sent out 1095 to member via email per her request', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-09 07:47:28', '2020-04-09 07:47:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049526003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939079', 'Patricia Mitchell', NULL, 'Sent member all her receipts from July 2019 to current', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-04-09 07:35:55', '2020-04-09 07:35:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049500023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919182', 'Joshua Bowlin', NULL, 'Mary Lineback called on behalf of Joshua Bowlin because apparently he is going to the ER and was unsure as to what to tell the hospital when he got there- I told her that he just needs to state that he is a cash pay patient- to never pay more than his IUA (I didn''t tell her what that was) and to tell them to bill him the rest.  When he get''s home- call Sedera.  I am going to reach out to Sunny to follow up on his membership status with us. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-04-08 17:41:36', '2020-04-08 17:41:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049500018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048549155', 'Joshua Brewer', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  Joshua is an amazing new member! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-04-08 15:09:16', '2020-04-08 15:09:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049500013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046605028', 'Donald Spiegel', NULL, 'I called Donald for his welcome call, when he answered it sounded like he was driving, I asked if he was ready for the 30 min welcome call and he said "I guess".  I then asked him if he was in front of a computer, he said no and asked if he needed to be.  I told him that going over the checklist with him online would be the best option because it provides a good visual, I told him that I would be happy to do the welcome call without him looking at it and send him the list with links and directions after the call.  He then asked his wife what he should do- they went back and forth until he told me clearly that they would like to be able to sit down in front of their computer.  I then asked if his wife was interested in coming onto the plan with him- he told me that it wasn''t the case and that she was going to sit, listen, and ask me questions to see if it was a good fit for him, he said that they knew nothing about the plan he had just enrolled in.  I then told him (and wife in the background) that he/they needed to then reach out to Jonathan (Zac) Masters.  Donald then asked why he would need to do that- I told him to gain an understanding of the plan- that''s when Donald then said - "I thought that was your job."  I told him that it was Zac''s job to lay out the plan, and it was my job to go over how it all works together.   I told him that I would reach out to Zac and that''s how the conversation ended.  I called Guy immediately after and Guy was reaching out to Zac right away. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-04-08 13:50:59', '2020-04-08 13:50:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049500008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047519198', 'Theodore Hsu', NULL, 'called in for script coupon- emailed it over to both email addresses as requested. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-04-08 12:59:43', '2020-04-08 12:59:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049500003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086456009', 'Chloe Ray', NULL, 'left a voicemail for missed welcome call.  sent another scheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-04-08 12:18:14', '2020-04-08 12:18:14'),
