  ('zcrm_1579374000049437038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003848025', 'Jennika Wildau', NULL, 'Jennika called to ask about Covid19 testing- she wondered if we knew where she could get an antibody test as apposed to the type she turned down today that takes 5 days to read.  I told her that I would need to get back to her- I spoke to Guy and he said that she really needs to contact her own local health department for this information.  I sent her an email with that advice as well as some links from Sedera. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-04-07 17:20:00', '2020-04-07 17:20:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049437033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046605028', 'Donald Spiegel', NULL, 'Zac called me concerning Donald not getting his MPowering Benefits welcome packet with QR Life code cards in the mail yet.  He also asked if I could resend a welcome call scheduler.- sent Donald an email asking to confirm mailing address. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-04-07 16:58:39', '2020-04-07 16:58:39'),
