  ('zcrm_1579374000049437018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447085', 'Ian (Gary) Van Houten', NULL, 'called because of the email Patti sent him about aging out of the plan, I transferred the line to Wendy. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-04-07 14:02:26', '2020-04-07 14:02:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049437013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033451023', 'Scott Ballard', NULL, 'Orlena called in regarding Cirrus MD- she wanted to know if there was a way that Cirrus could send her the same email that Scott received earlier today.   She thought that she may have been "passed over" by  the plan because she didn''t get an email.  I told her that I didn''t know exactly if this was true- but suggested that it may work a bit like Teladoc''s registration process , where the primary member needs to register first and then the rest of the family can follow.  This made her perk up and say that she and her husband will just start with the email sent and see how it goes.  I told her that in the meantime I would get a hold of John about the emails and registration progress.- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-04-07 13:48:12', '2020-04-07 13:48:12'),
