  ('zcrm_1579374000049405008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049144002', 'David Rubine', NULL, '4-6-20 Called bc hasn''t received any information from Anthem yet and I gave him timeline and not to worry. He will wait until about 4-17-20.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-04-06 12:33:39', '2020-04-06 12:33:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049404013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012351098', 'Teresa Brachle', NULL, 'called to request last 12 months of invoices sent via email to her.  I emailed Sunny for this request. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-04-06 12:31:21', '2020-04-06 12:31:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049404008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049368070', 'Holly Singer', NULL, 'Holly called to find out if her annual checkup would be covered if it were via video chat with her doctor.  I told her that the plan she is listed under does not have any preventive care services.  She told me that it wasn''t right and that she spoke to Daniel about this before and he told her that the preventive services were a part of the plan she was signing up for.  I told her that I would contact someone from home office and Daniel to figure this out, and also ask about preventive care services being a "covered" expense under their MEC. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-04-06 12:23:45', '2020-04-06 12:23:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049398031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049368070', 'Holly Singer', NULL, 'Member Only $$2500 IUA 40-49 SD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-06 11:37:46', '2020-04-06 11:37:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049405003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050050205', 'Eric Cohen', NULL, '4-6-20 Answered more questions. Jill is tough but I think she gets it again. The Welcome Call will be vital for her. She wants to know what to do in every possible scenario. I told her that''s what the Concierge is for, to help alleviate fears and the need to remember everything. She can call upon them for assistance if/when she has a medical issue/need. They will discuss further and let me know if they want to move forward with PDHC at likely the $1500/$910.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-04-06 11:36:43', '2020-04-06 11:36:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049401018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002519033', 'Diane Bailey', NULL, 'Diane called and said about 3 weeks ago she spoke to someone to cancel and she said the person told her they did not know how that process works. So I am assuming that was the back office betties. She said that was the last she heard and was now charged $50 again after she has been cancelled with Liberty since Feb. I told her I can send her the cancellation link to the form to fill out and reimburse this months $50. She was perfectly happy after telling her that... Patti will take care of it. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-04-06 11:36:00', '2020-04-06 11:36:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049398023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005081065', 'Lisa DeNoto', NULL, 'I received cancellation form for this member.  She now says that she submitted form however she did not.  She filled it out when I resent today.  I have refunded her 1 month.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-06 11:30:40', '2020-04-06 11:30:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049398018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006982053', 'Christine Bowker', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel eff 5/1/2020', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-06 11:22:40', '2020-04-06 11:31:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049404003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521512', 'Daniel Kaplan', NULL, 'Spoke to client and requested that he send me any documents he has regarding billing for a preventative visit.  waiting on documents from Client to contact ASI and review claim from MD office...', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2020-04-06 11:18:00', '2020-04-06 11:18:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049401013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521512', 'Daniel Kaplan', NULL, 'Dan called to ask about what he needs to do because he went to try and set up an appointment for a preventative colonoscopy and he said all that happened was the doctor felt his stomach for 2 seconds and asked him a couple questions and billed ASi $500 and was denied and now he got the letter form ASi saying he has to pay now. He was screaming and cursing at me so I transferred the call over to Guy because I did not understand what the situation was and was getting very very angry at me when all I was trying to do was ask him questions on everything I needed to know to try and help him. Guy took care of it and is having Dan send him the letter/bills he got and Guy will contact ASi to get everything figured out. It seems like it was just a simple miss coding issue from Guy''s opinion. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-04-06 11:15:42', '2020-04-06 11:15:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049401008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031359241', 'Ramiro Peru', NULL, 'Ramiro called in and said that his wife had a blood test done due to her pregnancy and that only a portion of the bill was covered and wanted to know what to do about the remainder of the bill. He said he was told that he could call in and Sedera would negotiate the remainder. So I stopped him and told him that anything to do with pregnancy is injury/illness not preventative so he should have NOT presented his RCI card and to present himself as a cash paying patient and is responsible for the first $1500 of his IUA. He will then need to submit everything into Sedera to start a "Need" anything more than his IUA. I told him I will send him the email that explains how to submit bills to Sedera and to give them a call and ask Sedera to go over the Maternity portion because that is a whole different process. He will do so once he gets the email. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-04-06 11:01:35', '2020-04-06 11:01:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049398013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012594106', 'Sharon Carducci', NULL, 'Member called into request Cancellation form I sent via email.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-06 10:49:53', '2020-04-06 10:49:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049401003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030706004', 'Kathleen Duke', NULL, 'Called in to cancel due to a new insurance plan she found, very sweet. Sent the cancellation link to the form via email. Reminded her to have it in before the 20th due to being charged for next months coverage. Will send it right away. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-04-06 10:38:35', '2020-04-06 10:38:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049398008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028448053', 'Jonathan Brumbaugh', NULL, 'Member called in and told me he was in the ER a few days ago and how was he supposed to use the plan.  I told him that he had to pay his $1000 IUA and that he should contact Sedera and let them know what happened and that they would step him through the process of opening a need.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-06 10:36:40', '2020-04-06 10:36:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049398003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005081065', 'Lisa DeNoto', NULL, 'Per note below I did not received any form back from this member however she is requesting 2 mos back.  I advised that we have expenses that are incurred for services and that if I did not receive her cancellation I could not cancel.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-06 09:54:36', '2020-04-06 09:54:36'),
