  ('zcrm_1579374000049389003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046762183', 'Stephen Berry', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Member will get back to us if he didn''t receive QR Life code cards has to check with wife. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-04-06 07:50:59', '2020-04-06 07:50:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049306150', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007096195', 'Nancy Topoozian', NULL, 'Nancy was unable to make an online appointment with MeMD it only gave her an "urgent care" option.  I tried to troubleshoot this but I failed.  I passed this off to John Kach via Slack. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-04-03 17:53:32', '2020-04-03 17:53:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049306145', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043265090', 'Janet Thomson', NULL, 'Janet called for help in remembering how to go about preventive care with her co-pay plan as well as her lab work.  I went over everything again with her, and she was really glad that I spent some extra time on the phone with her. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-04-03 17:33:48', '2020-04-03 17:33:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049306140', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007096195', 'Nancy Topoozian', NULL, 'Nancy reached out via Sales IQ wanting some help logging in to her Teladoc account- I checked her info and saw that she was a Liberty member and sent her all of the info needed to use the MeMD telamedicine benefit. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-04-03 17:22:20', '2020-04-03 17:22:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049330008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049815023', 'Andrew Vick', NULL, '4-3-20 Andrew is 54 and healthy, no tobacco. Has some short term plan that he doesn''t even know what it includes. Broke his ankle last March. Friend has some other similar issue and a 1 hour 45 min. ER visit cost $10,200! He realizes he needs to protect himself. Adding him to his wife''s plan was going to be $1000 a month! He''s not sure how much they pay for his daughter who''s at CU. Daughter is on wife''s plan as well. They will explore changing it but forewarned him that CU was being difficult about approving MCS but no further word from clients. So, I assume they pushed it through finally. He''s looked over and knows of April 20th deadline. I mentioned the 17th at the latest. He''ll discuss.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-04-03 16:20:13', '2020-04-15 11:29:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049330003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050504066', 'Deborah Madsen', NULL, '4-3-20 Deborah and Bill want to enroll next week on Tuesday at 4:00. They will have their Cobra letter to know cost at that point as well. They assume it will be expensive. They will choose a June 1st start date bc his current plan runs through May 31st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-04-03 16:11:33', '2020-04-03 16:11:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049326003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048228044', 'Phillip Fannin', NULL, 'Al called in again about the welcome call for these members.  I sent the welcome call scheduler to the email on file so they can schedule.  Apparently they did not receive Sedera email.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-03 14:27:00', '2020-04-03 14:27:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049306135', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035227061', 'Marie Folsom', NULL, 'Marie called in inquiring whether we had a plan for people who had lost their jobs to the covid19 virus- I gave her Sedera''s phone number and then transferred the line to Juan at Sedera. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-04-03 12:40:09', '2020-04-03 12:40:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049305024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904178', 'Gerald Roper', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Member asked and I specified Skin checks are not covered. Also said to call Sedera in regards to pre existing conditions if she had further questions about Gerald thinking about hip replacement in future. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-04-03 12:01:26', '2020-04-03 12:01:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049306103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919395', 'Michael (Mikhail) Kaspin', NULL, 'Michael emailed me concerning whether or not I had heard back from ASI- I told him that I had not, and I cannot make any promises as to when ASI will be working per usual again.  I resent my original question to Leena for good measure. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-04-03 11:21:40', '2020-04-03 11:21:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049306098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017033271', 'Shannon Drake', NULL, 'Sent me and email to cancel. Found a more affordable option. I sent her the cancellation email with the link to the form. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-04-03 11:01:34', '2020-04-03 11:01:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049299013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862262', 'Pete Scifo', NULL, 'Spouse called in and let me know that they had to close their bank account that our paymnet was drawn from.  I sent her out link to Payment Update form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-03 10:54:17', '2020-04-03 10:54:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049305019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047084284', 'Karen Quigley', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule the 30 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-04-03 10:43:45', '2020-04-03 10:43:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049305011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046762047', 'David Holstein', NULL, 'Spoke to member he left a message with US Corporate Wellness waiting for response. I sent email to John to look into this problem. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-04-03 10:31:25', '2020-04-03 10:31:25'),
