  ('zcrm_1579374000049239013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001696029', 'Keila Hoover', NULL, '4-2-20 All set! Anthem Silver Pathway X HMO 5150 HMO/Silver. $250.33 APTC and $161.34 her cost. All set for April 1st, 2020 with Dr. Brian S. Nelson.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-04-02 16:49:45', '2020-04-02 16:49:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049239008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049242001', 'Madeleine Blanchard Cupolo', NULL, '3-27-20 Chose Cigna Connect Flex Silver $3500 for Madeleine. She has sensory processing disorder and needs OT and psychotherapy. Sondra Blanchard and Shawn Cupolo (parents) earn about $50K-$75K per year. At $60K don''t earn APTC, so left it w/o. Madeleine''s main doctor doesn''t accept insurance. But, they need her to have ins since may have a bunch of needs moving forward. Not good for MPB/MCS. Got it on extended SEP and know to make certain payment is going through.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-04-02 16:00:08', '2020-04-02 16:00:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049232021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005568091', 'Caterina Savino', NULL, 'called for help finding doctor''s and facility''s in-network.  I spent a lot of time going through everything with her from scratch and looking up different doctors and facilities.  I ended up getting lists together for her to go over. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-04-02 15:49:53', '2020-04-02 15:49:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049239003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040737053', 'Angelina Kalianda', NULL, '4-2-20 Angelina wants to enroll her husband again. They''re in Spain right now. He''s covered in Spain bc he''s native. They aren''t sure when they can get back here now. So, she''s going to wait until April 20th to see if they can return by May or if delayed to June. She''s putting it on her calendar to contact me by 20th of April.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-04-02 14:42:38', '2020-04-02 14:42:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049218013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048228044', 'Phillip Fannin', NULL, 'Affiliate Allan Harmon called in and told Kelly C that this member did not receive their welcom email from Sedera.  I told him to have member look in spam folder.  If not to contact me and I would send them the Welcome call Scheduler.  Also went over ith him who to call for what.  Us for admin Sedera for needs.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-02 13:54:43', '2020-04-02 13:54:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049232016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046762047', 'David Holstein', NULL, 'was unable to access US corporatewellness.com - I tried to get in as well 4 times with no luck.  I sent this over to Vanessa since she did the welcome call earlier today to follow up with it in the morning. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-04-02 13:21:05', '2020-04-02 13:21:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049236003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005150013', 'Pamela Shriver', NULL, '04.02.20:  Emailed Pam. Asked her to schedule a time for a call so we could discuss her options.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-04-02 13:20:08', '2020-04-02 13:20:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049232011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013590004', 'Isabel Graefin Von Rittberg', NULL, 'Isabel called in regarding an email and link she was promised via Skipio but never received.  I apologized, and told her to keep a lookout in her inbox.  She was pretty sweet about it...she just wanted to make sure that she was missing something important. I let John know. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-04-02 13:10:50', '2020-04-02 13:10:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049232003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048228151', 'Jennifer Wright', NULL, 'Welcome Call Complete!  She seemed a bit rushed for time and annoyed.  She wondered if specialist''s would be "covered".  I told her that would depend on whether or not the situation was pre-existing.  I asked if she knew what the pre ex clause was, he answer was "pre-existing conditions aren''t covered?"  That''s when I went over Wendy''s definition for her. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-04-02 12:35:39', '2020-04-02 12:38:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049218008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048586020', 'David Kanning', NULL, 'Member submitted change of payment form. Updated bank acct info on admin 123', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-04-02 11:56:42', '2020-04-02 11:56:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049218003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005614021', 'Stefanie Overturf', NULL, 'Member submitted change of payment form. Zoho Subscription updated', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-04-02 11:38:25', '2020-04-02 11:38:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049177031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048462299', 'Devon Scholl', NULL, 'Member called in and wanted a "card" since he had a Dr''s appt tommorow.  I asked what the appointment was and he said he was seeing a dermatoligist for some moles.  I advised him that he was to present himself as a Cash pay patient and get receipts and that he would be responsible for the 1st $2500 for this need.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-02 11:15:16', '2020-04-02 11:15:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049204003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046217082', 'Aaron Martin', NULL, 'Welcome call complete with Aaron and Jennifer. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-04-02 11:00:18', '2020-04-02 11:00:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049197008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779401', 'Kathleen Wilger', NULL, 'Called in and needs to change routing and account number. Sunny was busy so Patti is going to send Kathleen an online form to fill out and change what needs to be changed. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-04-02 10:54:43', '2020-04-02 10:54:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049177026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046762183', 'Stephen Berry', NULL, 'Submitted proof of DPC to Sedera 3/18', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-02 10:15:11', '2020-04-02 10:15:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049177018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003195011', 'Camille Leon', NULL, 'Camille called in and asked what the $50 was for I explained that it was the yearly fee.  She also thought we were charging the wrong account.  I looked and found we are charging Ally bank account however Comerica Bank account shows up on receipt.  This bank account does not show up anywhere in FTNI so am unsure.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-02 09:58:15', '2020-04-02 09:59:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049197003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013822359', 'Heather Rose', NULL, 'Called and needed help on logging in with teladoc because she does not remember anything, I gave her Teladoc''s phone number to give them a call and they will help her. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-04-02 09:53:45', '2020-04-02 09:53:45'),
