  ('zcrm_1579374000049177013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740129', 'Julia (Wieck) Hardy', NULL, 'New Plan eff 5/1/2020: Member &amp; SP $1500 50+', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-02 07:56:45', '2020-04-02 07:56:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049177008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740129', 'Julia (Wieck) Hardy', NULL, 'Member submitted Change request to remove Child Brandon eff 5/1/2020.  I will notify ASi &amp; Sedera &amp; change pmt in FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-02 07:49:14', '2020-04-02 07:49:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049177003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020482017', 'Steven Thomas', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to update address I will update with all vendors.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-02 07:38:20', '2020-04-02 07:38:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049160008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028177004', 'Aaron Barnwell', NULL, 'Aaron''s mother called to ask about how our prescription med program works- I filled her in on the details.  She said that she didn''t have the med info in front of her, but that she would have Aaron fill out the quote request.  She asked me how long it would be for a turnaround time, the doctor had just called in the script to Walgreens so I knew he needed the meds tonight- so I told her that I would be on the lookout for the next 45 minutes. She seemed really grateful for that. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-04-01 17:58:38', '2020-04-01 17:58:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049145021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023592136', 'Raymond Ellason', NULL, '4-1-20 Raymond wanted to understand if it was worth dropping the MEC with the Self Directed Healthcare versus keeping it with Partially Self Directed. Once he understood dropping the MEC would eliminate the ability to fund an HSA his decision became very easy. He wants the tax savings and will keep the MEC. He was passed around from Mike to Sedera to Concierge to KC, Patti and Sunny. I heard of the questioning somehow and played serious phone tag with him and finally connected. He''s please to understand what his choices were and he''ll stay put! Just trying to figure out if/where he can cut costs bc of the lack of biz now. He thanked me profusely.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-04-01 15:54:25', '2020-04-01 15:54:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049145013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001696029', 'Keila Hoover', NULL, '4-1-20 Got app to go through after trying again little later. Chose Bright Health Silver 2 for $77.63 her cost and APTC of $250.33 for total of 327.96. Called and spoke with Clarissa at 2:40 pm and asked to backdate app to 4/1/20. She said all apps will be backdated. I don''t need to call in. No ticket # since no changes. Also found Dr. Brian Nelson in the network for Bright Health. UGH!!!! He''s NOT in the network. I double checked and called Keila. We need to switch to Anthem Pathway X HMO 1500 for $160.57 her cost and APTC of $250.33. Waiting on hold forever! Cancelled membership and we need to wait 24 hours to re-enroll in chosen plan. Deadline is April 3rd!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-04-01 15:27:09', '2020-04-01 15:39:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049160003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919496', 'Dana Green', NULL, 'called to cancel and check to see if medical expenses being incurred under an open need with Sedera will still be paid out.  I told her that she needed to speak with her needs coordinator over at Sedera about the need that is opened.  I also sent her a cancellation form to fill out. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-04-01 13:58:14', '2020-04-01 13:58:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049145008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001696029', 'Keila Hoover', NULL, '4-1-20 Keila thought she re-enrolled in 2020 but there was no enrollment showing in her account. We were able to update her income but system got error every time we submitted application. We chose Bright Health Silver 2 for $0 ded and $2600 max out of pocket. She will call C4 and ask them to fix her account and then choose the plan and back date it to April 1st. She''ll let me know when it''s set. Told her to make sure payment goes through and to set up ongoing payments with Bright Health directly.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-04-01 12:45:13', '2020-04-01 12:45:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049134008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046972029', 'Erika Gutierrez', NULL, 'Member contacted us and was very adamant to know that we will not charge her any more, I deleted her payment account on Admin123 just to make sure she won''t be charged moving forward.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-04-01 11:52:13', '2020-04-01 11:52:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049122028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048586020', 'David Kanning', NULL, 'This member changed to Self Directed Healthcare from DPC because he did not have a DPC physician. I charged him an additional $57 in FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-01 11:41:59', '2020-04-01 11:41:59'),
