  ('zcrm_1579374000049145003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049144002', 'David Rubine', NULL, '4-1-20 David and Ilyse enrolled last night into Anthem Silver Pathway X HMO 5500 for $582.19, $200 more than better Bright Health plan but they want Anthem bc they think it''s safer and they think more doctors will take it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-04-01 10:47:15', '2020-04-01 10:47:15'),
