  ('zcrm_1579374000049122013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044758457', 'Bradley Steele', NULL, 'Member &amp; Family $1000 IUA 30+', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-01 07:31:53', '2020-04-01 07:31:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049122008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044758457', 'Bradley Steele', NULL, 'Brad was transferred into the Select Group.  I set up recurring billing as follows Sedera Select T1 + MPB Care (HES). ( $564 + $25 = 589)', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-01 07:31:04', '2020-04-01 07:31:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049122003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047907018', 'Stephen Tonguis', NULL, 'Per Rod this member was charged the Sedera Select T1 pricing + the HES $25 rate ($564 + $25 = $589)', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-04-01 07:22:42', '2020-04-01 07:22:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049071023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049144002', 'David Rubine', NULL, '3-31-20 We got their C4 account active and updated and added David Rubine to Lori Ilyse (pronounced Elise) Streim. They are married and earning about $46,500 estimate for 2020. Put in David''s at $30K and Ilyse at $16,500. She''s not working now bc it''s a massage biz. He''s still working so far. They are pondering Bright Health Silver 4 RX for about $379 a month. They are continually pressing for Anthem now bc afraid nobody will be in network with Bright Health but Anthem equally challenging bc many places don''t accept Pathway X plans. They may cancel Nextera since not in network. But, they really wanted to keep Dr. Flanagan and Dr. Fliege. They will discuss. Anthem is about $200 more a month!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-03-31 17:22:48', '2020-03-31 17:22:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049095013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010954128', 'Brent Toevs', NULL, 'Sandra called in to ask the same question she asked Kelly Frederickson 4 hours ago.  I told her that she needed to call Sedera and provided their phone number. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-31 16:06:18', '2020-03-31 16:06:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049099003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005150013', 'Pamela Shriver', NULL, '03.31.20:  Called Pam. She is cancelling HES as she has not used this $50 service and wants to save the money. She is keeping LHS. She is healthy and doesn''t use medical care often. She is not happy w/LHS and wants to take a look at our new plans. I explained VPC and DPC plans.  Patti told me if she switches from LHS to our plan we will wave the $125 enrollment fee.  Emailed Pam to let her know I will look into the new program pricing and availability and let her know.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-03-31 15:30:22', '2020-04-02 07:18:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049098008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047907018', 'Stephen Tonguis', NULL, 'Member &amp; Family $1000 IUA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-31 15:07:53', '2020-03-31 15:07:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049098003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049054188', 'Chris Larson', NULL, 'Received this enrollment back from RCI as zip does not match city.  I left VM for correct info.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-31 15:01:58', '2020-03-31 15:01:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049071018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044758402', 'Blake Eliasson', NULL, '3-31-20 Called Tracy and she''s already gone back to Anthem. She wasn''t willing to sign a BOR form. Did it on her own and is happy to keep it on her own. She sees no need in assistance. So, not worth pushing. Just poor choice in my opinion.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-03-31 14:16:45', '2020-03-31 14:16:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049071013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030219010', 'Lori Kleiman', NULL, '3-31-20 Wanted help with tax form and then realized it''s a Cobra plan she was part of before she joined MPB and now has to called Cobra or employer for tax form for first 2 months of coverage in 2019.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-03-31 14:11:21', '2020-03-31 14:11:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049095008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044758402', 'Blake Eliasson', NULL, 'called to cancel.  she said that she has too many health issues to risk during this health crisis and is going back on a traditional plan. sent form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-31 13:37:29', '2020-03-31 13:37:29'),
