  ('zcrm_1579374000049040003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885255', 'Azucena Soto', NULL, 'Member requested 3 mos of receipts that he never received.  (422/19, 9/22/19, 11/22/19).  I sent out of FTNI via email.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-31 07:37:55', '2022-04-26 09:13:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049009038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033866102', 'Susan Muenchen', NULL, 'Susan called in because she couldn''t find a list of ACA compliant services....I pointed her in the right direction.....then she let me know that she had a colo-gaurd test at the tune of $650 that she was looking to have reimbursed.  I told her that it wasn''t one of the services mandated by the ACA.  She then took a deep sigh to go on to say "I guess I should''ve called and asked first." 
I also sent her an email with attachment going over services. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-30 16:46:16', '2020-03-30 16:46:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049009033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010281023', 'Malcolm Pointon', NULL, 'Malcolm called to ask how to add his new wife.  He is going to call Jane about pricing, and I sent him the online form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-30 16:10:05', '2020-03-30 16:10:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049007023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049144002', 'David Rubine', NULL, '3-30-20 David is 62 wife Ilyse (pronounced Elise) is 60. Healthy, no tobacco, David has thyroid meds. Live in Lafayette. With LHS now and too nervous about it. They didn''t realize they needed to join by 1/15/20 but learned of the new open enrollment now and wants to be done with LHS bc he''s afraid they aren''t financially solvent. He''s a builder and biz has slowed. Income about $46K for 2020 as best guess which gives them $1240 APTC. Cigna starts at $336 and Bright Health $342 for Silver plans. Wants Kaiser bc that''s what they had in the past but it''s another $100 more a month. Wants HSA Kaiser and that''s in the $500''s! Not worth it in my opinion.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-03-30 15:54:02', '2020-03-30 15:54:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049005066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810387', 'Valerie Ross', NULL, 'Don Ford, who pays for Valerie called after I contacted him and requested for the payment do be delayed f=with just a couple of days. I scheduled a payment to go through for the 5th of April. Will monitor', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-03-30 15:29:01', '2020-03-30 15:29:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049009028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810615', 'Don Ford', NULL, 'called to update payment- in a couple days once he gets the funds. transferred to Sunny. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-30 15:22:24', '2020-03-30 15:22:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049009023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810280', 'Alfred Shaw', NULL, 'called to change billing info- I sent him the online form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-30 14:51:59', '2020-03-30 14:51:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049007018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049054126', 'Santiago Mussi Tiscornia', NULL, '3-30-20 Santiago wants the $172 for $2500 IUA SDHC. He says he never gets sick. We''re going to enroll tomorrow at 9:00 am.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-03-30 14:47:21', '2020-03-30 14:47:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049009018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885197', 'Karen McCormick', NULL, 'member called to cancel effective April 1- I told the member that this request would be a bit "tricky" but she could read more details in the email that I would be sending along with the cancellation form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-30 14:18:57', '2020-03-30 14:18:57'),
