  ('zcrm_1579374000049007008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048586020', 'David Kanning', NULL, 'John and I had issues with the changing of this member''s plan in e123.  I went in and charged him the additional $57 difference for the Self Directed plan.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-30 14:13:11', '2020-03-30 14:13:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049009013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023592136', 'Raymond Ellason', NULL, 'Raymond called in regarding his membership and wanting a rundown on how much he is paying out to each entity.  I told him that I wouldn''t be able to tell him that amount, but that my co-worker could.  He was a bit miffed because he first called Mike- MIke told him that he couldn''t answer the question and told him to call Sedera, and then Sedera told him to call us.  I put Raymond through to Sunny, and she will follow up with Mike. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-30 13:12:37', '2020-03-30 13:12:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049009008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016111199', 'Michael Procaccini', NULL, 'called with many questions about how his plan worked- most to do with preventive care.  Also asked the best place for labwork- I told him about direct labs.  I sent all appropriate educational emails.  Michael was very happy. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-30 13:09:50', '2020-03-30 13:09:50'),
