  ('zcrm_1579374000049009003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030348722', 'Tamara Orebaugh', NULL, 'I noticed this a bit earlier in my shift and reached out to Vanessa about doing a second welcome call, now that Tamara still has another plan. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-30 12:26:51', '2020-03-30 12:26:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049005036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026202179', 'Erin Graham', NULL, 'Sent member and email informing them about April decline and giving them an option to update payment info or call us', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-03-30 11:51:16', '2020-03-30 11:51:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049007003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046972029', 'Erika Gutierrez', NULL, '3-30-20 Erika is panicking and needing to eliminate all expenses as she just lost her job with Catherine Brown''s law office. It''s a small office of 1-2 employees and Catherine just laid her off bc of coronavirus even though it doesn''t seem like law offices should be affected. Catherine is panicking on her end. I mentioned MPB Care to Erika and she can''t do it now until she figures out her finances but wants me to email her the information.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-03-30 11:48:50', '2020-03-30 11:48:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049005031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810387', 'Valerie Ross', NULL, 'Sent member an email informing them of decline and giving them options to update payment info or call us', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-03-30 11:47:35', '2020-03-30 11:47:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048973018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034059109', 'Hanan Al Hajry', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I will cancel with all vendors and have Sunny Refund', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-30 11:39:50', '2020-03-30 11:39:50'),
