  ('zcrm_1579374000049005018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939004', 'Mary J Lineback', NULL, 'April declined.... Sent member a notice of decline and gave them an option to update payment info or call us back to discuss', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-03-30 11:36:34', '2020-03-30 11:36:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049005013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012024161', 'Timothy Kratz Jr', NULL, 'Sent member a notice of April decline and gave them an option to update payment info or contact us', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-03-30 11:33:56', '2020-03-30 11:33:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049005008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012429064', 'Christina Bell', NULL, 'Sent an email informing member of the April decline and giving them an option to update payment info or call back', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-03-30 11:30:48', '2020-03-30 11:30:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000049005003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011019014', 'Caroline Kava', NULL, 'April declined. Sent an email informing of the decline and giving option to update info or call office.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-03-30 11:15:58', '2020-03-30 11:15:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048973013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028322485', 'Bodie Kulijian', NULL, 'Was notified by Sedera that member reached out to them and wanted to cancel.  I will send out Cancellation link to his email', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-30 11:12:59', '2020-03-30 11:12:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048973008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048586020', 'David Kanning', NULL, 'Hi Patti,

Thank you very much for all your attention and input.

I would like to switch the plan I originally elected from Direct Primary Care to the Self-Directed Plan with a $1500 IUA.  I''m 61 years of age, so fall into the 60-64 bucket.  As a result of this switch, I authorize you to bill the additional $57 difference in plan cost to the Discover Card used to open the account.

Feel free to contact me for any information you may need to complete this request,

Thanks again,
David', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-30 07:29:34', '2020-03-30 07:29:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048973003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048586020', 'David Kanning', NULL, 'After thinking about this David has decieded to go with the Self Directed option.  I made sure that he was aware that he had no preventative benefits.  He was ok with this.  He authorized the additional $57 to be drafted for the Self directed.  I have copied his email to me above.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-30 07:29:29', '2020-03-30 07:29:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048969003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045585130', 'Angela MacDonald', NULL, 'Emailed to cancel, sent cancellation email with link to the cancellation form. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-03-30 07:22:32', '2020-03-30 07:22:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048923128', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030348722', 'Tamara Orebaugh', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 659 
Question : I don''t understand my coverage', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2020-03-28 09:38:05', '2020-03-28 09:38:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048945018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031218132', 'Sandra Blanchard', NULL, '3-27-20 Choosing Cigna Connect Flex Silver $3500 for Madeleine. Likely to choose Bright Health for Shawn or staying put bc so expensive! Paying $486 now for Shawn and Sondra. Bright Health is around $400+ for Bronze and would want the HSA plan. She thinks he may balk when he realizes the price increase he will incur if he cancels Sedera and choose trad in. They will double their cost plus add $200+ for Madeleine. Instructed her to call C4 tomorrow to change password, change address and any other contact information that''s relevant to account.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-03-27 16:28:38', '2020-03-27 16:30:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048939013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048401026', 'Angel Ayala Jimenez', NULL, 'Welcome call complete with Aubrey and Angel. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-27 15:32:59', '2020-03-27 15:32:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048945013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050504066', 'Deborah Madsen', NULL, '3-27-20 Deborah and family are super healthy, skiing family from Aspen. I recognize Bill''s name as the head of NASTAR. He was just let go after 30 years bc of the coronavirus! He''s looking to get funding to buy out NASTAR. USSA owns it now and it will die otherwise, likely. Her cousin or niece is Beth Madsen. Shelley probably knows her. They think they need coverage May 1st. Were quoted $3600 for Anthem plan! Cobra will probably be expensive as well. Splitting up family with Bill and kids 21 and 17 both still dependents on taxes, 50-59 PDHC and Deborah is 61. Likes $500 IUA level. $691+$578= $1269.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-03-27 15:25:47', '2020-03-27 15:25:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048945008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031218132', 'Sandra Blanchard', NULL, '3-27-20 Just changed status from EF to ES. It was never changed when eliminated daughter.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-03-27 14:58:15', '2020-03-27 14:58:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048945003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034059109', 'Hanan Al Hajry', NULL, 'I received an email from Taylor/RCI letting me know that they had heard from Steve Cox that this member wanted to cancel.  I left a vm for Steve and I will go over the Cancellation process with him.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-27 14:30:10', '2020-03-27 14:30:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048939008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020482017', 'Steven Thomas', NULL, 'called to update address- I led him to the form online.   He then wanted me to remind him of his IUA. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-27 13:46:07', '2020-03-27 13:46:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048939003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037141488', 'Evian Hanshaw', NULL, 'Evian called with a hamstring issue that was causing her a great deal of pain and wanted to know the steps in how she should address this.  So I went over all of the steps and she asked if having her chiropractor script out an MRI so she could get it done faster than waiting for an ortho apt would be ok.  I told her that she needed to have an actual ortho doctor script out what they need specifically for a test- otherwise if she wants to try the natural route she should have her chiropractor write a letter to Sedera stating the treatment plan and show how it is curative.  She said that she didn''t want to go through Sedera''s process of finding the best cost and place for an MRI because it would take too long.  I told her that we do that for her and the rest of the members who are sharing the out of pocket cost.  She didn''t like the 2nd MD program all that much either. That''s when she said that this was too much for her to handle or do- I told her that there was more leg work with this rather than a traditional health insurance but that in the end....for the ENTIRE need....she would only be paying for her IUA.  She said she understood- but really disliked the process.  I asked if she would like to speak to someone else to help explain, she told me that she understood what I had to say to her, but didn''t think that her plan would involve this much work. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-27 12:36:02', '2020-03-27 12:36:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048913013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881005', 'Maxwell Brandel', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat with Kelly Cheever', 'Visit ID : 658 
Question : hello,', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2020-03-27 11:57:36', '2020-03-27 11:57:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048927013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005116389', 'Katherin Khidirian', NULL, 'Member submitted change of payment form. Zoho Subscription updated with the new bank acct info', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-03-27 11:21:41', '2020-03-27 11:21:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048927008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044061030', 'Denny Lewenkamp', NULL, 'Member submitted change of payment form. FTNI updated to a bank account of Pueblo West Transmissions.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-03-27 11:17:54', '2020-03-27 11:17:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048927003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010282165', 'Alicia Turbidy', NULL, 'Member replied to my email stating that she would like a full refund to her card and then a recharge for the correct amount. Done and moving forward amount is correct on FTNI', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-03-27 10:23:22', '2020-03-27 10:23:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048899013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034859046', 'Bryan Potter', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request.  I have cancelled RCI &amp; FTNI.  Will notify Sedera', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-27 08:33:08', '2020-03-27 08:33:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048899008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030630064', 'Katherine Carroll', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will inform Sedera and have Sunny refund April pmt', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-27 08:25:11', '2020-03-27 08:25:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048899003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048514189', 'Elisa Peavey', NULL, 'Proof of DPC received &amp; submitted to Sedera', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-27 07:38:55', '2020-03-27 07:38:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048878013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014508197', 'Jose Ernesto Rodriguez aleman', NULL, 'So JoAnna called in very upset because she is getting so many bills, Priscilla and Maddy weren''t getting back to her in time, the hospital wants to take out a lien on her home, AND Jose wound up in an ambulance on Tuesday with a major stroke- he was completely paralyzed except for one finger, and he was mistakenly put into Corona virus quarantine.  She called after 5 and that is why under the circumstances I called Dania.  She understood why I called and told me to tell Joanna that so far- all bills that have been submitted have been paid, she isn''t sure whether or not Maddy or Priscilla have more bills that haven''t been submitted yet, but she will find out tonight, she is also going to run this by Bridgette to figure out a game plan on what needs to be done.  I told Dania, that Joanna is just extra fragile right now Dania sympathized and assured me that they will handle her as such. I am letting John know so that he can hookup with Dania tomorrow if needed. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-26 16:00:01', '2020-03-26 16:00:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048878008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919395', 'Michael (Mikhail) Kaspin', NULL, 'Michael called upset because he is being hit with a $1000 bill from Labcorp- he wants to know why ASI is denying the claim.  He also states that he will not pay for it.  I told him to take a picture of the bill and send it to my email address so that I can send it over to ASI. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-26 15:53:26', '2020-03-26 15:53:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048880008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048586020', 'David Kanning', NULL, 'I sent out the 2nd request to this member for the DPC.  Member emailed me back and I then spoke to him on the phone. As I thought his Doc was not a DPC. He was unsure as to what a DPC was. He told me that Sally just gave him a bunch of prices.  He bought based on price.  When I told him how much it would be he told me that it was too much money and that he would go with a short term option.I sent him out a cqncellation request. I then spoke to Sally and she told me that she had explained what a DPC was and he was in a hurry to get coverage.  I advised her to follow up with him and let me know what the outcome is.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-26 14:44:29', '2020-03-26 14:44:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048880003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030630064', 'Katherine Carroll', NULL, 'I spoke to the member and she said that she was not aware of our cancellation deadline of the 20th.  She said that she had obtained new coverage w/a lower "deductable" .  I noted that she had a IUA of $5000.  I asked was her new coverage Trad Ins she replied no we went w/ Liberty HealthShare. ????', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-26 13:27:44', '2020-03-26 13:27:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048878003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030630064', 'Katherine Carroll', NULL, 'Katherine called to cancel and make sure that she didn''t have to pay for April- I explained that she already had and she had missed the deadline by 6 days.  She wanted to know who she needed to talk to to get this cancelled and get a refund because she didn''t have time to "chat" with me.  I told her Patti Baron would be the person but that her hours are shorter due to the pandemic and that she was on the way home.  Katherine asked then how to resolve this.  I told her that I would reach out to Patti and she would get back to her as soon as she could.  I sent a cancellation form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-26 12:18:38', '2020-03-26 12:18:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048855028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004833209', 'KayLynn Hanson', NULL, 'Husband Carl will be going on Medicare I will remove him from membership effective 4/1', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-26 11:37:32', '2020-03-26 11:37:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048858013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034859046', 'Bryan Potter', NULL, 'Called in to cancel, he has new coverage through a new employer and I sent him the cancellation form via email. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-03-26 11:06:12', '2020-03-26 11:06:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048858008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899452', 'Kristopher Hall', NULL, 'Kris called in and stated that his wife is in the hospital right now, he unfortunately is not allowed inside with her. She texted him saying she does not think that they are going to accept their "Insurance". I first corrected him saying what they have is NOT insurance, it is medical cost sharing, he knew that just didn''t know what to say exactly(as almost every member). I also let him know for her situation which is injury/illness they are responsible for the first $1000 out of pocket. She is to present herself as a cash pay. As soon as I said that it clicked in his mind and he said oh yeah. I let him know that whenever you present yourself like that you generally will get a cash discount. I made it clear that he needs to make sure to NOT pay more than $1000 and to keep all the receipts. He will then need to contact Sedera and open up a "Need" with them if this is going to be more than their IUA of the $1000. I provided him with Sedera''s phone number to give them a call if he already knows or has a good feeling this is going to be more than their IUA. He took their number and is giving them a call now. I let him know lastly if he has any other questions that there will be someone working and be taking phone calls until around 9pm EST. He was very very happy for the help and thanked me very much. I have a feeling he might be calling in again because when I told him there will be another Kelly working until 9pm he asked what time zone that is, so that kinda entails he might be calling again for more questions. Again he was very happy for the help and that is all he needed to know for now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-03-26 11:03:59', '2020-03-26 11:03:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048855023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000167678', 'Kokila Siva', NULL, '3-26-20 Spoke to me over an hour regarding her recent lay off, severance, Medicaid, APTC, etc. She asks 100 questions and wants me to repeat the answers many times. She''s 58 and was making $100,000. Got severance pay check on March 18th as last payment which is 8 weeks of pay. Lost ins. on Feb. 29th through work with Kaiser. Wants Kaiser even though it costs $50 more bc already a patient there. Will try to get unemployment which we think will be around $573 a week giving her around $700 APTC (I think per memory). Premiums are then around $250. So, she''s going to start her C4 app and her unemployment app next. Will contact me when knows how much unemployment will be for 6 months. Then loses that and will qualify for Medicaid. She suspects it will take her a year to get a new job.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-03-26 11:02:41', '2020-03-26 11:02:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048859081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038087012', 'Jonathan McCallister', NULL, 'April refunded 3/26', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-03-26 10:32:03', '2020-03-26 10:32:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048859076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010282165', 'Alicia Turbidy', NULL, 'Member''s card is not set up to receive partial refunds, I can only reverse full transaction. Sent member an email to let them know I can either reverse the full transaction and then charge only the amount owed ($244 less) or they can provide a bank account info where they would like to receive the $244 difference at.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-03-26 10:21:09', '2020-03-26 10:21:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048859071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021695527', 'Gabriel Weaver', NULL, 'Refunded $315 on 3/26', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-03-26 10:09:15', '2020-03-26 10:09:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048859066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048462055', 'Jillie Diane', NULL, 'Member was charged twice by mistake. Refunded second transaction of $486 back to her bank account. Moving forward the bank account has to be charged, not CC. Admin 123 updated and payments are NOT set up on FTNI to avoid double charge from both FTNI and 123. Will monitor in April', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-03-26 09:58:43', '2020-03-26 09:58:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048855018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005116389', 'Katherin Khidirian', NULL, 'Sent member link to update CC', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-26 08:29:50', '2020-03-26 08:29:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048855013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048514189', 'Elisa Peavey', NULL, 'DPC 2nd request sent', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-26 08:10:55', '2020-03-26 08:10:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048855008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048586020', 'David Kanning', NULL, 'DPC 2nd request sent', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-26 08:08:37', '2020-03-26 08:08:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048860003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041152084', 'David Butler', NULL, 'Put in request to Kelly F to send replacement QR Life code card with Redirect as per member request. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-03-26 07:37:41', '2020-03-26 07:37:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048858003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041152084', 'David Butler', NULL, 'New QR Life Code: H0UGW. Called and needs a replacement Redirect QR Life Code. Moved old code to the QR Life Code spot and put new one in the MPower Life Code. Also will send out mail merge letter with the new card via mail.  -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-03-26 07:37:10', '2020-03-26 07:37:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048855003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038087012', 'Jonathan McCallister', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel Sedera &amp; RCI and cancel &amp; refund April pmt', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-26 07:35:19', '2020-03-26 07:35:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048824023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044061129', 'Emily Kloser', NULL, 'Emily called to ask where to start with submitting her mammogram bill to Redirect.  I gave her Redirect''s phone number. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-25 17:24:41', '2020-03-25 17:24:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048824018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038087012', 'Jonathan McCallister', NULL, 'called to cancel- sent form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-25 15:43:23', '2020-03-25 15:43:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048824008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043013016', 'Tranquilino Padilla', NULL, 'Member contacted main number to ask about giving member a "break" during shutdown.  I have a question into Dania via Slack re: Suspending Accounts.  I left him a voicemail and let him know if he cancels his Pre-Ex time starts over.  I left him  a voice mail and let him know that I would get back with him tomorrow.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-25 14:41:01', '2020-03-25 14:41:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048824003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043013016', 'Tranquilino Padilla', NULL, '"Leo" called to ask if we were giving a members a "break" regarding their monthly payments.  Patti is giving him a call back. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-25 14:37:39', '2020-03-25 14:37:39');
