  ('zcrm_1579374000048806003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048514334', 'Jordan Lubin', NULL, 'called to make sure that he was in the system and had a few questions for me.  I offered to do a welcome call on the spot but he wanted to a scheduler so that he can schedule with his wife. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-25 13:09:09', '2020-03-25 13:09:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048791003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044061030', 'Denny Lewenkamp', NULL, 'Sent out link to payment update form', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-25 10:40:35', '2020-03-25 10:40:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048746003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021695527', 'Gabriel Weaver', NULL, 'i finally got a signed cancellation form in so I will cancel all services and ask Sunny to refund', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-25 08:00:39', '2020-03-25 08:00:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048729003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041152084', 'David Butler', NULL, '2nd Welcome call complete for new product.  weird call due to the fact that his girlfriend was on the line asking me sales questions.  I emailed Wendy about this as well as reached out to home base to reissue David another ER contact card, also I am reaching out to Redirect about two doctors that Amanda (the girlfriend) mentioned wanting to go to. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-24 17:37:43', '2020-03-24 17:37:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048720003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049054126', 'Santiago Mussi Tiscornia', NULL, '3-24-20 Santiago now has his Green Card and is revisiting this bc of coronavirus. He''s covered until April 5th and ok with a May 1st start date. He likes the SDHC option since he''s already done all of his wellness stuff while going through the Green Card process.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-03-24 16:12:27', '2020-03-24 16:12:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048709008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021695527', 'Gabriel Weaver', NULL, 'I spoke to Sally and she advised that she was in contact with Rachel about 2 mos ago and she submitted the form back to her however it was not signed by the member.  I just received the form back unsigned.  I emailed advising that the form must be signed by the member and to resubmit then.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-24 14:12:06', '2020-03-24 14:12:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048709003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021695527', 'Gabriel Weaver', NULL, 'Rachel called in and let me know that they have been in contact with Sally Thomsen in order to cancel this plan.  I was never informed and member now has been paying for plan for 2 months that we now will not be able to refund.  I sent cancellation link email and when I receive will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-24 13:53:00', '2020-03-24 13:53:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048662003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048661001', 'Todd Rader', NULL, 'Completed Presentation with Client PSD Member only, $1500 IUA.  Will sign up around April 15, 2020', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2020-03-24 09:11:39', '2020-03-24 09:11:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048648013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010282165', 'Alicia Turbidy', NULL, 'New plan eff 4/1/2020: Member &amp; Spouse $500 50+', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-24 08:42:09', '2020-03-24 08:42:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048648008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010282165', 'Alicia Turbidy', NULL, 'Member change for to remove dependent I will notify Sedera &amp; change billing.  I will also let Sunny know to refund $244 for the April pmt.when we receive', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-24 08:36:46', '2020-03-24 08:36:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048648003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819433', 'Kaimey Ela', NULL, 'Kelly C sent me a slack msg about a chat that she had with this member saying that he had tax questions.  I called and left him a VM with ways to reach me', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-24 08:25:59', '2020-03-24 08:25:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048623008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031391042', 'Jonathan VanNoy', NULL, 'Jonathan called in about his son Benjamin and how are they to present their card over the phone- I told him that I had already sent the Wellness Visit Instructions months ago but would send them again.  Then he said he didn''t have his RCI card, so I told him that I would reach out to get those ordered.  He called back stating that he found it. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-23 14:59:09', '2020-03-23 14:59:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048616024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043491714', 'Douglas Bush', NULL, 'Sent him an email with the requested receipt attached.


