</mlbadger@gmail.com>', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-03-23 14:33:02', '2020-03-23 14:33:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048616014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165388', 'Kimberly Baldwin', NULL, 'Sent her a long email in regards to Friday''s questions. CCed Wendy too.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-03-23 14:30:10', '2020-03-23 14:30:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048623003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031391042', 'Jonathan VanNoy', NULL, 'One of the sons attached to this account called to ask about seeing a doctor in network for a checkup- I told him that I would be happy to help him out with this.  I heard Nicole in the background directing him on what he needed to ask- she was getting pretty upset as usual.  She wanted me to check into a hospital group- I told the son that unfortunately with hospital affiliations there is no blanket when it comes to network.   I then asked why he felt it necessary to look into going to a hospital for an annual checkup- Nicole didn''t like that question very much, so I asked specifically for the name of the doctor.  I was given the name- Margarita Sevilla and found her in network.  The son thanked me and said that was all he needed for now.  If I had to make a wild guess- Nicole is trying to fly under the radar for covid testing and or meds. I am going to let GUY know just so he can get a heads up, because the family is pretty darn big. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-23 14:24:59', '2020-03-23 14:24:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048587033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000049780068', 'Sofia Gomez Villafane', NULL, '3-23-20 Sofia is turning 26 on April 15th, 2020 and her ins ends at end of April. Wants May 1st start date. Interested in PSDHC bc has IUD she needs removed within the year and possibly replaced. She''s going to inquire about the cost as self-pay patient as well. Found 2 Drs. in Park City she can use. She doesn''t have a Dr. in UT bc she''s just been going to Dr. in CA when home with parents plan. Healthy, no tobacco. Looked at marketplace and prices ranged from $170''s - $500''s. MPB''s are better for sure.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-03-23 13:59:41', '2020-03-23 13:59:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048587028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048514446', 'Alicia Zyburt', NULL, 'Member is from IL not a state that allows MCS.  Jane sold in error', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-23 13:34:09', '2020-03-23 13:34:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048587023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028522001', 'Michael Higgins', NULL, '3-23-20 Had a nice call with Lisa just now and she''s gotten her bill squared away. Here''s what she wrote as well, ello Wendy and John,

Thanks for your quick reply. I have spoken to the both RCI and the service provider (Pacific Coast Imaging) this morning and I think I found the problem. It seems Pacific Coast Imaging has repeatedly sent the claim to an incorrect PO box for some reason, and never notified me of that. Not sure why RCI told me the claim had been processed when I spoke to them last. It seems like a lot of miscommunication all around. Pacific Coast is re-submitting, hopefully to the correct address, and has assured me they aren’t going to send the bill to collections.

I’m glad to hear you are changing the model because it’s very confusing, for the health care providers too I think. They had a hard time figuring out when to bill insurance and when to bill me, especially because my “file” only has one code in it. They had to remove the code indicating that I was insured when setting up the bill for a diagnostic issue, then change it back for preventative. I did not realize that the concierge could assist in this kind of situation, either; I thought they just helped find health care providers and that sort of thing. Nice to know.

Again, thanks for your help."

She was appreciative and feels better that it will be taken care of. Also happy to know she can call Concierge in future.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-03-23 13:11:48', '2020-03-23 13:11:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048587018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033185042', 'Lynn Quire', NULL, 'Member called in and requested an additional RCI card for her 19 yr old daughter also needed MPB card.  I ordered RCI card for her and Kelly F sent out MPB card.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-23 12:33:22', '2020-03-23 12:33:22'),
