  ('zcrm_1579374000048533033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165388', 'Kimberly Baldwin', NULL, 'I gave Kimberly her answer via Sunny-  The reason is that if the 22nd falls on a weekend or a holiday, the payment will got through on the last business day prior to that. The 22nd falls on Sunday this month, that is why all payments hit today.', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-20 17:36:50', '2020-03-20 17:36:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048533028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165388', 'Kimberly Baldwin', NULL, 'Kimberly called inquiring as to why she was charged for her monthly payment earlier than usual.  I told her I didn''t know why but that I would reach out to someone in finance and either they or myself would get back to her on that. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-20 17:28:26', '2020-03-20 17:28:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048533023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048401026', 'Angel Ayala Jimenez', NULL, 'Aubrey had forgotten about her welcome call (understandably).  She called me back 15 min later after my voicemail.  I told her that I would be happy to do the welcome call with HER now, but that Angel would have to schedule another one because he is the primary on the account- she asked to reschedule and I booked her for 2:15 mountain time. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-20 14:38:40', '2020-03-20 14:38:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048533018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001207493', 'Eben Grace', NULL, 'called in to speak with Reid- tried to transfer but it went to voicemail- left message on Eben''s behalf and gave Eben Reid''s phone number. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-20 14:30:16', '2020-03-20 14:30:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048532108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042309116', 'James Maynard', NULL, 'I had to change pmt for this member since the could not submit proof of DPC.  The children are not covered on DPC plan.  Member to add them around June time frame I told her in the .month before to submit invoice to me with Husband &amp; children and we can submit to Sedera.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-20 13:40:42', '2020-03-20 13:40:42'),
