  ('zcrm_1579374000048532008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032679073', 'Tory Reed', NULL, 'Received email from Appleton Clinic saying that these members we signed up with their clinic.  Will send that on to Sedera.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-20 07:10:56', '2020-03-20 07:10:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048542023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047084073', 'Nicole Garth', NULL, 'aborted welcome call,  member was under the impression that her plan had a MEC and was compatible to her pre x weak heart muscle condition. member was unaware of pre x clause.  Spoke to Guy about the situation and sent him a more detailed rundown.  Member was upset but a good sport about the situation but we ended call with member not knowing if she will be able to continue on with us. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-19 18:32:22', '2020-03-19 18:32:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048542018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032679315', 'Robert Neufeld', NULL, 'called to cancel/possibly remove but leave some family members.  requested both forms.  member sounded a bit stressed. sent forms. and let Patti know. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-19 16:11:26', '2020-03-19 16:11:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048542013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919419', 'Leo Goodman', NULL, 'Leo called in to ask us what we were planning on doing as far as helping our members out during this health crisis because his bank account had "spiraled down to zero".  I told him that either myself or someone else would give him a call- Guy called him back and went over the definition of medical cost sharing as a community of people that need to band together during times like this.  Leo tried to argue about what the credit card companies were doing- and again- Guy went over why his membership with us/Sedera/ASI are not the same as a credit card company. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-19 15:53:17', '2020-03-19 15:53:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048542008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048544005', 'Daniel Soleja', NULL, 'Spoke to client...will be enrolling 3/19/2020 with 5000 IUA...Member + Family', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2020-03-19 15:47:57', '2020-03-19 15:47:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048540074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047084237', 'Mark DeRespinis', NULL, '3-19-20 Mark called in bc concerned since biz will no longer be earning $ bc of corona virus bc his clients are restaurants who are all forced closed right now. I suggested to downgrade to SDHC to at least maintain membership while no income coming in. He asked about Medicaid and has chosen to keep membership at the SDHC level and hopes income will return soon.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-03-19 15:25:47', '2020-03-19 15:25:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048542003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044725056', 'Payton Hoops', NULL, 'member called because she said she lost her emergency contact card and she needed it for her doctor to submit Covid testing too.  I told her that she didn''t have a MEC card- and even if she did all expenses would be out of pocket up until her $500 IUA that she chose with Sedera.  I told member that I would send her a link with instructions as well as another Welcome call scheduler because she hasn''t done that yet!!!! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-19 14:38:18', '2020-03-19 14:38:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048540069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028584155', 'Hali Nurnberg', NULL, '3-19-20 Left message with front desk person yesterday and today, two different people. I told them to have her check her email as well with instructions to complete task. I think it was Becky I spoke with today and maybe Christine or Colleen yesterday? Both were super nice and will pass along info. They know of deadline of tomorrow.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-03-19 14:06:07', '2020-03-19 14:06:07'),
