  ('zcrm_1579374000048495003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000160613002', 'Emily Thomas', NULL, '3-18-20 Emily is 30, fraternal twin, mostly healthy. Just had a lump in rt breast that got checked out and dr. was not concerned about it at all. He''s having her check it again in 6 months to make sure nothing has changed. Sent records back to Planned Parenthood rated at a 3. Planned Parenthood needs rating to be 2 or lower to prescribe birth control. So, she''ll ask doctor to change rating when she goes back in 5 months from now. She''s not concerned at all about it either. It''s been there a long time and just has dense tissue. Had infuriating experience with Cigna and the Connect Flex limited network. Wasted 3 hours to find someone to see and even got transferred to Home Depot in process! Paying $286.34 now with $26.12 APTC. Might be that lowered a bit bc income less than expected but not by much. Looking at the PDHC at $311/$500. Interested in HMA as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-03-18 14:01:28', '2020-03-18 14:01:28'),
