  ('zcrm_1579374000048447026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009926276', 'Jaime Raaj', NULL, 'Jaime called to find a doctor in network for some chronic headaches she''s suffering from.  I explained that there is no network for visits related to an injury or illness.  I told her to just keep Sedera informed if the doctor makes the recommendation for any type of scan- so that they can tell her the best price and place she can go as well as open that line of communication.  I told her to be mindful about going over her IUA limit- and to give Sedera the heads up asap. I also sent a script request quote form in the event she is put on any sort of medication.- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-17 16:04:44', '2020-03-17 16:05:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048447018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048462092', 'Delia Villarreal-Webb', NULL, '3-17-20 Delia is enrolling now in PDHC and is 51 with same DOB as mine but different year. She''s healthy, no tobacco. Super nice! $500/$378. Excited to get same positive treatment that Daniel''s getting. It''s been really easy she said!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-03-17 15:02:16', '2020-03-17 15:08:29'),
