  ('zcrm_1579374000048435003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046217204', 'Selina Schuh', NULL, 'Selina called in and said that her husband has a possible torn meniscus, an issue with his knee and is most likely going to need surgery. She asked what the whole process is if surgery is needed. She asked if that meant she needs to get a second opinion and go to another doctor or if the second opinion is through us. I told her that everything regarding that is through Sedera. There is a 2ndMD program that her husband has to go through and that will make the IUA amount they pay go down by $250. If they do NOT use the program than their IUA or what is shared will go up. I told her that she needs to go through Sedera and they will help her with that process. I gave her Sedera''s phone number and she is going to call them right away. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-03-17 10:51:48', '2020-03-17 10:51:48'),
