  ('zcrm_1579374000048376074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043608754', 'Dana Schwartz Watts', NULL, '(posted in tickets as well) David called stating that he was confused as to what forms we needed him to send in.  He said that he has a few papers with what he thinks are codes on them- but isn''t sure.  He said that he doesn''t know what we want, and it''s been very hard for him to know what we need.  He wanted to send what he has my way so that I could take a look and let him know if it is correct.  I told him that would be fine, but if it isn''t obvious to me then he will need his question on this answered tomorrow. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-16 17:05:59', '2020-03-16 17:07:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048376066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048377012', 'Emily Martinek', NULL, '3-16-20 Healthy, 24 and was living in Germany and can''t get back bc of Corona virus. Stuck here for at least 6 months or more. Choosing SDHC since can get wellness done in Germany if/when she returns. She got tonsils out 1 1/2 years ago. Has cyst in breast since HS and nothing since. I used the Liberty code to waive $100 since referred by her mom and she''s an independent now. No need to collect and pay out the $100 to Suzy Martinek (mom).', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-03-16 16:02:08', '2020-03-16 16:07:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048376061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035547236', 'Kaya Sarzynska', NULL, 'Tim HIll called to say that back in OCT 19 Kaya cancelled from (his group) and said that she broke off to her own plan and they have been double paying us since.  I called Patti about this and she will speak to them tomorrow. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-16 15:55:49', '2020-03-16 15:55:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048376056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059563258', 'Brandi Stanley', NULL, '3-16-20 Brandi chose Kaiser for now while she deals with thyroid issue and estimated self employed income at $30K but only has 6 weeks of data to determine real income since starting up own business. Sent her link to C4 showing what they want as proof of income. She didn''t allow them to check her taxes but it''s not really relevant since she left that job anyhow. She will join MPB as soon as she knows what''s up with thyroid and it''s dealt with.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-03-16 15:16:08', '2020-03-16 15:16:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048376045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048401026', 'Angel Ayala Jimenez', NULL, '3-16-20 Aubrey just enrolled for DPC and with Dr. Stefano Lee with Harmony Health today. They had a medical need with son and went to him who dealt with it immediately and he didn''t charge them for their sons accident even though the kids aren''t members yet. They plan to move the kids to his practice in a month or two. Dr. Lee prorated their membership to begin immediately as well. She was super pleased with his service! I waived the $100 fee since referred by Dr. Lee and used the Liberty code to do so. Chose $500/$377 ES.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-03-16 14:21:14', '2020-03-16 14:43:39'),
