  ('zcrm_1579374000048374013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048347078', 'Marla Meridith', NULL, 'Member Only $500 IUA 40-49 SD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-16 13:24:31', '2020-03-16 13:24:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048362013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008282039', 'Melissa Harper', NULL, 'David called in and initially asked for John and John was busy at the moment. When David started telling me what it was in regards to I was able to help him with everything that he needed. His wife has an injury occur while "Up in the mountains" and wanted to know what he needs to do with the bills that will be coming in. He said he presented himself as self pay but the hospital wouldn''t take his credit card, they wouldn''t take any money which is odd. I told him he did the correct thing with how he presented himself and let him know he is only responsible for the first $1000 of his IUA. Anything after that he is to ask to be billed and he will submit everything into Sedera and start a "Need". I gave him Sedera''s phone number and told him to call them asap and let them know what is going on and they can walk him through the process. I gave him the brief rundown of what Sedera will do, he was very happy with the help and understands what to do now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-03-16 13:00:39', '2020-03-16 13:00:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048376029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002232057', 'Larry Barnard Jr', NULL, 'March went through. Still due for February', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-03-16 12:30:30', '2020-03-16 12:30:30'),
