  ('zcrm_1579374000048376024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000191450', 'Terese McGroarty', NULL, '3 months overdue- cancelled.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-03-16 12:28:07', '2020-03-16 12:28:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048376019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059563258', 'Brandi Stanley', NULL, '3-16-20 Hey, Wendy!

Thanks so much for sending all of this info and for hopping on a call last week. I''ve decided to go ahead and opt into marketplace coverage for now, as I need more time (and actual coverage) to gather more information on my thyroid and, hopefully, get it treated (once it''s safe to go in for medical care again). After I have more info and feel like I have my needs largely taken care of around it, I''d love to consider getting into the health share instead, at that future time...', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-03-16 12:21:10', '2020-03-16 12:21:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048362008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016038161', 'Karee Watson', NULL, 'Karee called in and said she has gotten a bill from Quest for her lab work she had done in regards to her annual OBGYN appointment. It says that some or all of the test were denied for coverage. I asked her if the bill has the CPT codes on it and she she said yes. I asked her to take a picture of the bill and email it over to me and I will send it over to Monica Lugo at ASi and she will figure out what is going on. I will tag Karee in the thread so she will get the updates and answers directly. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-03-16 12:17:43', '2020-03-16 12:17:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048376014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038445150', 'Kenneth Van Horn', NULL, '3-16-20 Called into main MPB office to ask about 1095 form and tax deductions. Patti told him he was on co-pay plan for 1 month and requested to be cancelled off bc co-pay plan was ending. He remembered that after she refreshed his memory. He then wanted to know if his membership was tax ded and she told him no. He was upset and she told him to speak with his Advisor Ryan Hoff. He called Ryan and Ryan also refreshed his memory and focused on his monthly savings outweighs his tax deductions. He''s settled down and understands now. All is well according to Ryan.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-03-16 12:09:14', '2020-03-16 12:09:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048376003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004833209', 'KayLynn Hanson', NULL, '3-16-20 Dr. Carl Hanson called in to cancel membership for just him, not his wife. He''s aging into Medicare and needs April 1st end date. I gave him info@LibertyHealthShare.org to complete cancellation and request email confirmation. Again, wife will remain member. Leaving HES alone. I changed DOB to reflect 1955 not 2019. UPDATE, Patti will cancel Carl from his telemedicine, etc. and leave wife on.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-03-16 11:54:18', '2020-03-16 12:03:38'),
