  ('zcrm_1579374000048362003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529184', 'Shan Shan Chu', NULL, 'Shan Shan called in and said she never got her RCI card and needed replacements. I put her back to Patti because she is the one that handles the RCI card''s. Patti confirmed her mailing address and email and will get a temp card send to the email and a hard copy send to her mailing address. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-03-16 11:04:38', '2020-03-16 11:04:38'),
