  ('zcrm_1579374000048298024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023592136', 'Raymond Ellason', NULL, 'called because wife''s name was misspelled on his 1095- so he wanted to know how it was spelled in our system.  It was spelled correctly- Raymond declined me offering to send a corrected form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-13 14:18:33', '2020-03-13 14:18:33'),
