  ('zcrm_1579374000048298011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047238350', 'Amy Wentworth', NULL, 'Amy called back- welcome call complete!  a tad bit overwhelmed because it''s new, but I reassured her that once she gets her feet wet with the program it will be a breeze!  Her US Corporate login wouldn''t take- I told her to try next week.  Her phone number when entered into the Sedera Portal gave her an error message- I have reached out to the Slack team about this. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-13 12:46:28', '2020-03-13 12:53:39'),
