Sent by Patti Baron on 3/13/2020', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-13 09:45:52', '2020-03-13 09:45:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048290003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039567010', 'Adam Pollock', NULL, 'Adam called in and he was starting to ask about drugs/medications that he is being prescribed for his "Need" that he has going on and I stopped him and asked if he has started a need with Sedera and if he has a needs coordinator. He said yes, so I let him know since he has done all that then anything that pertains  to this need is going to be through whomever his coordinator is. His question was if the medication and prescriptions are included in what is shared, I said yes as long as it specifically has to do with that specific need, he said yes, so I told him yes but to still contact Sedera to make sure first before he pays for anything. Gave him Sedera''s phone number because he did not know specifically who was working on his need. Thanked me and is calling to find out. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-03-13 09:42:41', '2020-03-13 09:42:41'),
