  ('zcrm_1579374000048252008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030348722', 'Tamara Orebaugh', NULL, 'Tammy called to state that her SS# was incorrect on the form that was sent out to her- I emailed Tricia to follow up in the morning. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-12 15:08:49', '2020-03-12 15:08:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048247016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048462092', 'Delia Villarreal-Webb', NULL, '3-12-20 Delia is Daniel Webb''s wife. She''s 51 and he''s 63, so best to put her on her own membership. They want $500/$378 PDHC. She''s healthy, no pre-x and wants April 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-03-12 14:51:38', '2020-03-12 14:51:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048247008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037788094', 'Daniel Webb', NULL, '3-12-20 Dan is looking to add his wife Delia Webb to his membership. He''s 63 and she''s 51 so I told him to have her enroll on her own for much better price. They want the $500/$378 IUA. She''s healthy, no pre-x. Dan also used Redirect the other day and they sent him to Urgent Care and they paid for it. Urgent Care sent him to the ER and he doesn''t have that bill yet. ER told him nothing is wrong/couldn''t find a problem. He called Sedera to learn how to set up a Need when he gets the bill. He''s happy so far!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-03-12 14:48:05', '2020-03-12 14:48:37'),
