  ('zcrm_1579374000048247003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006644205', 'Martha Rybak', NULL, '3-12-20 Martha is super nervous about LHS bc of their delay in paying. Has an outstanding bill from March 4th 2019 and now a mammogram for about $1200 from Nov. Told her to ask hospital for cash price to settle bill since should only cost few $100''s not thousands. She will do that. She will share this with her husband and get back to me before the 20th.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-03-12 13:02:18', '2020-03-12 13:02:18'),
