  ('zcrm_1579374000048194038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904253', 'Marcella Friel', NULL, 'Marcella called to inquire about her Taxes- I told her that I believed the forms that are going out to be just as of today finalized and that there was a deadline for mid month.  I told her that I could reach out to someone in the office and have them give her a call back tomorrow, but she wanted to know when she could call herself and be able to speak with someone that could help.  I gave her our hours and told her that Kelly F would direct her call. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-11 17:18:59', '2020-03-11 17:18:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048194033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043128097', 'Richard Whitcomb', NULL, 'Richard had remembered that I spoke to him regarding directlabs.com and called for a refresher.  I walked him through everything, very happy with how easy it is to use. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-11 15:09:03', '2020-03-11 15:09:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048203003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059563258', 'Brandi Stanley', NULL, '3-11-20 Brandi just left FT employer and is self employed now. She was proactive and got thyroid checked bc she had benign growth years ago. They found 7 nodules on thyroid now. She''s aware that will be considered pre-x. She''s supposed to see endocrinologist to double check them. I advised she call to see what cost of visit and possible removal or test will be as self pay. She knows it''s her responsibility to pay for bc of pre-x clause. Healthy otherwise. She''s 38 and likes the PDHC better than SDHC. PDHC for $311/$500 looks best in her age category.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-03-11 14:20:47', '2020-03-11 14:20:47'),
