  ('zcrm_1579374000048199013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041152084', 'David Butler', NULL, 'Hey Wendy--

Yes, please go ahead and upgrade me to the Provider Directer starting April 1. I''ll expect a monthly premium change begining around March 22st then?

I need to schedule my annual physical with my PCP as well. Please remind me - I should call the insurance phone# first before making my actual appointment?', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-11 14:00:10', '2020-03-11 14:00:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048194013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045539338', 'Pamela Omilian', NULL, 'welcome call complete-she had no idea how anything about her plan worked, admittedly. She was pretty cross because she broke her wrist and then had surgery 3 weeks ago and she is not getting the clear and constant communication that she expects one should get as a member. She said that she left 3 messages with an Erin Starkey at a 512 area code.  I told her that I would let someone in management know about this, and urged her to call the main line next time she hits a brick was with her needs coordinator.  I told her to give me a call tomorrow around this time if she still hadn''t heard anything from anyone there.  She then said that she had just received an email from someone there who replied to an email she sent yesterday. note- she didn''t know anything about 2nd MD.  I will share my notes with Dania. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-11 13:59:57', '2020-03-11 14:05:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048199008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042932035', 'Arthur Cline', NULL, 'Member called into change banking info.  I will send him the link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-11 13:35:23', '2020-03-11 13:35:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048195008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017307157', 'John Kniepmann', NULL, 'Member called in and let me know that there was an error on his 1095.  Name Susan Kortals was on his form in error.  I will let Tricia know to inform ASi. - PB', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-03-11 12:54:46', '2020-03-11 12:54:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048199003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011019034', 'Cheryl Cunningham', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I have notified ASi &amp; Sedera &amp; cancelled pmt in FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-11 12:23:17', '2020-03-11 12:23:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048188018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008282039', 'Melissa Harper', NULL, 'Member called to change payment info. FTNI updated', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-03-11 12:10:49', '2020-03-11 12:10:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048194008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650615', 'Naomi Gagnon', NULL, 'Naomi called.  Husband was diagnosed with a double hernia and needs surgery.  Walked her through the second MD process.  Asked if he had symptoms or a diagnosis prior to start date.  Explained pre-ex.  She said no.  Member to call Sedera', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2020-03-11 11:32:39', '2020-03-11 11:32:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048195003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005636283', 'Mella Webster', NULL, 'Mella called in and I think she though this was Liberty because she said she needed to speak to billing and said that WE have not been paying her hospital bills for over a year and she is VERY unhappy with our services. She is cancelled with our part by the way, and when I pulled her up I confirmed with her that she has Liberty and she said yes. I let her know that would all be on Liberty and she needs to get in contact with them. I provider her with their phone number and she was more than happy to take that number down, she thanked me at least! -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-03-11 11:15:42', '2020-03-11 11:15:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048194003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045539338', 'Pamela Omilian', NULL, 'Mem only SD $1500 IUA', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-11 11:15:04', '2020-03-11 11:15:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048188013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025283259', 'Julie Oldham', NULL, 'The 1095 form that was sent was wrong. Sent her a corrected one via email.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-03-11 10:59:48', '2020-03-11 10:59:48'),
