  ('zcrm_1579374000048178003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045539338', 'Pamela Omilian', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 30 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-03-11 08:48:59', '2020-03-11 08:48:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048136027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048143018', 'AJ Chamberlin', NULL, '3-10-20 AJ just learned she is not a member or anything now since divorced (I''m guessing). She wants to compare to LHS but I advised her against it. She knows they will no longer work with agents and wants cheapest cost. But, also I told her of their back up on reimbursements for 1+ years! She will look over information I send to her. AJ will look into this and call me next week if wants to move forward. She knows of the 20th deadline for April 1st start.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-03-10 17:36:51', '2020-03-10 17:40:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048145018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046632091', 'Ruth Valliere', NULL, 'welcome call complete.  member was not in front of her computer but wanted to do call anyway.  She knows that she can call me with any additional questions.  Member was shocked that there was a prex clause. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-10 17:02:07', '2020-03-10 17:02:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048145013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045585130', 'Angela MacDonald', NULL, 'left a detailed message.  sent scheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-10 15:48:55', '2020-03-10 15:48:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048145008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023008066', 'Nathan Wilson', NULL, 'Shantha called in to ask what services are available for her son Drew and his mental health. I went over absolutely everything with her- Head to Heart- Teladoc Behavioral Health Services.  She told me that she was frustrated that the psychiatrist she found in network will only see Drew with a referral.  I sent a few lists of GP''s close to where Drew is.  I also went over prescription med''s and sent a form.  I am going to reach out to Jennifer Chasteen to see if there are anymore options for this family.  I told Shantha that I would keep her in the loop. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-10 15:15:17', '2020-03-10 15:15:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048127023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031359127', 'John Scarrow', NULL, 'Member called and was upset with Kelly Cheever because wife''s name was still her maiden name.  Had issues with TeleDoc writing a perscription.  I advised him that this was how they enrolled.  I will send him plan change form to update.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-10 14:30:09', '2020-03-10 14:30:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048145003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031359127', 'John Scarrow', NULL, 'John called in a bit upset, wondering how Teladoc had his wife under her maiden name.  He was concerned as to what entity would know that information, and stressed that we all were wrong in having that name on file.  I told him that I would inform those who need to be so that the changes to their account can be made.  He said that he wants her last name as Scarrow across the board.  I am touching base with Patti about getting this done without a member change form, but told him that he may receive one if needed. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-10 14:18:45', '2020-03-10 14:18:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048136022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062380257', 'Rachel Brisson', NULL, '3-10-20 Rachel just left employer coverage and was paying half which was $230-$240 and employer paying other half. She''s healthy, no tobacco, has slightly elevated blood pressure from living at altitude. Takes low dose lisinopril. Wants May 1st start date and will reach out to me mid April to get going. PHDC best for her in Aspen Area.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-03-10 14:16:26', '2020-03-10 14:16:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048136011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048401026', 'Angel Ayala Jimenez', NULL, '3-10-20 Aubrey is highly interested in DPC with Dr. Stefano Lee at Harmony Health. Her husband is skeptical of leaving Kaiser for kids bc fears the unknown. Aubrey will have husband go meet with Dr. Lee to alleviate fears. If add all family members at $500 IUA/it''s $720 total which includes $180 for EF with Dr. Lee ($80+$60+$20x2). Her kids are sick all of the time with pink eye, ear infections, nasal congestion, etc. Unlimited care with Dr. Lee would be amazing and so much easier for them. She will talk it over and let me know. She knows of deadline with April 1st start. Also Aubrey sees Dr. about 4x per year and husband less. She was also looking at Sedera with Apex through DMAR and realizes DPC is so much better and price is better.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-03-10 13:53:39', '2020-03-10 13:54:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048136003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048165014', 'Cynthia Brown', NULL, '3-10-20 Cynthia is enrolled for 4/1/20 in PDHC $350/$1000. All set to go. Uses satellite for phone and often phone doesn''t ring. So, good to email when ready to talk sometimes. She''s set to sign up for welcome call as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-03-10 13:20:51', '2020-03-10 13:20:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048133008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002469017', 'Floyd Trujillo', NULL, 'Floyd called in and needed a provider list for General Practitioners for his annual wellness visit is wanting to have. Sent list via email and updated email because he said the last time he has not gotten it. Two letters were caps and need to be lower case. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-03-10 13:11:57', '2020-03-10 13:11:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048127018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048122162', 'Joseph Feran', NULL, 'Tracking #9808201
Sent by Patti Baron on 3/10/2020.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-10 13:10:12', '2020-03-10 13:10:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048127013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048122162', 'Joseph Feran', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 50-59 Redirect', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-10 13:02:59', '2020-03-10 13:02:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048133003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009471005', 'jeff kanter', NULL, 'Nancy called in and needed a prescription look up. Sent the prescription quote from via email. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-03-10 12:40:33', '2020-03-10 12:40:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048127008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048122121', 'Adam Grochowsky', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 30-39 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-10 12:25:59', '2020-03-10 12:25:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048127003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048122033', 'Alex Herron', NULL, 'Member Only $500 IUA 18-29 SD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-10 12:05:09', '2020-03-10 12:05:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048102008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034128004', 'Nancy Warburton', NULL, 'Nancy called in and said that she got a bill from her recent mammogram that she has and did not know why and wanted to know who to contact. I told her to contact RCI right away and they will be able to help her with that. I asked if she made sure that the provider was in the PHCS network and she said no and that she has no control over who her provider sends her to. I said yes you absolutely do. When that happens is you can NOT just go wherever and she needs to call into her and make sure that provider is in the network. If they are not than I will help her out by finding providers in her area with a list. I also sent her some general education emails and mainly another Welcome Call is something that I advise she do again to get a refresher on how her plan works. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-03-10 11:35:37', '2020-03-10 11:35:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048096059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045806081', 'Audra Butler', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 30 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-03-10 11:18:32', '2020-03-10 11:18:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048096054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045806150', 'Dwain Rosse', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 30 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-03-10 11:16:03', '2020-03-10 11:16:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048096049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045438095', 'Charlene Buffington', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 30 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-03-10 10:50:14', '2020-03-10 10:50:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048096044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045376098', 'Ryan Nelson', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 30 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-03-10 10:46:00', '2020-03-10 10:46:00'),
