  ('zcrm_1579374000048053008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048122162', 'Joseph Feran', NULL, '3-9-20 Joe was looking for a STM which we don''t have in CO. I told him MCS are all long term options and he said he''d just join for a year then. I then described the PDHC since he''s 55 and healthy, no pre-x, no tobacco. He could get Cobra for about $600. He''s currently paying $290 and company paying $290 for Kaiser. Lives in Golden, CO. He does his annual wellness visits every year. Needs April 1st start and will sign up at 1:00 this afternoon.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-03-09 11:46:30', '2020-03-09 11:46:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048053003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000689078', 'Kim Gangwish Zahorik', NULL, '3-9-20 She just panicked with her accountant who thought she earned too much last year and was going to have to pay back $10K. But, they finagled something so she won''t. But, looking to future options and will call me if income creeps too high for her to join MPB/MCS Provider Directed for $335/$1500. I have not explained it to her yet.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-03-09 11:43:53', '2020-03-09 11:43:53'),
