  ('zcrm_1579374000047988033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031420053', 'Patricia Purdy', NULL, 'Member called in asking why when it was her intention to cancel eff 1/1/2020 she had being billed in both January &amp; February.  I advised her that I had no cancellation for her.  She said that her agent had cancelled her. She went to Tony Maranca and came back and said that she would take 1 month refund.  Sunny will get this back fro Sedera &amp; I will ask Redirect.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-09 11:03:18', '2020-03-09 11:03:18'),
