  ('zcrm_1579374000048039008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015735109', 'Steve Moeller', NULL, 'Steve called in and said that he is getting overdue payment statements which he believes is from his colonoscopy from last year. I see that he called in back in February with Kelly C and she sent somethings over to Leena at ASi. I gave Steve ASi''s phone number and told him to ask for Leena or Monica. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-03-09 09:46:41', '2020-03-09 09:46:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000048039003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043354017', 'Buddy Johnson', NULL, 'Sara called in and said that she recently had kidney stones removed and that she needs to go back in and get a stint removed and asked if we here can call the doctors office to negotiate the price. I told her no that is not something that we can do and told her that with that she is subject to her $1000 IUA and after she has paid that then she is to submit to Sedera and Sedera is who will negotiate the price with the provider. I gave her Sedera''s phone number. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-03-09 09:28:27', '2020-03-09 09:28:27'),
