  ('zcrm_1579374000048005008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005636885', 'Richard Wennerstrand', NULL, 'cancelled member called in upset stating that the coupons given to him were rejected by CVS.  I apologized and told him I would look up the correct coupon.  I asked what the price was on his coupon and he told me it was $60- I told him that I would do some more research, but get back to him.  This is when I realized he was cancelled- I searched for a discount coupon anyway to kind of calm him down but could not find advair discus generic for $60- the cheapest I could find was for $112- So I sent him that and also gave him Reid''s info. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-06 15:37:57', '2020-03-06 15:37:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047988018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003848025', 'Jennika Wildau', NULL, 'Jannika called in and said she has yet to use the plan and needed to look up a provider to see if she was in the network to get a wellness visit done. The provider was in the network and I walked her through what she will need to do and explained the differences between ASi and Sedera. I sent her a few educational emails for her to look at. She is all set and understood everything I told her. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-03-06 13:34:58', '2020-03-06 13:34:58'),
