  ('zcrm_1579374000047988013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083170', 'AnaMaria Iglesias', NULL, 'Ray called back in and I confirmed that he and his wife got the PDF copy of their new ASi cards. Also I sent 2 list''s of approved providers for imaging facilities for a mammogram and general practitioner''s. Once they choose the 2 providers Guy asked Ray to call back with them and he will look the providers up and get some generalized pricing. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-03-06 11:52:17', '2020-03-06 11:52:17'),
