  ('zcrm_1579374000047947018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005676935', 'Lior Gabay', NULL, 'Called in to cancel because they cancelled with Liberty and saw we were still charging the $50. I let her know that Liberty is separate from us and does not let us know when members cancel. I told her I will send her the cancellation form and she will be refunded the $50 from this month. She was fine with that. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-03-05 14:28:13', '2020-03-05 14:28:13'),
