  ('zcrm_1579374000047947013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029000316', 'Symone Sandquist', NULL, 'Symone called in and said that she just got off the phone with Teledoc and they told her to call into here to make an appointment at an urgent care. I explained to her that we do not make appointments for her and that for injury/illness she can go to any urgent care in her area and present herself as a self pay patient up to her $500 IUA. Anything after that she will need to submit to Sedera and start a "Need" with them. She then said she though all of her appointments were FREE up to a certain point. I explained to her that nothing is exactly Free and what the process is for preventative care and presenting her RCI card and needing to stay in the PHCS network and use a provider that is in the network. I told her that for everything SHE makes the appointments herself. She did not seem to like that. I told her that in my opinion she needs to have another Welcome Call and refresh her on her plan. I explained how that works and that I sent a Welcome Call scheduler to have another one. She said ok that is fine, she seemed like she just wanted to get off the phone and didn''t seem to care about anything I told her. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-03-05 11:08:09', '2020-03-05 11:08:09'),
