  ('zcrm_1579374000047909003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028459022', 'Liat Lieberman Tabachnik', NULL, 'I have sent the NPI number associated with the obgyn that Liat would like to see over to Jennifer at RCI- waiting to hear back. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-04 17:56:30', '2020-03-04 17:56:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047893016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008640041', 'Allison Adams', NULL, 'Member called in and had lots of questions about plan as she has never used it in 3+ yrs on.  I went over the Preventative Care process, needs process, etc.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-04 13:56:00', '2020-03-04 13:56:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047893008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032679073', 'Tory Reed', NULL, 'Membe''sr spouse called in and asked about a mammogram.  I advised that she would be submitting that to Sedera.  I also asked for proof of DPC that was never submitted.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-04 13:10:20', '2020-03-04 13:10:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047888008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068229', 'Sharon Heiney', NULL, 'Sharon called in and needed some explanation of her plan on preventative and injury/illness. She stated she went to Dr because she is sick and said she handed them an APEX card. I stopped her and explained for that type of appt injury/illness she is a cash pay patient and pays out of pocket up to her IUA of $1000. She did pay and understood that the IUA is per need.I told her that she has ASi and that the APEX card is the wrong card and to not use that again. I explained that she has ASi and I will put a request out for new cards to be sent to her. She then asked how the preventative process works. I explained about making sure the provider is in the PHCS network first and then I explained how she will present herself with her ASi card. She understood and will wait until she gets her card to make the appointments. She needs to have a mammogram done and a physical. I also stressed to her to make sure she tells the providers that her appointments are strictly preventative and the billing needs to be coded as such. She understood everything. I sent her the provider lookup email with instructions on how to navigate the website, the wellness visit instructions, and I tagged her in the email I sent out to request new cards from ASi. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-03-04 12:29:51', '2020-03-04 12:29:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047893003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046217362', 'Grace Lau', NULL, 'Member wishes to enroll in PSD option eff 4/1.  I have enrolled them in RCI and have requested with Sedera.  I will change billing in E123', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-04 11:38:11', '2020-03-04 11:38:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047888003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045841134', 'David Mason', NULL, 'David called in and said that his daughter has been referred to another ENT to have her tousles looked at and it is looking like she is going to have to have them removed. I told him about the Need''s process with Sedera and having to pay the first $1500 of his IUA. I also told him about the 2ndMD process his daughter is going to have to go through before any sort of surgery. He already knew about that and I gave him Sedera''s phone number and told him to call them ASAP before anything and they will start the process with him and walk him through it all. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-03-04 11:01:33', '2020-03-04 11:01:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047854003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044701107', 'Annette Nathan', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Sending out replacement QR Life Code card. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-03-04 08:04:10', '2020-03-04 08:12:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047834003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012429101', 'Karyn Burke Whitcomb', NULL, 'Karyn emailed me early this morning to say that she had never heard back from Kelly F.  I sent my apologies and a list of facility''s for colonoscopy. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-04 07:03:20', '2020-03-04 07:03:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047821013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007637033', 'Nancy Elgie', NULL, 'Mady Messick  5:19 PM
Can someone please reach out to Nancy Elgie? She reached out on how to update a Need, which I’ve explained to her, but now she has questions on how to go about her preventive care through her MEC - ASI. I explained the difference to her and gave her their number but she mentioned that she hadn’t done this in awhile and forgot. If someone could please reach out and help give her a refresher, she is needing a little love :slightly_smiling_face:
Kelly Cheever  6:20 PM
sure thing Mady!  I''ll give her a call now!
Mady Messick  6:25 PM
I helped her out with the Need portion so she’s all set on that, but just needs guidance for the MEC side
Kelly Cheever  6:35 PM
Mady, I gave her a call- she sounded happy and only wanted to ask me about this newer need and MY opinion on whether or not this new medical need is new or old-stemming from a need that was covered previous.  I told her that my opinion was to listen to whatever "Melvin" told her to do from her Sedera chat as well as her needs coordinator.  This was her only concern- she didn''t bring up her MEC at all.  And told me that this need was her only concern and that she is satisfied with filling out the Needs form and the assistance she has received from us this evening.  I am going to send her some preventive care educational emails as well as a welcome call scheduler for the refresher.
new messages
Mady Messick  6:42 PM
Oh awesome! She had mentioned that she had other preventive/check up visits that she needed to take care of so I thought she might need assistance on that but sounds like she figured it out. As for the Need, yes I confirmed with her Needs Coordinator that it would be a new need before responding to her. Thanks for all your help!
Kelly Cheever  6:46 PM
gotta love some late afternoon team work!', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-03 16:50:38', '2020-03-03 16:50:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047821008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030219010', 'Lori Kleiman', NULL, 'Lori called in absolutely confused.  She said that she has a family member that is having a tough time medically and it made her think about the fact that she has no idea how to utilize the plan that she has and called asking for a refresher.  I told her that I would walk her through the plan and answer her questions.  I told her that she needed to call Redirect for anything medical. I also helped her fix the issue about her phone number not being recognized by the Sedera app....I spoke to Benjamin at Sedera and he told me that there was no phone number in the account, he added what I gave him and updated the account- fixing the issue.  She was grateful for all of it- but at one point exclaimed "I am a smart woman! and I can''t figure this out!"  In the end I think that Lori was glad that I listened- she thanked me a few times.  She was thrilled that I helped her understand so many things.  I think that once she dips her feet into the program she will see that it isn''t as scary as her anxiety''s are making it be.  I told her that she can call back anytime and we will happily answer any additional questions. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-03 16:00:56', '2020-03-03 16:00:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047821003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047084020', 'Linda Tornabene', NULL, 'welcome call complete.  Linda did great, she knows and values medical cost sharing and is happy to have some extra padding with the copay plan. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-03 14:25:49', '2020-03-03 14:25:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047795013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032122001', 'Eileen Fagan', NULL, 'Eileen called in and said that she scheduled a colonoscopy and presented herself as self pay and was just calling in to see what else she needs to do. I spoke with Guy because this is my first time dealing with a member that has DPC and I don''t know much about that. Guy told me to let Eileen know to get a price from the place she is going to and then make sure that they code everything as preventative. Once she has done that to call into Sedera and open up a "Need" with them. I gave her Sedera''s phone number and she will do all of that and get with Sedera once she gets a generalized price and Sedera will walk her through the rest of the process. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-03-03 13:35:33', '2020-03-03 13:35:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047795008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046514018', 'Clayton Jackson Rambo', NULL, 'Sent out today QR Life code card to member. Sent to office at 675 Seminole Avenue NE Atlanta, Georgia  30307 member doesn''t have a permanent address yet as per Kelly. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-03-03 11:25:55', '2020-03-03 11:25:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047792028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046217362', 'Grace Lau', NULL, 'Spoke to this enrollee she did not know what a DPC doc was.  I explained what it was and she told me that she didn''t have one.  I told her that I would get in touch with Leah and have her get back with her ans to what plan she really wanted.  Leah called back and told me that she was a chiropractor and that is all they used.  She told me that she went over the PSD with her and that she thought that was what she was going to sing up for she will get back to me.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-03 10:00:50', '2020-03-03 10:00:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047792023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043959202', 'Diane Elliston', NULL, 'Member sent in Proof of DPC I submitted to Elizabeth', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-03 09:48:47', '2020-03-03 09:48:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047792018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043354017', 'Buddy Johnson', NULL, 'Sara (spouse) called in told me that she went into the emergency room over the weekend with severe pain.  Turns out that she had Kidney Stones that she had operation for.  I advised that she had a IUA of $1000 and asked if she paid that.  She did not.  Told her that she was going to be responsible for that and told her to make sure she got a receipt for that...I advised her to be in touch w/Sedera to let them know what happened.  Gave her their number.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-03 09:37:07', '2020-03-03 09:37:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047792013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027924354', 'Darrin Hallman', NULL, 'Member called asking if Individual mandate went away.  I advised that he had been on the plan all of last year and that all he had to do was say that he was on an employer plan.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-03 09:17:13', '2020-03-03 09:17:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047792008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043959202', 'Diane Elliston', NULL, 'Member never received request for proof of DPC Email.  I resent', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-03-03 09:08:22', '2020-03-03 09:08:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047795003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083170', 'AnaMaria Iglesias', NULL, 'Ray called in and said that his wife AnaMaria has yet to use any of the services for her plan and is getting ready to have a Mammogram and an Annual Physical done. I told him I would send him the emails for looking up providers and presenting her card. After I got off the phone Rod wants Guy to help me out with this and have Guy contact Ray and explain everything and get them the best pricing and places to go to. Guy gave Ray a call and spoke about everything that will be done and Ray asked for new ASi cards for his wife. I just sent out and email to the ID department for ASi and requested a PDF copy sent to her email and a hard copy sent out to their mailing address on file. Guy will be keeping up to date with Ray once he has found some places and pricing for him. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-03-03 08:13:56', '2020-03-03 08:13:56'),
