  ('zcrm_1579374000047771018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659967', 'Shawn Mynar', NULL, 'called to make sure that she was getting her 1099 form.  I told her that those are due out by the middle of the month. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-02 18:50:03', '2020-03-02 18:50:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047771013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046514018', 'Clayton Jackson Rambo', NULL, 'Welcome call with Clayton finally finished.  He really did stick in there amidst his busy schedule.  Good sport. I am going to contact the home base about where his welcome packet is- because he is moving all of the time and doesn''t have a permanent residence.  Also US Corporate Wellness site login not working. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-02 17:24:02', '2020-03-02 17:24:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047771008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046514018', 'Clayton Jackson Rambo', NULL, 'Clayton tryed to complete his welcome call with me and wasn''t able too...the wifi at the resident he is pet sitting at was locked and he didn''t have the password.  I told him to call me anytime until 9:00 if he figures it out.  If I do not hear from him at all tonight I will send him another rescheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-02 16:36:14', '2020-03-02 16:36:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047771003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040737144', 'Catherine Rongey', NULL, 'Catherine called to inquire about a check that was due to her from RCI- I saw that Kelly F had been in touch with Brooklyn about this so I reached out to her.  Brooklyn stated that the check is signed and is in line to be mailed out, she said that she will keep Catherine updated with the process. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-03-02 16:03:27', '2020-03-02 16:03:27'),
