  ('zcrm_1579374000047755031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885127', 'Bergen Kunselman', NULL, 'Bergen called in and said she needed help with a claim. I asked her what this was in regards to and she said she went to the ER because she fell and started saying she handed them both of her cards. I stopped her and I said with an incident like that it is not something that is covered. It is Injury/Illness and she is responsible for the first $1500 of her IUA and then she is to submit everything and start a claim with Sedera. I asked if she has paid anything on it yet and she said no. I gave her Sedera''s phone number and said to call them asap. I told her that they are going to ask her to pay the  $1500 and then submit proof of the payment and the remainder of the bill and they will walk her through the rest of the process. She is calling them now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-03-02 12:05:26', '2020-03-02 12:05:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047750030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026291070', 'Alex Lutterbein', NULL, 'Patricia contacted me to inform us Terry is no longer with Talisman. She provided the new point of contact, James Wilson and wanted to know how is the balance being paid, by check or by card and if they are up to date. Updated QB with the new point of contact info and new address for Talisman', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-03-02 11:51:51', '2020-03-02 11:51:51'),
