  ('zcrm_1579374000047755008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013233147', 'Karl E. Schoepflin', NULL, 'Member called in with questions about a cough that he has been experiencing.  Dr is sending him for a chest xray.  I advised no "network" involved that he could go and see anyone.  Told him how to present and what to ask for. -PB', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-03-02 11:27:32', '2020-03-02 11:29:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047761003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043491094', 'Adam Kobler', NULL, 'Member called in for a replacement QR Life code card sending one out today. Updated address on file. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-03-02 11:17:35', '2020-03-02 11:17:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047755003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009604129', 'Lori Frisbie', NULL, 'Tom called and said he got into a motorcycle accident this morning, someone else hit him, and called to ask what to do because he has pain in his left leg. I had Patti speak with him and since there was someone else involved Tom has to get the other person''s information and he needs to contact the car insurance first as primary. Sedera will only come into play once everything has been used up with the car insurance and there is still things that need to be paid. Car insurance is ALWAYS the primary call and what the member is to go through. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-03-02 10:52:53', '2020-03-02 10:52:53'),
