  ('zcrm_1579374000047683013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005636885', 'Richard Wennerstrand', NULL, 'Richard called in and needed me to find 2 prescription coupons for him. Was very happy with the pricing for both. I also let him know I would send him the prescription quote form to fill out for future times so he doesn''t have to call every time he needs a coupon. Very very happy with everything. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-02-28 13:48:12', '2020-02-28 13:48:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047695016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021695393', 'Patrick Boyum', NULL, 'I was able to connect w/Redirect and they have removed his termination date.  I have cancelled his enrollment on RCI/Apex.  I have notified Sedera.  Payment changed back to Redirect in FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-02-28 12:58:53', '2020-02-28 13:03:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047683008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046514018', 'Clayton Jackson Rambo', NULL, 'we went about 45 min into the welcome call, Clayton requested that I help him enroll in the links.  I told him that was fine- then he asked if we could finish it up on Monday because he needed to head out house hunting. He requested at 4:00 I scheduled him for 4:15. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-28 12:54:27', '2020-02-28 12:54:27'),
