  ('zcrm_1579374000047661003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038445042', 'Pamela Parsons', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Wanted info on Dental Plans she said she will call Sally Thomsen for that info. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-02-28 08:36:26', '2020-02-28 08:36:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047659003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610208', 'Marc Krawatsky', NULL, 'Marc emailed me asking about his 1095 B form for this year. He said he was able to get and find his from 2018. I emailed him back letting him know that we tell every member this every year that the IRS actually advises against and does not want people to file that form. They will tell you to NOT file it and there is not need. This form is only for their records, NOT to file it on their actual taxes. I told him all of this and let him know that they were sent and he should be getting it any day now. It will not hurt anything or change anything by not filing it. It actually makes it a LOT harder and takes a lot longer for you to get your taxes if you put it on here. I lastly told him that the deadline for the forms to be sent out is March 2nd 2020 but they were already sent out directly from ASi so he should have it in the next few days. Patti told me to let him know that if he has anymore questions to please call Patti directly and I gave him her number. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-02-28 08:22:50', '2020-02-28 08:22:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047648008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047639040', 'Keegan Swenson', NULL, 'Member Only $1500 IUA 18-29 SD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-02-28 07:49:46', '2020-02-28 07:49:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047648003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006263141', 'Michael Traub', NULL, 'Cancelled HES Supscription', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-02-28 07:39:41', '2020-02-28 07:39:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047623013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046972029', 'Erika Gutierrez', NULL, '2-27-20 Catherine Brown''s law firm will pay for Erika''s membership but decided to pay Erika directly in pay check and Erika will pay monthly fee to us to keep it simple. All set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-02-27 16:10:28', '2020-02-27 16:10:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047623008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052864149', 'Catherine Brown', NULL, '2-27-20 Catherine called my cell phone! I answered and she just wanted to figure out how to pay for her employee Erika Gutierrez''s membership. Erika is paying out of her personal account. I told Catherine to pay her or reimburse her in her paycheck every month. She agrees that the easiest. She was concerned about the tax implications but told her these are not pre-tax memberships bc not insurance. So, paying post-tax is fine. She agreed and will reimburse Erika for the $100 enrollment fee as well. All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-02-27 16:09:22', '2020-02-27 16:09:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047629008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243659', 'Karen Meyer', NULL, 'Karen called very wound up and asking for the insurance information on her card because she misplaced it.  Because her tone sounded emergent- I asked what was going on that she needed the group number and other info that is on the card.  I told her that I would reach out to ASI to get her a PDF and hard copy.  I made sure to verify her address, but I went over what services her ASI card is for, and said that it is never to be used for an injury or illness.  She said that she wanted to make sure that she had it "just in case"- I reiterated that at no time would this card be used in an emergency situation.  She then told me that someday she''ll have to finally learn about how her membership works but that it will have to be another time.  I am sending a welcome call scheduler, and I have already reached out to ASI for a new PDF and hard copy to be issued. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-27 16:07:27', '2020-02-27 16:08:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047629003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047084020', 'Linda Tornabene', NULL, 'called new member for her scheduled welcome call.  no answer.  left lengthy voicemail and sent new scheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-27 15:17:00', '2020-02-27 15:17:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047623003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047639040', 'Keegan Swenson', NULL, '2-27-20 Enrolled for SDHC since PSDHC is going away soon. He called his doctor''s office and a wellness visit is just over $100 so much better to pay self pay for that. He''s choosing $1500/$177 and getting LifeBySpot.com for accident protection for $20K in case gets in cycling accident. Cost is about $25 a month. All set for April start date. Also sent him National General - https://www.insubuy.com/national-general-short-term/
I suggested to choose the Enhanced PPO $2.5K deductible with 100/0 for $78.74. This is in UT so I can''t earn anything on this.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-02-27 14:18:04', '2020-02-27 14:18:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047617008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047612079', 'Meena Puri', NULL, 'Member Only $5000 IUA 50-59 SD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-02-27 12:54:45', '2020-02-27 12:54:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047617003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047612029', 'Marla Jacobsen-Horn', NULL, 'Member Only $1500 IUA 50-59 Copay', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-02-27 12:23:34', '2020-02-27 12:23:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047606003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043460179', 'Jason Steinberg', NULL, 'Jason called back to give me an updated address for him to get his RCI card out to him finally. We were missing a number in the P.O. Box number. I fixed in the CRM here on his profile and wrote it down as well to fix on the letter and we will send it back out. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-02-27 11:13:17', '2020-02-27 11:13:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047570039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021695393', 'Patrick Boyum', NULL, 'Previous Plan Redirect frm 9/1/2018 to 4/1/2020', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-02-27 10:44:55', '2020-02-27 10:44:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047576013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521512', 'Daniel Kaplan', NULL, 'Dan called me back and I let him know the good news that he IS able to get the colonoscopy done. He gave me a provider name to look up and the Dr. IS in the network, so he is good to go for making an appt. with that provider. I also let him know that even though we and he doesn''t know who the anesthesiologist is ahead of time but they need to be in the PHCS network as well. I told him what he can do at the most is ask them to give him someone that is contracted with PHCS, if not than that portion is going to be an out of pocket cost. He understood and was fine with that. Dan is all set and will be making the appt shortly. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-02-27 10:37:20', '2020-02-27 10:37:20'),
