  ('zcrm_1579374000047576008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521512', 'Daniel Kaplan', NULL, 'Dan called in and wanted to get a routine colonoscopy done. He is 36 years old and for it to be covered you have to be 50+ of age. I called Monica at ASi to see is this would be covered even though he is not of age. He is wanting to get this done b/c he has a family history of colon cancer. Monica said yes it would be covered b/c of the family history and there is nothing different that needs to be done. Just make sure the provider and anesthesiologist are in the PHCS Network and present his ASi Card upon arrival and submit the claims into the P.O. Box address on the back of the card. I tried calling Dan back to look up a provider he had but not answer, I left a voicemail to call me back when he can. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-02-27 10:07:54', '2020-02-27 10:07:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047585003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045821781', 'Leeanne Whittaker', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule the 30 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-02-27 09:05:06', '2020-02-27 09:05:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047570019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040737100', 'Colette Kirkendall', NULL, 'I sent this member a receipt of of FTNI for the March pmt.  I advised that I didn''t think you could opt out of the receipts.and that she should look in her spam or junk mail.  Also to let me know if she didn''t get on for next month.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-02-27 08:56:49', '2020-02-27 08:56:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047570014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082312', 'Kelly Panton', NULL, 'Member submitted Member Change Form to update address.  I will update in FTNI &amp; Sedera RCI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-02-27 07:30:27', '2020-02-27 07:30:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047570006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026552012', 'Karen W. Isaac', NULL, 'Updated address for this member in FTNI, Sedera &amp; RCI.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-02-27 07:26:04', '2020-02-27 07:27:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047576003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045539203', 'Shine Paul', NULL, 'Shine called in and was wondering why his monthly payment did not come out like it usually does between the 20th and the 22nd. There was a glitch in the system and they payments for everyone were run last night 2/26/20 and will come out in the next couple business days for it to come out. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-02-27 07:10:56', '2020-02-27 07:10:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047555008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040737100', 'Colette Kirkendall', NULL, 'Colette called to say that she thinks she accidentally opted out from her monthly payment emails and would like this reversed.  I let Sunny and Patti know about the situation. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-26 17:16:02', '2020-02-26 17:16:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047555003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035227061', 'Marie Folsom', NULL, 'Marie called in because she found her dermatologist in the PHCS network and wanted to know if dermatology was a covered service.  I told her that it was not one of the services mandated by the ACA.  She then asked if it was covered at all- I told her that it would only be shared in if a medical need was found and the amount snowballed over her IUA. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-26 15:12:08', '2020-02-26 15:12:08'),
