  ('zcrm_1579374000047528003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004833121', 'Gregory Olsky', NULL, '2-26-20 Greg is owed about $4400 from LHS now and is getting collections notices. He''s spoken with folks at LHS about 5 times and they always promise to pay stating they made a mistake and owe the money. But, they still haven''t paid from a visit Jan. 3rd 2019 at Aspen Valley Hospital. He just want to get reimbursed and then will jump ship. He does see chiro as well. So, PDHC will be good option. Nancy and Nesta will still be best served by traditional ins bc they are getting good APTC and Nancy has heart issues. Nesta has genetic disease that may or may not be an issue. Right now no problems with it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-02-26 11:40:34', '2020-02-26 11:43:18'),
