  ('zcrm_1579374000047469022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028130264', 'Mark Sewell', NULL, 'I want to add a note that we got Mark''s RCI card''s and letter sent back to us saying the address was not able to be sent to. I called Mark to confirm his address and see if they moved or anything like that and no they did not and the address I read to them was 100% correct. Very strange that it got sent back to us. I will try to send it to the address again and I asked Mark if it gets sent back again if there is another address we could send it to. He gave me his work address and said if it gets sent back again that we can mail it to his work. So I have it on file here his work address is: 12857 West Colonial Dr. Suite #105 Winter Garden FL, 34787. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-02-26 09:37:58', '2020-02-26 09:37:58'),
