  ('zcrm_1579374000047397023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529382', 'Mitchell Magdovitz', NULL, 'Mitchell called to get a coupon on some antibiotics for his daughter.  I sent it via text. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-24 17:28:03', '2020-02-24 17:28:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047397018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650401', 'Frederic Besch', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  Fred is on the ball and he and his girlfriend have really done their homework! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-24 16:56:12', '2020-02-24 16:56:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047397013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904687', 'Mike Gardner', NULL, 'I gave Michael a call and he was running around finishing up a few things for the day.  He didn''t even have a pen and paper- and he wasn''t able to be in front of his computer.  He asked to reschedule- so I scheduled him for tomorrow afternoon.  He was appreciative. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-24 15:54:43', '2020-02-24 15:54:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047397008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011752018', 'Kim Rust', NULL, 'member called in because she has gotten a divorce and wanted to remover her now ex-husband from the plan.  I sent member change form and let her know that Patti would be reaching out to her tomorrow. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-24 15:18:12', '2020-02-24 15:18:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047397003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529441', 'John Digirolamo', NULL, 'John called mentioning a bill that he received expressing that the plan he was on denied it and he wanted to know why.  I told him that he needed to speak with Redirect and gave him their phone number. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-24 14:16:04', '2020-02-24 14:16:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047386028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041953095', 'Susan Farrar', NULL, 'Member called in and spoke with Kelly F re: Colonoscopy Her issue is that she has had polups in the past and is scheduled for colonscopy. I told her that since this was something that she had prior to her membership that it would not be shared in the 1st year and that $15,00 would be shared the 2nd year.  I told her that since she has had them in the past that whole procedure would most likely be coded as diagnostic.  Said that Andrea clarified this with someone.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-02-24 14:13:27', '2020-02-24 14:13:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047378023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041953095', 'Susan Farrar', NULL, 'Called in and had a bunch of questions in regards to preventative appointments. She is going to have a Mammogram, looked up the Sally Jobe and the exact location is in the network and she will make sure that the person that is going to be reading the results is in the PHCS network as well, then she needs to have a colonoscopy done. I did not find the exact name of the place that she usually goes to but I did find specific providers for the address she gave me and multiple different locations with the address matching up with what I found in relation to the facility name she gave me. I went over exactly what the procedure is of Preventative appointments and what she needs to do and how she presents herself. I also went over her card while she was looking at it and explained everything on the card and what needs to be done upon arrival to her appt''s. I will be sending her educational emails and the lists for the gastroenterology. I had to have Patti call her back and explain that since she has had polyps found in the past that her colonoscopy is not going to be preventative and will not be shared. I was unaware of this and was never told about that. Patti called Susan and explained what is going to happen. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-02-24 14:03:54', '2020-02-24 14:03:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047386023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026209074', 'Michael Flynn', NULL, 'Member''s wife called in and said that she had a Hysterectomy scheduled for 3/17 and had not spoken to Sedera as yet.  I told her that all elective surgeries had to go through the 2nd MD and that she needed to contact Sedera ASAP.  I suggested doing a 2nd welcome call.  Wife resisted but did not know to contact Sedera.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-02-24 13:33:53', '2020-02-24 13:33:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047378018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028419199', 'Jane Rosenberg', NULL, 'Jane called in and said she is getting ready to put money into her HSA and wanted to call here first to make sure she still qualifies. Last year she did, I put her into Patti to answer that for her. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-02-24 13:15:50', '2020-02-24 13:15:50'),
