  ('zcrm_1579374000047376018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045798309', 'Wesley Contro', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Told him once he checks his mail to give us a call if he doesn''t receive QR Life code card that was resent back to him. Verified address. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-02-24 10:07:22', '2020-02-24 10:10:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047378008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043575167', 'Peggy Neises', NULL, 'Peggy called me and said the list i sent her a while back for general practitioners in her area was not a large list there was very few and she said she looked up reviews for them all and they all had really bad reviews so she asked if I could look up some more and do some more research. She gave me one specific Dr''s name and I found him on google to match the address and Dr. John Gordon did come up and everything matched. I called Peggy back to let her know and asked if she still wanted me to look more up and she said that was fine and with John Gordon and I gave her the website healthgrades.com to look up reviews. She was very happy. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-02-24 10:01:14', '2020-02-24 10:01:14'),
