  ('zcrm_1579374000047283038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044842321', 'Stephanie Vogel', NULL, 'Termination:
Tracking #9728913
Sent by Patti Baron on 2/21/2020', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-02-21 11:17:39', '2020-02-21 11:17:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047312003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675034', 'Faith Ketterer', NULL, 'I got this from Salena-
Good Morning Kelly,

 

I tried giving you a call to better explain but Kelly F said that you were not in the office yet, so I will email you instead.

 

I called the provider and they confirmed that she did not have the services done and they billed us in error. They confirmed that she could still get them done with the current order she has at the facility. They also confirmed the diagnosis codes on all of the lab orders. Out of the 5 lab codes 2 are considered non-preventative and will not be covered by us, the code 82306 and code 84443. The other three labs will be covered by us if she gets them done. Please call me if you have any questions or feel free to email me. Look forward to hearing from you and helping Faith work all this out!

 

Thank you,

Salena Abreu

Claims Department Supervisor

MERP/HRA/Dental/Vision Plans

Administrative Solutions

P. O. Box 5809?Fresno, CA 93755

Ph. 559.256.1320 ext. 243?Fax 559.475.5780

sabreu@asibenefits.com?www.asibenefits.com


 and I just got off of the phone with Faith letting her know the good news of letting her know exactly what to expect, and everyone involved being on the same page.  She apologized for the situation not being as clear as we needed at first, but I told her not to be- that she is being a pro-active member and that''s what we love. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-21 11:13:29', '2020-02-21 11:13:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047297013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044842321', 'Stephanie Vogel', NULL, 'Called in to cancel, sent cancellation via email. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-02-21 10:54:52', '2020-02-21 10:54:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047297008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610129', 'Bethany Stoll', NULL, 'Bethany called in and needed copies of new ASi card sent to her. I emailed the ID department to get new cards sent out to her via PDF and mailing address. She also needed to know why she got a letter from ASi stating some of her physical preventative appt was not covered. I asked her to send me what she has and I will contact someone at ASi for her. I called Leena and she picked up and let me know that the reason was because she had a blood test done and was diagnosed with a Vitamin D deficiency so that is the only this that was not covered because it is not preventative. They did pay for the entire preventative physical. I asked if she could call and email Bethany and she said she is leaving right now but took down both her numbers and email and said Salena will contact her to let her know. I also emailed Bethany to let her know as well. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-02-21 10:24:20', '2020-02-21 10:24:20');
