  ('zcrm_1579374000047264028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675034', 'Faith Ketterer', NULL, '***please keep conversations with Faith to Guy and Kelly C- Faye has been having a hard time conveying what it is she wants or needs fixed and I just don''t want it to get even more upside down that it is.**** I spoke with Faith for awhile- I am requesting that Salena reach out to her doctor''s billing department to try to sort things out.  I also tagged Guy in thread. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-20 19:03:18', '2020-02-20 19:03:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047264023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021903103', 'Jodi Anglin', NULL, 'Jodi called in stating that she found that the HPV vaccine is showing as a covered expense through APEX.  After reading Patti''s note below I thought I would be cautious, I gave Jodi Jennifer Chasteen''s phone number and email because I couldn''t tell her for certain if it would be covered or not- especially since she was diagnosed with it and wants both of her sons to have the vaccine as well so that they do not spread it with their partners. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-20 17:01:32', '2020-02-20 17:01:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047264018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044406111', 'Chadd Ziegler', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  I called at scheduled time with no answer- he called me back about 30 min later and I had time for us to complete it.  You could tell that he was pretty unsure of himself about understanding everything, but I took a lot of time going over everything with him. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-20 16:46:50', '2020-02-20 16:46:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047264013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675034', 'Faith Ketterer', NULL, 'I spoke to Guy about Faith''s lab requisition form.  I tried giving her a call but it went to voicemail. - left message- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-20 15:26:45', '2020-02-20 15:26:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047264008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529830', 'Joseph Lopez', NULL, 'Joseph accidentally gave us a call rather than Redirect.  I gave him their number again.  I told him that he needs to call them for everything medical, but for pharmacy to call us, or if he has questions regarding his billing. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-20 15:23:54', '2020-02-20 15:23:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047241126', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011809121', 'Annette Wolf', NULL, 'This member was transferred to me by Betties.  She had 2 questions 1. Could she go to her Preventative appt earlier than the June appt she had last year.  I told her no it could not be less than a year.  2. Last year she had 3 needs that totaled $3000.  In addition she paid out another $7000 in expenses prior to Sedera paying out.  She took this money out of her HSA and is no getting a Tax bill and wants to know if she needed to pay it back or was it duductable.  I deferred to her tax professional or reaching out to Sedera as they must have had this situation before.  Said she has not heard back from Sedera.  Told her to follow up with them.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-02-20 14:33:12', '2020-02-20 14:33:12'),
