  ('zcrm_1579374000047256074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047238442', 'Anne DeWaters', NULL, '2-20-20 Annie is enrolling now in PDHC $500/$378. All set and feels well versed after also talking with Matt Ross about his experience.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-02-20 12:04:33', '2020-02-20 12:12:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047241081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041185116', 'Tiffany Luke', NULL, 'Member called in to cancel I advised that today was the deadline.  She will fill out the form and get back to me', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-02-20 11:57:50', '2020-02-20 11:57:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047256042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001207493', 'Eben Grace', NULL, '2-20-20 Eben called just to reassure himself that this is a good stable option after hearing rumblings about healthsharing not being ACA compliant in the media/blogs, etc. I shared with him my experience and knowledge and his membership is currently ACA compliant with the MEC. I told him that may go away soon. He had his first colonoscopy and that went well and was mostly paid for. There is now discussion about a polyp that was removed and they''re working through that still. He''s pleased thus far. He was thankful to reach me.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-02-20 11:56:58', '2020-02-20 11:56:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047264003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675034', 'Faith Ketterer', NULL, 'client emailed me with all of the same questions Guy just answered last night.  So- I forwarded the email to Salena at ASI and Guy Travis because we are going in circles here. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-20 11:37:39', '2020-02-20 11:37:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047241073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016111199', 'Michael Procaccini', NULL, 'After terming w/ Total Healthcare member wanted to continue with coverage so he enrolled in the PSD option w/MPBA', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-02-20 11:33:40', '2020-02-20 11:38:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047258023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000689077', 'Andre Simoneau', NULL, 'Welcome call complete with member and wife Mara. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-02-20 11:31:27', '2020-02-20 11:31:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047241068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047238273', 'Jennifer Bradfield', NULL, 'Member &amp; Fam $1500 IUA 40-49 SD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-02-20 11:28:24', '2020-02-20 11:28:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047241063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039268017', 'Matthew Sayre', NULL, 'Per Vanessa request sent PDF copy of RCI card &amp; ordered new cards to be sent.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-02-20 11:09:39', '2020-02-20 11:09:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047258018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039268017', 'Matthew Sayre', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Putting in request for another RCI card to Patti. Also sending out replacement of QR Life Code card. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-02-20 10:55:09', '2020-02-20 10:55:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047256026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047238350', 'Amy Wentworth', NULL, '2-20-20 Amy just enrolled in PDHC for her and son. Might pull son off if husband is able to cover him but not successful in doing so with C4 yet. Chose $1000/$567 for the two of them.  All set and easy to work with.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-02-20 10:41:23', '2020-02-20 10:41:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047256021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050050205', 'Eric Cohen', NULL, '2-20-20 Eric 54 and Jill 51 are healthy. Jill had bunyonectomy foot surgery recently and understands if something arises with that it''s her responsibility to pay for. Eldest son at 16 lives with another family and has some mental health issues but doesn''t like taking medications. They don''t think he''s been on any for possibly 3 years but they don''t know. Youngest son Eli is healthy at 14.  Jill is challenging to talk to. She''s very nervous about how this works. She couldn''t grasp the fact that Redirect may pay $75 of a chiro visit and she''d need to pay the rest since her chiro charges $150 per visit, higher than any chiro I''ve heard of. She started to grasp it at the end and thinks reading it all will help her. She''s excited to read through all materials bc that will help her drastically she says. Cobra is $2800 and therefore not feasible. Anthem with accident or some other policy total around $1800 for them now. She thinks the $910 is still expensive since she can''t grasp what her cost will be yet. She was deathly afraid of the negotiation process that happens. Again, started to grasp it at the end. She goes to chiro about 2x per month.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-02-20 10:37:11', '2020-02-20 10:46:28'),
