  ('zcrm_1579374000047241033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021903103', 'Jodi Anglin', NULL, 'Jodi called in to ask questions about her recent diagnosis of possible HPV.  Said that she will have to go in for a procedure.  I advised that she should get a price for the procedure and then if will be more than $1000 she should be in contact w/Sedera.  I went over the process on how to present and she said that she has call into provider financial office.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-02-20 09:16:52', '2020-02-20 09:16:52'),
