  ('zcrm_1579374000047251003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521512', 'Daniel Kaplan', NULL, 'Daniel called back in to ask if blood work was included with his preventative physical. I said yes as long as it is coded as preventative. I also let him know he can get the script from his doctor for the blood work and then go to a LabCorp or Quest Diagnostics and have them do it there because they are the approved facilities. He said his doctor was just going to do it there and I said that is fine as well just as long as it is coded as Preventative. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-02-20 08:26:21', '2020-02-20 08:26:21'),
