  ('zcrm_1579374000047216014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675034', 'Faith Ketterer', NULL, 'Spoke to client in depth about situation about her concerns regarding preventative tests...asked client 3 different times if she had any additional questions...she confirmed that she understood the preventative care program...instructed client to call with additional questions...', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2020-02-19 16:29:26', '2020-02-19 16:29:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047214021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032516016', 'David Sims', NULL, '2-19-20 David wants to protect kids for an upcoming Big Mountain Skier Competition in Taos, NM via IFSA. He''s waiting for response from CHP+ for yes or no for coverage for kids. His income is expected to be around $47K for 2020 which puts him well below the cut off for CHP+ showing about $57K for the APTC to kick in. They will back date it to Feb. 1st. He''s nervous bc they didn''t give him a definitive answer if he qualifies. After researching he "should" be fine and covered back to Feb. 1st. I just sent him an accident policy through Andrea as well through VBA for March 1st start if he''s worried they won''t be covered out of state. He wasn''t sure about that with CHP+. But it won''t protect them for this weekend. Sheldon is 2/24/2005 and Lucian 10/4/07, 81611.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-02-19 16:12:19', '2020-02-19 16:12:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047214016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047238273', 'Jennifer Bradfield', NULL, '2-19-20 Enrolled in SDHC bc PSDHC is changing in next few months. They already did all of their annual wellness visits, so they don''t need to pay for that. He''s going to share with his wife and wanted to make sure he could upgrade to PSDHC if changed mind after Welcome Call. I said that he could if need be. I believe they will be happy with SDHC to avoid future changes.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-02-19 15:57:49', '2020-02-19 15:57:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047166074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023008066', 'Nathan Wilson', NULL, 'Nathan called in wondering if he was going to receive some sort of tax form from RCI- I told him that he should''ve gotten it already- I confirmed his address and sent an email to Jennifer Chasteen over at RCI.  He had MANY MANY questions concerning his preventive health care I went over everything with him as well as helped him through understanding the multiplan site.  I sent all appropriate emails. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-19 15:36:47', '2020-02-19 15:36:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047166069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919520', 'Dechen Hawk', NULL, 'Laura called in stating that she had submitted a claim and she wanted to know if it would be covered or not.  I confirmed that she meant with Sedera.  I gave her their number and then tried to transfer the call to Sedera- the line got disconnected.  I let Laura know that I would reach out to Sedera on her behalf.  So I slack requested that someone touch bases with Laura- it turned out that her needs coordinator had been trying to get ahold of her with no response.  BUT they didn''t have her email or her cell phone on file.  I gave Sedera that info- Mady told me that their account is updated now and that the needs coordinator will be reaching out with updated contacts. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-19 15:33:09', '2020-02-19 15:33:09'),
