  ('zcrm_1579374000047166032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028419015', 'Daryl Morris', NULL, '02.19.20:  Got copied on an email from Daryl to Jennifer Chasteen.  Daryl recvd. another bill of $1708 for anesthesia for her preventive cholonoscoopy. She was assured by Jennifer this bill would be covered.. She also recvd. a 2nd notice that her prevenitve annual physicial, which is supposed to be covered, is not.  the procedure and check up were both preventive and nothing was found wrong. Both doctors and facilities were and are stil in thier network.
