  ('zcrm_1579374000047097023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601171', 'Susan Bradley', NULL, 'Susan wanted to know if a dexa screening would be covered.  I told her no- only basic mammogram.  I walked her through the multiplan site so that she can look up a facility that is in network.  I then sent all supporting templates. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-17 16:09:24', '2020-02-17 16:09:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047092029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810797', 'Chris Massey', NULL, '2-17-20 Chris called and needs to cancel. He feels terrible since I helped him so much to set him up. But, he suddenly has to take out an additional loan for his daughter''s school that was completely unexpected. He''s not just hoping nothing goes wrong health wise in the next few months. He''s hoping for a offer from a company that has full benefits. He''ll need to move if he gets the job as well. But, he simply can''t swing the cost right now. He was super nice and appreciative of my time.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-02-17 16:02:16', '2020-02-17 16:02:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047097018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003524005', 'Jamie Rotunno', NULL, 'called to cancel.  sent form and tagged Wendy. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-17 15:23:40', '2020-02-17 15:23:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047097013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025756253', 'Robin Beck', NULL, 'Robin was trying to call in all day- Wendy finally got through to my line so that I could speak with her.  Robin was trying to get a script quote for her son, and the medication jumped to over $230 and it was a bit of a shock to her.  I ended up finding it for $51 and using the same pharmacy.  She was ecstatic! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-17 15:00:56', '2020-02-17 15:00:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047061066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047033001', 'Robert Meyerson', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 639 
Question : Hi, I spoke to Guy last week and am finishing some research. My wife was curious, if when she goes to her annual Gynecologist exam, do all the same guidelines apply? She would be responsible to meet the I.U.A. first before any cost sharing benefit would be available?', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2020-02-17 14:51:00', '2020-02-17 14:51:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047097008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000020299236', 'Sara Berry', NULL, 'Sara Berry called in to ask if counseling was something that was shareable- I told her that it wasn''t but told her about Head to Heart Ministries, as well as new Teladoc services.  I emailed detailed info. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-17 14:42:46', '2020-02-17 14:42:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047081076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043608110', 'Kevin Shah', NULL, 'Called and needed to get a correct mailing address for Kevin to try and send his RCI MEC Card out to him again. I left a message stating he can still call and give the address to Kelly C and we will send it out once we get that from him. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-02-17 14:37:00', '2020-02-17 14:37:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047081071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043460179', 'Jason Steinberg', NULL, 'I tried calling Jason to get a corrected mailing address to send his RCI MEC Card back out to him. We tried sending to the address on file and it got sent back for insufficient address. I left a message to call back when he can with the correct address for us. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-02-17 14:33:13', '2020-02-17 14:33:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047092016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025756253', 'Robin Beck', NULL, '2-17-20 Robin is having trouble using the toll free Concierge toll free #. I connected her to Kelly C to get medication for her son.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-02-17 14:32:38', '2020-02-17 14:32:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047081066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043462286', 'Bryan Baker', NULL, 'Tried calling and I did NOT leave a message because the voicemail was for someone else and it was for some company with a different guy''s name. I did shoot him an email though to get his updated mailing address to us because his RCI Card we sent out got sent back with Vacant written on it. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-02-17 14:29:12', '2020-02-17 14:29:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047097003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830079', 'Jose Hernandez', NULL, 'Jose emailed me wanting where to start for his preventive care services.  I told him that I would resend all of the emails that I sent him back in June ''19 and I also pulled a few lists for him to look through for his primary care Dr. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-17 14:14:18', '2020-02-17 14:14:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047081061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165388', 'Kimberly Baldwin', NULL, 'Kimberly called in and said on Friday she was speaking with Kelly Cheever about her mammogram she has scheduled for tomorrow. She just wanted to make sure she was presenting her card correctly. I looked at her emails and it looks like Kelly sent her the email about presenting her card. She said yup she has that and will look it over. I also explained to her on the phone about the customer support # the front desk is to call to verify her benefits and next to that there will be a P.O. Box address and that is where the facility is to submit the claims to. She understood and is good to go. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-02-17 14:04:11', '2020-02-17 14:04:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047071061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047084284', 'Karen Quigley', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA 60-64 CoPay', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-02-17 13:33:17', '2020-02-17 13:33:17'),
