  ('zcrm_1579374000047071028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047084125', 'Katherine Leary', NULL, 'Member Only $1500 IUA 60-64 SD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-02-17 11:35:04', '2020-02-17 11:35:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047081056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043013016', 'Tranquilino Padilla', NULL, 'Tranquilino called in and was needing questions answered about his appointment he is needing to go to for his Sciatic problems with his back and was asking questions. I looked him up and he has Redirect and let him know that he needs to contact them ALWAYS. I let him know Redirect is his first point of contact for anything and I am not his provider which is what he thought. He said he was given our card. I told him that card is just to contact me the concierge to be directed to the correct department or I may be able to answer certain questions, other than that he HAS to call Redirect for anything. I let him know to never hand that card out for anything. Call Redirect and they will help him out and gave him their pone number. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-02-17 11:32:54', '2020-02-17 11:32:54'),
