  ('zcrm_1579374000047081031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257276', 'Jacqueline Martinez', NULL, 'A letter got returned back to our office from RCI for member. Patti updated apt number with RCI. Put in mail today to be sent back to the member. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-02-17 10:10:07', '2020-02-17 10:10:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047081023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810797', 'Chris Massey', NULL, 'Not able to leave message. Sent email to book online the 30 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-02-17 09:59:19', '2020-02-17 10:00:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047081018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012429101', 'Karyn Burke Whitcomb', NULL, 'Karyn called in and firstly wanted to know what the process is of getting a bone density test and if it is covered with her plan. I told her that is something that is preventative and covered but there are a few rules for it to be. First she has to be 60+ years old. She is not, so how this is going to work then is she is going to have to open up a "Need" with Sedera and pay out of pocket up to her IUA of $500.  When I started talking about that process she started saying she knows exactly what to do. She has already gone through that process already and said she has all of Sedera''s info to do so. I let her know to double make sure she has all of her receipts as well as the super bill to give them. Her last questions were about getting a colonoscopy. I told her yes and it is the same as any other preventative appt she has done in the past. She has to make sure the provider is in the PHCS Network, she has to have a script from her provider(she does) and gave me a facility to look into and see if they are approved. Lastly I explained how she is going to present her ASI card and walked her through what the card will say and where the info is for the provider to call and verify her benefits and the address on the back for the claims to be submitted to. She was very happy for all the info and the help. I will be emailing her everything I can find and she will make her appt. after she has the bone density test done. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-02-17 09:50:34', '2020-02-17 09:50:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047081013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044842692', 'Michael Chavez', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 30 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-02-17 09:16:30', '2020-02-17 09:16:30'),
