  ('zcrm_1579374000047071013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016111199', 'Michael Procaccini', NULL, 'Cancellation submitted for this employee.  I will notify Sedera &amp; ASi', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-02-17 08:47:24', '2020-02-17 08:47:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047071008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028177059', 'Teresa Vannoy', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request. I have cancelled RCI &amp; will cancel Sedera &amp; FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-02-17 07:52:58', '2020-02-17 07:52:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047071003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042309236', 'Matthew Funke', NULL, 'Member called in and told me that he might be getting employer health coverge and could he put off his payment until he hears.  I explained the billing situation to him and advised him of the deadline of the 20th.  If later we could refund.  I sent him Cancellation link to have on file.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-02-17 07:50:32', '2020-02-17 07:50:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047039003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028459022', 'Liat Lieberman Tabachnik', NULL, 'trying to get Liat to understand between how differently she needs to handle her preventive and her illness care.  Please see emails...I have made it clear over and over again.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-14 19:00:41', '2020-02-14 19:00:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047036042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028419015', 'Daryl Morris', NULL, '02.14.20:  Emailed Daryl to remind her the deadline for enrolling for a Marach 1 start date is 2/10. Asked if we can schedule a call.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-02-14 15:25:27', '2020-02-14 15:25:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047036037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028419015', 'Daryl Morris', NULL, '01.28.20:  Daryl called. Said she wants to add her daughter onto her membership.  the daughter is age 21 and a student - very healthy.  Looking for a March 1 start date. I explained options for Redirect, VPC and DPC.  Sent her information and pricing for all three in addition to keeping her current Partially Self=directed plan.  Daryl replied that she would take a look and see which fets best and get back to me. I replied ok.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-02-14 15:24:18', '2020-02-14 15:24:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047036032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028419015', 'Daryl Morris', NULL, '12.03.19:  Emailed Daryl. Told her the normal process to deal with these issues is to have our Concierge help her handle it.  If,  however, she feels this matter can be rectified with her call to the anesthesiologist, to do it.  If she runs into any difficulties, please let me know and John will look into it.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-02-14 15:15:17', '2020-02-14 15:15:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047036027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028419015', 'Daryl Morris', NULL, '12.02.19:  Was copied on an email Daryl sent to Jennifer Chasteen at RCI. Daryl just recv''d. a bill for $1700 for anesthesia service for same colonoscopy procedure in April 2019. Daryl was told all was paid. Asked Jennifer to advise. Jennifer replied they never received an anesthesia bill. She advised that Daryl call the anesthesiologist''s billing dept. and update her insurance info. so the anesthesiologist can resubmit the claim to her insurance co.  Daryl thanked Jennifer and said she will contact the provider.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-02-14 15:12:02', '2020-02-14 15:12:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047036022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028419015', 'Daryl Morris', NULL, '07.24.19:   I replied to Daryl''s email that it''s my pleasure and I''m here to help.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-02-14 14:24:05', '2020-02-14 14:24:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047036008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028419015', 'Daryl Morris', NULL, '07.23.19:  Jennifer replied all was paid and Daryl will receive another explanation of benefits. What Daryl was just sent was sent before all was corrected. I Emailed Daryl thanking her for keeping me in the loop. Daryl replied to thank me for all my help.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-02-14 14:20:10', '2020-02-14 14:23:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047036003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028419015', 'Daryl Morris', NULL, '07.20.19:  Was copied on Daryl''s email to Jennifer Chasteen. Confused because she just recv''d a bill for $1850 instead of $0.', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2020-02-14 14:19:22', '2020-02-14 14:19:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047035003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005663211', 'Chad Gray', NULL, 'Chad called into here at MPowering looking to speak to Wendy. I asked for him name, phone #, and a message just in case she does not pick up and I leave a voice mail. I tried to transfer and Wendy did not pick up, per usual. I left a voicemail stating that Chad called and wanted to speak to her in regards to enrolling for a new plan. I left him number so hopefully she will call him back. I will also send Wendy an email. She seems to answer that better. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-02-14 12:51:00', '2020-02-14 12:51:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047034003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047033001', 'Robert Meyerson', NULL, 'Completed Full Presentation - will discuss with wife re sign on date: 3/1/2020 - Redirect Plan $1500 IUA presented.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2020-02-14 12:50:28', '2020-02-14 12:50:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047019031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044842427', 'Jill O''Dell', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 30 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-02-14 10:22:52', '2020-02-14 10:22:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047019026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810615', 'Don Ford', NULL, 'Mailbox is full. Not able to leave a message. Sent email to book online the 30 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-02-14 10:02:42', '2020-02-14 10:02:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047019021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044571112', 'Cheryl Claman-Brennan', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 30 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-02-14 09:31:09', '2020-02-14 09:31:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047019016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010954128', 'Brent Toevs', NULL, 'Processed address change.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-02-14 09:19:00', '2020-02-14 09:19:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047019011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068195', 'Yen-Yen Yuan', NULL, 'Member called in and asked if her plan was a HDHP.  I told her it was and that her plan had a $3000 Deductable associated with it.  She asked how she would know that I answered that was how it would have been sold to her.  She asked that since she cancelled could she contribute until time of cancellation I advised her to consult with her tax professional about that.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-02-14 09:14:48', '2020-02-14 09:14:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000047019003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045438013', 'Drew Cifrodelli', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Sending out form to remove child Cole off the plan. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-02-14 08:46:56', '2020-02-14 08:59:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046961029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165388', 'Kimberly Baldwin', NULL, 'I helped Kim in finding her doctor and imaging facility in network- but told her that it isn''t 100% and that she would need to call and ask first.  I also told her that when she is at her appointment to make sure that she asks that the imaging go to someone in network. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-13 18:16:48', '2020-02-13 18:16:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046983018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047153471', 'Thomas Ferguson', NULL, '2-13-20 Obtaining medical records and we will enroll him tomorrow at 1:00 MST.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-02-13 15:33:50', '2020-02-13 15:33:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046983013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047084237', 'Mark DeRespinis', NULL, '2-13-20 Mark is 40 turning 41 soon and wife Tara is 38 going on 39. Daughter Tara is 5 and turning 6 soon. Mark''s only health issue is ceriasis. Tara''s has some minor heart issue that she''s not willing to go on meds for. I told them the full pre-x clause and recommened traditional ins for her. After her understood how membership works and stepping blocks of pre-x clause he thinks Tara might still be a good candidate for this since not a concern for anything any time soon. He will read guidelines and discuss with Tara. He makes about $60-$65K in 2019 and expecting about $75K for 2020. He and Tara are not legally married but finances combined and such. File taxes separately. Not sure how they are seen in eyes of state if considered domestic partnership or not. Moved from NM to CO 2 years ago and started own organic farm business! Daughter and Mark see Dr. few times a year. Recommended PDHC bc of daughters visits and ease of access, etc. He''s thrilled about this versus traditional options. May be kicked off Medicaid soon if not already. They didn''t meet the deadline of Feb. 5th to show updated income bc earning too much now. He''s not sure when they will be cancelled. He knows of 20th of the month deadline.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-02-13 15:14:09', '2020-02-13 15:14:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046979033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046762125', 'Caleb Champagne', NULL, 'Submitted I cancelled &amp; refunded the member all fees and will inform Sedera', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-02-13 14:08:45', '2020-02-13 14:08:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046979028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046762125', 'Caleb Champagne', NULL, 'I received email back from this member saying that he wasn''t a member of a DPC. I then spoke to Mike Montes and asked him to get with member and let me know what he wanted. Just received phone call from member and he would like to withdraw app right now and might enroll at a later time. I will send cancellation link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-02-13 14:07:52', '2020-02-13 14:07:52'),
