  ('zcrm_1579374000046983003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011447234', 'Thomas McCarthy', NULL, '2-13-20 Tom called to see if he could pay for his monthly membership fee out of his HSA. I told him it''s not a true medical expense and therefore no. But, I also told him to talk with his accountant since the laws are changing daily. He will do so.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-02-13 11:20:15', '2020-02-13 11:20:15'),
