  ('zcrm_1579374000046979003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044758366', 'Jennifer Fossen', NULL, 'Vanessa let me know that this member said that she is interested in cancelling.  I sent out the link and called and left a voice mail letting her know.  Advised her of the deadline.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-02-13 10:04:00', '2020-02-13 10:04:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046978003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010857037', 'Ilan Brown', NULL, 'Ilian called in and was at a follow up visit for an ER visit he had a few weeks ago for Injury/Illness non preventative incident. He wanted to know how to go about presenting himself and payment. I told him he was correct in saying that he is a self pay patient and that he only pays up to his IUA of $1000 and to be asked to bill the rest. He will need to keep every single receipt and the remainder of the billing and submit it all into Sedera and they will take it from there. He said he has Sedera''s phone number and will do so. All set. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-02-13 10:03:31', '2020-02-13 10:03:31'),
