  ('zcrm_1579374000046915036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026202179', 'Erin Graham', NULL, 'Erin thought she was calling Redirect- she wanted to schedule all big ticket preventive care items.  I told her that she needed to call Redirect. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-12 18:07:30', '2020-02-12 18:07:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046915031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045539058', 'Allison Atkin', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  She works in healthcare so has some idea about how medical cost sharing works.  I reassured her that the concierge desk will always be there to hold her hand through the process whenever she feels to reach out. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-12 18:05:50', '2020-02-12 18:05:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046915026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047238442', 'Anne DeWaters', NULL, '2-12-20 Annie said we''ve met at parties years ago and she had about 15 people tell her we need to hang out bc we like to do the same activities. We have tons of mutual friends. She is 51 and graduated from UVM in ''90. She just moved out here to Vail 3 years ago and loves it. She''s healthy, no pre-x, no meds, no tobacco. She''s friends with many of the orthos at Steadman''s in case she got injured, she''d pay them cash. She doesn''t have ins bc it was too expensive but is thrilled for this option. She''s going to call Matt really quickly and then get back to me to enroll. She''s a candidate for the PDHC, perhaps $1000/$350. In VT it cost her over $600+ and even more in Vail. So, this is wonderful for her since her biggest concern is for injuries.  She''s friends with Megan Brown and many of the others from ski racing.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-02-12 15:38:54', '2020-02-12 15:38:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046915018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044842469', 'Paula Fowke', NULL, '2-12-20 Explained how IUA works with her again. She was super appreciative. I think she finally gets it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-02-12 15:12:15', '2020-02-12 15:29:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046915013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044842469', 'Paula Fowke', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  Very eager member- she was unsure about how her IUA works.   I spent a lot of time with questions. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-12 14:41:43', '2020-02-12 14:41:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046915008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046972029', 'Erika Gutierrez', NULL, '2-12-20 Erika is 26 and just moved here from CA. Works with Catherine Brown as her new employee. Catherine will pay up to $300 towards Erika''s healthcare. Erika is healthy, no pre-x, no meds, no tobacco. She gets her annual wellness visit every year. She joined the PSDHC at $500/$269 a month with a March 1st start date. Erika will work out reimbursement with Catherine for her membership.  Enrollment complete and set to go. Super nice!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-02-12 13:43:40', '2020-02-12 13:43:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046915003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052864149', 'Catherine Brown', NULL, '2-12-20 Referred new employee Erika Guiterrez who is 26. Catherine is paying up to $300 towards her membership which covers the entire cost.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-02-12 13:29:23', '2020-02-12 13:29:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046883031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521512', 'Daniel Kaplan', NULL, 'Spoke to Daniel about HSA.  He wanted to know about investments.  I told him that we had a relationship w/HSA Bank however he could use any HSA provider.  He will research.  He also asked about 1095B''s and I explained.  He also said that he had changed his address back in Dec and spoke to a man here.  I verified his address but don''t know if address was ever shared w/ASi or Sedera so I emailed this information.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-02-12 12:56:36', '2020-02-12 12:56:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046877008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779188', 'Jason LaPointe', NULL, 'I have been meaning to put some notes in for Wendy, Jason''s wife. Wendy has come to me multiple multiple times in the past and recently now asking about the same things over and over again. All about her Preventative care services and what is covered and the process of going about that. I have explained and sent many many emails explaining in FULL detail what she needs to do. She has emailed me AGAIN asking about the same exact thing and what she needs to do in regards to getting her mammogram done. I have explained very vividly on how she needs to stay in the PHCS Network. I also want to note she is in Aspen CO, where the is barley ANY providers in the network for any kind of service, so it is very difficult to find providers that are nearby. So I have explained to her about the providers for her Preventative Services being in the PHCS Network and if not than she pays out of pocket and will only be reimbursed up to 130% of Medicare Allowable. I have also explained how she needs to have her regular provider (who HAS to be in the network as well) has to script her out to have a mammogram done. Usually that is done during her annual woman''s well visit. Again I stressed about being in the network and making sure everything is strictly Preventative and the billing HAS to be coded as such as well to be covered 100%. There are process''s that she needs to go through and she always says she gets it but comes right back to me with incorrect info or continuously asking what she needs to do. I am just at a loss of what else to say to her anymore, I am banging my head against the wall now. I get the wound closed and it starts to heal and then it re open''s the same exact way. Patti is going to be speaking with her whenever Wendy can give her a call back. Wendy emailed me asking about her mammogram once again but there was something else she was asking that did not make any sense to me so Patti called her and left a voicemail. Waiting for the call back. This has been back and forth for a couple months now.  -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-02-12 12:11:20', '2020-02-12 12:11:20'),
