  ('zcrm_1579374000046855003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044551026', 'Sharon Helden', NULL, 'Commission should go to Stuart Lubline', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-02-11 10:32:37', '2020-02-11 10:32:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046853003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000048165014', 'Cynthia Brown', NULL, '2-11-20 Cynthia is 58 and paying for  a full year for some other insurance that I''ve never heard of. Paying $4010.50 for full year. PDHC at $1000/$350 is $4200 a year but protects her better with lower IUA. She has high ded with other plan. The only thing she sees doctor for is HRT and that doctor makes her come in every year to run various new extensive tests just to replace the HRT again. Doctor isn''t fan of HRT and keeps trying to do more and more and Cynthia doesn''t want anything done except refill of prescription since it''s been working well for 12 years already. Lives in Hood River OR part of year and Mexico on ocean other part of year. Talking to me via satellite. She wants an April 1st start date bc that''s when her other plan renews. She will call me when it gets closer to the time and after she discusses it with her husband. She''s psyched to do this!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-02-11 10:28:16', '2020-02-11 10:28:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046841046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045438152', 'William Nichols', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 30 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-02-11 10:27:03', '2020-02-11 10:27:03'),
