  ('zcrm_1579374000046841008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045841317', 'Brian Koenigsknecht', NULL, 'Mailbox full. Not able to leave message. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-02-11 09:20:35', '2020-02-11 09:20:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046839013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038280403', 'Marne Gleason', NULL, 'Marne called in and asked who she needs to speak to about removing her pr-exisiting condition because she just found out through all the years she has been miss diagnosed. I asked Patti and she told me Marne needs to speak with Sedera. She will call them now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-02-11 09:15:18', '2020-02-11 09:15:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046841003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045798106', 'richard rosin', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-02-11 09:07:23', '2020-02-11 09:07:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046839008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010857102', 'Kimi Mischke', NULL, 'Kimi finally got back to me with her bills with the CPT codes on them along with her receipt that she paid and the letter from her provider stating that she had to have a special 3D Mammogram done for dense breast''s. Usually for a normal circumstance a member can not have that done as the regular mammogram screening, again unless otherwise written from their provider which she has. I sent everything over to Monica Lugo who is the head of the claims dept. with ASI. I tagged Kimi in the email so when Monica responds and is working on this everything will go directly to Kimi and myself. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-02-11 09:00:55', '2020-02-11 09:00:55');
