  ('zcrm_1579374000046776043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005271339', 'Christina KUB', NULL, 'address in CRM was incorrect- it is supposed to be 4007 not 4017.  I let Patti and Vanessa know. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-10 17:05:25', '2020-02-10 17:05:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046776038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005271339', 'Christina KUB', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  Christina is on the ball! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-10 16:59:11', '2020-02-10 16:59:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046760033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028466180', 'Sarah Pyper', NULL, 'I got this call transferred from Betties.  Member was looking for TeleDoc''s number, when I saw that she had Redirect told her that she needed to be in touch with Redirect for everything.  Said that she did not get MPB Cards and I told her that I would have another card sent to her.  She also said that she had no idea ho plan worked and I saw that she did not have a welcome call.  I sent out scheduler and stressed that she should spend 30 mins to do this and that dhe would understand things better after she did.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-02-10 14:08:18', '2020-02-10 14:08:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046776033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028466180', 'Sarah Pyper', NULL, 'she called when I was on the other line- I called back and left a message. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-10 14:05:14', '2020-02-10 14:05:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046776028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601222', 'Ashley Markison', NULL, 'Ashley called in for a refresher on preventive care- I went over everything involved and sent supporting emails. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-10 14:03:08', '2020-02-10 14:03:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046760028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041271490', 'Jerry Riechert', NULL, 'Member called in and spoke to Kelly C and she asked me how to handle: member children are going to CSU and need proof of "insurance" .  I called him back and explained what a challenge this was and emailed him Letter from Sedera.  He understands told him to call me if he had any other questions.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-02-10 13:34:59', '2020-02-10 13:34:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046776023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041271490', 'Jerry Riechert', NULL, 'Jerry called in for help with his sons needing proof of insurance for getting into Colorado State.  I spoke to Patti- she is going to send him that he can give the school explaining the plan that they have.  Patti is also going to give him a call to explain that it isn''t 100% that this will work for him and why.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-10 13:07:19', '2020-02-10 13:07:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046760023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041599023', 'Amber Neumann', NULL, 'Member submitted Member Change form to update address.  I update in CRM &amp; Sedera.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-02-10 12:39:10', '2020-02-10 12:39:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046760018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046762183', 'Stephen Berry', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $500 IUA 50-59 DPC', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-02-10 12:11:13', '2020-02-10 12:11:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046776018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038280403', 'Marne Gleason', NULL, 'Marne called sounding high.  She called us because she couldn''t get in touch with anyone at Sedera- she needs to see an ENT and wanted to know the next steps because this is concerning an open need.  I told her that I would reach out to them on her behalf but that they were probably in a meeting or very busy, but that someone would get back to her as soon as they could. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-10 11:57:03', '2020-02-10 11:57:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046776013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005711131', 'Maria Hart', NULL, 'member called to understand what her membership with us is.  She asked to cancel- I sent her a form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-10 11:54:24', '2020-02-10 11:54:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046776008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919419', 'Leo Goodman', NULL, 'Leo called back in to say that no one from Sedera has gotten back to him yet.  I told him that it was probably due to the fact that they were in a meeting since they had yet to respond to me reaching out on our shared social network.  I told him that they would get back to him by end of day. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-10 11:32:14', '2020-02-10 11:32:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046768041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045798207', 'Jordan Inda', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 30 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-02-10 11:26:32', '2020-02-10 11:26:32'),
