  ('zcrm_1579374000046768013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045841134', 'David Mason', NULL, 'Spoke to wife Brandi will book online the 30 minute welcome call.  Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-02-10 09:25:18', '2020-02-10 09:25:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046776003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919419', 'Leo Goodman', NULL, 'Leo called in saying that there has been "no movement" on his needs case that he opened and he wanted to know why- I asked if he knew the name of his needs coordinator and he did not.  I tried to transfer the call to Sedera but left a message on his behalf.  I also reached out via slack.  I told him that someone would be in touch with him later today. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-10 09:24:38', '2020-02-10 09:24:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046768008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045841172', 'Shoshana Kressler', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 30 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-02-10 09:20:16', '2020-02-10 09:20:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046768003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045889025', 'Laurie Testa', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-02-10 08:20:29', '2020-02-10 08:20:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046760003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035379141', 'Christopher Jackson', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel Sedera &amp; Billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-02-10 07:27:39', '2020-02-10 07:27:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046706023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026991117', 'Ryan Dunlap', NULL, 'Ryan called back in because his son''s dentist took xrays and told him that he would need to go to the ER- he just needed some reassurance in the process so I went over all protocol.  I also sent him a prescription med quote form just in case his son was sent home with scripts. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-07 15:47:42', '2020-02-07 15:47:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046706018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008973005', 'Richard Brown', NULL, 'Member called to cancel- sent link-tagged Jane- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-07 15:46:37', '2020-02-07 15:46:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046732008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005011261', 'Jodi Ayers', NULL, '2-7-20 Talked with Jodi to let her know Autumn''s membership Might not be compliant but we have a compliant solution that will be effective May 1st that we can switch her to at that time. She will take her chances and understands how difficult it is to work with CA. Her biz they''ve stopped bc of all of the regulations.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-02-07 15:36:05', '2020-02-07 15:36:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046732003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047153471', 'Thomas Ferguson', NULL, '2-7-20 Sam just turned 49. He''s a paraplegic but only went to dr. 1x last year for a cut, plus wellness visit, no meds, no DME or anything. He''s paying $800 for Anthem now with $6K ded and ready to switch asap after he reads the information.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-02-07 15:33:23', '2020-02-07 15:33:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046706013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026991117', 'Ryan Dunlap', NULL, 'his son was playing hockey and a puck smashed him in the face and he knocked out a tooth.  He wanted some direction on what to do- on whether to go to urgent care or the ER- I told him that he could go to either depending on  the severity.  Present as Cash pay and ask for cash discount- be sure to ask for the detailed medical bill along with the cash receipt.  Ryan still wasn''t sure of what to do so I suggested that his son use the Teladoc Service to get an MD''s opinion on what steps he needed to take.   Ryan thought that would be a good place to start.  I reminded him of his IUA. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-07 14:51:10', '2020-02-07 14:51:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046706008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035379141', 'Christopher Jackson', NULL, 'called to cancel- sent link and copied Andrea- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-07 14:04:40', '2020-02-07 14:04:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046720008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006164215', 'Karen Bonnanzio', NULL, 'Received cancellation cancelled subscription', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-02-07 13:41:53', '2020-02-07 13:41:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046721003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046719031', 'Nisha Kotecha', NULL, 'Member will be getting PSD plan - Member only, $1500 IUA, Start date 3/1/2020', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2020-02-07 13:16:12', '2020-02-07 13:16:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046720003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006164215', 'Karen Bonnanzio', NULL, 'Member called into verify her cancellation.  Didn''t know she had to cancel with us separately.  I email link to form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-02-07 13:13:21', '2020-02-07 13:13:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046706003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045889059', 'David Norris', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-07 12:22:40', '2020-02-07 12:22:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046702003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647211', 'Jacqueline Woodward', NULL, 'Jackie called in and she needed to know what the process was for submitting some claims that she had. They are all injury/illness related. I explained the process to her about submitting everything into Sedera. I sent her the email that also explains how to do that and to call Sedera as soon as she can. She will get on that now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-02-07 11:40:33', '2020-02-07 11:40:33'),
