  ('zcrm_1579374000046648013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650515', 'Ashton Harvey', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  Ashton has a pretty good understanding for just starting out in the program. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-06 18:00:36', '2020-02-06 18:00:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046609010', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045821700', 'Judith Snyder', NULL, '2-6-20 I informed Patti and John -  I just discovered the zip code for my client Judith and Jeff Snyder was showing wrong in the CRM. It was showing an 8 in stead of a 3 at the beginning. The only reason I discovered this is because I''m sending them business cards to market my services and the zip wouldn''t work. At any rate, if you sent a packet to them it''s not going to get there, I presume. Just a heads up! You will need to resend it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-02-06 17:26:46', '2020-02-06 17:26:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046609005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059427020', 'Doug Lewis', NULL, '2-6-20 Doug is 56 and Kelly turning 50 sometime soon. Doug is healthy and Kelly has some issues. She got a flu many years ago about 8 years ago which kicked off a thyroid problem which lead to stomach issues and traditional medicine hasn''t helped. She''s gone holistic lately. Doesn''t go to dr. much now and manages it on her own with vitamin, diet, etc. Obviously they are super active all the time. They are paying $1000 month now and PDHC is $625/$1500. He will put Kelly in touch with me next and knows of the 20th deadline.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-02-06 16:32:05', '2020-02-06 16:32:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046648008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013330097', 'Craig Nelson', NULL, 'Craig called in for a copy of the original cancellation email that we sent him so that he can print it as evidence to show the new insurance company so he could start with them.  I told him that I could not see it on my limited Concierge end- and that I did not have access to private emails.  While I was looking high and low for the email - he told me that today was the first day he realized that he hadn''t had coverage the last few months and that his argument was a good one, but that no one wanted to listen.  I told him that I didn''t know about what has transpired and that Patti would call him back tomorrow. I slacked a message about this to Patti- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-06 16:15:17', '2020-02-06 16:15:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046617048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036082029', 'Brea Judge', NULL, 'Received task from John to cancel this employee.  I will cancel Redirect &amp; Sedera &amp; Let Tricia know of cancellation.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-02-06 14:08:20', '2020-02-06 14:08:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046617043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013330097', 'Craig Nelson', NULL, 'Member called in and  wanted to know if he could change his payment information, I advised him that he was cancelled as of 12/1/19 because he put a stop payment on the Dec payment.  He asked if we could re-instate this plan.  I told him no because we were not enrolling individuals in the plan that he was in anymore.  I directed him to Kevin Michaels to go over options  available to him.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-02-06 13:25:53', '2020-02-06 13:25:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046617038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001746016', 'Kristen Brown', NULL, 'Member called in and submitted cancellation request says she hasn''t been a Liberty member since 1/2018.  I will refund February pmt', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-02-06 12:52:06', '2020-02-06 12:52:06'),
