  ('zcrm_1579374000046617023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740100', 'Rossana Johnston', NULL, 'Member called in and asked why the price went up.  I advised that there was a price increase over the summer.  She told me that plan was too "fractured".  I explained that an email was sent out to her last summer. She came back that she had shopped around with that "dummy" email.  I told her no that this was the email that she applied with.  I will update her email.  She said that she hadn''t used to plan in the 2 yrs that she had been a member and that I recommended that she do another welcome call I will ask Vanessa to resend  scheduler.  I explained need process to her & IUA.  I have asked Kelly to order her a new ASi Card & resend the Rate Change email.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-02-06 11:49:13', '2020-02-06 11:49:13'),
