  ('zcrm_1579374000046616003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044118245', 'Christopher Villinger', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 30 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-02-06 08:11:05', '2020-02-06 08:11:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046568043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885296', 'David Steiner', NULL, 'David called in with more questions about how his entire plan worked.  I took a lot of time answering his questions the best I could- he alluded to therapist or counseling and he wanted to know if it would be covered.  I told him that he should download the guidelines I would be sending him to look up more specifics and if he still needed help he should give Sedera a call.  He was so upside down about how his IUA worked that I went through Wendy''s definition from the welcome call script.  He said that it helped.  He mentioned having his IUA lowered and I told him that I would reach out to Wendy about it. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-05 18:35:54', '2020-02-05 18:35:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046568038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039786025', 'Mary A. Waggener', NULL, 'Jennifer Chasteen reached out to Mary prompting her to submit her well womens visit claim because they had never received it. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-05 16:49:00', '2020-02-05 16:49:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046568033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993227', 'Catherine Young', NULL, 'Catherine called to make sure that her mammogram was covered.  Her account was showing her as partially sd and that she had APEX. - so I advised her as such.  SHE HAS REDIRECT HEALTH  I reached out to Jennifer about going over Catherine''s benefits and in network and tagged Wendy.   Thank goodness Wendy got back to me and Jennifer to let us know that Catherine has actually had Redirect since Sept 2019. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-05 16:45:43', '2020-02-05 16:45:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046568028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037657007', 'Mary Evans', NULL, 'Mary called to ask if dermatology was one of her benefits because her son needs to make an appointment soon- I told her that it wasn''t one of the services mandated by the ACA- BUT she does have the benefit of having Redirect and their negotiating powers! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-05 16:33:58', '2020-02-05 16:33:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046568023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045889059', 'David Norris', NULL, 'a "Kristi" called from a doctors office to verify benefits- I told her that it isn''t how his plan works.  That he needed to call redirect for all appointments and medical needs. I told her that I would reach out to him.  I just sent him an email with Redirect''s phone number and I also sent him a scheduler so that her can go through a welcome call. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-05 16:02:38', '2020-02-05 16:02:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046590008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993160', 'Karen Peirson', NULL, '2-5-20 Eric and Karen called to better understand their new membership with PDHC with Redirect. They asked about out of country services with Redirect and panicked bc Redirect told them they don''t cover anything internationally. I explained they still have Sedera which protects them for intl and all big health issues. They feel happy now. They are going to try to get reimbursed for immunizations for kids since redirect didn''t respond fast enough to pay for it! They hadn''t responded in the 6 days and they made it clear the time frame they needed.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-02-05 15:47:21', '2020-02-05 15:47:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046568018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044758155', 'Natalie Jex-Landoe', NULL, 'Welcome call complete! KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-05 15:33:24', '2020-02-05 15:33:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046590003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007272051', 'Annie Zrubek', NULL, '2-5-20 Annie is going to think over switching. She''s struggling with paying an additional $100 a month but also loves the unlimited Primary Care Doc visits to address the small stuff. She also kept fighting to get $180 reimbursed for mammogram and gave up. She''s due for another mammogram and I told her to wait which she will do. She''s a single mom and needs to save money wherever she can.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-02-05 15:08:42', '2020-02-05 15:08:42'),
