  ('zcrm_1579374000046525008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650615', 'Naomi Gagnon', NULL, 'Called in and said when she was setting up her appt with her new primary care doctor (I checked and they are in network) they asked for an insurance card. I explained to her that it is not insurance but the card that she will be presenting is her RCI card. She had it right in hand and I explained what she will need to do and sent her an email that explains how she is going to present herself and her card to the provider. She was very thankful and said she is loving this new alternative to insurance! -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-02-04 09:51:02', '2020-02-04 09:51:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046531008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044758208', 'Hillary Bolle', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to schedule the 30 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-02-04 09:31:40', '2020-02-04 09:31:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046531003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650322', 'Kathryn McGaughey', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-02-04 09:21:35', '2020-02-04 09:21:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046525003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885296', 'David Steiner', NULL, 'David called in and wanted to know if there was any coverage for him having to get physical therapy. I explained to him the process of starting a "Need" with Sedera and about what his IUA is and how that works in regards to his "Need". I told him I will send him and email that explains how to submit his bills into Sedera and their phone number is in the email if he has any further questions about starting the process. He also wanted to know if it is possible to lower his IUA to $500 and I let him know that there is a specific time he can do that which will be in July and emails will be sent out beforehand that will explain how he can go about doing that. Thanked me and said that answered all of his questions. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-02-04 08:48:03', '2020-02-04 08:48:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046515008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043354017', 'Buddy Johnson', NULL, 'Spouse Sara called in and asked to update payment information.  I sent link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-02-04 08:10:08', '2020-02-04 08:10:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046515003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027741461', 'Michael Tyburczy', NULL, 'Member called in and asked if he could have a HSA with his present plan.  I advised that he could not have one since he had the Self Directed plan.  He asked if I had any advice of getting out of a HSA if he had one?  I directed him to his accountant.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-02-04 07:55:44', '2020-02-04 07:55:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046487028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044486244', 'Buffy Lloyd-Krejci', NULL, 'Buffy did not want another welcome call- she just had leftover questions and sign ups that hadn''t gone smoothly for her.  She was most confused about the QR life codes and Preventive care.  I went over it all with her.  Much happier!!!! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-03 17:38:27', '2020-02-03 17:38:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046487023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005011261', 'Jodi Ayers', NULL, 'Welcome Call Complete!  Jodi called in between calls and I completed her welcome call with her.  She had a good understanding of her plan. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-03 16:00:13', '2020-02-03 16:00:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046487018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045821744', 'Scott Wingfield', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  Heidi and Scott present for the call- hardly any questions- good understanding of the product. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-03 14:46:12', '2020-02-03 14:46:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046487013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005011261', 'Jodi Ayers', NULL, 'Called Jodi for 30 min welcome call and left a vm. - I told her that if it was still a good time for her that she could give me a call back in the next 15 min - if not, no problem- I will send her out another reschedule. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-02-03 13:34:11', '2020-02-03 13:34:11'),
