  ('zcrm_1579374000046487003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015735109', 'Steve Moeller', NULL, 'Steve called in and told me that his wife has a spot on her leg and wanted to know if there was any "coverage"  I advised no that that would be an out of pocket expense.  Told him to present as cash pay and if it turned into some "condition" that they would come out of pocket $1500 prior to opening a need.- PB', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-02-03 11:40:26', '2020-02-03 11:40:26'),
