  ('zcrm_1579374000046403056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000167691', 'Catherine Dailey', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 632 
Question : I need to update my autopay in my account - can you help me see where to do that online?', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2020-02-01 16:32:03', '2020-02-01 16:32:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046398086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011509065', 'Joy Kelley', NULL, 'Joy called in upset that the ENT her doctor told her to go to told her over the phone that if her son needed surgery that she would have to be flipped from self pay to insurance.  Joy wanted to know what information to give them when asked about insurance.  I told her multiple times, that she is cash pay- and never pay more than her IUA- I made it very clear that if the Dr. looks at her son and says "we need to do emergency surgery NOW" then she should follow his advice and head to the ER- she quickly told me that she didn''t think that it was the case.  So I told her to present as cash pay, ask for a discount- if the Doctor recommends a non emergent surgery she needs to get a hold of Sedera so that she can be walked through this process and go through the 2nd MD program.  I asked if she wanted to be transferred to someone there and she declined.  I had her write down their phone number and well as sent the how to submit bills email.  She was very on edge with her sons apt in 20 min.  I told her to stick to the plan that I laid out for her, and that I would contact Sedera on her behalf and ask that someone reach out to her to give her an extra helping hand.  She appreciated that. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-31 15:57:41', '2020-01-31 15:57:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046434023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000919219', 'Leigh Gannan', NULL, '1-31-20 Leigh called me bc Redirect isn''t showing all family members on membership. I told her to call Concierge on Monday if Redirect doesn''t get it sorted out for her. They did tell her they need to call the "employer" to figure it out.  Right now Redirect only sees Leigh on the account.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-31 15:57:40', '2020-01-31 15:57:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046398081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045798150', 'Robin Smith', NULL, 'Robin called in distraught because she accidentally erased all emails from Vanessa today!  I told her that it wasn''t a problem, that I would resend everything that Vanessa sent....the only thing that I couldn''t resend would be the checklist- so I reminded her to go to MPoweringbenefits.com- put in the secret code and click on the Redirect button to make it a YES, and that way she can utilize links and instructions online.  she sounded pretty happy and relieved!  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-31 15:39:40', '2020-01-31 15:39:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046398076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028177143', 'Heidi Piper', NULL, 'I gave her another call back and she told me that someone from home office handled her problem "brilliantly"! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-31 14:27:09', '2020-01-31 14:27:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046422021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028177143', 'Heidi Piper', NULL, 'Patti got a hold of the member through the betties calling. She needed help with a prescription. She is at the pharmacy as we speak and needed help. She didn''t know what the process was. Pattie transferred the call over to John to look up a coupon for her. He got her one and had it texted to her phone. Happy member. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-01-31 14:20:54', '2020-01-31 14:20:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046398071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028177143', 'Heidi Piper', NULL, 'I tried calling her back but it went to her voicemail. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-31 14:14:07', '2020-01-31 14:14:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046434018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028177143', 'Heidi Piper', NULL, '1-31-20 Heidi called for assistance with a medication. She''s in the pharmacy right now. I gave her the Concierge # to call.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-31 14:10:38', '2020-01-31 14:10:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046422016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011509065', 'Joy Kelley', NULL, 'Joy called in very upset(not at us) because her son lodged a bead into his ear. She does not want to pay thousands of dollars for something like this so she called to see if we have any places to recommend to her that are not going to cost her an arm and a leg. I told her the only thing I can suggest is an Urgent Care. They are a LOT cheaper than any hospital and can do that type of procedure. I called one of the urgent care places that are in her area with the zip code on file for her and they said just to be seen will be $140 and there will be other costs after that for the actual extraction of the bead. That was the best I could do for her. She was thankful for me looking that up and calling and will take him over there now. Her pediatrician of course was not in office today. She was upset, understandably. I did the best I could, she thanked me for trying for her. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-01-31 14:10:14', '2020-01-31 14:10:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046431023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012024161', 'Timothy Kratz Jr', NULL, 'Member called and provided new CC Payment method. Updated FTNI, ran February payment and updated his address.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-01-31 12:38:56', '2020-01-31 12:38:56'),
