  ('zcrm_1579374000046413019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046071074', 'Lauri Dykstra', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-01-31 11:03:12', '2020-01-31 11:03:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046422006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031810039', 'Morgan Adams', NULL, 'Tom Adams (Morgans father) and explained to me a billing issue that has been going on with his daughter and her preventative gynecology visit. He sent me the email Morgan sent in. There is nothing else that I can do on my end with this situation. Morgan has already taken the correct steps in who she should be speaking with and what her next steps are. I apologized and said she is already doing what I would have done if she came to me first. I wished him the best of luck and I hope everything will sort itself out. I will post the email she sent that has all the info on what is going on in it. 
Hello,
I received a statement dated 1/18/2020 from RCI with an explanation of benefits and a total to be paid of $1,116. The insurance did not cover any portion of the bill.

    Claim # 0004170959
    Patient # 16562940V2017

 The statement is from a gynecologist visit on August 5th, 2019. I saw the provider Dr. Jaclyn Kolosky (NPI #1174941173). The statement says that Dr. Kolosky is an out of network provider, however, the PHCS in-network provider search said otherwise. Had I even the slightest inclination she was an “out of network” provider – I would not have gone to the visit.

 I contacted the phone number listed on the statement (308-635-2260) and spoke with a representative named Anna. She confirmed that she could also see Dr. Kolosky listed as an in-network provider and would contact PHCS to hopefully re-price the statement.

 Anna has now informed me that PHCS still refuses to assume responsibility for the error and I am to pay the $1,116 myself. The next step would be to contact PHCS and file a dispute. The number she gave me is: 888-342-7427.

I hope you are able to understand my frustrations as I did everything by the book to find an in network provider. $350 was deducted from my account monthly so that a routine gynecologist visit would be covered without this headache.

Please inform both myself, and father Tom Adams, as to what the next step in this process is.

Thank you.
Morgan Adams

D.O.B. 12/16/1994

Phone Number: 720-209-9212 

-KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-01-31 10:50:23', '2020-01-31 10:50:23'),
