  ('zcrm_1579374000046384018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032601403', 'Christine Kennedy', NULL, 'Christine called in because she wanted to make sure that her primary care doctor in OH is in network.  She said that she goes there for her annual and asks for a refill of pain tablets- she wanted to know if that would be a problem.  I told her that it might, but guided her through the process.  I told her to say that she was there for her wellness visit and needed a refill on her pain meds.  I told her to be upfront.  I told her that it could be an issue.  I went over all preventive care protocol and tips, and went through all of them while I was on the phone with her. She thanked me for all of the advice and for guiding her through the process- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-30 15:03:20', '2020-01-30 15:03:53'),
