  ('zcrm_1579374000046384008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990381', 'Elena Garet', NULL, 'Elena wanted to know who to put as her employer for her HSA account.  I told her MPowering Benefits. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-30 14:11:41', '2020-01-30 14:11:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046384003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045841227', 'Theresa Goins', NULL, 'Welcome Call Complete!  I answered a lot of questions, but Theresa already has a handle on how her program works.  I told her that she can call in with any questions about the different mailings and emails that are in the process of getting to her! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-30 12:52:13', '2020-01-30 12:52:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046348008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819216', 'Rebecca Brignole', NULL, 'Member called in asking how much she was paying every month and from what account this was being drawn from.  She then asked about receipts and I told her that she gets a receipt every when the $ get drawn.  She then asked about what she would get every year from us.  I explained 1099 to her and told her it would just be for her records.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-01-30 12:43:32', '2020-01-30 12:43:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046377008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041185005', 'James Roberts', NULL, 'James unfortunately called in and stated he just had a heart attack..... He said he was calling to see if there is anything he should do before he leaves the hospital. He said he is going to be ok but just wanted to make sure he was doing everything correctly. I went over the Needs process with Sedera and how all that works with his IUA and submitting the bills into Sedera and starting a Need with them. He said was familiar with that process already and just wanted to  make sure. I gave him Sedera''s phone number to told him to call the right away after he gets off the phone with me and let them know what just happened so they can help him and walk him through the process. I made it clear to him to make sure he keeps all of his receipts of proof of payment towards his $500 IUA, then to ask the provider to bill him the remainder. He will then have to submit everything into Sedera and they will walk him through the rest of the process. He understood everything as he has done all of that in the past. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-01-30 12:42:22', '2020-01-30 12:42:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046377003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044406197', 'Suzanne Muller', NULL, 'Suzanne called in and spoke with Patti about Teladoc. She asked if her address has been updated from when she called in and changed it on January 15th with Kelly Cheever. Patti read to her what we have and that was correct. So Patti told her the only thing Suzanne can do is go in and try and register. If she has an issue to call Patti back on her direct line and let her know, Patti will then contact Sedera and let them know the issue and Patti will let Suzanne know what was said. -PB/KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-01-30 12:01:57', '2020-01-30 12:01:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046355041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005030048', 'John Chamberlin', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-01-30 11:31:33', '2020-01-30 11:31:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046355036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045889096', 'Samantha Wilson', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-01-30 10:51:02', '2020-01-30 10:51:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046355016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043608685', 'Christian Hager', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-01-30 09:47:26', '2020-01-30 09:47:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046355011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045821781', 'Leeanne Whittaker', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule the 30 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-01-30 09:08:19', '2020-01-30 09:08:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046355003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045739067', 'Rachel Namordi', NULL, 'Welcome call complete.Updated address on file. Member not in front of computer at time of the call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-01-30 08:44:44', '2020-01-30 08:52:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046354003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013475051', 'Krista Wilson', NULL, 'February payment refunded.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-01-30 08:31:10', '2020-01-30 08:31:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046348003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013475051', 'Krista Wilson', NULL, 'After calling in after hours I sent this member link to the cancellation form.  She submitted and I will cancel ASi &amp; Sedera and pmt in FTNI.  I have requested Sunny to refund the Feb pmt.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-01-30 08:07:13', '2020-01-30 08:07:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046328018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016570002', 'Michael Wisner', NULL, 'Member asked his primary care dr if he could get the vax listed below at his office and the response was "no, because I never get reimbursed for them.  I send my patients to drugstores and pharmacies instead."  I scoured multiplan''s site for this guy!  and came up completely empty handed- no clinics, or pharmacies.  I told Michael that it looked like because he lived in one of "those" areas- that he would have to pay out of pocket, make sure that the vax are coded preventive, grab the itemized bill along with cash receipt and then send it all to ASI.  I told him that they would pay 130% medicare allowable- which meant that probably not all, but most of the bill would be covered. I also sent Preventive care emails because he didn''t know what and ASI card was.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-29 17:47:33', '2020-01-29 17:47:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046328013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039567010', 'Adam Pollock', NULL, 'Adam called in to state that he has been diagnosed with pneumonia and wanted to know how to open up a need with Sedera.  I guided him to the app as well as gave Sedera''s number if he had any further questions. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-29 16:08:35', '2020-01-29 16:08:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046328008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027741557', 'Ethan Pajak', NULL, 'he was just getting started with uploading Alison''s pre natal care and needed some hand holding.  it was much appreciated. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-29 16:04:39', '2020-01-29 16:04:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046310013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034085163', 'Teresa Baker', NULL, 'Teresa called in and she needed some help on finding a few providers for her preventative appointment''s. There are 3 she gave me names and ALL 3 of them came up in the network with the address she provided me as well!! I was honestly shocked because that never happens where every single provider that she gave me all came up AND the addresses. She needed a Gastroenterologist, Internist, and OBGYN. She is all set on using them for her preventative appt''s. I explained in detail what he next steps are going to be and using her RCI card and about the customer service #''s on the back of the card and right next to that will be a P.O Box address that all the billing and claims will be sent to . I sent her a few educational emails as well like how to present herself at her wellness visits, 5 steps for preventative billing, the provider network search tool and attached to that the 64+ preventative services that are mandated by the ACA. She was very very happy for the help and is looking forward to having her appt''s and what not. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-01-29 14:15:11', '2020-01-29 14:15:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046328003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810440', 'Erin Nissen', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  I helped her find her family''s doctor in network.  She took lots of notes.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-29 14:05:37', '2020-01-29 14:05:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046302045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017830047', 'Robert Chavez', NULL, 'Member submitted change of payment form. FTNI updated', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-01-29 13:15:08', '2020-01-29 13:15:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046316003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046294057', 'Holly Goldstein', NULL, '1-29-20 I just spoke with Holly and she apologized for her behavior with Vanessa. She was having a bad morning due to dealing with her mom who had a stroke recently. Holly said she gets it now. I simplified it drastically for her to call Redirect when she''s not in an emergency situation and MPB when questions about all aspects of membership. Always self-pay patient. She understands now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-29 10:21:43', '2020-01-29 10:21:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046312008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046294057', 'Holly Goldstein', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Member completely confused. On phone for over  1 hour.   Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-01-29 10:18:16', '2020-01-29 10:18:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046312003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046294057', 'Holly Goldstein', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-01-29 09:24:43', '2020-01-29 09:24:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046310008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017243610', 'Paula Chavez', NULL, 'Needed to make sure the updates she made with her banking and billing is correct. Sent over to Sunny. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-01-29 08:31:09', '2020-01-29 08:31:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046310003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000023207130', 'Monica Robinson', NULL, 'Monica called in and said she has just gotten a bill in the mail from her preventative wellness visit and does not know why. She is very frustrated because she does the same thing every year, same provider and everything and there has never been a problem. The provider IS in the network, I checked while on the phone, and she said the provider has all of her information from her RCI card on file and what not. This is nothing new, nothing has changed it is all the same as before. She is frustrated that she has gotten billed for this. After going over everything with her in regards to making sure everything was done correctly and making sure it was all preventative only the only thing I can think of is the provider coded it incorrectly. If that is the case it is an easy fix of her simply contacting the provider and telling them this and ask to re code everything as preventative and re submit everything. I asked her to send me the bill she has with the CPT codes in it and I will send it over to someone at RCI and tag her in the thread so she can stay up to date and whomever at RCI will be talking with her directly. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-01-29 08:30:16', '2020-01-29 08:30:16'),
