  ('zcrm_1579374000046290003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675034', 'Faith Ketterer', NULL, 'Kelly F transferred this member to me and Guy as she was not understanding what she was trying to tell her.  She had 2 issues that she needed clarification on.
1. Mammogram 2. Blood work.  She said that PCP wanted to draw blood in his office and "send it out".  Guy and I told her that this could be problematic since we wouldn''t know where it was being sent and if they were in the network.  We advised to just get the scrip and go to LabCorp or Quest.  Didn''t know anything about them.  We explained.  Mammogram - I went over that it could only be Screening Mammogram Kelly F looked up facility and they were in network so we thought she was good to go but I guess not.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-01-29 07:05:00', '2020-01-29 07:05:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046238040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990450', 'Douglas Holderread', NULL, 'Doug called in with a few "super bills" from his preventive care visit.  It turns out that even though his doctor is showing up as in network they only except cash.  So I told him to take a picture of the bills and send them to claims@asibenefits.com I told him that they would reimburse the 130% medicare allowable. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-28 18:07:59', '2020-01-28 18:07:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046243044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003848047', 'Aine Carlisle', NULL, '1-28-20 Left vm for Aine just now to discuss possible switch to MPB Assoc from LHS.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-28 16:34:38', '2020-01-28 16:34:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046243039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032561377', 'Kristi Celico', NULL, '1-28-20 Called Apex/RCI to cancel membership. Fortunately they told her to call me. Sent her the link to cancel. She got a new job that will pay for her health ins entirely! Super nice and wants to refer people to me still.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-28 16:17:20', '2020-01-28 16:17:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046243034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046294057', 'Holly Goldstein', NULL, '1-28-20 Holly also joined Anthem for the month of Feb. since missed deadline for MPB Assoc. Joined Anthem Bronze Mountain Enhanced X HMO 6000
