  ('zcrm_1579374000046243024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000047238350', 'Amy Wentworth', NULL, '1-28-20 Amy is 46, healthy, no tobacco, only takes bc which may get off of soon. She''s been in corporate world for last 10 years and been with group plans. Lives in Eagle, CO, so recommended PDHC so don''t have to deal with network. She likes that and does the wellness visits at PCP in Eagle. She will possibly add her son if it makes sense. But, ex is paying through exchange and ex makes $30K-$40K, so likely gets good subsidy. She will figure out what''s best. She knows of Feb. 20th deadline for March 1st. She can get onto Cobra for Feb.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-28 15:57:42', '2020-01-28 15:57:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046243019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006532233', 'Vickie Hunt', NULL, 'Called Vicki and left a message to call me back - gave her my availability', 'Jane Kassel', 'Jane Kassel', '2020-01-28 15:38:04', '2020-01-28 15:38:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046238035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675034', 'Faith Ketterer', NULL, 'Faith called to go over an EOB as well as a lab order for someone to go over to let her know if it will be covered or not.  She says that the office is stating that it is coded correctly.  I asked her to send both to me...and I would send them over to ASI.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-28 15:18:03', '2020-01-28 15:18:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046243014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046294057', 'Holly Goldstein', NULL, '1-28-20 Enrolling now for PDHC. The documents I sent were super helpful in her understanding. She''s joining $1000/$312 at age 48.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-28 15:05:57', '2020-01-28 15:05:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046246003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471317', 'John Kline', NULL, 'This is an email that I got from Ross(John) today. I replied and told them what to expect for how the Need''s process works and sent him the email on how to submit bills to Sedera. I told him to call Sedera ASAP if he knows this will exceed his IUA. -KF

