  ('zcrm_1579374000046223028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016570002', 'Michael Wisner', NULL, 'Member called in and wanted to know if Shingles Vacc, DPT vac and Flu vac would be covered.  I advised that it would be better if he would have it done by his provider.  I advised if he does have it done at local drug store it would be out of pocket. -PB', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-01-28 11:33:55', '2020-01-28 12:11:22'),
