  ('zcrm_1579374000046148048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881581', 'Jason (Jay) Wright', NULL, 'February bounced back due to NSF. Per member''s request,m I re-tried the payment as he stated the funds from his old account did not transfer on time for the payment but are there now.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-01-28 08:34:22', '2020-01-28 08:34:22'),
