  ('zcrm_1579374000046216013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044725004', 'Richard Zimmerman', NULL, 'New Plan eff 2/1/20: Member &amp; Fam  $1500 IUA 40-49 SD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-01-28 07:49:00', '2020-01-28 07:49:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046216008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044725004', 'Richard Zimmerman', NULL, 'Member is requesting to be changed from PSD to SD.  I will cancel RCI &amp; have Sunny refund difference of $96.  I will create task to change commissions.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-01-28 07:48:13', '2020-01-28 07:48:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046216003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044725004', 'Richard Zimmerman', NULL, 'Dear Wendy,

Hi.. a couple weeks have passed by, but our last conversation was about switching my family Health plan to be Self-directed vs Partially -directed. This decision came after I explored during the welcome call the options in my area(Southern Oregon) to use the Obamacare portion of coverage and found very few providers.

I noticed I was billed for Partially-directed for Feb. Is this still an option to switch? 
I know it brings the cost down about $100 per month, which I would like to use to go to a DR. of my choice.

Thanks for your input,

Ann Zimmerman', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-01-28 07:41:40', '2020-01-28 07:41:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046202028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043386031', 'Robert Eberlein', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  I stayed on the phone with both Robert and Kathleen for an hour!  They had many questions but I was happy to answer all of them! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-27 18:17:56', '2020-01-27 18:17:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046191047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650083', 'Meghan Van Vleet', NULL, '1-27-20 Meghan has $597 and $472 charges for Jan. and Feb. But, Jan. was charged late bc of problem with account so it looked like too many charges in one month. She understands now that it''s for 2 months and she''s all set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-27 16:38:59', '2020-01-27 16:38:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046202023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018451009', 'Kay Sasser', NULL, 'called to cancel- sent online form and tagged Wendy.- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-27 16:19:10', '2020-01-27 16:19:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046191032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650083', 'Meghan Van Vleet', NULL, '1-27-20 Asking about 2 fees. I mentioned the 2 initial fees when joined but perhaps she was charged 2 fees for Feb? I''m not sure.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-27 16:05:36', '2020-01-27 16:05:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046202018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043608754', 'Dana Schwartz Watts', NULL, 'David called in and wanted to know about where to send his billing and get reimbursed, at first I thought RCI- then after reading Kelly F''s notes I told him to take pictures and send them to us.  I told him that home office may want the actual bills but that he could do this for now.  He understood.  He also says that it is showing in his patient portal  (from his primary care Dr office) that he owes an excess of $350 on "things that should be covered "  he asked where to send that.  I told him that he could take a screenshot and send it to me and I would get it to the day crew since they have been working on this already.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-27 15:58:44', '2020-01-27 15:58:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046202013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165388', 'Kimberly Baldwin', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  Kimberly is on the ball with everything already!  I told her that she could call back anytime with questions concerning all mailings/emails/cards she is going to get.  -  KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-27 15:33:24', '2020-01-27 15:33:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046191027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001245005', 'Linda Nelson', NULL, '1-27-20 Linda hasn''t had any of her health issues paid for by LHS but not willing to pay more money for membership for PDHC. Also not wiling to go to SDHC with highest IUA $5000/$189 since LHS seems like it gives you so much more. She will ponder SDHC and let me know or check in with me in May or June about our new Care products if those can bring the cost down enough. But, she''s 59 and turning 60 in 1 year where price jumps as well. She hasn''t seen the prices for Marketplace and wants to pay $100 for catastrophic coverage which doesn''t exist now. She has meniere''s disease as pre-x now that LHS wouldn''t share cost. Lives in FL and ME.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-27 15:23:55', '2020-01-27 15:23:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046147041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045376098', 'Ryan Nelson', NULL, '4TH QR Code: H0HN3 for child Curtis Nelson. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-01-27 14:28:50', '2020-01-27 14:28:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046202008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005150013', 'Pamela Shriver', NULL, 'called to get a handle on what services we provide monthly.  she is unsure if she is going to stay with the plan, she had more pressing questions about billing, she found it odd that if we were no longer with Liberty HS then why would we have Liberty HS all over her billing.  I told her that was probably due to the fact that she is in our records as actually having Liberty.  I transferred the line to Sunny. and will email her this as well. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-27 14:26:30', '2020-01-27 14:26:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046191016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046217307', 'Heather Weidner', NULL, '1-27-20 Has Golden Rule which is now United Health One indemnity plan that she didn''t realize it was super limited. Had an ER visit which was due to problem with IUD which has been removed and insurance paid for nothing or $200 total. Missed open enrollment and Isabel Rittberg highly recommended MPB. Paying for PSDHC $500/$296 now until turns 40 and it''s $322 month. Enrollment complete!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-27 14:25:50', '2020-01-27 15:05:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046147036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810797', 'Chris Massey', NULL, 'Previous QR Code:H0266 Changed to Redirect. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-01-27 14:24:03', '2020-01-27 14:24:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046202003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810769', 'Erik Boller', NULL, 'Welcome call with both Jennifer and Erik complete.  They were completely caught off guard about their IUA and how it is per need and not a culmination of different needs.  This shocked them so much there was a moment of silence.  Jennifer and Erik shook it off with a positive attitude.  Also asked Patti to ask RCI to resend cards- they never got them. They did however receive our cards and letter. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-27 13:41:38', '2020-01-27 13:41:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046201008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045805015', 'Autumn Ricksecker', NULL, 'Hi Wendy,


Please change my membership to the Partially Self Directed Healthcare at the $1500 IUA level for $243 a month in order to remain compliant with the CA healthcare mandates. Please confirm.


Thank you,
Autumn Ayers', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-01-27 13:31:22', '2020-01-27 13:31:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046201003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037657007', 'Mary Evans', NULL, 'I sent Mary out the Request for Waiver of Insurance letter that was supplied by Sedera.  I advised her that we have had mixed results with this letter.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-01-27 13:28:02', '2020-01-27 13:28:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046147031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045806225', 'Mark Johnson', NULL, '4TH QR Code for child Deven Johnson: H0K3G', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-01-27 13:24:29', '2020-01-27 13:24:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046191011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045805015', 'Autumn Ricksecker', NULL, '1-27-20 Reminded Patti to upgrade Autumn''s account to PSDHC bc lives in CA and Autumn sent official request last week or so. Patti will work on it tomorrow.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-27 12:54:42', '2020-01-27 12:54:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046191003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046294057', 'Holly Goldstein', NULL, '1-27-20 She is visual learner and really struggling to understand how this works. May want traditional insurance. Was on Aliera/Trinity which has now been banned from CO. C4 has created new open enrollment for these people. Cheapest Anthem is $531.44. Holly is now 48, healthy, no tobacco, takes Adavan on occasion for anxiety. Tried explaining PDHC to her and super confused. Doesn''t know who to call when and what to do or say and struggled to listen to my explanation since she needs to see it in writing. I sent her all supporting documents to read. She has a client she needed to help and jumped off phone.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-27 11:31:08', '2020-01-27 11:41:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046147026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018019042', 'Alexandria (Lexie) Hall', NULL, 'Lexie called and needed to change her payment option and update. I told her I will send her an email that will have a link to bring her to a Payment Update Form. I told her to just fill it out and when she is done click submit and it will send it directly to us. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-01-27 11:09:21', '2020-01-27 11:09:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046179018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042221122', 'Sarah Wright', NULL, 'Spoke to husband Bob member Sarah was not available. Sent out email to reschedule the 30 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-01-27 10:33:04', '2020-01-27 10:33:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046179013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043491891', 'Brenda Pepin', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Follow up with member Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-01-27 09:41:50', '2020-01-27 09:41:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046179008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041829001', 'Kruti Patel', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 30 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-01-27 09:28:32', '2020-01-27 09:28:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046179003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043462286', 'Bryan Baker', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 30 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-01-27 09:21:31', '2020-01-27 09:21:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046147021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810847', 'Sally Hammond', NULL, 'Sally called and is at her mammogram appointment and thought this is the number she calls for payment. She has Redirect and I told her that is her first point of contact for everything and to give them a call. She already had their number, calling now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-01-27 08:59:52', '2020-01-27 08:59:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046147016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037657007', 'Mary Evans', NULL, 'Mary called in and she needed to know what to put down or what to do in regards to her son''s collage. I started to let her know this is NOT Insurance because that is all she was calling everything, she knew that she just didn''t know what other wording to use. I told her it is medical cost sharing. Anyway she wanted to know what member ID number she puts and what not. I stopped her and told her that I needed one of my group admins(Patti) to speak with her because there is a different process that has to happen. Since this is NOT insurance there isn''t really anything that is covered. It would be for emergencies and it would be out of pocket costs. Patti spoke to her and told her she will be sending out an email template that her, as the member, fills out and give the college. It states that this is a medical cost sharing group and it is NOT insurance. It will explain the type of plan they have and what medical cost sharing is and why they have choose this. Patti let her know that it is a hit or miss. Especially for Colorado State. We (MPowering Benefits) have had issues with this college in the past and they will not accept it. That is something the member needs to keep in mind, some take it some don''t. So all she can do at the moment is send that letter into the college and see what happens from there. Patti will send the email template out by noon today the 27th. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-01-27 08:53:28', '2020-01-27 08:53:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046147008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068195', 'Yen-Yen Yuan', NULL, 'Yen-Yen called in and needs to cancel. She thought that the payments come out the 1st of the month and I explained to her that we start billing the 20th of the month for the next month''s coverage. She thought that was very odd. She was not upset, just thought it was unusual. So I let her know a few days ago the payment came out for coverage of February. She stated that she will have new coverage starting March 1st and asked if we can take those few days off of her payment because she will be covered with something else. I explained we can not unfortunately because it is an automated withdraw and we can''t go in and take a few days off or anything like that. She was ok with that. I sent her the form and she will be cancelling for March. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-01-27 08:17:26', '2020-01-27 08:39:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046148003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027741461', 'Michael Tyburczy', NULL, 'Member called and updated payment info. FTNI updated', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-01-27 07:54:34', '2020-01-27 07:54:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046147003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027741461', 'Michael Tyburczy', NULL, 'Called in and needed to change his payment, sent through to Sunny. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-01-27 07:51:58', '2020-01-27 07:51:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046077036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031810039', 'Morgan Adams', 'Zoho SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 629 
Question : I received a statement in the mail in which I can not tell if it''s been paid or not. Where do I type in the claim number to find out?', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2020-01-26 07:48:18', '2020-01-26 07:48:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046092041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005956089', 'C. Michaele Hogan', NULL, 'Christian said that he had called Kelly F earlier in the day for help in filling his thyroid med script.  He told me that he thought he had made it very clear that he didn''t have an actual doctor''s script but she said no, don''t worry about it and sent him a coupon to use at his local Walgreens.  He called in to me stating that Walgreens didn''t have a prescription for him.  So he was a bit confused and bewildered.  I told him that I was sorry for the miscommunication, but that we didn''t fill scripts, I suggested that he should use his telemedicine service to try and see if a doctor through that service would give him a months supply to tide him over until he sees his primary.  He said that he needed just a script and that he goes to see a naturapath that doesn''t believe in medication.  I told him that there was nothing more I could do on that front. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-24 16:24:02', '2020-01-24 16:24:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046092036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045005030', 'Scott Tesoro', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-24 14:59:00', '2020-01-24 14:59:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046094008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001245005', 'Linda Nelson', NULL, '1-24-20 Listened to your audio.  Have more questions.  You never mentioned monthly payments....that might be my determining factor.  I am presently paying about $4,000/year with liberty once I add in my deductible and they are not paying for issues I am having.   I realize I missed the deadline for this month but would still love to talk with you.  Let m know when you are available.  I am in Eastern time zone.
Thanks,
Linda', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-24 11:56:41', '2020-01-24 11:56:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046092018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031359199', 'Kimberly Scully', NULL, 'I assisted Kimberly with finding a pharmacy in her area that is in network so that she can get her generic birth control covered. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-24 11:15:29', '2020-01-24 11:15:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046092013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043575167', 'Peggy Neises', NULL, 'Peggy called in and she needed a list of Dermatologist''s in her area that are approved in the PHCS network. I was more than happy to look those up for her and sent her the list. I also let her know what she needs to do as presenting her RCI card and she will be paying a $50 co-pay as well. She will then have the office visit, which is the only thing that is covered with her plan, submitted to the P.O. Box address on the back of her card. I went over the card with her while she was looking at it. She fully understood everything and was happy for the help. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-01-24 11:13:58', '2020-01-24 11:13:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046073023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046071074', 'Lauri Dykstra', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA 60-64 DPC', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-01-24 11:10:44', '2020-01-24 11:10:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046087013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045682035', 'Christy Curtis Buss', NULL, 'Spoke to member updated address with unit number. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-01-24 11:06:29', '2020-01-24 11:07:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046092008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028177256', 'Russell McKendry', NULL, 'Kelsi from the Rose Surgical Center called in and stated that both Russell and Tracy are having their routine colonoscopies done today at this facility and she was calling the verify their benefits. She stated that the card they gave her was ineligible and she could not read anything. She stated she is very frustrated because she tried calling yesterday and whoever picked up the phone, I am assuming is was the Bettie''s, said the only person she could talk to was a Paul, we do not have a Paul that works her. She was very upset about that. I apologized and said that has never happened before and i told her to call this number, my number 800-519-2969 and from 8:30am until 10pm if she calls that number she will get in contact with me or the other Kelly that starts at 4pm until 10pm. If one of us are on the other line we will either pick up and ask to be placed on hold or it will go to John and then Patti and last the Bettie''s. But I believe someone needs to contact them and tell them to stop telling people that there is only one person they can talk to and telling people names of people that do not even work here. Anyway I gave her all the info from the back of an RCI card. The customer service numbers and the address where the claims are submitted to. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-01-24 10:47:44', '2020-01-24 10:47:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046073018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005630381', 'Mario Pommier', NULL, 'Member called in and requested cancellation I sent out cancellation form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-01-24 10:39:40', '2020-01-24 10:39:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046094003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046071074', 'Lauri Dykstra', NULL, '1-24-20  Laurie is turning 61 Feb. 6, 2020. She has mild asthma with no issues in past 2 years. Can''t remember last time used inhaler, in very infrequently. She takes Advair daily though. Asthma only becomes a problem when gets sick. Also last year she had a basal cell removed from face. Has had it checked  again and no problem. Enrolled in DPC via recommendation from Dr. Jennifer Lentz in FC. She is a member of LHS now and still waiting 1 year for a reimbursement. Understands this will cost more be work better. They are starting to feel like LHS is a scam. She will have a March 1st start date. $1000/$425 DPC. Chet is on Medicare.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-24 10:28:38', '2020-01-24 10:28:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046092003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043608754', 'Dana Schwartz Watts', NULL, 'David called in today again to say that now him and his wife after having their annual wellness visit''s yesterday and are now both at a facility for their blood work. His question was that the place is saying they both have to be charged $100 each before anything can happen. When I spoke to John yesterday about him and his wife''s situation and that the place was saying they need to be charged $100 as well beforehand. John had said to me to tell them that it is ok and to put it on their card and get the receipt and bill with the CPT codes(which David said he is familiar with and knows what those are and what the bill should look like.) John and everyone are in a meeting right now, I grabbed Patti quickly and she said to just tell them exactly what John said to do about the $100 for the wellness visit. Put it on their credit card and make sure they get the bill and receipt and send it over to us and they will get reimbursed. This is what I told David and he is fine with that and will do everything I told him that John told me. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-01-24 10:00:05', '2020-01-24 10:00:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046087008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045821781', 'Leeanne Whittaker', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to reschedule the 30 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-01-24 09:10:00', '2020-01-24 09:10:00'),
