  ('zcrm_1579374000046073008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033266001', 'Konstandinos Roumeliotis', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation I have cancelled RCI and will notify Sedera and will cancel future pmt and have sunny refund 2/1 pmt.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-01-24 07:26:34', '2020-01-24 07:26:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046073003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078546002', 'Alix Tingle', NULL, 'Member Only $500 IUA 30-39 DPC', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-01-24 07:18:04', '2020-01-24 07:18:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046051013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006799147', 'Celeste Prince', NULL, 'Celeste called in because she received an email to let her know that her CC was expired- I sent the payment update form and told her that the finance team would be back in the morning to sort it out. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-23 17:59:23', '2020-01-23 17:59:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046051008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044842227', 'Justin Keith', NULL, 'I spoke to both Justin and Tassi- they had very many questions right off the bat because as Tassi put it "we think that we were sold something that it''s not"  I took all of the questions.  Tassi was surprised to know that there was a network for preventive care- I looked up her doctors and they were both in network!  long welcome call but a good one- sent them tons of emails. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-23 15:54:25', '2020-01-23 15:54:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046051003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043386031', 'Robert Eberlein', NULL, 'I called Robert but he wanted to reschedule because his wife was stuck traveling and he booked the welcome call mostly for her sake.  So we rescheduled for next mon at 7:15 - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-23 14:22:05', '2020-01-23 14:22:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046025013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675034', 'Faith Ketterer', NULL, 'Faith called in and stated she just got an EOB from us and ASI stating that only some of her annual wellness visit was covered and she does not know why. I went through with her to make sure she took the right steps in making sure everything was covered. The provider was in network and she presented her ASI card the correct way. I told her to send over the EOB and I will get it over to someone at ASI as soon as I get it. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-01-23 13:30:09', '2020-01-23 13:30:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046025008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040737144', 'Catherine Rongey', NULL, 'Cathy called me today and she have finally gotten the bill with the CPT codes on it for her mammogram. I have sent it over to Brooklyn Young at RCI to have her look over the bill and to reimburse Cathy since she already paid out of pocket because she did not have her RCI card and did not know she needed that. She does have the card now for future appointments for Preventative. I am hoping Brooklyn can get that reimbursed for her. The bill is a very small amount of $220. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-01-23 13:10:25', '2020-01-23 13:10:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046034003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046294019', 'Melany Matheson', NULL, '1-23-20 Melany called to better understand differences and utlization of PSDHC vs PDHC. She''s set now to share with her husband to determine which one is best. Will let me know and knows the deadline for March 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-23 12:49:22', '2020-01-23 12:49:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046025003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028082090', 'Susan McCausland', NULL, 'Susan called in and said she may have hurt her knee skiing and wanted to know what the process is on what she should do. I explained the whole process of what she needs to do to start a "Need" with Sedera and explained how she will present herself and what not. I also sent her the email that explains how she submits her bills over to Sedera. Was very happy for the help and will get right on that when she goes and see''s someone. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-01-23 12:29:09', '2020-01-23 12:29:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046013013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033266001', 'Konstandinos Roumeliotis', NULL, 'Called to cancel, sent cancellation form via email. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-01-23 11:56:01', '2020-01-23 11:56:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046020003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011509065', 'Joy Kelley', NULL, 'Joy called in because she is receiving medical bills from her "preventative care" visits- the one that is really bothering her is from quest stating that none of the tests were going to be covered by her insurance.  I told her to take pictures of all bills in question, send them to me so that I can send them off to ASI for review and explanation. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-23 11:47:41', '2020-01-23 11:47:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045984051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022809001', 'Nancy Compton', NULL, 'Refunded January 1/23', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-01-23 11:45:06', '2020-01-23 11:45:06'),
