  ('zcrm_1579374000046019003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046016007', 'Scott Heather', NULL, 'Interested in PSD $1500 IUA or $5000 IUA.  Client currently has $40,000 in HSA..Conferring with Family members about possible sign up for 3/1/2020.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2020-01-23 11:16:19', '2020-01-23 11:16:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046015033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041616032', 'Gregory Gibbons', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-01-23 11:02:08', '2020-01-23 11:02:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045978058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012024293', 'Brian Johnson', NULL, 'New Plan: Emp Only $1000 IUA 50+ - $294', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-01-23 10:21:38', '2020-01-23 10:21:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046013008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043608754', 'Dana Schwartz Watts', NULL, 'David called in a little concerned because from a list that I sent him and his wife for General Practitioner, they called and made an appointment for a wellness visit for Dana and the one provider they called did not have anything available until May and sent her to another place with a Nurse Practitioner 20 miles away. He called to make sure that would be ok. I said yes as long as they are in the PHCS Network. The facility did not come up but the Nurse Practitioner did. I asked John if this would be ok and she spoke to David and let him know everything should be fine and if there is any issues with the billing to send the bills to me and we will look into and get it figured out for him and his wife. He called back a few minutes later and said the office is now saying that his wife needs to pay $100 upfront before anything and he wanted to know if that is something they should pay and if they will be reimbursed. I spoke with John again and he said to tell them put it on the credit card and send the receipt and bill to us when they get and we will take care of it for them. He said that we have been a huge help and thanked us very much. They just wanted to make sure they are going through the right process. Also sent David an email that explains how to present themselves and the RCI card to the providers and what to say. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-01-23 10:18:18', '2020-01-23 10:18:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045978053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013233193', 'Rebecca Kirk', NULL, 'Member called in and asked how to add spouse to plan.  I advised that I would send out form and to fill out ASAP and advised of past deadline.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-01-23 10:14:04', '2020-01-23 10:14:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045978048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012024293', 'Brian Johnson', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to remove child Grant from membership.  I will notify ASi &amp; Sedera and adjust billing and ask Sunny to refund $200 difference.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-01-23 10:08:01', '2020-01-23 10:32:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046015028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041953152', 'Roger Ariza', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 30 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-01-23 10:05:53', '2020-01-23 10:05:53'),
