  ('zcrm_1579374000046015018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043608110', 'Kevin Shah', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 30 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-01-23 09:48:50', '2020-01-23 09:48:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045984036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010288013', 'Seth Owen', NULL, 'Spoke to member and his request was responded to the very same day. Explained to him that we didnt receive a cancellation form from him, therefore he was not cancelled. He understood that there was lack of communication on his end and requested a resend of the email. Filled out cancellation form and requested a refund for Dec and Jan. Processing the refun on 1/23 and requested a refund from Sedera', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-01-23 09:41:52', '2020-01-23 09:41:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045984031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043491830', 'Jerry Hemme', NULL, 'Member was covered in December and Dec 1 start was honored even though acct set up fee $25 declined. Cancelled as of 12/31. Sedera refunded January. Did not issue a refund to the member for December as he was covered and set up fee declined.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-01-23 09:38:43', '2020-01-23 09:38:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046015013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043652034', 'Ryan Woolard', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 30 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-01-23 09:37:33', '2020-01-23 09:37:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046015008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810769', 'Erik Boller', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 30 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-01-23 09:15:36', '2020-01-23 09:15:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046015003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043608685', 'Christian Hager', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 30 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-01-23 09:11:03', '2020-01-23 09:11:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046013003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010288013', 'Seth Owen', NULL, 'Seth called in and said this is the second month now in a row that he has been charged to his account and he said he cancelled with us 2 months ago. He is very upset and said that he is a single parent and can not afford this and needs the 2 months refunded immediately. Patti looked him up and there was no form from him. Sunny sent him a cancellation form back on December 5th. Transferred to Sunny. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-01-23 08:22:46', '2020-01-23 08:22:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045984026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000008973029', 'Julian Gonzalez-Becerra', NULL, 'Refunded February.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-01-23 08:01:50', '2020-01-23 08:01:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045978043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716731', 'Brandon Mahurin', NULL, 'Member called in requesting receipts for all pmts made last year prior to cancellation.  I wondered why he didn''t save these.  Said he needed them for his "Tax Guy".  I also made sure he knew that only the MEC portion was deductible.  He did not ask me what that was.  I verified email and sent them to him via email..', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-01-23 07:51:07', '2020-01-23 07:51:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046006028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004091054', 'Jasjeet Arneja', NULL, 'Pritpal called in thinking that she had service through us for a medical need.  I explained that she has been cancelled with us for quite some time now.  I made sure that she understood that she needed to speak with Liberty and made sure that she had their phone number. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-22 18:04:27', '2020-01-22 18:04:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046006023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039164151', 'Reid Holtzclaw - Swan', NULL, 'Reid called in upset stating that we just tried to take 2 payments from his account after he cancelled 2 months ago.  I let Sunny and Patti know.  fun times. KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-22 17:54:43', '2020-01-22 17:54:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046006018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026391116', 'David Barricklow', NULL, 'David went to the cardiologist today and he paid the $50 copay- but was charged a fee for them downloading info from his pace maker.  He was also told that he needed a complete echocardiogram as well as a stress test.  He wants to know what to expect paying out of pocket.  I told him first I would reach out to Jennifer at RCI to see if any of the copays could be applied- and dependent on what she says possibly ask Sedera to find the best price and place for him to get those tests done at. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-22 16:24:45', '2020-01-22 16:24:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046006013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037141140', 'Cami Brecto', NULL, 'a dental office called because Cami asked them to call us to fill them in on what sort of dental plan she has.  I told the woman that Cami did not have dental coverage through the plan that she chose with MPowering Benefits but that she may have purchased it separately from her Rep, Wiley Long- I gave his cell number to the woman and asked that she give the number to Cami so that she can ask  him if she had signed up for an additional dental plan- outside the scope of the PSD MPowering Benefits Plan. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-22 15:31:08', '2020-01-22 15:31:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046006008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674338', 'David Garlock', NULL, 'Lisa called in stating that she never received the email I sent her on the 9th- we verified the email address on file and I sent it again. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-22 15:15:06', '2020-01-22 15:15:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000046006003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036932155', 'Amy Betancourt', NULL, 'Amy said that she got into an accident over the weekend and was checking in with her primary doctor to get cleared.  She wanted to know if she could just go ahead and get her yearly bloodwork done at the same time.   She said that she had been texting someone back and forth all day- I told her that was someone from Redirect and she needed to ask THEM about additional bloodwork. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-22 15:06:11', '2020-01-22 15:06:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045988041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045976082', 'Stacey Garrett', NULL, 'Tracking #9593308
Sent by MPowering Benefits Broker on 1/22/2020.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-01-22 13:23:11', '2020-01-22 13:23:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045994008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044486166', 'Elizabeth Collins', NULL, 'Called in and is very confused on how everything works. She needs to start a need with Sedera and got in contact with Redirect and they sent her a 3 page PDF file that was all sorts of confusing for her. She then got in contact with Sedera and they said to go through a Portal and then said never mind because they don''t want to mess anything up with what Redirect sent her. I told her I never heard of a PDF file about starting a need and to disregard that and follow the instructions I sent her via email. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-01-22 13:19:56', '2020-01-22 13:19:56'),
