  ('zcrm_1579374000045988031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010857102', 'Kimi Mischke', NULL, 'Member called in and stated to Kelly that she had received a bill for her Ultrasound Mammo fro Radiology Imaging Associates.  and that she had paid it and needed to be reimbursed.  I asked if she had made sure that provider was in network, she said no that her doc just sent her there.  I advised that she must always check to see if provider was in-network.  I directed her to send in bill to info and we will submit to ASi.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-01-22 12:47:23', '2020-01-22 12:47:23'),
