  ('zcrm_1579374000045921041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027361787', 'Cammy Dwyer-Abbey', NULL, 'I have started a needs case. Unfortunately I thought I was going to be a great candidate for the cost sharing programs but with one autoimmune disease I have now become a drain. So sad about it all. Just spent 5 days in ICU intubated and have had 2 lung procedures. Finally going home from the hospital tonight!

Cammy Abbey

Hi Kelly , does that work with infusions or do Doctors usually order those types of medications? I am talking about Cytoxan  or Rituximab. I was diagnosed with Granulomatosis with polyangiitis and the rheumatologists generally treat with one of these 2 drugs as an infusion. 

Cammy Abbey

Cammy,

Please see the quote that Reid from World Meds has for your Cyclophosphamide (Cytoxan) below.

 Cyclophosphamide 50mg x 100tabs $134.42 + $9.95 shipping.

 You will also be able to find all of his contact info so that you can order it.  He was able to find a very good deal on this medication- GoodRX, for the same quantity has the lowest priced coupon at $352.75.  I am sorry we were unable to help with the Rituxan at all- The discount price (if you can call it that) I was able to find through blinkhealth.com had it going for $1,968.48.

Please let us know if there is anything more we can do to assist you.', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-21 17:54:00', '2020-01-21 17:54:00'),
