  ('zcrm_1579374000045862023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904449', 'Hein Brutsaert', NULL, 'Hein called to see if "reintroduction therapy" between himself and son would be something that is "covered" by his plan.  He then prefaced it by saying it was for psychological issues.  I told him that he should call Redirect to ask them if there was anyway that they could reach out to his doctor to negotiate down a price.  I gave him their phone number. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-20 18:26:20', '2020-01-20 18:26:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045869021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045889096', 'Samantha Wilson', NULL, '1-20-20 Samantha is enrolling now for PDHC at  $1500/$335. Just moved to Aspen from CA and is paying $600+ with Anthem $1950 ded, $6500 out of network... She has a thyroid issue and takes levothyroxine 75 mg which is $10-$24 for 90 day tablets. Needs blood drawn 2x year. Wants to keep her PCP in CA.  DOB 7/16/1968. She was in a rush. I explained everything except 3 free mental health counseling services. She takes an occasional med for sleep aid. Also was in car accident 1 1/2 years ago and had back issues which is being taken care of by other person''s car insurance. All set to go.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-20 16:57:11', '2020-01-20 16:57:11'),
