  ('zcrm_1579374000045862008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004868046', 'Gabriella Horvath', NULL, 'Called to cancel sent cancellation form. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-01-20 09:08:44', '2020-01-20 09:08:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045862003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042738053', 'Clint Williamson', NULL, 'Called to cancel, sent form via email. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-01-20 08:40:29', '2020-01-20 08:40:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045777033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904638', 'Kevin Schemers', NULL, 'Danette called in because she was in a bind due to the fact that she has put off going to see her doctor for heart meds because she recently lost her son.  I went over her plan as well as I could- I searched for the doctor and or facility in network and was unable to find it but told her I would continue searching for her and let her know how it goes....she said that when she spoke to someone in billing they said that they did accept it.  So I went over her co-pay benefits as well as sent them to her- I gave her all of the information I could think of to make her feel more confident about her apt on Mon.  I also sent a welcome call scheduler, she said her husband usually gets in late and they didn''t think we scheduled them at that time.  I told her that if they are up to it to just give the main line a call and see if I am available, if I am on the other line, I will just call them back. Danette was very happy with all of the info I gave her. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-17 17:48:40', '2020-01-17 17:48:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045813085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045841227', 'Theresa Goins', NULL, '1-17-20 Enrolling now for ES $1000 IUA / $521 mo PSDHC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-17 16:18:00', '2020-01-17 16:18:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045813073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045841172', 'Shoshana Kressler', NULL, '1-17-20 She reached out ready to move forward. They just want to include both adults. I priced out the PDHC previously and quoted that to them now for just the 2 of them. They are enrolling now at $500/$577.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-17 15:12:22', '2020-01-17 15:12:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045813068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045841134', 'David Mason', NULL, '1-17-20 Brandi is enrolling now and they decided on the PSDHC for $1500/$655 month for family of 4. The price won''t change until Jan. 2021 bc of DOB''s.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-17 14:41:18', '2020-01-17 14:41:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045777028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036757110', 'Brandon Lowitz', NULL, 'Brandon called to make sure that his cancellation form went through and that he would not be charged for next month.  I told him that we had the form and because he is meeting the deadline for the 20th he would not be charged. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-17 14:31:26', '2020-01-17 14:31:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045761078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044842577', 'Joleen Fuenzalida', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request after being on the plan 1 month.  I will cancel RCI, Sedera &amp; FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-01-17 13:56:18', '2020-01-17 13:56:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045802107', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032516237', 'Pennye Nixon', NULL, 'Pennye called in and she stated she has yet to use her plans benefits and needed to walked through the process of how everything works and needed to make some preventative appointments. An annual wellness visit and a mammogram. I explained how everything works and what the difference is between preventative and diagnostic. I also told her how the diagnostic portion of her plan works as well. She asked me to look up some providers for her to the wellness visit and a mammogram. She gave me 2 different zip codes to use and I sent her all the list''s and educational emails as well. How she is to present herself and her RCI Card at her visit''s and how to avoid surprise bills for her preventative care. She was very happy with the help and seemed to understand everything I told her. Happy Member. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-01-17 13:46:29', '2020-01-17 13:46:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045802102', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026023246', 'Kristy Barber', NULL, 'Kristy called in and just needed to know the process of getting and MRI done that she is scheduled for. I explained to her about her $500 IUA and to keep all the receipts of proof of payment to send into Sedera. I then explained what the next step is where Sedera will call the provider and negotiate the bill to a final cost and then Sedera will send a check to her and she will use that to pay the providers. She understood everything and I sent her the email that explains how to submit bills to Sedera with their phone number. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-01-17 13:14:24', '2020-01-17 13:14:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045761073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045821781', 'Leeanne Whittaker', NULL, 'Member Only $1500 IUA 18-29 SD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-01-17 13:10:40', '2020-01-17 13:10:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045777023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044061030', 'Denny Lewenkamp', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  I spoke with Kelly, she said that she would fill Denny in about the plan, because it would be "lost on him".  Good welcome call,  she was already very well informed. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-17 12:59:00', '2020-01-17 12:59:00'),
