  ('zcrm_1579374000045813011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000191497', 'Michael Rust', NULL, '1-17-20 Micki and Michael will ponder for a March 1st start date. They have too much going on right now for Feb. 1st. Michael has 2 pre-x. 1) double hernia with mesh implant years ago where the mesh keep causing constant infection, pain and problems. Mesh was basically screwed into bone and no doctors are willing to remove it for fear of metal causing other more serious problems. So, they manage it with endomethecin to reduce inflammation similar to if treated for gout. Also mesh is towards back and most are done on front. So, no real solution and just sees PCP to manage it. Also, had acid reflux where they decided to tie his stomach around his eshophagus and he''s had that surgery 3x because it gets all twisted and causes problems. Also just sees PCP for those visits for now. They like to see naturopathic Dr. for $90 per visit well within the range for PCP through Redirect. PDHC at $1500/$335 is what they are exploring for March 1st start potentially. They have had problems with LHS getting reimbursed for a number of bills and had to submit them many times over and over. Tired of the troubles, but price sensitive as well. This will only be $35 more a month for far more benefits.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-17 11:30:49', '2020-01-17 11:30:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045802097', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044758155', 'Natalie Jex-Landoe', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 30 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-01-17 11:11:54', '2020-01-17 11:11:54'),
