  ('zcrm_1579374000045761033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026991117', 'Ryan Dunlap', NULL, 'Spoke to Tyler re: adding Tyler back to plan.  I looked into this and other than the note from Kelly C nothing was ever submitted to take Tyler off the plan.  So according to Elizabeth he is still on the plan.  I advised Ryan of this.  Ryan if there were any ID cards.  I asked what he was going to be doing, he said that ahead of gettin a job in Law  Enforcement that he was looking to get a tatoo removed.  I advised that this would not be shareable.  He thanked me for my help on this.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-01-17 10:27:09', '2020-01-17 10:27:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045813003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045821744', 'Scott Wingfield', NULL, '1-17-20 Heidi and Scott just enrolled. Scott''s DOB is 1/18/20 and price was not adjusting for his DOB since puts him into the 40 age category. Their monthly cost should be $655 not $629 a month. Heidi has been notified and it''s no problem.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-17 10:19:38', '2020-01-17 10:19:38'),
