  ('zcrm_1579374000045761008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650365', 'Pierre Dube', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request due to Pre Ex.  I will cancel Redirect &amp; Sedera &amp; biling.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-01-17 07:20:41', '2020-01-17 07:20:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045781110', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990450', 'Douglas Holderread', NULL, 'Douglas reached out late last night via Sales IQ- I gave him a call and helped him understand his preventative care benefits- he has been paying them out of pocket for 2 whole years.  The doctor is in network- I went over all protocol AND sent out all emails.  It sounds to me as if his dr owns a DPC- I told him to ask, and maybe switching would be an option.  I told him to reach out if he had any questions, and if he would like to hear from Analisa about making the switch. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-16 19:32:13', '2020-01-16 19:32:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045802077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045821700', 'Judith Snyder', NULL, '1-16-20 Judi and Jeff are enrolling now for PDHC $1500/$970 and Laura Kupperman referred them.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-16 17:18:45', '2020-01-16 17:18:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045802069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003158023', 'Lorene Cecilia', NULL, '1-16-20 Lorene is done with LHS. Knows of their problems. She''s choosing PDHC for all extra benefits and knows of price increase when turns 50. Also knows she can change her IUA in Aug for Association''s renewal to adjust for price change when turns 50. She''s in good health. Had pneumonia that was treated for in Oct 2019. All set otherwise. Abnormal pap was cleared as normal. No tobacco, no meds, nothing else within last 36 months. $500/$333', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-16 16:48:12', '2020-01-16 17:03:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045781105', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810174', 'Margaret Zachary', NULL, 'missed Welcome Call attempt 1.  sent another scheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-16 16:47:35', '2020-01-16 16:47:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045802064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045806225', 'Mark Johnson', NULL, '1-16-20 Mark is 45, Allison 43, 12 son, 17, 20 daughter. 12 year old son has ADD and taked Ritalin ER for about $70 a month on GoodRX. Otherwise healthy, no pre-x, no tobacco, no meds. Mark is a nurse anesthetist so he helps take care of the small stuff.. Want to keep Dr. Garron Miller pediatrician and Dr. Daivd Tipton who are both in PHCS network. He likes the $1000 IUA / $706 month. Enrolling in PSDHC now. Referred by friend Colt Bronson.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-16 16:21:03', '2020-01-16 16:21:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045781100', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045539150', 'maria molina', NULL, 'Maria called in very confused, sounded desperate, and had no idea about the plan that she has.  I sent all details via email to John, Wendy and Patti- Patti is wondering if maybe Ali can save the day in the morning due to the language barrier.- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-16 16:04:23', '2020-01-16 16:04:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045802059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045821700', 'Judith Snyder', NULL, '1-16-20 Judi is pissed bc joined US Health for $1000 month and already got declined bc of arthritis, anxiety and hypotyhroid issue. So, she wants to cancel LHS and join PDHC. Kept LHS active but hasn''t paid and will do so if need be.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-16 15:38:19', '2020-01-16 15:38:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045802051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045805015', 'Autumn Ricksecker', NULL, '1-16-20 Just realized she lives in CA and needs PSDHC or PDHC to remain compiant! Left vm for April and Autumn just now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-16 14:54:02', '2020-01-16 14:54:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045781095', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038280403', 'Marne Gleason', NULL, 'Marne called in because she just spoke with Charles, and he prompted her too.  She said that she didn''t know what to do with all of the bills that were pouring in from her Nov ER visit.  She said that she saw the email that we sent her on how to start the process but she was was "stuck"  I gave her Sedera''s phone number and transferred the line to Priscilla who works there.  *note- she sounded very high, I told her to feel better and she said that she was all right now.  she kept asking for reassurance that all she was going to pay was her $500 IUA* -KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-16 14:43:48', '2020-01-16 14:43:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045802046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650365', 'Pierre Dube', NULL, '1-16-20 Mary now needs a hysterectomy bc of uterine fybroids and she had symptoms prior to membership which she just thought was from menopause. So, she''s cancelling and getting back on Anthem in CA. Their deadline is Jan. 31st so she''s set with that. Plus husband has had 3 hip surgeries and that could be an issue moving forward as well. Best to move to insurance until all healthy.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-16 14:41:12', '2020-01-16 14:41:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045776148', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015902152', 'Douglas Pardieck', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel Sedera ASi &amp; FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-01-16 13:53:28', '2020-01-16 13:53:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045802036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045805015', 'Autumn Ricksecker', NULL, '1-16-20 Autumn is choosing SDHC and will pay for wellness visits on own. Enrolling now at $1500/$177.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-16 13:50:42', '2020-01-16 13:50:42'),
