  ('zcrm_1579374000045776138', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044406017', 'Patricia Nard', NULL, 'Patricia called in and needed to change her payment. I sent her the member payment update form. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-01-16 13:19:05', '2020-01-16 13:19:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045802031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002019001', 'Alexandra LeGrant', NULL, '1-16-20 Left vm after she requested a call. But, I see she lives in WA and I can''t help her there now unless she''s moved...', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-16 13:17:12', '2020-01-16 13:17:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045802026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045821744', 'Scott Wingfield', NULL, '1-16-20 Left vm for our appt. No answer.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-16 13:14:44', '2020-01-16 13:14:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045781090', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529781', 'Robert Johnston', NULL, 'Robert Johnston reached out via email to ask that we change his birth date, because when he went to the pharmacy -the pharmacist told him that his birth date was incorrect.  He reached out to Jennifer Chasteen as well as myself- I told him that Patti was going to change the date and it would be 1-2 days to cycle through to RCI- and because his RCI card does not show his DOB he won''t run into that problem again.  I did however ask what type of medication he was trying to get with his card because it is limited to what is mandated by the ACA.  I also let him know about our prescription program and sent him a link- I also offered a second Welcome Call.  I have heard nothing back- to me, it looks like he was frustrated about his medication, wanted to jump down everyone''s throat- and when he realized that only his wife would be using that card if she were on birth control- and he used it for something else- I am waiting to hear if Rob has any further questions or assistance in understanding the plan that he and his wife signed up for. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-16 12:41:06', '2020-01-16 12:41:06'),
