  ('zcrm_1579374000045802016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006176111', 'Lisa Carnahan', NULL, '1-16-20 "Gotta say Wendy, this is a little too little and a little too late. It''s been a nightmare working with LibertyShare... I had surgery for a knee replacement a year ago and LibertyShare only paid the bill (after weekly phone calls for months), when I sent LinkedIn messages to their CEO, COO and Board Director."', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-16 11:55:46', '2020-01-16 11:55:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045802011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165373', 'Dieter Bruhn', NULL, '1-16-20 Dieter is interested in PDHC but wants to weigh benefits vs cost increase of $100 per month if he joins PDHC $1000/$350. He had physical recently and his hemoglobin levels were slightly elevated but could be due to altitude or dehydration. He has a dr. visit on Monday with a hematologist to dig deeper. Assuming that checks out fine then he could consider switching, otherwise best to stay until gets is sorted out. He will keep me posted. I sent him the PDHC info already to read.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-16 11:54:17', '2020-01-16 11:54:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045747168', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042309289', 'Delia Wadsworth', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 30 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-01-16 11:20:30', '2020-01-16 11:20:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045747163', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043013016', 'Tranquilino Padilla', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the 30 minute welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-01-16 11:16:34', '2020-01-16 11:16:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045747158', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044006727', 'Charles Korb III', NULL, 'Spoke to member will book online the 30 minute welcome call. Sent email to do so. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-01-16 11:11:11', '2020-01-16 11:11:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045802003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064277164', 'Raissa Wilkes', NULL, '1-16-20 Raissa and I with Matt in background discussed SDHC, PSDHC and PDHC. Dr. Adochio and Dr. Rochelle Bernstein are in the network. Raissa sees Endocrinologist for thyroid issues 2x year and blood tests every 3 months. It''s a specialist so Redirect may not help in that circumstance.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-16 11:06:14', '2020-01-16 11:17:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045747153', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044118300', 'Rick Papaleo', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 30 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-01-16 11:05:31', '2020-01-16 11:05:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045747148', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044758303', 'Stephanie Hart', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Member will let us know if she didn''t receive QR Life code card. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-01-16 10:51:44', '2020-01-16 10:51:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045776113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028543301', 'James Marcellus', NULL, 'James called and wanted to confirm that the address change form was correct because on his end from the email that was sent back to him with the form he filled out said his age was wrong and under the section Spouse Info it said Adding and he is not adding a spouse and the age said 18-29 which he is not. I handed the call to Patti because she is the one that gets these forms and works on them. She pulled his up and explained that those 2 things he is talking about that are wrong is just auto filled. All that was changed was his address that''s it. He understood and is fine now. Just wanted to make sure everything was correct. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-01-16 10:26:45', '2020-01-16 10:26:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045776108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904654', 'Rigoberto Rivas', NULL, 'Notified by Patricia Georges the this member termed eff 2/1 I will notify Sedera &amp; RCI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-01-16 10:26:01', '2020-01-16 10:26:01'),
