  ('zcrm_1579374000045747044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990450', 'Douglas Holderread', NULL, 'Member called into to update pmt info.  I sent him the form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-01-15 09:47:37', '2020-01-15 09:47:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045777003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030041019', 'Brittany Barnes', NULL, 'Brittany called in and she was looking at the list of the 64+ Preventative services that are covered with her plan and she said she did not see anything that says about a regular wellness exam. I told her that yes 100% that is something that you can get done and is covered as long as everything is done correctly. As in the provider has to be in the PHCS Network and she needs to make sure when making the appt that it is STRICTLY Preventative only not Diagnostic. The biggest issue is making sure that the Dr codes everything as Preventative as well. I also let her know going in that if she has any questions or talks about any kind of pain ect.. that those things will not be covered and can turn the bill into Diagnostic. Only because those types of things discussed are deemed Diagnostic Injury/Illness. She was very happy to hear that this is something that is covered because she has not gotten one done in over 3 years. She gave me a name of a Dr that she has been going to for something like this to look up and see if she is in the network. I looked her up and she IS in the network so she is good to go to use her for her Wellness Visit. I explained on what she needs to do with her MEC card and to let the provider know this is STRICTLY Preventative only and if she has any questions or concerns or any type of pain to leave that for a separate visit because it can turn the billing into Diagnostic. She fully understands everything I explained and thanked me greatly for the help. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-01-15 09:05:05', '2020-01-15 09:05:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045776003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042932035', 'Arthur Cline', NULL, 'Left a detailed message on voicemail. Sent email to book online the 30 minute welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-01-15 08:04:19', '2020-01-15 08:04:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045772028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026391116', 'David Barricklow', NULL, 'David called in extremely in the dark on how his membership worked.  So I am helping him work on straightening everything out.  Billing AND stressed the importance of a welcome call.  I offered to do the call right there on the spot multiple times.  He declined because he wants to find a time that he and his wife can do it together.  He also brought up his smoking habit and how he would like to stop- I told him about my own experience with vaping and gave him some suggestions.  Member is very happy for all of the info and help. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-14 18:04:28', '2020-01-14 18:04:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045760118', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045780080', 'Lucianne Conklin', NULL, '1-14-20 Lucy is going to choose Anthem Bronze $328 HSA compliant.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-14 17:37:26', '2020-01-14 17:37:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045772023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034059029', 'Michele Westmoreland', NULL, 'Monica over at ASI is checking to see if the Tax ID''s Michele Provided are found in network- Michele IS tagged in that thread.  Monica said that she will let us know as soon as she hears. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-14 17:15:38', '2020-01-14 17:15:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045772018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045627026', 'Marjorie Bisbee', NULL, 'member called to cancel- I sent the form and tagged both Jan and Patti to it. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-14 17:07:41', '2020-01-14 17:07:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045760113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045841227', 'Theresa Goins', NULL, '1-14-20 Theresa is finalizing decision. Wants to choose Bright Health HSA Silver for son and PSDHC for them to take advantage of HSA. She''s going over everything tonight with husband and will call me tomorrow to enroll. Will also enroll tonight with C4 to make sure no problems. I will help if need be on that front as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-14 16:51:29', '2020-01-14 16:51:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045772013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904017', 'Angie Hernandez', NULL, 'Welcome call complete, Angie has been and is still doing her homework on learning all there is to know about her plan.  She felt under prepared for the welcome call because she was "only" half way through reading her guidelines! KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-14 16:42:56', '2020-01-14 16:42:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045760108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165363', 'Adrian Denise Farley', NULL, '1-14-20 She really likes the sounds of PDHC with no network and unlimited visits to PCP. She''s going to see what she''s paid to LHS this past year and see if it makes sense. She knows she will need to pay for PT and mental health stuff. She''s 40 now. I will waive $100 of the $125! Likes $500/$333 PDHC. Will call me tomorrow or email me.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-14 16:22:33', '2020-01-14 16:22:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045760103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165413', 'Irene (Renee) Barbeau', NULL, '1-14-20 Still pissed about LHS and dealing with collections and BCH. But was on Kaiser through work but just got laid off. She will find out cost of Cobra next. She needs 2 eye surgeries but told her to get those done under Kaiser bc pre-x. Once she''s done with that she can consider switching. She thinks $335/$1500 is expensive! Will be interesting to learn cost of Cobra. Her coverage ends Jan. 31st. She''ll keep me posted.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-14 16:01:04', '2020-01-14 16:01:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045772008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881658', 'James Lynch', NULL, 'James called in upset that he is getting bills from seeing his doctor that has been in the past in network.  I am going to reach out to Monica at ASI and tag James in the thread. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-14 15:42:37', '2020-01-14 15:42:37'),
