  ('zcrm_1579374000045760078', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000167691', 'Catherine Dailey', NULL, '1-14-20 Decided to stay put with LHS bc of price is half of Sedera. If I hear of anything else down the line let her know. She re-evaluated $50 and likes the telemedicine aspect to that. Will keep for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-14 15:08:00', '2020-01-14 15:08:00'),
