  ('zcrm_1579374000045760065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045739067', 'Rachel Namordi', NULL, '1-14-20 Rachel is enrolling now in PDHC for only $11 more to gain all benes of Redirect! So choosing $500/$333 for Feb. 1st start. Likes alternative options including chiro. She''s also not protected for Jan. But, suggested she sees if she can keep Cobra open as an option until hits Feb. If not issues then close that door. She will call x''s employer since no STM options in CO.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-14 14:30:46', '2020-01-14 14:37:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045772003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810570', 'Mark Franklin', NULL, 'Welcome Call complete!', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-14 14:10:30', '2020-01-14 14:10:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045760057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001165513', 'Christine Pietras', NULL, '1-14-20 When paid with Rapid Care DPC is $501/$1500, $445/$2500 plus $150 for entire family to be members of Rapid Care for all small stuff. They also pay $50 month for entire family for accident insurance that pays up to $10,000.  She will discuss with Kyle tonight and call me tomorrow. Kyle is 49. I should alert them of age/price change when hits 50.
