  ('zcrm_1579374000045760047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005636491', 'Kathryn Holt', NULL, '1-14-20 Kathryn recently had a baby and is not wanting to make a change since they will need to see if/how well they get reimbursed through that whole process. They are paying $529 now and with PSDHC at $1500 IUA it''s $629 a month. So, she''s happy to know there are other options if the need arises.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-14 12:15:46', '2020-01-14 12:15:46'),
