  ('zcrm_1579374000045760042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001881005', 'Maxwell Brandel', NULL, '1-14-20 Max just enrolled in SDHC on his own and I called him to give him low down. Told him about IUA vs AUA, pre-x, no preventative, etc. He''s on board and chose $2500 IUA. He doesn''t have any pre-x and not entirely sure about Soshy but not worried about it. Told him to do Welcome Call and he will. They are on Kaiser now and will cancel Kaiser for end of month.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-14 12:03:22', '2020-01-14 12:03:22'),
