  ('zcrm_1579374000045706062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001107434', 'Lauren Peterson', NULL, '1-13-20 Cigna Connect Flex Silver 5000 for $47.61 Her PMT and $554.64 rest of premium to total $602.25. Successfully enrolled for Feb. 1st 2020.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-13 18:08:39', '2020-01-13 18:08:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045718013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006871163', 'Deborah Pettit', NULL, 'Welcome call Complete!  Deborah is awesome!  but not too tech savvy- so I did a bunch of enrollments for her, she was really grateful for the extra time and hand holding. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-13 18:07:55', '2020-01-13 18:07:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045706054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001524034', 'John Leahy', NULL, '1-13-20 Enrolling now in PDHC at $1000/$350 on LHS Conversion link to waive $100. Sending him link to cancel HES as well. All set! But, he realized an old phone auto populated on his application. Need to keep 720-443-2136 as primary #!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-13 17:38:30', '2020-01-13 17:56:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045706049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005011261', 'Jodi Ayers', NULL, '1-13-20 Jodi is switching to PDHC and daughter on SDHC at $1500 for each $335 and $177 so total $512 vs $550 now with LHS &amp; HES. Only health issue is broken hand 2018. Still waiting for reimbursement on some of it. She''s not really sure how much.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-13 17:37:06', '2020-01-13 17:37:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045722003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045889059', 'David Norris', NULL, 'Completed Presentation for Provider Directed (ReDirect) Plan...presented $1500 IUA plan...Client will decide by 1/20/2020', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2020-01-13 17:20:35', '2020-01-13 17:20:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045706041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001165513', 'Christine Pietras', NULL, '1-13-20 Member of Steamboat Memorial Regional Healthcare - Rapid Care Clinic for $70 per month per adult and $5 per child.  Gain tons of services at low or no cost - https://memorialregionalhealth.com/healthcare-services/. She''s sending me info her friend sent her about the membership a while back. I want to see if it can be approved as DPC or not. If not, perhaps have them join SDHC since so many services and some wellness taken care of here already.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-13 16:44:54', '2020-01-13 16:47:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045706033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165388', 'Kimberly Baldwin', NULL, '1-13-20 Enrolling now in PSDHC for her and Chris $486/$1500. She wants to get an MRI for something and will pay for it on her own. Already priced it out months ago and will found an affordable place. Was scared to ever run anything through LHS. Is happy to change. She enrolled with the Conversion link that eliminates the $100 fee already.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-13 15:53:29', '2020-01-13 15:56:15'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045718008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810387', 'Valerie Ross', NULL, 'Welcome Call Complete.  Valerie was a tad on edge- which is understandable since she and her family got off to a rocky start. She wasn''t thrilled about being on the phone.  I told her that everything I just went over was the "fine print" and that Redirect would take the thinking out of about 90% of it.  She also was not in front of nor willing to get to a computer.  I told her that it was a checklist and that I would go over everything with her and send it at the end for any homework she has left.- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-13 15:29:55', '2020-01-13 15:29:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045706028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005271219', 'Jacklyn (Jackie) Gartman', NULL, '1-13-20 Jackie is about to have two procedures right away for her degenerative disc in neck and got cash price of about $500 with Dr. or $750 with other place. She will get this done first and hopes to get reimbursed by LHS now that sent the email to clean up their act. She will stay put for now and see how it goes. She will review info I sent in case she still needs to switch later if LHS doesn''t follow through on promises.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-13 15:25:45', '2020-01-13 15:25:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045718003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039786025', 'Mary A. Waggener', NULL, 'Mary called in saying that she thinks she received a bill for a pap smear- I asked her to send it over to me and I would send it out to the appropriate party.  She also called in concerned about a New York Times expose done on medical cost sharing and it made her very nervous.  I told her that the Sedera group as a whole are very good at what they do,  and the guidelines are there for the healthy like minded members. She said I made her feel better.  I will let Ron know.....KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-13 14:49:56', '2020-01-13 14:49:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045686043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026950477', 'Bonnie Blair', NULL, 'Member call into the Concierge on 1/10 asking for guidance because she is having issues finding a provider that will take cash paying patients in her area.  I reached out to Sedera with this question and Mady messaged me back letting me know that they had emailed her with how to price shop for cash pay facilities in her area..  I also left her a VM letting her know to look for email.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-01-13 14:02:36', '2020-01-13 14:02:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045686038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030630011', 'Tamara Quiroz', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation form I will cancel out in RCI portal &amp; billing &amp; Sedera.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-01-13 13:49:50', '2020-01-13 13:49:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045686033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012474377', 'Lynette (Lynn) Arena', NULL, 'Member called in to ask about Ophthalmology benefits specifically they yearly exam.  I told her that the yearly exam was not one of the covered services under the ACA and that it would be an OOP cost.  I sent her the ASi Plan Design.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-01-13 13:40:53', '2020-01-13 13:40:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045686028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005173170', 'Melissa Smith', NULL, 'Member Only $500 IUA 40-49 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-01-13 13:17:53', '2020-01-13 13:17:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045686023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005173170', 'Melissa Smith', NULL, 'Previous LHS Member from 1/1/17 to 3/19', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-01-13 13:16:59', '2020-01-13 13:16:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045716008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030630011', 'Tamara Quiroz', NULL, 'Charles Frohman called in and said that Tammy and her husband would like to cancel and asked what to do. I told him as we speak I am sending her the cancellation form to fill out and just let her know that she needs to fill it out and send it back to us before the 20th of the month because that is when we bill for the next month of coverage. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-01-13 13:13:42', '2020-01-13 13:13:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045716003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881351', 'Ronald Stear', NULL, 'Maria called in and she was already at her wellness appointment. She told me that she is having difficulty with the people because they are saying they never heard of us and don''t use us, ect... I stopped and asked first off did you  make sure the provider is in the PHCS network. She hesitated and said "uhhhh this is the only doctor in my area and they are telling me i have to pay upfront, please just tell me what to do". I told her that no she does NOT pay upfront and that the provider HAS to be in the PHCS Network. For ANY type of preventative appointment the providers need to be looked up in the PHCS Network. She said ok and gave me the name of her provider. I looked her up and No the provider OR facility was NOT in the network. She seemed very frustrated. I explained to her that for anything to be covered that is how it works. She has to stay in the network with a provider otherwise it will not be covered. She sighed and said ok can you please look up providers in my area? I said of course I could do that. That is how things are usually done anyway. You call into me and let me know what type of provider and I look it up and send a list via email for the member to choose from and then you make the appt and present your ASI Card to the front desk upon arrival. She understood. Anyway when I looked up providers in her area there was nothing for 20 miles. She is in CO so I already know that I am going to have to search up to 100 miles. I was correct. 4 search results came up for 100 miles. I told her the first one which is the closest to that zip code she gave me for Aspen CO, was 37 miles away. She immediately became snippy and inpatient and said "NO thank you I am NOT driving a million miles away for some doctor. I will just pay for this and be done with it!!" and she proceeded to hang up and I stopped her and said hold on let me try typing one more thing in. Instead of GP''s I typed in Internal Medicine which is essentially the same type of DR just a different name and a little bit more in depth with what they do. For 20 miles I at least got 1 result. 19 miles away in Basalt CO. She sounded a LOT more relieved and better after telling her that. 19 miles away is a LOT better than almost 40. She took down all the info for that one result and that was it. She said thank you and hung up. So Hopefully everything works out for her. I am going to send her an email anyway that explains how she is going to present herself at the appointment if she makes one. To me it sounds like she is just going to pay for the appt out of her pocket where she is at right now while we were on the phone. That is what she said at least before I gave her the info for the 19 miles away result. Very confused and not too happy of a member. I asked her in the beginning of the call if everything that I was telling her was told to her and her husband about how to go about making appt''s and things along those lines. Preventative and what not. She again hesitated and said she didn''t think so and if she did it was a long time ago and she never uses this. Again I will send some emails and hopefully she opens the one and reads all of the info on the Wellness Visit Instructions. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-01-13 13:01:10', '2020-01-13 13:01:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045706023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005173170', 'Melissa Smith', NULL, '1-13-20 Melissa wants me to keep her abreast of any changes in case it''s best to move at any point in the future. She doesn''t remember getting any other emails about making a change from LHS. She does want her annual wellness visit. She may downgrade from PSDHC to PDHC at some point. She''s enrolling now in PSDHC for $500/$322 at age 48. She was nicer this time but still not pleased that I didn''t tell her sooner to switch... We are on a better note now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-13 12:38:25', '2020-01-13 12:38:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045706018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001524034', 'John Leahy', NULL, '1-13-20 Jack used to train aikido from 2000-2007! I must know him. He''s turning 52 this year. He pulled a groin muscle up to lat and wants to take care of it. It is pre-x. But, he can see a PCP via PDHC at least to get some help for cost. Let him know he will have to pay for PT or other items associated with it. He thinks he''s paying $299 but will check his account later to be sure that doesn''t already include HES. He did go to dermatologist while on LHS and they paid $30 of the $160 bill. Very strange amount. Not sure why. He''s open and ready to switch to PDHC since more benefits and similar price. Plus waiving $100 fee. We''ll reconnect tonight to enroll.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-13 11:56:16', '2020-01-13 11:56:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045706013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165343', 'Renee Athay', NULL, '1-13-20 Renee is rebooting her life and is putting this on fore front to attend to as soon as she has the $ to pay for it. She understands this will be better and protect her further. She will inquire with LHS to make sure she has Liberty Complete, not Share. Paying on $249 now. 61 and knows she needs to be adult about this and handle healthcare soon. Only has bioidentical HRT and otherwise, no pre-x. Understands cash pay bc only paid $80-$120 for labs with BCH charged her $842 for same labs!!! Finally got price down to $300-$350 but still insane. Also works internationally and in NM and UT.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-13 11:38:51', '2020-01-13 11:38:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045696024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042738053', 'Clint Williamson', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2020-01-13 10:53:21', '2020-01-13 10:53:21'),
