  ('zcrm_1579374000045650023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650042', 'Julie Wilson', NULL, 'she''s all set with her Sedera membership- they are fixing a glitch in both her birth date and email in regards with Teladoc, and will send another email to her with instructions when she will be able to use it. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-10 17:00:43', '2020-01-10 17:00:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045650018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043128097', 'Richard Whitcomb', NULL, 'helped him find a great price on tamsulosin. he was thrilled! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-10 16:49:27', '2020-01-10 16:49:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045650013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650042', 'Julie Wilson', NULL, 'Julie called worried that she was not enrolled with Sedera because she was unable to sign into Teladoc today and hasn''t received any emails from Sedera.  I went over the Needs process- because that is what she really was worried about because she is going to do some traveling.  I went through the whole process and put her mind at ease- I gave her a mini welcome call and she was thrilled, wrote down notes and everything!-KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-10 16:45:38', '2020-01-10 16:45:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045655023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165388', 'Kimberly Baldwin', NULL, '1-10-20 Going to share with Chris tonight and reconnect on Monday to enroll in PSDHC. Dr. Christine Hansen is in network with PHCS. No health issues. Was getting concerned about LHS with their recent emails and such. Happy to switch to PSDHC $1500 or $1000 IUA $486 or $521 mo.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-10 16:35:44', '2020-01-10 16:35:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045655018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045798150', 'Robin Smith', NULL, '1-10-20 Larry had a heart attack last April. I''m recommending he stays with trad insurance through Doreen Fitzgerald. She is helping them with Bright Health. But, we can put his wife onto PHDC. She''s 59 and turning 60 in April. He knows of price difference from $335 to $507. She is healthy. Just takes anti-anxiety meds and HRT generic type, not specialized. They are super religious so he liked the other options as well. Told him the woes of LHS and the caps on per incident to stay away from. Did not mention lack of wellness visits also. Next time mention if need be. With Bright Health he can join for $719 Silver through Doreen and wife through me and save $. Otherwise he was looking at $1400 for both on Bright Health. Therefore, will save about $400 for 11 months and then $200 thereafter.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-10 16:17:36', '2020-01-10 16:17:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045655013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045841227', 'Theresa Goins', NULL, '1-10-20 I sent Theresa info about trad ins she said. I need to make sure she''s a client in C4! Looking at Bright Health for son only and PSDHC or PDHC for her and husband. Cleft palate might be considered pre-x bc he has done orthodontia in past year. She will look at Bright Health closer and then make decision and let me know.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-10 15:41:09', '2020-01-10 15:41:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045655008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001230091', 'Lester Pardoe', NULL, '1-10-20 Exploring trad ins with APTC of $233 with income of $60K and plans starting at $333-$600 for crappy bronze and silver plans. Or MCS PSDHC or PDHC or group of 3 employees and he''ll send me their appox DOB to run quote for that as well to run by board.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-10 15:29:17', '2020-01-10 15:29:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045650008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044725004', 'Richard Zimmerman', NULL, 'Welcome call complete- member uneasy that her dr isn''t in network.  Wendy is going to give her a call. Interested in either self directed or redirect. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-10 15:02:25', '2020-01-10 15:02:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045655003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001746009', 'Jill Bryant', NULL, '1-10-20 Jill enrolled in PDHC for $378/$500. Knows of cost increase once hits 60. Was also looking at CAR with Sedera but their prices are higher bc use Apex Co-Pay Network. She would pay $409 for that. Ours is better! She is disputing $50 HES since didn''t understand not connected to LHS or how to cancel it. CC is already cancelled and dispute begun so I couldn''t stop that from happening.  She''s still healthy. Just went off statin after she read how bad it is for people and eliminate carbs and sugar from diet instead. She just had to find checkbook to complete enrollment. Asked Sunny to waive $100 of $125 fee as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-10 13:33:29', '2020-01-10 13:33:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045650003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044265014', 'Rebecca Rechtman', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  sent her all appropriate emails and her Sedera guidelines because she was curious as to what to expect if she were to become pregnant. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-10 13:26:39', '2020-01-10 13:26:39'),
