  ('zcrm_1579374000045603061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650042', 'Julie Wilson', NULL, '1-10-20 Called in bc didn''t receive Welcome emails from Sedera or Redirect. She found ours once I told her I sent them again yesterday. Gave her Concierge # and told her to get help with Teladoc and to request emails sent again. She''s leaving town and wants it to be set up right away.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-10 12:29:27', '2020-01-10 12:29:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045603053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005030048', 'John Chamberlin', NULL, '1-10-20 Enrolling now for PDHC EC $1500/$938. Understands pre-x clause and IUA vs AUA. Also knows he might need AJ to take over account once he moves to Medicare to include kids at that point. Cost would go down as well since she''s younger. He''s completed enrollment now. Used to sell my townhomes Hunter''s Ridge as realtor when first built in 90''s. He owned one and sold it for $118K way back.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-10 12:13:18', '2020-01-10 12:16:56'),
