  ('zcrm_1579374000045602008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041152005', 'Krista Barker', NULL, 'Krista called in and told me that she had a wellness visit scheduled for her son however it has been less than a year.  I advised that since it was her 1st with us that it would be ok.  I also told her that she must tell provider to code as preventative and not to talk about any issues that he may be having.  That if they code it as diagnostic it will be out of out of pocket.', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-01-10 09:28:22', '2020-01-10 09:28:22'),
