  ('zcrm_1579374000045545063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005030048', 'John Chamberlin', NULL, '12-20-19 Both John''s kids have Lyme disease! One got it when she was 7 and they still have the tick that bit her. Dr. blew them off even though she had the red bulls eye rash. Mistreated. Once reached HS she could barely make it from her car to class and had to get handicap tag to shorten walk. They think son got it through lice. Daughter has miraculous turnaround after seeing Michael Kehoe PA at the Sound Clinic in Louisville. They target the different infections very scientifically and differently than others. Daughter bound out of appt one day and has gotten better since. She lost 50 lbs of weight that she''d gained from inflammation and lived a normal senior year of HS! Son hasn''t had dramatic improvement like sister but his was never as bad either. Kehoe''s phone is 303-444-8393, 303-698-0333 and email is MKehoe614@SoundClinic.com. John thinks appt run about $200 per visit.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-09 19:36:56', '2020-01-09 19:36:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045549038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044764041', 'Ryne Cooper', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  What an amazing, seamless experience!  Ryne already had everything down already that he was finishing my sentences.  He is an incredible new member! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-09 17:41:37', '2020-01-09 17:41:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045545058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005291620', 'Natalia Guidi', NULL, '1-9-20 Wendy,
