  ('zcrm_1579374000045549008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045539058', 'Allison Atkin', NULL, 'Allison had scheduled a welcome call for later in the day- I emailed her that we would like new members to wait til the 1st or second week to schedule the call so that they have everything they need in front of them when we go over the checklist.  I told her that if she has questions about her plan in the meantime she can give Wendy a call.  I attached a scheduler and told her that we looked forward to going over her membership with her next month. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-09 13:25:47', '2020-01-09 13:25:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045544043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045539293', 'Matthew Hammerlund', NULL, 'Member Only $$2500 IUA 50-59 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-01-09 13:19:14', '2020-01-09 13:19:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045545038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005654211', 'Hans Erickson', NULL, '1-9-20 Wants to switch but just got hit in face with puck playing hockey and had ER visit yesterday. So, wants to wait to see if can get reimbursed with LHS and/or USA Hockey''s insurance. He gave them LHS card but I told him he may want to try USA Hockey''s first. He will find out what the coverage is. He thinks they will cover his IUA portion at least. He''s psyched about PDHC once he''s ready to switch. Got the run around from LHS when did his annual wellness visit and still stuck with bill bc Aspen Valley charges so much.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-09 13:17:24', '2020-01-09 13:17:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045544038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045539248', 'Levi Bowen', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA 40-49 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-01-09 13:11:28', '2020-01-09 13:11:28'),
