  ('zcrm_1579374000045545023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015086178', 'Kristine Smith', NULL, 'Called and paid, gave me the whole story of why she was late. Up to date and got a new CC for moving forward', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-01-09 12:49:41', '2020-01-09 12:49:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045545018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004641025', 'Ruth Ebbinghaus', NULL, '1-9-20 Ruth and husband are now 61 and 63 and only paying $349 with LHS. So, PDHC at $970 for the 2 of them just doesn''t make sense as long as they remain healthy. They only get annual wellness visits every year and never go to Dr. otherwise. Open to new options if there''s something that makes sense for them. Knows of LHS delayed reimbursements. Super nice and thankful for the information.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-09 12:45:35', '2020-01-09 12:45:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045544028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045539150', 'maria molina', NULL, 'Member Only $5000 IUA 50-59 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-01-09 12:44:51', '2020-01-09 12:44:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045549003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000919219', 'Leigh Gannan', NULL, 'Welcome call complete.  Member was upset that she didn''t realize that the $1500 was per need.  I did reach out to Wendy to let her know. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-09 12:44:18', '2020-01-09 12:44:18'),
