  ('zcrm_1579374000045545013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165429', 'Jodie Brenner', NULL, '1-9-20 Jodie is interested in PDHC bc scared of LHS now. She''s 58 and got shingles in past 36 months. Otherwise healthy. Sees naturopath for $145 per 1 hr or $65-$75 phone consult. Willing to pay difference in cost of reimbursement rate if need be. Enrolling on Monday.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-09 12:33:24', '2020-01-09 12:33:24'),
