  ('zcrm_1579374000045544003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610622', 'Leif Anderson', NULL, 'I received slack msg from Sedera saying that Natalie had called them wanting to add her newborn.  She said that someone here told her to call Sedera.  I told Sedera that I would reach out to the member and send her the form.  I asked who told her to contact Sedera and she said that she thinks it was someone @ ASi.  She to fill out form and I will inform all vendors.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-01-09 12:10:46', '2020-01-09 12:10:46'),
