  ('zcrm_1579374000045491021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005271219', 'Jacklyn (Jackie) Gartman', NULL, '1-9-20 Looking to see if Michael Malamed MD Concierge Dr. will suffice for DPC requirement. Paying about $1500 a year for unlimited access via text/phone, etc. Called and talked with Dania and she''s asking the appropriate person and will let me know.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-09 10:50:50', '2020-01-09 10:50:50'),
