  ('zcrm_1579374000045484018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042696152', 'Diane Lary', NULL, 'Per Kelly C, this member requested another set of RCI ID cards be sent to her for her college age daughter.  Ordered via RCI portal.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-01-09 07:46:35', '2020-01-09 07:46:35'),
