  ('zcrm_1579374000045409028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650228', 'Tom Schramer', NULL, 'one hour Welcome Call complete!  it got off to a Rocky start due to some issues with Redirect, but we all got back on track and went on going through the program. At the end we all thanked each other for being good sports and finishing it, they told me that I did help to answer a lot of questions for them.  I called Wendy and she and I went to work on informing Redirect''s back end of the complaints.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-07 18:18:28', '2020-01-07 18:18:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045409023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044006573', 'Wahida Aryan', NULL, 'called in stating that she just had discovered the payment decline email, and that she thought the reason the payment info was wrong was because some lady helped to fill out the papers for her- when I asked the lady''s name she finally remembered Andrea.  I emailed Sunny and Patti to get with her sometime tomorrow. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-07 18:12:33', '2020-01-07 18:12:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045395013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650228', 'Tom Schramer', NULL, '1-7-20 Tom and Leslie had their Welcome Call with Kelly C. and were frustrated with Redirect bc Leslie has pinched nerve in neck and isn''t get response from Redirect. Kelly submitted ticket to RedirectHealth.com/ExtraHelp to resolve problem. David Slepak knows and suggested using the site. Leslie has a PT appt tomorrow and will cash pay if doesn''t hear from Redirect in time. She will wait to see if cost will exceed $500 IUA as well. Super patient and nice. DIdn''t want to get anyone in trouble but they were frustrated since not receiving the guidance they were promised.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-07 17:55:14', '2020-01-07 17:55:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045395008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003176035', 'Renae Einspahr', NULL, '1-7-20 Renae is exploring PDHC but doesn''t want to increase her cost by so much and may take her chances with keeping LHS until hits Medicare. She''s close. Will ponder.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-07 16:25:48', '2020-01-07 16:25:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045409018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810333', 'Rebecca Scalf', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  Rebecca has really taken the time to educate herself about the plan, and I just basically filled in the gaps.  She knows that as soon as more welcome letters and cards get to her she has a place to call for any questions! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-07 16:20:20', '2020-01-07 16:20:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045409013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044764010', 'Ryan Cooper', NULL, 'Welcome Call Complete!  Ryan was blown away by how thorough everyone she has spoken to yet in the company is.  Great new member! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-07 15:27:18', '2020-01-07 15:27:18'),
