  ('zcrm_1579374000045363018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650365', 'Pierre Dube', NULL, 'unable to find Vyvanse for under $300 a month.- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-06 14:43:44', '2020-01-06 14:43:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045363013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716785', 'Megan Friday', NULL, 'Megan called in to see how to go about paying for $350 genetic test for her son, so that they will know the correct meds to give him that won''t cause anymore bad reactions.  It turned out that she hadn''t even spoken to Sedera because her son''s mental health issues have been a whirlwind.  He did get medicare help- but no benefits yet.  I told her the best thing that she could do would be to just speak with Sedera- that they would help guide her through the process.  I transferred the line to Priscilla at Sedera.- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-06 14:42:53', '2020-01-06 16:58:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045331057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012351173', 'Marsha Huber', NULL, '1-6-20 Left vm for Marsha just now to update payment information. Told her a final notice was sent.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-06 14:18:50', '2020-01-06 14:18:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045363008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010899089', 'Mateusz (Mat) Piasta', NULL, 'called to ask if Lasik was something that Sedera could help find the best cost for.  I gave him Sedera''s phone number and told him that it wouldn''t hurt to ask. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-06 14:05:46', '2020-01-06 14:05:46'),
