  ('zcrm_1579374000045331036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005030048', 'John Chamberlin', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request citing Liberty''s poor service and alluded to the requirement that he be a Member of HES to get LHS.  Another misinformed member.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-01-06 12:33:01', '2020-01-06 12:33:01'),
