  ('zcrm_1579374000045331026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045454012', 'Laura Hanssen', NULL, '1-6-20 Laura is too nervous about Sedera bc of their pre-x and not wanting to risk it this close to retirement. So, we''re looking at the lowest cost Bronze Anthem plans now. There are 3 starting at $1324+. She has Dr. Lauren Sontag is system which brought cheapest options up to $1500+. Totally willing to find a new Dr. anywhere, even in GJ or Denver if need be to lower cost. She will talk with friends and find a dr. to switch to and send me an email with times to discuss further.  I should suggest to put husband on PDHC and Laura on traditional. Husband doesn''t seem to have much for pre-x but need to reconfirm.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-06 12:19:52', '2020-01-06 14:12:28'),
