  ('zcrm_1579374000045340003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993160', 'Karen Peirson', NULL, 'Eric called in and said he is confused because he is just now getting billed for his colonoscopy that he had about 9 months ago or so. He has the EOB from RCI and and bill from the actual facility. He said he did make sure the provider was in network and presented his RCI card at arrival. I told him to send me everything he has and I will get it over to someone at RCI to take a look at it. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-01-06 09:14:45', '2020-01-06 09:14:45'),
