  ('zcrm_1579374000045331003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027529151', 'Sherry Marriner', NULL, 'Member''s spouse email in asking what the $25 draft to his bank account was. I emailed with the answer.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-01-06 07:37:48', '2020-01-06 07:37:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045289018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014431007', 'Suzanne Cote', NULL, 'called to say that she unfroze her bank account for us to try to run the payment again.  she doesn''t want to use any other form of payment at this time.  I let Patti and Sunny know via email.- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-03 16:41:48', '2020-01-03 16:41:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045258117', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650083', 'Meghan Van Vleet', NULL, '1-3-20 Left another vm for Meghan for corrected pmt info.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-03 15:20:30', '2020-01-03 15:20:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045289013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044006690', 'Miguel Gallardo', NULL, 'It turns out the phone number that we have on file was incorrect and we have been leaving messages on someone elses vm- the person receiving the voicemails was kind enough to call in to let us know our mistake.  The area code was flipped around- we had 702 instead of 720- Miguel only had 10 min to talk but I told him that it wasn''t enough time so I rescheduled him for Monday. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-03 14:37:14', '2020-01-03 14:37:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045258109', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004711523', 'Michael Yocom', NULL, '1-3-20 Michael has $12K outstanding with LHS that he hasn''t been reimbursed for yet. He''s 4 months from submitting bills and they are telling everyone it''s 180 days to get reimbursed now. He''s paying $274 a month which seems to be Liberty Plus not Liberty Complete. BUT, he''s only keeping membership to make sure they reimburse him. He''s already on Medicare since turned 65. He just wanted to share his experience with me and not burden me with it. I told him he''s welcome to send me the super bills and I can see what I can do. He will think on it but doesn''t want me to have to deal with it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-03 14:27:53', '2020-01-03 15:18:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045289008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044006690', 'Miguel Gallardo', NULL, 'called for his welcome call but went to vm- left a message inviting him to give me a call back if it was still a good time for him, and if not, I would send along another scheduler for him. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-03 14:20:08', '2020-01-03 14:20:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045279021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068140', 'Michele Venne', NULL, 'I have been in contact with Monica Lugo over at ASI about Michele''s mammogram billing issue. The most recent update from Monica is:
Hi Kelly,
Each procedure has a diagnosis tied to it to determine preventive or diagnostic. I am having one of our representatives calling these providers to obtain more information. We will try and see if we can get this information. Without it, we may need to consider as an exception. I will keep you updated.

Thank you, 
Monica Lugo

I will continue to update through notes and am also keeping Michele updated. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-01-03 14:07:39', '2020-01-03 14:07:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045279016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005568233', 'Sherry Lewis', NULL, 'Sherry called in and she stated that she was made aware that a mammogram that she had done on July 3rd 2018 has not been paid or anything. She was speaking with the facility she just went to for where she gets her mammograms done. She did say she made sure the provider is in the PHCS Network and she did give her ASI card like she is supposed to. I told her to send me the bill when she gets it and I made sure that she gets the bill with all the CPT procedural codes on it, and EOB. She said she will do that and then send it over to me and I will send it to ASI on her behalf. I also let her know she can always call ASI herself and ask any questions she may have and she wanted to know if I can see her other bills and what not. I said no I do not have access to that information and that would be ASI that would have it, so I told her she can give them a call and the number is on the back of her card. Just waiting for her to send the bill to me. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-01-03 14:01:55', '2020-01-03 14:01:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045270033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042007069', 'Kendall Williams', NULL, 'Member called to update CC info. Payment declined but weirdly did not show up under declines. Processed January with new CC on 1/3/2020', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2020-01-03 13:47:30', '2020-01-03 13:47:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045279011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028177222', 'Amy Vasterling', NULL, 'Amy called in and said that she is confused on why she is getting billed for her children''s annual physical. I checked and made sure the provider is in the PHCS Network and they are and then I asked if she presented her RCI card to the front desk and said said yes. She stated that the provider told her that they do not submit anything with cost sharing, which does not sound right. I told her to send me the bills that she has via email and I will get them over to someone at RCI. I told her what type of bill they have to be with the CPT Codes on them and she said she doesn''t see any codes on what she has but she will get in contact with the provider and get that bill but will send me what she has in the meantime. Waiting for the email with the bills she has. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-01-03 13:23:53', '2020-01-03 13:23:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045258104', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014431007', 'Suzanne Cote', NULL, 'Susanne called in and said that her CC Declined and wanted to know what account she was using.  I called her back and gave her that information.  I will send out Paymnet info link in case she wants to update.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2020-01-03 12:53:56', '2020-01-03 12:53:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045289003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044006639', 'Ashley Semidey', NULL, 'I called for her welcome call but Ashley asked if she needed to take down notes or anything.  I told her yes, and go over a list online.  She asked if she could reschedule for Mon - so I set her up with an apt 10:45 her time. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-03 12:50:08', '2020-01-03 12:50:08'),
