  ('zcrm_1579374000045238023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810615', 'Don Ford', NULL, 'Don called in not knowing which way is up or down.  He said "I don''t know how you guys have "us" set up"  there is just money coming out from all different places in different amounts and I don''t know who is it for or for what.  I let Wendy, Patti and Sunny know.  Also- his address is incorrect- it is supposed to be 351 Jenkins Ranch Rd- changed in CRM but will let Patti and Sunny know about the changes as well- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-02 18:50:27', '2020-01-02 18:55:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045238018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044842427', 'Jill O''Dell', NULL, 'Jill called worried sick that her payment declined- she said that it wasn''t her fault because she wasn''t the one who enrolled.  I asked if she had filled out the new payment form, she said no because it was asking for her banking info and she only wanted to provide a credit card.  So I took down the info- sent it to Patti and Sunny.  Jill told me that she has an appointment tomorrow, she asked if she could go to any doctor she liked? because that is what she was told.  I told her that yes, but she needed to call Redirect first.  "What''s that? what''s redirect?  I signed up for Sedera. Who are you?"  I let Patti, Wendy and Sunny know about the situation. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-02 18:46:36', '2020-01-02 18:46:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045238013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041152044', 'Sheldon Olshansky', NULL, 'Sheldon called in to schedule a welcome call and he got me!  Welcome call on the spot done!  His only complaint is having to call Redirect before doing anything medical- he said that is not how he understood it when he signed up.  No worries- The Drexi.com site blew him away!  he loved it! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-02 18:22:09', '2020-01-02 18:22:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045232044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006446065', 'wendy wassom', NULL, '1-2-20 Wendy''s daughter is turning 26 in Jan. and wants Feb 1st start date for PSDHC. She is healthy but has sports injuries which she sees PT for. But, works in PT so pays on her own. Had foot surgery for bone spur in 2018. PT for hip and shoulder issues. Explained pre-x to Wendy and she''s totally fine with it! Likes $269/$500 option.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-02 17:42:24', '2020-01-02 17:43:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045232036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862412', 'Joy Lanzano', NULL, '1-2-20 Spoke with Frances numerous times today to get him squared away with Nextera. Joy only signed up herself by accident. We just spoke and the payments were $99 + $79 for Dec. and $99 for Jan. So, it''s definitely only showing for her. Frances paid for his portion today and was able to get into a dr. today in Centennial. Katie Harmon helped him. Joy will call Katie tomorrow to set up ongoing payment for Frances on her membership. She told me they are hiring a new doctor and she hasn''t heard back yet about when she can get in herself. I told her to ask Katie tomorrow and let me know if she has any problems.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-02 17:16:32', '2020-01-02 17:19:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045238008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032809035', 'Michele Manna', NULL, 'I didn''t hear the call...but saw that it was missed.  I gave her a call back and left a message on her vm. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-02 14:57:06', '2020-01-02 14:57:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045238003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650130', 'Paige Thoele', NULL, 'Welcome call done!  Paige is a bit nervous but excited as well about her new plan, but I think she''ll be just fine.  I told her that Wendy did a great job in fitting her with Redirect! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2020-01-02 14:15:22', '2020-01-02 14:15:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045223018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012474186', 'Cierra McNamara', NULL, 'Cierra called and needed a little bit of info on her plan/account. She needed to know what her monthly premium, what her "deductible" as in IUA was, and then asked what the price would be if we took her husband off and just had her. I gave her all the info and she was very happy that I was able to give that to her right then and there. She said we are awesome at customer service and getting info to her quickly. Member is very happy. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-01-02 13:32:32', '2020-01-02 13:32:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045232026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030548016', 'James Harris', NULL, '1-2-20 Spoke with James and he got his family members onto a STM plan for Jan. while he waits for DPC to return from vacation to see if they can enroll wife and kids. Looks like they might only accept 18+ patients. He has the member update form and will complete that once he knows if he can enroll kids as well into DPC Dr. Landon Roussel.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2020-01-02 12:59:12', '2020-01-02 12:59:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045236003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045235001', 'Kristen Poleski', NULL, 'Contacted K. Poleski, client wanted price for Member Only....provided price for Redirect Plan $1500 IUA...Member then informed agent that she would only sign up for 9/1/2020 start date.  Informed client to re-connect with Agent in July 2020 for sign up if interested.  Additionally, sent my clickfunnel access to client''s email for her to review ProviderDirected Plan.  This is a referral from James Marciano.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2020-01-02 12:47:42', '2020-01-02 12:47:42'),
