  ('zcrm_1579374000045223003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000040737144', 'Catherine Rongey', NULL, 'Cathy called in and said that she was not sure what the next step is when it comes to submitting her bills after having a Mammogram done. I asked if she made sure the facility was in network and she said yes. She said when she went to get the mammogram done that the front desk said they have worked with MPowering before and she needs to pay upfront and then they send Cathy a bill and she submits the bill to get reimbursed. I asked her to send me what she has and I will get it over to someone at APEX and have them look into this for her. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2020-01-02 10:24:07', '2020-01-02 10:24:07'),
