  ('zcrm_1579374000045069013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038280270', 'Cynthia Forney-Smith', NULL, 'called in because she just had a mammogram done and didn''t know where to submit the bill- I sent her Sedera''s how to bill email.  I told her that basic mammogram and basic colonoscopy are a covered expense...but not a prostate exam.  She seemed confused as to what she actually has as a plan because she went through us being insurance and Sedera- I told her that she didn''t have insurance- she had medical cost sharing.  I am going to send her another welcome call scheduler. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-30 10:32:31', '2019-12-30 10:32:31'),
