  ('zcrm_1579374000045084018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017981058', 'Maria Quinones', NULL, 'Member put a stop payment and then decided she wants to stay on. Sent her an email that I need $345 for January and $40 for the stop payment fee to reinstate.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-12-30 09:00:50', '2019-12-30 09:00:50'),
