  ('zcrm_1579374000045084008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939004', 'Mary J Lineback', NULL, 'Joshua Bowlin and Mary are under the same bank account. She is still outstanding for December so if we don''t receive a payment by 1/5 she will be cancelled. Sent her an email explaining.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-12-30 08:44:27', '2019-12-30 08:44:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045069008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027529279', 'Jay Thorp', NULL, 'reached out via sales iq to cancel.  when I figured out who they were I notified them that it has already been done. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-30 08:35:23', '2019-12-30 08:35:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045084003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043608110', 'Kevin Shah', NULL, 'Member submitted change of payment form and asked if back payment will be cancelled. Sent him an email that we have received the form and updated FTNI and the that the change will take effect on the next billing cycle on 1/22', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-12-30 08:23:23', '2019-12-30 08:23:23'),
