  ('zcrm_1579374000045069003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017981058', 'Maria Quinones', NULL, 'Maria called in to continue her plan with us even though she had requested a stop payment with her bank.  She has mistakenly been calling ASI for this.   She also wanted help ensuring that her mammogram will be covered. I alerted Sunny to this as well as asked Maria to send the name of her doctor and facility to find in network. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-30 07:40:36', '2019-12-30 07:40:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044992068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990335', 'Charles Grigsby', NULL, 'I let Shirley know that someone in finance will be in touch with her on Monday about her payment bouncing. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-27 14:23:11', '2019-12-27 14:23:11'),
