Kind regards,

Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-27 14:16:53', '2019-12-27 14:16:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044992053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044758269', 'Michael Pennavaria', NULL, 'His wife Laura called in to update the payment- I sent her the form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-27 14:13:22', '2019-12-27 14:13:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044992048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017981058', 'Maria Quinones', NULL, 'Ray called to say that Maria was thinking of cancelling her plan, but he thinks that it was due to a language barrier.  He took a welcome call on behalf of his wife (who has the same plan and also needed a translator) told me to send Maria all of the post welcome call emails and said that he was going to call her at 5:00 to go over everything with her. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-27 14:12:11', '2019-12-27 14:12:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044992043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862186', 'Suzanne Nadeau', NULL, 'Jan called to say that Suzanne''s husband will be going off of the plan because he is going on Medicaid - I sent Suzanne a member change form.  I tagged Jan and Patti in it. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-27 13:40:30', '2019-12-27 13:40:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044992038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015979037', 'Ryan Nelson', NULL, 'Ryan reached out via sales iq- I gave him Sedera''s number and sent appropriate medical need emails out to him. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-27 13:38:51', '2019-12-27 13:38:51');
INSERT INTO zoho_import.notes ("note_record_id", "person_type", "person_record_id", "person_name", "note_title", "note_content", "note_owner", "created_by", "created_time", "modified_time") VALUES
  ('zcrm_1579374000044992033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990335', 'Charles Grigsby', NULL, 'Shirley called in to speak to someone in finance.  I slack messaged Sunny. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-27 13:12:04', '2019-12-27 13:12:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044992028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083170', 'AnaMaria Iglesias', NULL, 'Ray called in originally for help with how to go about AnaMaria getting some care for a very painful shoulder that she has.  That turned into him asking to do a welcome call for her- but she wanted him to translate after he jotted down the notes to translate.  I did a welcome call and sent many educational emails. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-27 13:05:55', '2019-12-27 13:05:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045018013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000078459001', 'Schaana Wetzelberger', NULL, 'Address was update in RCI so I ordered new ID Cards to be sent.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-12-27 11:48:02', '2019-12-27 11:48:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045018008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041271366', 'Hayley Kirkman', NULL, 'Per Kelly C this member has just signed up with a PC and wants it to be effective 1/1.  I will cancel Redirect and send in Proof of DPC to Sedera to change.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-12-27 11:38:30', '2019-12-27 11:38:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000045018003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030548016', 'James Harris', NULL, 'I spoke to James about his intention to add wife &amp; children to his DPC plan.  Doc is out of town until 1/6 and office mgr dosent know if they take children.  Member asked if they could go on without the proof I told him no.  He will contact provider after the 1st of the year and be in contact w/Wendy with what to do.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-12-27 11:33:00', '2019-12-27 11:33:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044992023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862096', 'Edward Christopher Wiencek', NULL, 'He called in wanting to know how to log back into his HRA and re-do it for the year. I guided him through all of the steps and he logged in successfully. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-27 11:21:21', '2019-12-27 11:21:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044988043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044758457', 'Bradley Steele', NULL, '4TH QR LIFE CODE CARD -H0XEV', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-12-27 11:09:36', '2019-12-27 11:09:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044992018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030548016', 'James Harris', NULL, 'James called and said that his DPC Dr was out on vacation- but that the manager didn''t think that he saw children.  So now, James wants to "get everything that can get done today" and inquire about getting he and his wife on the plan and how much this would cost.  I told him that I couldn''t promise him anything, and that I didn''t have pricing for him.  I told Patti about all of this and she is going to give him a call. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-27 11:00:10', '2019-12-27 11:00:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044992013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041271366', 'Hayley Kirkman', NULL, 'Hayley called in because she said she wanted to switch to a DPC plan and Sedera told her to call us.  She thought that she was already on a DPC plan and said she just needed to cancel her APex card.  She was obviously very very confused.  So I went over the Redirect Plan and how it differs from the DPC plan.  Even after all of my explaining she still didn''t seem to grasp everything.  I asked if she understood and she replied "I''m getting there"  she asked to cancel by Jan 1, I told her that it probably wouldn''t happen by then- that changes need to be in by the 20th of the month.  I told her that in the mean time she could email Patti a copy of her DPC receipt.  I also sent her a cancellation form to cancel from Redirect just in case Patti needs it.  I called Patti to let her know what was going on.  She said that she would give Hayley a call. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-27 10:57:08', '2019-12-27 10:57:08'),
