  ('zcrm_1579374000044981041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043608110', 'Kevin Shah', NULL, 'Sent him Change of Payment form.


From: Kevin Shah <kms291@gmail.com>
To: <sunny@myahe.org>
Date: Tue, 24 Dec 2019 15:09:09 -0500
Subject: MPowering Payment
============ Forwarded message ============

    Hi Sunny,

    I was charged for MPowering for the month (reference number: 154087213), but I didn''t want to use a credit card for the payment (especially given the $25 fee).  Can I change the method of payment to something that doesn''t have an additional fee?  I spoke with Mike Montes and he told me to reach out to you.  Please let me know what further information you need from me.  Thank you.

    Regards,

    Kevin Shah', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-12-27 09:01:59', '2019-12-27 09:01:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044992008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027741047', 'Shane Bright', NULL, 'I saw that Shane called after holiday hours last night and gave her a call back- left a vm. letting them know that I will be here to answer any questions until 5 est. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-27 09:00:35', '2019-12-27 09:00:35'),
