  ('zcrm_1579374000044981003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939004', 'Mary J Lineback', NULL, 'Mary LIneback is still outstanding for December.. January payment went through so I informed her that we need the outstanding balance covered, otherwise we have to cancel the coverage as of 12/31', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-12-27 07:54:45', '2019-12-27 07:54:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044961048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993577', 'Lori Bacon', NULL, 'client called in to make sure that she was in compliance with her plan...I told her that she was.  And will send her updates as needed. Told her not to worry. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-26 15:01:58', '2019-12-26 15:01:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044972003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030548016', 'James Harris', NULL, 'I just spoke to Kelly C on this matter.  I directed her to reach out to this member and have him send me the proof of DPC when/if he gets it.  At that time we will charge him the difference for Member Only &amp; Member &amp; Fam price.  I will then submit via usual channels.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-12-26 14:08:31', '2019-12-26 14:08:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044961043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003037201', 'Maxine Gower', NULL, 'called in and wanted to cancel her services with us and Liberty.  Sent cancellation form and gave her Liberty''s phone number. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-26 13:48:55', '2019-12-26 13:48:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044961038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011939004', 'Mary J Lineback', NULL, 'Mary called to say that she has an injured knee, when I expressed my concern she said she didn''t just injure it, but that it had been and she needed to go see a doctor right away and wanted help finding someone in network.  I explained that there wasn''t any network for injury/illness related needs- she asked if it was ok for her to call her GP and get a referral to a specialist, and I told her that would be perfect!  I told her she could also utilize healthgrades.com - she asked what she should do if she needed a cat scan or mri- I told her how to contact Sedera with the CPT code for best price and place.  I sent her Sedera videos and a how-to on opening up a need. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-26 12:56:12', '2019-12-26 12:56:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044961033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030548016', 'James Harris', NULL, 'I reached out to Dania on James'' behalf.  Dania said that it was in fact possible to get the rest of his family on the plan- she sent me a link and instructions that James would need to complete before this could happen.  I sent her the new member form from cognito.  James is thrilled!  -KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-26 11:44:31', '2019-12-26 11:44:31'),
