  ('zcrm_1579374000044961008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041770071', 'Debra Flick', NULL, 'I sent an email to Debra concerning her prescription medication quote request form- asking for the amount of patches for her estradiol and also that I was trying to get the info concerning how she can start utilizing the drexi program BECAUSE they have all the best prices for her meds and the only site with low but not the lowest prices was goodrx.com- we already had a conversation about how she was using the goodrx program.  I told her that I would let her know about the drexi program as soon as I got any info back. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-26 08:31:25', '2019-12-26 08:31:25'),
