  ('zcrm_1579374000044896003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257357', 'Benjamin McDonald', NULL, 'Megan sent me an email stating that she needs to cancel her plan. Sending her en email with the cancellation form and will -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-12-23 07:39:48', '2019-12-23 07:39:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044855008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036209064', 'Damian Smith', NULL, 'Jacci called in panicked  because she just saw that we are taking $783 from her family''s bank account.  She thought that they were cancelled while trying to come up with ways to stay on the plan somehow and speaking with their rep= Charles Frohman.  I told Jacci that it was after hours for Sunny, but that I would try to transfer the line anyway, when I told her that Sunny wasn''t answering, I then said that I would email Sunny and tag Jacci in the email so she can get all of the updates and explanation. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-20 17:26:23', '2019-12-20 17:26:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044812360', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904449', 'Hein Brutsaert', NULL, '12-20-19 Hein is 52 and paying $1000 for just himself. He''s joining PDHC and is thriled. He has hypothyroidism but his new dr. took him off the meds. No other meds. He had 2 shoulder surgeries 6 and 9 years ago. Now has arthritis in hip and drs. do not want to do surgery for another 5-10 yrs at this point. He does have pain in his hip. No tobacco. Enrolling now. Hein is pronounced as Hane. He Chose $1000/$350 PDHC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-20 17:13:41', '2019-12-20 17:23:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044812352', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005030048', 'John Chamberlin', NULL, '12-20-19 John wanted to explore other options. He needs to remove AJ from membership bc they are divorced now but looking like price won''t change. His 2 kids have lyme disease. Alex is now SR. in HS and contracted it when 7 and doctors misdiganosed her even though they told about tick and bullseye spot. Test showed not lyme so the dr. diagnosed something else. Nothing worked. She had major joint pain and could barely get from car to class. Got handicap sign for parking to get into school faster. Has brain fog, mold sensitivity, etc. Went to Sound Clinic with Dr. Kehoe and looked like nothing was happening. But, Alex felt the change. Then after one appt she went bounding down the stairs and lost 50 lbs practically overnight. She has major water retention, inflammation, etc. Son Landrum has lyme and they think got it through lice outbreak in school. He''s younger and his symptoms are less and taking longer to see major changes. Believe lyme can be transferred sexually or via lice since blood born. Not sure. Dr. Kehoe took guy diagnosed with ALS to running marathons in 1 year!!!! 
Anyhow, best to keep John with LHS now with kids. He may revisit this in middle of year to move to MPB PDHC. Not sure if Sound Clinic can be considered PCP. He thinks charges about $200 visit. Just here in Louisville!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-20 16:23:58', '2019-12-20 16:25:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044812342', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165335', 'Glen Delman', NULL, '12-20-19 Glen and Melody are having troubles with LHS but scared to switch bc of the cost is quite a bit higher. They are struggling with understanding Redirect and why BMC doesn''t need to know Redirect or MPB or Sedera. I also discussed PSDHC since price is $783 month/$1500. But, now I''ve confused them entirely. The PSDHC might be better so they just use the insurance card for their annual wellness visit and cash for all other visits. Either way, they are going to wait to do anything. Melody has her annual wellness visit on Jan. 7th and they are hoping it just gets billed to LHS directly. Sounds like BMC won''t do that and she''ll have to pay. They are gun shy and not ready. We will wait.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-20 14:53:10', '2019-12-20 14:53:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044856003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021919346', 'Troy Wells', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request All cancelled.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-12-20 14:37:30', '2019-12-20 14:37:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044812337', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006151095', 'Ronald Vinluan', NULL, 'Per Kelly''s note below this member was told by Jane that he had to have our services in order to get Liberty.  He asked what out program was and I explained that this was a product that was sold with Liberty to fill the wholes in their product. I will refund him 1 month but member is not happy using the argument that he did not use services and that he was misled.  Said that he would be filing a complaint.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-12-20 14:06:41', '2019-12-21 15:53:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044844018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006151095', 'Ronald Vinluan', NULL, 'Called in to cancel, sent cancellation form via email. Is arguing with me and Patti now that he never used ANY of the services and he deserves and is demanding a refund for everything. He is being very rude. Patti is authorizing a 1 month refund, and he wants to file a complaint for being told that he was forced to have My Academy as part of his plan to be able to have Liberty by his agent Jane. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-12-20 14:04:32', '2019-12-20 14:04:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044855003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043608754', 'Dana Schwartz Watts', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  Dana is great and a good sport! Her Sedera Portal wasn''t working, nor was her login on uscorporatewellness.com site- nor would her QR code register.  I reached out to Sedera about this, I also reached out to John. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-20 13:33:28', '2019-12-20 13:33:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044812329', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904504', 'Mariah Bauer', NULL, '12-20-19 Mariah and I spoke with her friend on Wed as well. Her friend is helping her understand and decide. We had a good conversation. Mariah today asked a few more questions and is enrolling now just for herself. Her husband is doing his own thing for now. They don''t currently have a computer but they do have an iPhone and iPad. So, should be set with that. Enrolling in PDHC bc in mtns and wants the $312/$1000.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-20 13:11:15', '2019-12-20 13:20:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044812319', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521794', 'Eric DeMarko', NULL, 'This member submitted cancellation request I will cancel ASi &amp; Sedera &amp; cancel billing', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-12-20 12:34:04', '2019-12-20 12:34:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044812314', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044842427', 'Jill O''Dell', NULL, 'This enrollee was transferred to me from the front Desk. Said that she thought that we were missing her children''s SS#s and how did we process her application.  I told her that we had that information and her application was processed.  She was totally unaware of what she bought, had no idea who we were or how Redirect was.  I got the impression that she didn''t even submit the application.  I told her that she needed to contact her affiliate ASAP because we were going to be charging her very soon.  She wanted me to verify waht she bought and the pricing after that she said she wanted it and to let it go through.  I am now not confident of all the business that this affiliate has submitted month end.  I left a voice mail for Wendy to let her know.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-12-20 12:31:42', '2019-12-20 12:31:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044844013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521794', 'Eric DeMarko', NULL, 'Eric called in to cancel with us. I let him know that today is the deadline for cancellations and he HAS to get the cancellation form back to us by the end of the day today before 4PM. He said he is waiting for the email now and will fill it out and send it back immediately. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-12-20 12:30:02', '2019-12-20 12:30:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044812300', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904597', 'Cliff Ahumada', NULL, '12-20-20 Audrey Ahumada is enrolling for her husband 59 turning 60 in Feb. and kids 24, 22, 20.  24 yr old is dependent will join own membership. Live in Snowmass Village so PDHC is best. Healthy, no tobacco, no meds. Audrey 52 is on employer coverage already and doesn''t need this. I gave her prices for when Cliff turns 60 so she knows what to expect in Feb. She was shocked at the difference. But, needs to move forward. Noah did have knee surgery from injury in 2017 which is healed and done now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-20 12:20:20', '2019-12-20 12:24:22'),
