  ('zcrm_1579374000044834041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045821700', 'Judith Snyder', NULL, '12-19-19 Judi is 61 and husband 62 in Jan. 2020. No tobacco, healthy. Just takes 150 mcg 6x week of synthroid. Husband has kidney stone a few years back and that''s it. She also uses chiro 1x month bc her ankle is fused and body get out of balance. She''s been with LHS for a few years and its terrible. This price is about twice that of LHS but she''s going to do the math and decide if this will work for them or not. She also runs a financial services business to help 50+ folks prepare for retirement financially. She already thought of one client this would be great for. She used to refer them to LHS and not afraid to do so and never got her referral money from LHS.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-19 18:58:52', '2019-12-19 18:58:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044834031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043265090', 'Janet Thomson', NULL, 'I spoke to Janet at length, I gave her some detailed information about provider network and co-pay plan.  She is just really nervous because this is all very new to her and she needed a bit of reassurance and a promise to hold her hand through the learning process. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-19 17:04:53', '2019-12-19 17:04:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044834023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044842469', 'Paula Fowke', NULL, '12-19-19 She gets overwhelmed easily. She has a hard time understanding everything but is completing her enrollment now for PDHC $1000/$350.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-19 15:47:29', '2019-12-19 16:09:42'),
