  ('zcrm_1579374000044825018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885127', 'Bergen Kunselman', NULL, '12-19-19 Bergen spoke to someone at 1-800-519-2969 and wasn''t treated the way she wishes to be. It was a woman who didn''t know the answer and a man chimed in in the background and told her to set up her HSA next year, not this year. That''s none of their business when she sets it up. She has an HSA compliant plan through the end of the month. I have her the $3K per individual and $6K per family numbers she needs to set up the HSA. She appreciated my help.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-19 13:24:22', '2019-12-19 13:24:22'),
