  ('zcrm_1579374000044769284', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810797', 'Chris Massey', NULL, '12-18-19 Workman''s comp claim for elbow is all set and dealt with from this year. Otherwise, super healthy, no problems. Enrolling now for just himself for 2/1/20 to make sure he has the funds since the holidays are expensive. He will look into health ins through school for his daughter in Sept and decide if he will add her then. PDHC $335/$1500 enrollment complete after some troubles with site. It added $75 for tobacco even though it was clicked as No. Very strange but I got it to show correct price finally.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-18 16:54:28', '2019-12-18 17:23:11'),
