  ('zcrm_1579374000044769274', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044079035', 'Eugene Max Myers', NULL, '12-18-19 Put income at $23K for 2020. He''s getting a $225.01 APTC and premium $113.40 is his portion with Bright Health Silver 2 EPO. I called C4 to request Jan. 1st start date and TKT # 191 218-177 7958 and spoke with Antwoinise. Max wants to keep Dr. Charles Tawa and he''s showing in-network with Bright Health. Told him to double check with Cloud/Dr. Tawa.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-18 16:12:26', '2020-01-02 12:12:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044744126', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012578137', 'Rachel Fisher Ingraham', NULL, 'Rachel called in stating that she was being billed for her kids pediatrician visits.  The office said that they had tried calling ASI to submit the bills and they told them that she was not a member.  I asked Rachel to take pictures of both of the bills- I sent them to Leena for advice. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-18 15:58:04', '2019-12-18 15:58:04'),
