  ('zcrm_1579374000044769251', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045438013', 'Drew Cifrodelli', NULL, '12-18-19 Drew is 57 and son is 15. Healthy, no tobacco. He gets a $300 APTC or so and cost on Healthcare.gov is about $350 for the cheapest plan. He found the Karis Group via Google bc he fears the true cost of care. Had twins 15 years ago and they needed to hire someone to advocate on their behalf to deal with the piles of bills and duplicate bills.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-18 14:51:23', '2019-12-18 14:51:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044769246', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810847', 'Sally Hammond', NULL, '12-18-19 They are enrolling now for 1/1/20 for PDHC. I had her enroll as primary since Pete will reach Medicare age first. $1500/$970. All set and super appreciative for my patience.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-18 14:44:50', '2019-12-18 15:03:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044744121', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043128097', 'Richard Whitcomb', NULL, 'Welcome call complete- he was unable to access his needs portal- I contacted Sedera via Slack. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-18 14:18:29', '2019-12-18 14:18:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044769241', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659598', 'Christina Bremner Anderson', NULL, '12-18-19 Christina and Todd got divorced in Sept. They are on good terms! Christina needs to remove Todd from her membership. He''s supposed to pay for kids health ins. but to keep it most affordable she will keep kids on her membership for now. Her new cost will be $474/$1000. Todd can join PDHC at $350/$1000 and he needs to do so by Friday. Sent Christina instructions to remove him from her membership and he will communicate with Todd about everything and have him call me to complete his re-enrollment.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-18 14:00:08', '2019-12-18 14:00:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044769236', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004971047', 'Jeff Myers', NULL, 'Because this member has yet to pay for December and because of his poor payment history I will be cancelling him.  I will let ASi &amp; Sedera know.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-12-18 13:24:16', '2019-12-18 13:24:16'),
