  ('zcrm_1579374000044744111', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529382', 'Mitchell Magdovitz', NULL, 'Mitchell called and had a few questions regarding 2 injuries that he had and where he submits the bills to and what to do. I explained everything to him in regards to what he is going to need to do and how he is responsible for the first $500 of his IUA on both incidents. I told him he will be submitting his bills into Sedera and they will help guide him along the way. I sent him the submitting of bills to Sedera email and told him to give them a call when he can. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-12-18 12:04:56', '2019-12-18 12:04:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044744106', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010990158', 'Loren Jinkins', NULL, 'Loren called in and she said she has had an injury and thinks she has a torn meniscus. I told her what she needs to do in regards to paying out of pocket up to the IUA of $1000. I told to make sure she keeps all her bills and receipts that show she has paid the first $1000. I told her I will send her an email that explains how she submits her bills over to Sedera and to give them a call to explain what is going on and they will help guide her the rest of the way. I also told her to present herself as a cash paying patient and most of the time she will get a good discount that way. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-12-18 11:48:07', '2019-12-18 11:48:07'),
