  ('zcrm_1579374000044744091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993542', 'Deborah Smith', NULL, 'Deborah called in and she has just had her annual physical and her doctor recommended for her to have some blood work and to have a mammogram. She told me they sent her to Quest and I let her know that is fine and to just make sure that everything is Preventative only and the billing needs to coded as such. She gave me the name of the place they recommended for the Mammogram and it was not in network. So I told her I would find a list of providers for her that are in the network and explained how she goes about making the appointment and made sure that it is preventative mammogram screening only and sent her a few emails that explains what she needs to do and say upon arrival. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-12-18 09:14:50', '2019-12-18 09:14:50'),
