  ('zcrm_1579374000044750023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000919219', 'Leigh Gannan', NULL, '12-17-19 Enrolling now for PDHC for family. Spent 2 hrs on phone w LHS yesterday and still got nowhere in getting reimbursed. Zach with LHS is no longer responding. Leigh is done with them and going to remove cc from her Sharebox so they don''t charge her ongoing. She sees tons of complaints about challenge to cancel and stop payments. Her Pediatrician isn''t willing to negotiate rates at all. She knows she will have to pay difference in cost Redirect will pay vs the amount doctor charges. Sick visit is $145 and told her avg cost is $75-$100, therefore she will pay the rest.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-17 11:41:17', '2019-12-17 11:42:02'),
