  ('zcrm_1579374000044687018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000167696', 'Rachel Weitz', NULL, '12-16-19 Spoke with Annie at C4 and she terminated Dan''s other account now  TKT # 191 217-177 2838 and back dated acct to 1/1/20 for Rachel and Dan together. TKT # is 191 217-177 2860. Annie was super easy to deal with and helped quickly.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-16 17:30:04', '2019-12-16 17:30:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044687013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000167696', 'Rachel Weitz', NULL, '12-16-19 Annie with C4HCO is helping to cancel Dan''s account now and backdating to 1/1/20 for Rachel and Dan to join Kaiser Bronze $5000 30% HSA. Rachel is pregnant now and due Feb 28th. The was on Medicaid but doesn''t qualify now that income is higher and combined with Dan''s. Her income is about $32,295 and his is about $20K expected for 2020 as he starts his own business. APTC is $264 and their cost is $350.98.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-16 17:24:07', '2019-12-16 17:24:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044684023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005291035', 'Ronald DiDio', NULL, 'called to cancel- sent form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-16 17:01:46', '2019-12-16 17:01:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044684018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000030219010', 'Lori Kleiman', NULL, 'At her annual physical the doctor suggested that Lori have a lung scan done because she is a former smoker.  She wanted to know if this service would be "covered" I told her no, that this was not a service that was mandated by the ACA. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-16 16:31:09', '2019-12-16 16:31:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044687003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044725056', 'Payton Hoops', NULL, '12-16-19 23 and healthy, no real health issues except skin issues. Will pay for wellness visit on own since saves $792 a year to do SDHC vs PSDHC. Got a $138.38 APTC but those plans were still pretty bad. So, came back to MCS at $500/$203 SDHC.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-16 16:14:12', '2019-12-16 16:14:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044684013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001378007', 'Whitney Kauffman', NULL, 'Whitney called from her pharmacy because they were not accepting her ASI card for her birth control.  Patti spoke to her and forwarded the line to Bowtie.  Whitney called back and told me that she was unable to contact anyone there.  I spoke to John and he said to tell her that we would contact Bowtie tonight and call her back tomorrow. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-16 15:02:36', '2019-12-16 15:02:36'),
