  ('zcrm_1579374000044684008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002630141', 'Cameron Elmendorf', NULL, 'Welcome call complete.  She was admittedly flustered by all of the aspects of the plan.  She was not at a computer BUT said she could do it over her phone.  I told her that I would just go through the list...and when we were done I would just send her it.  I reassured her several times that Redirect was going to take most of the thinking out of all of it.  I told her that I was going to send her many emails that may be overwhelming but if they are, give me a call, save then all in a folder in her email program for future reference. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-16 13:10:16', '2019-12-16 13:10:16'),
