  ('zcrm_1579374000044578086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000045841227', 'Theresa Goins', NULL, '12-13-19 Theresa and seems to go by Sherry, 49 and Trevor 49. Son has cleft lip cleft palatte. Looking at Bright Health Silver 2 looks best bc may have surgery this year. No pre-x for adults, healthy, no tobacco. Maybe enroll for Jan or Feb. 1st start depending on how fast can decide. Wants to keep Dr. Gregory Alan pediatrician. Interested in PSDHC or PDHC and Bright Health for son.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-13 18:14:11', '2019-12-13 18:14:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044578081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044575094', 'Doug Klof', NULL, '12-13-19 See notes in Douglad Klof about Heather''s Braca 2 genetic diagnosis almost 2 1/2 years ago.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-13 18:02:36', '2019-12-13 18:02:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044578076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650042', 'Julie Wilson', NULL, '12-13-19 Choosing PDHC for $500/$333 and enrolling now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-13 17:41:06', '2019-12-13 17:41:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044578071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044842469', 'Paula Fowke', NULL, '12-13-19 Paula is 55, single, pretty healthy. She is told she needs hormones in the coming year that may cost $370 according to her dr. She doesn''t know what they are or if they are compounded or not. She is a skier and has blown out knee 10 and 20 years ago. Earns too much for APTC. Paying $1100 with $6500 ded now! Sent her PDHC to review and have an appt for Dec. 18th to possibly enroll. Otherwise she needs traditional ins and deadline is Sun.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-13 16:57:03', '2019-12-13 16:57:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044578066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650228', 'Tom Schramer', NULL, '12-13-19 Had many questions and wanted to understand why more expensive than Karen Peirson''s. She has PSDHC before we knew challenges of the network in their area. Leslie and Tom are enrolling now. Tom seems to understand it all well. Leslie does deal with migraines and seeks preventive imaging for that every year. Explained if preventive in nature she will need to pay but diagnostic will go towards IUA after pre-x clause is done.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-13 16:41:16', '2019-12-13 16:41:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044578061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650365', 'Pierre Dube', NULL, '12-13-19 Enrolled Family for PDHC. All set and super happy.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-13 16:06:35', '2019-12-13 16:06:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044581023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257544', 'Barbara Peskind', NULL, 'called to cancel, I sent her the form and tagged Wendy. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-13 16:05:33', '2019-12-13 16:05:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044578056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650270', 'Douglas Klof', NULL, '12-13-19 Doug just joined with him and kids and put wife on Anthem for $353.65 to wait until she passes the 36 month mark for her genetic braca 2 diagnosis.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-13 15:30:24', '2019-12-13 15:30:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044578051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044904504', 'Mariah Bauer', NULL, '12-13-19 Mariah is 40 and husband 43. Healthy, no tobacco, no meds except bc. Prefers to go alternative route. Has Life Shield now for $100+ but it doesn''t cover much and not maternity which she is asking about. Had an ER visit it June 2017 with kidney stone blocking ureter and needed emergency procedure. Caused from excessive calcium which she was taking only on occasion a liquid magnesium/calcium supplement that must have caused it! After surgery her body temp reached 109 degrees! But, it''s all clear now, no problem! She didn''t have ins at the time and is still paying it down after friend helped her navigate system to get bills down significantly. She''s now familiar with self-pay from this experience.  Looking over PDHC with husband and friend to see if makes sense for them. Meeting Dec. 18th to enroll if moving forward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-13 15:00:18', '2019-12-13 15:00:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044581018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881351', 'Ronald Stear', NULL, 'Maria called to be reminded of her monthly premium.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-13 14:33:39', '2019-12-13 14:33:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044578040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650130', 'Paige Thoele', NULL, '12-13-19 Enrolling now for PDHC now for Jan. 2020 start date. Choosing $1000/$350.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-13 14:04:07', '2019-12-13 14:17:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044573043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885127', 'Bergen Kunselman', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will notify Sedera and cancel her via RCI Portal.  Also cancel billing in FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-12-13 13:52:01', '2019-12-13 13:52:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044581013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885127', 'Bergen Kunselman', NULL, 'Called in to cancel and wants to make sure she will be cancelled for 2020. I told her I will be sending her an email that has a cancellation form for her to fill out and to make sure she gets that back to us before the 20th of the month to be cancelled in time. She will be filling it out asap today. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-12-13 13:35:34', '2019-12-13 13:35:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044578035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650042', 'Julie Wilson', NULL, '12-13-19 Julie 46 is looking at the DPC option and has local DPC she wants to use for maybe $85 a month. Also wants chiro so mentioned PDHC to her and she will decide. Monthly cost difference is $20 for PDHC instead. Still encouraging DPC since likes that method. Also like naturopathic benefits. Has insurance through Providence Healthcare but income increased and thinks she''ll lose subsidy this year. Lives in Hood River, OR!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-13 13:25:05', '2019-12-13 13:25:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044578027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650083', 'Meghan Van Vleet', NULL, '12-13-19 Megan is 46 with 13 and 9 year old. She''s a naturopathic Dr. and takes care of most problems herself. 9 year old has problem with bed wetting and they''ve seen urologist etc to try to resolve. She''s self employed and husband is teacher but they can''t afford coverage through school.  She wants to keep Bettina Willuhn PA as pediatrician. Trad ins will cost $789.54. Likes the idea of PSDHC and is thinking of opening HSA now that she understands it better.  Has used Urgent Care and ER for boys in the last few years for broken ankle and such. But, ankle was 3 1/2 years ago. She just enrolled for PSDHC 1/1/20 at $1500/$472.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-13 12:37:57', '2019-12-13 12:42:37'),
