  ('zcrm_1579374000044573033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044571112', 'Cheryl Claman-Brennan', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA 50-59 Redirect', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-12-13 11:43:33', '2019-12-13 11:43:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044581008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043608546', 'Paige Kaufmann', NULL, 'Paige called and said she was just using the Spruce app for Redirect and she is very sick( I could hear it in her voice, she could barley talk) so she wanted to know if that meant that she needed to treat this as an incident. I explained how she is going to treat this as injury/illness and she will be presenting herself as a cash pay patient up to her IUA of $1500. She already knew what that meant and just wanted to make sure. I did let her know though that with her having Redirect that they are ALWAYS going to be her first point of contact with everything. She asked another question about a doctor and I was not sure the process with her having Redirect so I told her to give them a call and they will be able to answer all her questions and help guide her along the way. She understood and is calling Redirect now. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-12-13 11:10:31', '2019-12-13 11:10:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044581003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005291708', 'Sarah Johnson', NULL, 'Sarah called in and said that she is trying to log into/register with Teladoc and she is having the same issue that a LOT of members have been having recently. It is telling her that her information can not be found. I noticed that Kelly Cheever has been posting the members name and what message is popping up for them with Teladoc on Slack. I did the same, left the members name and that her info is not being found in their system as a message on Sedera Slack. Waiting for a response and will call Sarah back once I hear back. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-12-13 11:05:01', '2019-12-13 11:05:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044576028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044486210', 'Todd Ackerman', NULL, 'Acct set up fee charged 12/13. Billing set to start 12/20. Good to go for 1/1 start', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-12-13 11:04:38', '2019-12-13 11:04:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044573028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521158', 'Jennifer Hansen', NULL, 'Paul forwarded me email from these members asking if they could still be in MPBS group if the did not refer anyone.  Per Rod I advised that we would be moving away from the requirement for members to be 1099 contractors  therefore referrals at group renewal 6/1/2020.  Member ok at this time.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-12-13 11:02:56', '2019-12-13 11:02:56'),
