  ('zcrm_1579374000044578008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650401', 'Frederic Besch', NULL, '12-13-19 Fred is healthy, no pre-x, no tobacco, no meds. Wants to join same as Kath McGaughey and she shared membership with him and referred him.  Enrollment complete $1500/$335. All set for 1/1/20 and knows to complete Welcome Call.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-13 10:17:28', '2019-12-13 10:44:59'),
