  ('zcrm_1579374000044553003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610190', 'Andrea Lowery', NULL, 'Leena has gotten Jaydrian, who is part of Member Advocates at ASI, involved with Andrea''s claim issue. I will post what he has said and what will happen(Very good news, this guy sounds like a very good worker and knows exactly what he is doing and gets things done when they need to be): 

Hi Andrea,

 

Thank you for reaching out.  I have called the provider’s office about your 09/20/2019 date of service.  Reviewing over the information submitted it seems like the provider Legacy Meridian Park Hospital is not apart of the PHCS Network anymore.  With the provider not being a part of the PHCS network, they do not have to accept our contracted rates.  So the remaining balance is the difference between the contracted rate and the submitted charge amount $629.  I spoke with Jalisca in the billing office and requested that the balance billed amount please be written-off.  She advise me should would place the account under review and allow about 5 business days for the review to complete.  I will be follow up on the review with Legacy Meridian Park Hospital by 12/23, to see if they allowed the write off or not.  Please let me know if you have any questions.

 

Thank you,

 

Jaydrian Marrow

Claims Department - Member Advocate

Administrative Solutions

P. O. Box 5809│Fresno, CA 93755

Ph. 559.256.1320 ext.290 Fax 559.475.5780

jmarrow@asibenefits.com │www.asibenefits.com
I will continue to update here when needed. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-12-13 08:25:51', '2019-12-13 08:26:40'),
