C:  760-688-6085', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-12-13 07:42:37', '2019-12-13 07:42:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044513033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011779589', 'Jennifer Anderson', NULL, 'Jennifer called to see if she could still keep her plan because she is moving to Wisconsin in 2 weeks.  I told her that as of yet, Wisconsin is not on our list of states that are no longer participating with health cost sharing memberships.  I told her that if anything changes we would let her know.  In the meantime she updated her email address over the phone, and I sent her the address change form for her mailing address.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-12 18:58:54', '2019-12-12 18:58:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044516085', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039575047', 'Samuel Mitchell', NULL, '12-12-19 See notes in Robert Mitchell''s account.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-12 17:44:36', '2019-12-12 17:44:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044516080', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039539039', 'Robert Mitchell', NULL, '12-12-19 Update I reached C4 and so did he with no wait. We got his account working and I chose the plan since he didn''t have Maggie''s login. We put in his cc # for 1st pmt and he knows to contact Anthem to set up ongoing payments directly with them. Cost is $1508.79.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-12 17:42:26', '2019-12-12 17:42:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044513028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012351173', 'Marsha Huber', NULL, 'Leena called in to speak to John because Marsha was verbally abusive to Leena and then hung up on her.  Marsha is extremely upset that ASI is denying her claim.  She talked of cancelling.  I saw the notes below and asked Leena to speak with Guy since he was the last to speak with her.  Guy is going to go over this with John in the morning.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-12 17:40:52', '2019-12-12 17:40:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044516069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039539039', 'Robert Mitchell', NULL, '12-12-19 Rob is choosing Anthem Bronze HSA for while family bc afraid of pre-x clause for each of them. They earn residual income of $150K now. We set up another account for Rob forgetting Sam already has an account and it''s not letting us proceed to choose a plan! He''s going to call C4 at 8:00 tomorrow morning.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-12 16:47:38', '2019-12-12 17:41:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044516046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044571112', 'Cheryl Claman-Brennan', NULL, '12-12-19 Cheryl Claiman - Brennan is enrolling now for PDHC. She is willing to pay for her alternative treatments. She wants to gets her monthly cost down and this is 1/3 of the cost so she happy to join this even though she will still pay for all pre-x on her own. Says she spent over $100K last year for her and kids. Taking ant-depressant and anti anxiety and pain meds. Has post traumatic neuralgia which is a nerve disorder caused by shingles. $1000/$350. She turns 60  in Aug. I have her $1000/$530 price to be aware of as well. She''s fine with it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-12 16:15:43', '2019-12-12 16:26:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044516038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044571065', 'Anna Menz', NULL, '12-12-19 Super excited about this! She was ready to cry because this is so much more sane than anything! She now uses American Liberty Insurance for $471 a month locked into that price for 3 years and is approaching year 3. It has a $6500 ded and pays cash for everything bc basically catastrophic plan.  Healthy, no pre-x, no tobacco. Uses bio identical hormones for $275. They are all specific to her, so not likely to get reduced price on that. She''s from Australia and her mom at 83 has dementia. She''s going home to Australia until Jan. 20th. She wants me to come up to Edwards and put me in touch with President of Slifer Smith and Frampton and speak with up to 80 realtors after the she gets back. She is super sweet! She thinks our healthcare system is criminal which I agree with. She says I can stay in her home in extra room that is locked off even. She''s 56, single, super healthy, no pre-x, no tobacco. Just signed up for PDHC $1000/$350 and will cancel other ins for end of year. She is so, so, so happy to have this option.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-12 15:26:01', '2019-12-12 15:30:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044516033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165397', 'Justin Bogardus', NULL, '12-12-19 Cancelled me out of C4, so no longer his agent. Send him a quick email to confirm.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-12 14:30:09', '2019-12-12 14:30:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044516028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037657007', 'Mary Evans', NULL, '12-12-19 Just called Mary back and they found his membership after some quick calls. She is set to go. They were just trying to get some immunizations completed. Super nice and satisfied.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-12 14:27:15', '2019-12-12 14:27:15'),
