  ('zcrm_1579374000044419058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043608204', 'Gary Wolfe', NULL, 'Now Gary is having issues with his HRA- and still no Teladoc.  Contacted John, Dania and gave him an apology. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-10 18:42:23', '2019-12-10 18:42:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044419053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716785', 'Megan Friday', NULL, 'Megan called in because her son is now in involuntary hospitalization for his mental health issues- he is doing poorly as he has had adverse reactions to everything that the doctors have put him on.  So much so that the doctor told Megan that they could try a very new, very expensive medication called saphris a try, but that she would have to go out and purchase it due to the fact that it is so expensive they don''t even have it on hand in the hospital.  I looked up pricing on this end and it was showing as around $600 for a 30 day supply.  Reid came through big time!   He can source it for $200 for a 90 day supply!!!!!!!!!!!!!!   So I told Megan that I would recommend that she ask the doctor for a script for 1 week with 2 refills so she can cut down the out of pocket while waiting for the meds from Reid.  I hope that this can help the family. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-10 18:17:45', '2019-12-10 18:17:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044426023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005676847', 'Jillian Palacio', NULL, '12-10-19 Jillian cancelled her LHS membership 2 years ago and just forgot to cancel HES until now. She''s all set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-10 16:28:00', '2019-12-10 16:28:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044419048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043608204', 'Gary Wolfe', NULL, 'welcome call complete with Gary and Cheri,  he was still having issues with Teladoc (that Sedera already told me they fixed) and transferred the line to "Joy" to assist in setting up his account. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-10 16:09:26', '2019-12-10 16:09:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044419043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862244', 'Andrew Racuch', NULL, 'Regina called in to ask if she was allowed to go back to her doctor for a visit as well as more blood tests for high cholesterol- I told her that it she could go to any doctor she chose for illness/injury care- present herself as cash pay, ask for a cash discount and submit detailed medical bills to Sedera when opening up a need.  She told me that she knew the process but that Sedera had asked her to reach earlier than she had when dealing with her knee Need.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-10 15:04:50', '2019-12-10 15:04:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044419038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011537031', 'Maureen Mulkey', NULL, 'Maureen called to make sure that she was compliant with her plan.  I told her that because she never referred anyone that we would send her instructions sometime in January with a link and instructions on how to re-do her HSA.  She wanted also to let us know that she will be "off the grid" during mid January- so if we try to get a hold of her and can''t she doesn''t want to be cancelled.  I promised her we wouldn''t! and to enjoy her vacation! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-10 15:00:30', '2019-12-10 15:00:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044426018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027220214', 'Min Kaess', NULL, '12-10-19 Wants to renew for 2020. Already auto-renewed since 12-1-19 renewal date. They''re set to go.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-10 14:55:47', '2019-12-10 14:55:47'),
