  ('zcrm_1579374000044426013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044486075', 'Iris Fernandez', NULL, '12-10-19 Iris is 53 and son 18. Healthy, no pre-x, no meds, no tobacco. Makes about $70K. Likes this option. Jose will pay for her son and she will pay for herself on the same membership. Native Spanish speaking so like Redirect to speak Spanish. Talking tomorrow to join after reads through it and talks with Jose.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-10 14:45:36', '2019-12-10 14:45:36'),
