  ('zcrm_1579374000044407068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000003680030', 'Warren Lucas', NULL, 'Member called in and said that he would be cancelling LHS at the end of the month and needed to cancel I will cancel subscription', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-12-10 13:56:07', '2019-12-10 14:03:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044426008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650228', 'Tom Schramer', NULL, '12-10-19 Leslie has family of 4. Leslie 52, husband almost 54 in week, duaghter 16 and son 17. All athletic. Leslie has hypotyhroid and takes levothyroxine, valacyclovir 500 mcg. Both cheap $4 and $14.25 or so. Provider Directed best in their area and age. Wants to share with husband and ideally Jan. 1st start date. Paying upwards of $2K month for Anthem BCBS.  Looking at the $500-$1500 IUA levels.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-10 13:28:44', '2019-12-10 13:28:44'),
