  ('zcrm_1579374000044372003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044371010', 'Sandra Heath', NULL, 'Spoke w/ client and gave presentation.  Client &amp; Spouse very interested....Partially Self-Directed, Member + Family; $1500 IUA...will call by end of week to enroll...', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-12-09 19:12:16', '2019-12-09 19:12:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044349049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044406061', 'Mark Ovind', NULL, '12-9-19 Mark is enrolling now in PDHC for him and daughter. Man of few words! Completed enrollment. $1000/$567.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-09 17:31:11', '2019-12-09 17:52:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044349044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650322', 'Kathryn McGaughey', NULL, '12-9-19 Kath and Eric are engaged but not yet married. Was looking into LHS and I told her to be careful. She''s with Covered CA now but will wind up paying most of her APTC back bc of alimony she forgot to report. Both her and fiance''s will cost $500+ each! With this is $335/$1500 PDHC. They was interested in HSA but not good option for Truckee area bc no drs. in network. They are super healthy, ski, etc. Kath is from Australia and she''s 50 and Eric is 53.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-09 17:15:03', '2019-12-09 17:15:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044349039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044406197', 'Suzanne Muller', NULL, '12-9-19 Suzanne is going to join Self Directed and may want to upgrade later. She''s happy that Teladoc is included to take care of most of her small stuff. $256/$1500.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-09 16:15:36', '2019-12-09 16:15:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044349034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000007733007', 'Nanette Kushel', NULL, '12-9-19 I just renewed Nan''s plan on C4 per her request. Her new APTC is $556.59 and her new amount is $142.86 with Anthem Silver Pathway X HMO 5150.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-09 15:30:55', '2019-12-09 15:30:55'),
