  ('zcrm_1579374000044358025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028459022', 'Liat Lieberman Tabachnik', NULL, 'I spoke with Liat per information that was given to me from John about her new birth control not being covered when she went to the pharmacy. I was told to let her know that any generic birth control IS covered and should not cost anything. When she goes back to the pharmacy have her give the pharmacy the members support number for RCI from her RCI card and have them call. When the pharmacy calls RCI will should give them confirmation that it is indeed covered and should not cost anything with her plan. Also with a Need that she is having issues with from Sedera. She said that Sedera can not do anything at this time until they have a final cost of her bill. She keeps getting all different pricing from statements.  She asked if I can see what the final cost is. I told her I can not that I do not have access to information like that and to call her provider and ask for a final statement or bill and then give that to Sedera. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-12-09 14:01:47', '2019-12-09 14:01:47'),
