  ('zcrm_1579374000044349026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031936015', 'Brian Schey', NULL, '12-9-19 Wants regular ins. bc of heart issue. Bright Health will cost about $349.94 for Bronze Plus. Generic meds cost more than he''s paying out of pocket cash by using ins. He was starting to understand that. Asked him to choose me as agent on C4 and said he would.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-09 13:42:31', '2019-12-09 13:42:51'),
