  ('zcrm_1579374000044358017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012675217', 'Andrea Davis', NULL, 'Andrea called in and she needs to get a biopsy done because her doctor found some irregular cells due to HPV. I told her this would be Injury/Illness and she would be responsible for the first $500 of her IUA. Anything after that she will need to get in contact with Sedera and I explained what they will do. I told her to give them a call when she gets the chance and explain everything to them an they will help her out. I sent the email that explains how to submit bills to Sedera. She also called back and needed me to explain how she goes about making an appointment for her annual women''s wellness visit. I explained how that process works and sent her an email that explains how she presents herself when she gets to the appointment. I also sent her a list of providers in the PHCS network for her to choose from for her women''s wellness visit. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-12-09 11:16:33', '2019-12-09 11:34:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044349013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039539039', 'Robert Mitchell', NULL, '12-9-19 Rob and Maggie are trying to decide if they want to stay with MPB or choose Anthem for way more cost. They want to make sure they are protected and they aren''t 100% certain about the MCS at this point. But, the Anthem costs will be significantly higher if they go that route.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-09 11:11:56', '2019-12-09 11:11:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044360003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028130264', 'Mark Sewell', NULL, 'Amanda called in inquiring how to add daughter to the plan.  I sent out Plan Change form and advised of the deadline', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-12-09 10:51:50', '2019-12-09 10:51:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044358003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028130264', 'Mark Sewell', NULL, 'Amanda called and had a few questions. Adding their daughter to the plan, Mark''s lab work was not covered and they were sent a bill, I told her to email me the bill and I will get it over to someone at RCI. I transferred her over to Patti about adding the daughter to their plan. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-12-09 10:47:19', '2019-12-09 10:47:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044349008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022969020', 'Madisen Abbott', NULL, '12-9-19 Maddie''s income increased from about $17,200 to about $22,200 at Mama Roma''s restaurant. I updated her income in C4 and it gave her a $241.62 APTC down from $320.81. But, the full cost of the plan decreased by $90. Therefore, her cost went down by $10 to $50.64 down from $61.40 even though making more money. Keeping Bright Health Silver X plan with $500 Ded and $2000 MOP.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-09 10:04:37', '2019-12-09 10:04:37'),
