  ('zcrm_1579374000044344003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043265152', 'Jared Volkers', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Member not in front of computer at time of welcome call. Member hasn''t received RCI Card and QR Life code card yet. I said if don''t receive by the 15th of this month to give us a call. He hasn''t check his mail in a week so might be there already. Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', 'Vanessa Orozco', '2019-12-09 08:36:14', '2019-12-09 08:36:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044302013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919520', 'Dechen Hawk', NULL, 'Laura called for prescription help- on my end it looked like she was cancelled.  She failed to tell me that she was under her husbands account.  Anyways.....I went over her prescription medication benefits, found a good price on goodrx for her and also sent a request to Reid with Laura being tagged in it. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-06 18:31:28', '2019-12-06 18:31:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044302008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001746011', 'Laura Seraydarian', NULL, 'Laura called in for help with a prescription....I went on to assist her without realizing she was cancelled.  I gave her Reid''s contact info anyway. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-06 18:19:30', '2019-12-06 18:19:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044302003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919419', 'Leo Goodman', NULL, 'Leo called to ask when his last annual physical was, I told him that we do not have that information but that I would reach out to Leena at ASI to see if she can dig a bit for an answer to that. He thinks it''s been about a year- he just wants to make sure for coverage. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-06 16:30:17', '2019-12-06 16:30:17'),
