  ('zcrm_1579374000044274013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044406145', 'Casey Richter', NULL, '12-6-19 Casey Richter is 36 and Chad Ziegler is 52, not married but probably common law by now since living together for 6 years. May join separately anyhow bc of age difference. Had Kaiser with work but Kaiser is leaving area and looking at Anthem for $350 for Casey and $550 for Chad. Healthy, no meds, no tobacco, active CO people. Heard about an option with Vail Valley Care as well but I don''t know what that is. They LOVE this and are eager to join on Monday at noon after look over everything. Like the $500 IUA for Casey and maybe Chad as well for PDHC, $311, $378/$500', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-06 14:28:17', '2019-12-06 14:28:17'),
