  ('zcrm_1579374000044274008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018451062', 'Patricia Bedell', NULL, '12-6-19 Patricia is having difficulty with CU accepting waiver this year. Patti will send me Sedera''s letter of proof to submit. But, they may have to remove son for 5 months before graduates and daughter for longer and put her on Bright Health. She didn''t realize that I can help with trad ins as well. Sounds like she has some other guy helping but was happy to learn I can help as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-06 13:22:15', '2019-12-06 13:22:15'),
