  ('zcrm_1579374000044277008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037550104', 'John Carter', NULL, 'John called and had a couple questions about what to do for going to an orthopedic for his knee. He said it has just started hurting very badly and needs to go to one. I explained to him how it works with it being Diagnostic Injury/Illness. I told him there is no network and he can go to any doctor of his choice. He is only responsible for his IUA of $1000. Anything more than that he needs to get in contact with Sedera. I sent him an email that explains how he submits his bills over to Sedera and told him to give them a call. He was happy with the information and thanked me very much and will be looking for the email. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-12-06 12:52:06', '2019-12-06 12:52:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044267021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042309169', 'Rebecca Levine', NULL, 'Reordered new RCI ID Cards to be sent to updated address', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-12-06 12:40:25', '2019-12-06 12:40:25'),
