  ('zcrm_1579374000044181003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039880001', 'Debra Golden', NULL, 'Debra called in and left a message with the Betty''s. She said she is due for a regular mammogram but her doctor wants more in depth diagnostic testing done and wants to make sure it will be covered. I called her back and left a message that anything more than the regular mammogram screening is not covered and she will need to pay out of pocket up to her IUA of $1000. Anything after that is to be directed to Sedera. I gave her their phone number to call. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-12-06 07:21:48', '2019-12-06 07:21:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044150044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000022969020', 'Madisen Abbott', NULL, '12-5-19 talking with Maddie on Monday, 9:30 Dec. 9th to update her income to about $24K. It''s set at $17,200 or so now. Her cost will increase. She''s on Bright Health and will likely remain since it''s cheapest. But, we''ll see. Spoke with her mom Lauren Abbott as well since she was helping Madisen.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-05 17:28:10', '2019-12-05 17:29:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044150039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001669077', 'Mark Lackey', NULL, '12-5-19 Mark is healthy, no pre-x. Ins ending 1/1/20 with employer. Becoming Self Employed again and expecting to earn $75K hopefully. Showed him Bright Health vs PSDHC. Leaning towards PSDHC for cost and benefits.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-05 17:06:27', '2019-12-05 17:06:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044147042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005568255', 'Abigail Hughey', NULL, 'called to cancel, sent form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-05 15:12:24', '2019-12-05 15:12:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044147037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016101049', 'Naomi Sandoval', NULL, 'called for a preventative care review, went over everything verbally and sent all appropriate emails.  I told her to call if she had any questions. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-05 15:11:58', '2019-12-05 15:11:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044147032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043608204', 'Gary Wolfe', NULL, 'Sedera had Gary in the system.  Just not his phone number- so they rectified that so he is good to go as far as accessing his portal but will have to wait until Monday to register for Teladoc.  I called and left a detailed message.  I also sent a new scheduler as discussed with an update about Sedera. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-05 14:59:55', '2019-12-05 14:59:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044150031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650270', 'Douglas Klof', NULL, '12-5-19 Doug and wife are both 40. Wife has Braca 2 which is a genetic defect which makes her more prone to breast and ovarian cancer. She gets a mammogram every year and an MRI. Told him the mammo must be coded as wellness and MRI will be her responsibility to pay for if preventative and no diagnosis. Rest of family healthy. He actually started the application before he even talked with me. Ann sent him everything and researched it all first. He''s just waiting on response as to whether or no Brace 2 will be considered pre-x.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-05 14:55:37', '2019-12-05 15:03:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044150026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000017280031', 'Scott McKenzie', NULL, '12-5-19 Scott wants to pay for his caregiver''s healthcare membership. We will talk tomorrow morning. I sent him the audio as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-05 14:51:55', '2019-12-05 14:51:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044147027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016721056', 'Susan Crocker', NULL, 'Susan called in to make sure that she was utd with her hra- I told her just a little- but it was no big deal.  I gave her verbal and sent written instruction. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-05 14:51:31', '2019-12-05 14:51:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044147022', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016038052', 'Paul Squier', NULL, 'called to cancel, sent form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-05 14:34:45', '2019-12-05 14:34:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044150021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044781294', 'Lisa Paxton', NULL, '12-5-19 Lisa''s boss won''t pay anything towards this even though will pay towards traditional. They have a guy coming in on the 10th to review a group option that she wants to explore first and also USAA. She likes this best so far but needs to weigh her options. Her boss isn''t always on the up and up with paying to the ins even though the cost is taken out of their paycheck. She will let me know what she decides after the 10th. Super sweet!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-05 14:25:30', '2019-12-05 14:25:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044130083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042309289', 'Delia Wadsworth', NULL, 'Per Patti Money @ GR she was able to reactivate this member for a 1/1/20 start.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-12-05 14:24:52', '2019-12-05 14:24:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044135026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039880001', 'Debra Golden', NULL, 'Debi called in and said she has some prescriptions that she needs coupons for. I told her I would send her a prescription quote form for her to fill out and send it over to me and I will get her some coupons. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-12-05 13:50:16', '2019-12-05 13:50:16'),
