Sent by MPowering Benefits Broker on 12/5/2019.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-12-05 13:17:47', '2019-12-05 13:17:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044150008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018419116', 'Judson Poling', NULL, '12-5-19 Debra called to re-enroll. I completed renewal process and she should be all set. It''s just her on the account for Bright Health with a $520.89 APTC and her cost is $431.31 so total is $952.20. All set and I told her to make sure her payment is still auto wd in Dec and Jan. 2020', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-05 13:17:40', '2019-12-05 13:17:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044147017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043608204', 'Gary Wolfe', NULL, 'I called Gary and Cheri on time for their welcome call but couldn''t complete it- the Sedera app wouldn''t accept his main number- nor other two.  I apologized and told him that I would reach out to Sedera and make sure that this issue gets rectified.  I told him that I would call when I get an update and then send the welcome call scheduler again.- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-05 13:13:14', '2019-12-05 13:13:14'),
