  ('zcrm_1579374000044130063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006617067', 'Robert Picheco', NULL, 'tried to follow up with this member or whoever.  re:ticket left VM. Ticket it closed. If you see previous notes he is never reachable by phone call. Never has returned a call back, or email. It is very difficult to get in contact with this member FYI to everyone... -KF/PB', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-12-05 12:19:52', '2019-12-05 12:50:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044133049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005636699', 'Kelley Drew', NULL, 'Liberty did not tell her she has to cancel with us and she had cancelled with them already. Cancelled and refunded December', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-12-05 11:55:51', '2019-12-05 11:55:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044135018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005636699', 'Kelley Drew', NULL, 'Called in to stop payment on her card for the $50 charge because it will put her account in overdraft or wont go through at all. Liberty did NOT tell her that she also needs to call into here to cancel the rest of her plan with us. I told her I will most defiantly send her a cancellation form for her to fill out ASAP and send it back to us and I also transferred her over to Sunny to stop payment. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-12-05 11:53:41', '2019-12-05 11:53:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044135013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881658', 'James Lynch', NULL, 'James called and needed to know what to do with his billing that he has gotten for a rash that has been on going since March. He has been going to a Dermatologist for this said rash. I explained who Sedera is and what they do and how he is going to go about submitting his bills and receipts that prove he has met his $1000 IUA. I explained further how the "Needs" work because he asked when everything start over again. I explained to him that his 3 needs will start over from the first time he started his first "Need". So say he starts that today, which he is going to be calling Sedera to start his first "Need" than his 3 Needs will start over come December 5th 2020. I told him I will be sending him an email that explains in detail how he submits his bills, it has an educational video in there he can watch that also explains everything he will needs to know. Was very thankful for the information and said he understands what he needs to do and will be contacting Sedera shortly. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-12-05 11:47:06', '2019-12-05 11:47:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044130058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026675105', 'John Cimbura', NULL, 'I have left a voice mail for this member about issue outlined below.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-12-05 11:43:20', '2019-12-05 11:43:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044130053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026675105', 'John Cimbura', NULL, 'Hi Patti and Wendy,

I''m not sure who is the right person to ask about this so I apologize if I wrongly CC''d anyone. have a complicated situation with one of your members and was wondering if you could help. 

Amy Cimbura called and said that she had some preventive visits and her MEC came back with that they weren''t covered. She explained she wanted these paid for, however, preventive care is not through Sedera. Her bills added up to only a few hundred dollars, but her IUA is $2,500 so it wouldn''t be shareable. 
However, over the phone she mentioned she had RCI for her preventive care... but in our database we''re showing APEX. I asked if APEX seemed familiar and she said she had never heard of that before. She said if the group switched preventive care she was never notified. I tried to get her to call APEX to get the situation handled, as you all know we don''t speak on the MEC''s behalf, and she said that she wanted this to be resolved by us. She''s asking for an email update to: amy@thecimburas.com. Can someone please reach out to this member and resolve the APEX / RCI issue? Please let me know.

Best,
Mady', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-12-05 11:42:39', '2019-12-05 11:42:39'),
