  ('zcrm_1579374000044133003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034859046', 'Bryan Potter', NULL, 'Deb Bear referred this member but was not input as such initially so referral fee went to Jane. Deducted it from Jane''s October commission and sending Deb Bear $100 via check on 12/5', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-12-05 07:58:09', '2019-12-05 07:58:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044130003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000004869183', 'Lucette Dietz', NULL, 'Member called in upset that she had been charged wanted to know what the service was for.  Initially wanted refund for whole year.  Told her that I could give her 1 month back and could cancel her which I did.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-12-05 07:20:20', '2019-12-05 07:20:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044075087', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044342154', 'Samantha Jansky', NULL, '12-4-19 Samantha enrolled in PSDHC for $500/$506 mo. Almost chose PDHC bc goes to chiro and had a few doctor visits but wasn''t sure if it was worth an extra $700 year. She''s all set but will call with Julianne''s SS# tomorrow.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-04 17:20:32', '2019-12-04 17:20:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044094029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028257544', 'Barbara Peskind', NULL, 'I went over all things related to Barbara''s preventative care, I answered all of her questions, and sent all supporting emails.  Now.  She did at the end of our conversation tell me that she needed to get her thyroid checked because she is on medication, so she needed to see her regular GP and her obgyn- who gives her a different medication.  I told her that she could take the time to ask her doctor who she is already established with to possibly keep the thyroid check separate- BUT that would be very risky and that we could not guarantee payment.  I sent her info on direct labs- I sent her the article on tips on how to go to the doctors office for a wellness visit without any surprise bills.  I think she understood, I made it very very clear.  I tried to dig for her obgyn in network and came up with nothing.  I did however find her GP.- KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-04 16:32:38', '2019-12-04 16:32:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044075082', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044079035', 'Eugene Max Myers', NULL, '12-4-19 Sent Max back to Gail Longnecker bc she can help with trad ins. She didn''t realize his MAGI is $20-$25K not $37K. He qualifies for about $233 APTC and can get an Anthem Silver plan for $107+. He''s 32, healthy, no ins, no tobacco, no meds. See Dr. Charles Tawa with Cloud Medical but doesn''t have membership and only saw him 1x 3 years ago.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-04 16:02:25', '2019-12-04 16:02:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044075074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044118411', 'Nathalie Joly', NULL, '12-4-19 Enrolling now for 1/1/20 start date for PDHC. Including son for now but he might be offered a job in Jan. He''s finishing up school now but doesn''t have an offer yet and they don''t know when he will. Wnat to make sure he''s covered while a student and unemployed. She will share the audio and videos with her employees on Friday and see who''s interested. She will reimburse them 50% of cost and we have enrollment and education date set for Dec. 10th at 2:00. Super nice and thankful.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-04 14:57:12', '2019-12-04 14:57:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044088017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034039274', 'Rochelle Booker', NULL, 'Rochelle called in and had a few questions about what she does and how she presents herself when she gets to her annual physical appointments that she scheduled for herself and her daughter. She already made sure that the provider is in network. I explained to her what she needs to do and make sure that she hands her RCI card to them. I also made it very clear that for the blood work and everything else that it is coded as strictly preventative for it to be covered. Anything that is not preventative and is diagnostic she pays out of pocket up to her IUA of $1000. She fully understands what she needs to do and is going to call her doctor and ask if the blood work is preventative or diagnostic. Sending her an email that explains how she presents herself. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-12-04 13:50:46', '2019-12-04 13:50:46'),
