  ('zcrm_1579374000044088008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015735109', 'Steve Moeller', NULL, 'Steve called back in and was asking about something that is going on with his wife and dermatology. His wife had a spot that was found and it turns out to be melanoma. I told him that with the dermatology that is not something that is preventative or covered and he would have to pay out of pocket up to his $2500 IUA. Anything after that will be looked at and helped paid by Sedera. He changed his email address because he never looks at his email that was on file with us so now he will be able to see emails that come in. I let him know that I was going to be sending him an email that explains how to submit his bills to Sedera and it has their contact info in it to call them and let them know what is going on with his wife''s issue. He was happy to hear. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-12-04 11:09:48', '2019-12-04 11:09:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044088003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001171017', 'Thomas Williams', NULL, 'Called in to cancel, I told him I would send him the cancellation form and let him know that the next available cancellation is for 1/1/20 and that he is already paid for coverage of the month of Dec. He knew that and was fine. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-12-04 11:08:02', '2019-12-04 11:08:02'),
