  ('zcrm_1579374000044075043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044406061', 'Mark Ovind', NULL, '12-4-19 Mark is 48 and daughter is 4 referred by his sister Kristen Ovind Zeller. Mark only wants wellness visit but his daughter went to dr. 8-10x last year and had a 5 day ER visit for a "bad cold." He spent about $10K for her last year. The PDHC will be best and it would be hard to reach $10K for the two of them with $1500/$539 level. Otherwise healthy, no tobacco, no meds. Wants Jan. 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-04 10:23:11', '2019-12-04 10:25:23'),
