  ('zcrm_1579374000044076003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000018819469', 'Joseph Stafford', NULL, 'Wife Kellie called in to ask for pricing for just her (removing Joseph).  I advised if she wanted to do that she would have to cancel plan and re-enroll by herself.  I gave her the price and advised her of the deadline.  She will get in contact with Ron to re-enroll.  I will also send her cancellation link.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-12-04 08:31:58', '2019-12-04 08:31:58'),
