  ('zcrm_1579374000044048003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027283004', 'Phyllis McCarthy', 'ZOHO SalesIQ chat missed', 'Visit ID : 601 
Question : What is the $25 charge for?', 'Rod Maxson', 'Rod Maxson', '2019-12-04 07:53:04', '2019-12-04 07:53:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044021099', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044061081', 'Robert Green', NULL, 'Referred by brother. No health issues. Paying $600-$800 now. He''s 55, lives in FL. He''s a Telecom consultant in Palm Beach County. He''s willing to come in and see if he can lower our costs or not. He likes this concept and is enrolling in our first call for Self Directed Healthcare for $5000/$189. Has domestic partner, Laurie who earns $24K and is getting her ins for $45 a month right now but likes this for when she earns more money. She''s 44 and an acupuncturist.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-03 17:14:06', '2019-12-03 17:23:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044021094', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044571112', 'Cheryl Claman-Brennan', NULL, '12-3-19 Now paying $900 mo with UHC and pays for everything out of pocket for acupuncture, massage, reiki, etc. Could use monthly savings to pay for those items. Gave her PDHC prices for 59 and 60 in Aug. May want to add her two kids but not oldest who is an independent and had major addiction problems after husband died. They all use anxiety meds except daughter.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-03 16:41:34', '2019-12-12 16:19:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044042003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044371010', 'Sandra Heath', NULL, 'Spoke to client - very interested in Partially Self Directed Plan - $1,500,  Member + Family...going to call her back to give her a presentation...and complete sign up...', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-12-03 16:33:09', '2019-12-03 16:33:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044036013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042933004', 'James Pendleton', NULL, 'Welcome call complete.  James is great!  Really knowledgeable before speaking.   I told him to give us a call if he has any questions raised as new membership materials come in to him.  He has nothing yet, besides his Sedera Welcome email. I checked and made sure his address was correct.  - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-03 16:17:30', '2019-12-03 16:17:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044036008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015735109', 'Steve Moeller', NULL, 'He called to ask about his derm bill (again)  I went over why it isn''t covered..and tried explaining when I suggested that he schedule another welcome call to get a refresher because he has been with the plan for so long.  He thought that was a GREAT idea!  sent him a scheduler...and he is waiting on Kelly F to go over a bill he sent her a few hours back. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-03 15:25:35', '2019-12-03 15:25:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044037003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025283259', 'Julie Oldham', NULL, 'Left a message for client to discuss Mammogram billing issue....waiting on call back from client.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-12-03 15:12:34', '2019-12-03 15:12:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044036003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041953095', 'Susan Farrar', NULL, 'Susan forgot that she had scheduled a welcome call....I rescheduled her for same time in a week. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-03 15:10:26', '2019-12-03 15:10:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044021089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044725004', 'Richard Zimmerman', NULL, '12-3-19 Ann is almost ready to enroll. May choose PSDHC for the HSA benefits or SDHC. She will run by her husband tonight and email to schedule time to enroll for 1/1/20 start date. She''s an acupuncturist and likes idea of HSA.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-03 14:47:53', '2019-12-03 14:47:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044007109', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005212040', 'Kevin Sather', NULL, 'updated member''s CC', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-12-03 14:20:05', '2019-12-03 14:20:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044033008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034209013', 'George Jones', NULL, 'Julie called in and she did not know that her plan included preventative services. I told her that of course it does and I explained how all of that works. She needs to make sure the provider is in the PHCS Network and I can look up providers for her and send her a list via email. I told her how she needs to make it clear that everything is strictly Preventative and that everything is billed as Preventative not Diagnostic. I let her know that she needs to have her RCI card upon arrival at her appointments. She needs new copies sent out so I gave her and her husbands name to Patti to send out some new cards. I let her know a few other emails will be coming her way on how she presents herself to the front desk of her check ups, i sent her a welcome call scheduler because I think she needs to have one to know how the plan works. Lastly I sent her the 64+ Preventative services that are covered and mandated by the ACA. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-12-03 13:00:46', '2019-12-03 13:00:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044007104', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034209013', 'George Jones', NULL, 'Sent PDF copy of RCI ID as requested by Kelly.  Ordered hard copy resent.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-12-03 13:00:19', '2019-12-03 13:00:19'),
