  ('zcrm_1579374000044021074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000029364176', 'Andrew Bibb', NULL, 'Referral check was missed so $100 goes to Iris Frieling with the October 2019 referrals.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-12-03 12:30:54', '2019-12-03 12:30:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044033003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610380', 'Laura Watson', NULL, 'Laura called in and said she got billed for her preventative mammogram service. I asked if she made sure the provider was in network and she said no she did not know she needed to do that. I looked up the provider she gave me and they are in the network which is good. I asked if she showed her ASI Card to them and she said yes. I asked her to scan over what bill she has and I will send it over to Leena at ASI. In the meantime I asked for her to contact the provider and get the detailed medical bill with the CPT Codes on them and once she gets that to email me that as well. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-12-03 12:26:56', '2019-12-03 12:26:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044007089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044006690', 'Miguel Gallardo', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA 50-59 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-12-03 12:26:28', '2019-12-03 12:26:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044021066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044061129', 'Emily Kloser', NULL, '12-3-19 Listened to audio. Paying $1400 month, $6800 ded per person and not wanting to pay that anymore. They live a healthy lifestyle like Gretchen Reeves. She is scheduled to do her mammogram today and colonoscopies in Dec. Trying to decide if she should put those off until after member or folliow through with them. I told her its her decision and didn''t want to sway her either way since if they find something it could then become pre-x. She''ll decide. She takes anxiety meds only and they are cheap. Choosing to join as separate members from husband bc he''s turning 60 on Dec. 30th 2019 and she''s 55. She''s enrolling them both now for PDHC at $1500/$335, $1500/$507. Waive $100 of $125 fee.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-03 12:24:03', '2019-12-03 12:24:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044021061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041020015', 'Daniel Patterson', NULL, 'Member on the plan for less than 60 days. No referral fee to be paid', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-12-03 12:16:36', '2019-12-03 12:16:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044007084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044006639', 'Ashley Semidey', NULL, 'I requested Children''s SS#''s enrollee sent them to me right away.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-12-03 12:05:28', '2019-12-03 12:05:28'),
