  ('zcrm_1579374000044021056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031359199', 'Kimberly Scully', NULL, 'Member submitted change of payment form. FTNI updated', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-12-03 11:48:02', '2019-12-03 11:48:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044007074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044006573', 'Wahida Aryan', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA 50-59 PSD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-12-03 11:43:39', '2019-12-03 11:43:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044021051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043959202', 'Diane Elliston', NULL, 'Nextera - acct set up fee $25, no referral fee to be paid. Billing will start 12/20. Good to go for 1/1', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-12-03 11:40:57', '2019-12-03 11:40:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044021046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027885083', 'Susan Best', NULL, '12-3-19 Susie was super frustrated bc her ER bill hasn''t been paid. It was $14,856.73 and has been negotiated down to $8171 but remaining balance is $6685.53 or something like that. Sedera is sending a check for $6374 and she owes $310 of her IUA. Check will be sent Dec. 6th and must be paid by Dec. 17th at the latest. She was super frustrated bc this process is so complicated and she doesn''t have time for it. She was ready to switch but found the final email from yesterday showing the bill will be paid and it''s all set. She will stick this out for one more year. She also did a skin check as self pay and had a ortho visit for knee in Seattle but didn''t exceed IUA of $1000 so not relevant at this time. She feels a little better but hopes no more ER visits next year. It was too stressful to deal with. But, also broke her back 5 years ago and had 17 bills to deal with for that with traditional insurance. So, understands it''s not a great solution either. Will stay put.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-03 11:33:19', '2019-12-03 11:33:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000044021041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716955', 'Wes Richardson', NULL, 'Refunded member $1224.00 which is $204x 6 months of overcharging them.', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-12-03 11:22:49', '2019-12-03 11:22:49'),
