  ('zcrm_1579374000043984003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044764010', 'Ryan Cooper', NULL, 'Spoke with client and informed her that there would need to be 2 separate accounts through MPowering until she is married in 5/2020.  Will start with DPC program in 2 separate accounts...1. Member Only $500 IUA &amp; 2. Member + Children $500 IUA.  Waiting on call back from client to discuss enrollment process.', 'Guy Travis', 'Guy Travis', '2019-12-02 17:44:19', '2019-12-02 17:44:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043979023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010899005', 'Susan Maehl', NULL, 'Susan said that she had sent an email to us last month asking to cancel the plan.  I went through and found nothing- I asked what email address she used, it turned out to be Sedera''s member services.  I told her that was why!  I told her that she needed to cancel through us and I sent the link....she asked if she was still going to be responsible for the $50 that was just charged.  I told her that I didn''t know, but to mention something in the form because the person in charge of that department would be making that decision anyway. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-02 17:21:53', '2019-12-02 17:21:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043977039', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021624144', 'Kim Merryweather', NULL, '12-2-19 Left vm for Kim to help her with her questions.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-02 17:21:48', '2019-12-02 17:21:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043979018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000038529553', 'Shelly Jamieson', NULL, 'Shelly emailed me today concerning the fact that her husband is scheduled for surgery on his knee this weekend and she wanted reassurance from us that they will only be responsible for their IUA.  She stated that she was asking because Sedera was seemingly being flakey and vague. I ran it by Patti as to whom I would contact so I contacted Dania directly through Slack.  Dania wrote a response for me to use, so I did that, I tagged everyone in it.  Shelly still not understanding what was being said I replied that she needed to contact Sedera directly at once.  I never got a response back.  I had someone from the hospital reach out to me on Michael''s behalf and wanted to understand the family''s plan....so I explained all of it- I told her that Shelly was told to contact her needs coordinator, and that this wasn''t happening.  The hospital staff then asked for a direct line of some kind because she was having difficulty getting through to anyone all day.  I gave her Dania''s line because she would know what is going on. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-02 17:13:17', '2019-12-02 17:13:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043977034', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044342154', 'Samantha Jansky', NULL, '12-2-19 Samantha is 32, husband 32 and 1 yr old. Lives in Austin, TX now. Healthy, no pre-x, no tobacco. On Oscar Health now for $300 for her and $275 for 1 yr old with $7K ded. Uses alternative medicine her whole life, owns small biz/private school. Husband is on VA but difficult to use. Listened to audio. We have enrollment time scheduled for Wed. Dec. 4th.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-02 16:28:29', '2019-12-02 16:28:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043977026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044006727', 'Charles Korb III', NULL, '12-2-19 Recommending using ESET Internet Security for best encrypted protection when online for $99 for 3 years. Best solution he''s ever used. Used by Microsoft for all of their security. He just enrolled as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-02 15:51:09', '2019-12-02 15:51:24'),
