  ('zcrm_1579374000043979008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000033451023', 'Scott Ballard', NULL, 'I got to speak with Orlena.  I went over her preventative care services- the supporting emails and sent her a few multiplan search results. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-02 15:27:18', '2019-12-02 15:27:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043977018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044006727', 'Charles Korb III', NULL, '12-2-19 Good morning Wendy:

I am following up on the voice mail message left on Friday November 29th.

A couple of months ago I had an appointment with my Ophthalmologist Dr. Carl Hanson and he provided me with your contact information and a summary sheet for M Powering Benefits and Health Excellence PLUS. 

Currently I am with Kaiser Permanente and pay 100% of my monthly premium of $664.22 for their KP CO Bronze 6500/50 plan which is essentially catastrophic health insurance.  Dr. Hanson expressed his satisfaction with the coverage provided by your organization relative to the cost and recommended that I reach out to you.

At the present time, I work with a broker that is approved by the state of Colorado but since I am not receiving any ACA subsidization and his brokerage has not provided any cost effective alternative programs, there is little benefit in maintaining this relationship.
  
I am reviewing more effective options and would appreciate the opportunity to speak with you.  Please contact me at your earliest convenience using the following:

Charles R. Korb, III
5562 So. Cedar Street
Littleton, CO  80120

Home PH:  303-794-9368
Mobile PH:  303-601-3025
E-mail:  chuck.korb@gmail.com

Best regards,

Chuck Korb
