Chuck is 57, healthy former football and rugby player long ago, 5''11, 182 lbs, no tobacco except 1-2 cuban cigars yr, healthy diet, few glasses of wine or beer night. Uses chiro and massage most often. Likes the PDHC $500/$378.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-02 15:26:14', '2019-12-02 15:29:24'),
