  ('zcrm_1579374000043977008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044733042', 'Emily Inglis', NULL, '12-2-19 Emily has Type 1 Diabetes insulin dependent, self-employed and brain injury from getting dropped on her head while dancing! She has Anthem Silver Pathway X now and hates it. She pays $150 with $1700 MOP. Looking at Cigna, Bright Health or Friday Health but doctors are not all in same network. Sees neurologist, PT and Cognitive therapist. Mary Finck PT at ESP Sports Medicine in Louisville/Lafayette, Camma Love at Good Samaritans Health and Healting, OT, Dr. Joanna Plonska, Dr. Peter Gottlieb in Aurora, Dr. Patricia Sinoway. Needs DME from Tandem Diabetes or Dexcom, Apidra for insulin. Very complex scenario with no good solutions. She''s super sweet and cheery even though the situation is grim. $20K income for 2020.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-12-02 14:22:02', '2019-12-05 18:20:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043971033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043959115', 'Veronica Greenfield', NULL, 'Member Only $5000 IUA 18-29 SD', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-12-02 14:11:43', '2019-12-02 14:11:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043971028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042309289', 'Delia Wadsworth', NULL, 'Had a conversation w/Leah Garcia about this member''s cancellation.  Member is saying that they were not notified of the process.  I forwarded email from Sunny to Leah.  Member no thinks this is a scam. I told Leah that this might not be the option for them.  She said that she understood.  I advised if they re-applied that they would have to give us another pmt method and that I would apply $125 to that enrollment.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-12-02 13:54:02', '2019-12-02 13:54:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043979003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021624144', 'Kim Merryweather', NULL, 'Welcome call complete!  Kimberly went from melting down and bucking the Welcome call to calm letting me know that she was dissolving an anti anxiety drug while doing the call to help get her through.  She has been calling in for help with her mental health...I went over EVERYTHING that could possibly help her in that regard, and then just went over everything else.  She never got any cards, she said probably because she was moving during that time.  I reached out to ASI for a hard and PDF copy to be sent over to Kimberly.  I also reached out to Kelly F to issue a new QR Life code.  I explained all of the emails I was going to send and told her to tag them all to a folder in her inbox for easy access.  I told her that she could call me anytime and I would happily go over the welcome call all over again if that''s what she needed.  She seems a good fit for Redirect, especially because she gets regular massages for her neck and shoulders due to her hair stylist profession.  She would also like to go onto a vision and dental plan....so I told her that I would reach out to Wendy on her behalf.  I made sure that she asked all of her questions, and told her that it is perfectly fine if she calls me back with more! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-12-02 13:39:49', '2019-12-02 13:39:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043971023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044006502', 'Joseph Stradling', NULL, 'Member did not enter SS# for Spouse &amp; Dependents.  I will email and call to advise.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-12-02 13:30:40', '2019-12-02 13:30:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043956175', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006886058', 'Ashley Duffy', NULL, 'Member called and updated CC. Zoho updated', 'Vladislava Terziyska', 'Vladislava Terziyska', '2019-12-02 12:56:37', '2019-12-02 12:56:37'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043971018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028171274', 'Diane Thomason', NULL, 'Member called in and requested that Kelly look up some providers.  She sent her back to me because she wanted to ask how she could change her IUA.  I advised her that the only time that she was able to do that was upon the Group renewal and that she was notified in the summer to do so.  Said she hadn''t received any emails from us since 3/19.  She hung up on me.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-12-02 12:14:05', '2019-12-02 12:14:05'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043964023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011919617', 'Heather Davies', NULL, 'Heather called in and she had a couple questions if 2 certain services are covered as preventative or not. Both things she asked about are not. So I explained to her how it will work with her IUA and Sedera. I sent her the email that explains how to submit your bills to Sedera. I told her exactly how they work and what Sedera does to help out. She also had a Provider for me to look up if they are in network for a colonoscopy. The provider IS in network so she is good to go for that part. I also sent her an email that explains how she is going to present herself to the provider and front desk upon arrival. She understood and thanked me greatly for taking the time to help her out and how quick I was. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-12-02 11:30:20', '2019-12-02 11:30:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043971013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043608315', 'Kyrie Hooton', NULL, 'Proof of DPC Sent', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-12-02 10:41:15', '2019-12-02 10:41:15'),
