  ('zcrm_1579374000043966003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000026639045', 'Carol Schultz', NULL, 'Called Carol to follow-up with her.  I saw she cancelled her plan and I had some notes about her.  She indicated she will probably enroll again after Jan 1, 2020.', 'Ron Patterson', 'Ron Patterson', '2019-12-02 10:03:20', '2019-12-02 10:03:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043964018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015735109', 'Steve Moeller', NULL, 'Called in and said that he is getting bills from his Colonoscopy he had back in Feb. I told him to send me whatever it is that he has and I will let him know if I can use what he has or if I need to have him get the EOB that has the CPT Codes on them and then send it over to someone at ASI to figure out what is going on. When I asked him if he made sure the provider was in network and that he handed them the correct ASI Card he hesitated and said ummmm I am pretty sure. So This may be the case that provider is not in network/and or did not hand the correct card to the front desk upon arrival. I will take a look at what he is going to be sending me. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-12-02 09:36:40', '2019-12-02 09:36:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043964013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000016068140', 'Michele Venne', NULL, 'Emailed Michele the difference between Diagnostic and Preventative. She got billed from an incident where she got hurt and went to the hospital and is being billed for it and she does not know why. I explained to her why and that it is a situation where she pays out of pocket up to her IUA. That it is not going to be covered under her plan as Preventative. I send her the email that explains how she submits her bills to Sedera and I also gave her Sedera''s phone number if she has any other questions about what is Diagnostic and what is not. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-12-02 09:27:04', '2019-12-02 09:27:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043964008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021624144', 'Kim Merryweather', NULL, 'Will have a Welcome Call from Kelly Cheever at 1:45PM today.  Kimberly was much happier and content that she will be able to get this done today. That is all she was looking for and wanted and it was taking a while for her in the past to get one but is very happy she got put in for today because she needs to start making appointments for things and needs the run down of her plan before she can start doing that. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-12-02 09:05:24', '2019-12-02 09:05:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043964003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021624144', 'Kim Merryweather', NULL, 'Called Kimberly and spoke for a few minutes. She really does need the Welcome Call and is very confused on how anything works with her plan. She is mainly needing to speak so someone about Mental Health and what is covered what is not. She is needing to meet with a therapist. She did not go into detail specifically what for. I told her that I would speak with someone and see if they can call you to answer those questions and to have a Welcome Call Today. Kelly Cheever just got back to me and said she can defiantly have a Welcome Call anytime after 1PM Today. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-12-02 09:00:28', '2019-12-02 09:00:28'),
