  ('zcrm_1579374000043854003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005663233', 'Jason Lewis', NULL, 'Jason called in last week and left a message with the Betties'' in regards to a bill that wasn''t getting paid.  Kelly F called him back and left a message, and then I sent an email offering what we can do to help - explaining what is in his sharebox- and also gave Liberty''s info.  Jason has mistaken us for Liberty in the past per notes.  I figure that he found the right number. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-26 11:58:32', '2019-11-26 11:58:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043840018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000041152084', 'David Butler', NULL, 'Member called in wanting to know what to do about some issues that he was having with his knee.  He said that he called teledoc a couple of weeks ago and has been going to some pt appts for it but it does not seem to be resolving.  I told him that he would have to see a provider of his choice and that he would have to come out of pocket his$1500 IUA.  Explained how a need works and submitting a need. - PB', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-11-26 11:56:26', '2019-11-26 11:56:26'),
