  ('zcrm_1579374000043829003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028844054', 'Michael Matz', NULL, 'Member left me a VM on 11/22 after hours requesting that he be reinstated as his other coverage fell through.  I requested something in writing, and was notified by Sedera that he was reinstated.  I will reactivate in RCI portal.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-11-26 07:25:55', '2019-11-26 07:25:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043812018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012024293', 'Brian Johnson', NULL, 'Brian had originally called in frustrated that he was still getting labcorp bills even though he thought that this was already dealt with.  So I sent Nancy at ASI the invoice number and asked if she could look into this.  Then Brian called me back and said that he just found an EOB stating that all was taken care of and that he guesses that the Labcorp billing with slow down and stop. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-25 15:31:06', '2019-11-25 15:31:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043812013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011716785', 'Megan Friday', NULL, 'Crystal Knight called in from a mental health center to figure out what type of coverage Megan son, Finn has for behavioral health.  Crystal was very sweet and you could tell she wanted to help the family as much as I did- she wanted to know about the entire plan- I even pulled the guidelines and sent them to her.  I also gave her Sedera''s phone number.  She told me that "he needed to be admitted" I went over inpatient and out patient services- even including the latest Teladoc services at a discount through Sedera. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-25 15:17:16', '2019-11-25 15:17:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043812008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610515', 'Janice Sherman', NULL, 'called to cancel and sent form- tagged Wendy. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-25 15:02:47', '2019-11-25 15:02:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043812003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034039229', 'Duane Stearns', NULL, 'Duane called in because someone gave him a call from our number- he said he didn''t know why, but maybe his wife sent us an email or something.  Their complaint was Redirect and not having their names on their cards.  I asked if the visit went well...he said it did, but they were blinded by the fact that there was no information on their cards.  (Patti was speaking to Deanna about the same thing at the same time) our advice was, that they needed to call Redirect and ask them about their cards. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-25 14:12:25', '2019-11-25 14:12:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043788031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000034039229', 'Duane Stearns', NULL, 'Member had many specific questions having to do with her care w/Redirect.  Also asked if they would be getting ID cards.  I gave her Redirects phone number - PB', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-11-25 14:04:12', '2019-11-25 14:04:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043788023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000013330064', 'Diane VanWeelden', NULL, 'Member called in asking about the transition to Bowtie.  She has had recomendation from her doc to do a 3D mamogram &amp; ultrasound.  I advised that Sedera would not pay for this only screening mammo.  She told me that this was because they had found something.  I told her what to do and to contact Sedera to ask if she should upload any bills she has.  She expressed to me that she thought that Bowtie was wanting alot of detailed info and she probably would not be using them. - PB', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-11-25 13:53:02', '2019-11-25 13:53:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043783038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028522128', 'Keira Gannon', NULL, 'Member submitted Member change form to add newborn.  I added in RCI Portal and notified Sedera.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-11-25 13:31:12', '2019-11-25 13:31:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043788018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000025330325', 'Carson Calhoun', NULL, 'Carson called in and said that he needed help with making an appointment to go and have his annual wellness exam. I told him exactly what the process is which is, first looking up providers in his are that are General Practitioners with the correct zip code that are in the PHCS MultiPlan Network. Once I have gotten a list set up I will email him with that list attached as a PDF File. He was loving that. I told him there will be a few other emails that I will be sending that will help him really understand what to be and what to say and presenting himself the correct was and to bring his RCI Card, very very important. I also very very very much so stressed that he needs to tell the provider and everyone that will be involved that this visit is strictly Preventative and not Diagnostic!!!! he 100% understood everything that I told him. He was very excited to get this going and the whole 9. I will have to say he is staying pro active and a very very MPowering Member!! hahaha. Anyway he understood everything that he must do and say and will be one it. I told him of there are any issues to cal RCI first if it dealing with Preventative and the number is on the back of his card as well. If he can not get in contact with them he can feel free to call me back here or shoot me an email.  -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-11-25 13:13:35', '2019-11-25 13:13:35'),
