  ('zcrm_1579374000043788013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028130481', 'Gerald Marko', NULL, 'Kelli called and was a little confused because she called me and wanted to cancel on Friday November the 22nd 2019. That was the final day that people could cancel before the payment came out of their account for December coverage. Patti informed me that to tell them to send the cancellation form back to her ASAP!!! and Patti will stop the payment. All of this is what happened, Patti was able to stop the payment and cancelled her. She called in today and said their is a pending transaction for payment from us. I transferred her to Patti and Patti looked her up in FTNI and there is nothing on our end. The last payment that came out was for October 22nd 2019 for November coverage. So Patti told her if it goes through to call her back and she will  take care of it for her. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-11-25 12:32:01', '2019-11-25 12:32:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043788008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005630453', 'Rusty Phillipy', NULL, 'Called in to cancel, he does know that the payment for December just came out today and he said that is fine, he just needs to cancel going forward after December is over. Has no issue with that. Sent the cancellation form.  -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-11-25 12:27:51', '2019-11-25 12:27:51'),
