  ('zcrm_1579374000043704003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011019014', 'Caroline Kava', NULL, 'Refresher Welcome Call Complete.  Caroline had a list of questions at first...I answered them all and then filled in the rest.  I sent many many emails, gave her all important phone numbers- she appreciated it all.  Good call, great member! - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-22 13:50:08', '2019-11-22 13:50:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043694016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043959250', 'Brigitte Fleeman', NULL, '11-22-19 They are joining the HMA $15,000 for $198 monthly right now and starting account today. Brigitte will be primary member since Gary will age out sooner. Joining Provider Directed at $1500/$970.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-22 13:20:53', '2019-11-22 13:28:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043653043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028130481', 'Gerald Marko', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation request I will cancel in RCI, Sedera &amp; FTNI', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2019-11-22 11:47:41', '2019-11-22 11:47:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043671018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000032206031', 'Bryan Tew', NULL, 'Patti briefly spoke with Bryan about Nominating a provider he would like too Nominate and HE had already filled out the form but we do not know how to get access to those. I believe the provider will, if they choose too, will be added to the MultiPlan list and MultiPlan will call us to let us know if they have gotten the form and everything is correct. So in the meantime I looked up providers in his area for an ENT doctor. I sent him the list I found and explained everything in detail how he is going to go about making the appointment and keeping it Preventative and making sure the billing is Coded as Preventative NOT Diagnostic. If it is not a preventative appointment I also explained how he would need to pay out of pocket up to his IUA. Anything after that will be submitted to Sedera. I sent his the How to Submit the bills to Sedera explanation email and in full detail how he goes about that. I also sent him the Wellness Visit Explication email that tell him what to do upon arrival and what card he needs to show the front desk. Hoping everything will work out for him. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-11-22 11:46:29', '2019-11-22 11:46:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043671013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028130481', 'Gerald Marko', NULL, 'Kelli called in to cancel with us, she and her husband now have employer insurance. I did tell her that she needs to get the form back to me ASAP because the payment is going to come out today by 6pm EST for December''s payment coverage. I sent her the cancellation form and will get with Patti because they NEED to get it refunded or transaction stopped 100%. I told Kelli this and that it most likely will not be an issue, if so Patti will call back and get with her or her husband. -KF', 'Kelly Frederickson', 'Kelly Frederickson', '2019-11-22 11:30:23', '2019-11-22 11:30:23'),
