  ('zcrm_1579374000043631013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000042309236', 'Matthew Funke', NULL, 'I reached out to Matthew and offered that he could call in anytime until 9:00 and I would stop whatever I''m doing to give him a welcome call so he could be as up to speed as his wife was.  I never heard back from him. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-21 18:38:06', '2019-11-21 18:38:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043631008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647172', 'Julie Perington', NULL, 'I just sent this to Dania via Slack- can you please pass this along to Julie Perington''s need coordinator?  She called in this evening upset that her ASI card only gave her a minor discount on just about $400 on antibiotics that are being used to treat her daughters newly diagnosed intestinal infection and she thought that all of this would go towards her daughters already open need for mental health.  She thought that she would get reimbursed the money spent on the meds.  I tried to explain to her that there were 2 separate needs, and that she needed to call her needs coordinator tomorrow so that they could walk her through step by step through the process.  But she kinda shirked that idea off...stating that in total the medical bill''s for the infection were not $500 just yet and that when they were she would just upload the bills.  -
KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-21 18:09:26', '2019-11-21 18:09:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043613026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000043959202', 'Diane Elliston', NULL, '11-21-19 Diane is 52 and husband 50 and 3 kids. Spoke with Katie at Nextera and wants to do DPC option. She thinks husband will want stripped down without DPC but she''s vying for DPC. All fees with MPB/Sedera/Nextera will be $935 month vs Redirect at $910. We did not discuss Redirect since she''s on the DPC path. They are LHS members and still not reimbursed for immunization and sprained ankle. Took forever to get money back for ER visit for Noro Virus. She''s done with LHS. Bright Health will cost $1398 mo./$20K year and still crappy coverage. She will share with husband and will call me tomorrow.
Diane worked with Shelley at Pharmaca!!!!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-21 16:38:58', '2019-11-22 10:41:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043631003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005663407', 'Vickie Hoffman', NULL, 'Vickie called in to ask that the $50 fee every month stop.  She tried to say that she shouldn''t have had to pay since Feb of 18, but I explained that she was told via email, and that she could''ve used our services at anytime. She was fine with that, I sent her the form. - KC', 'Kelly Cheever', 'Kelly Cheever', '2019-11-21 16:32:46', '2019-11-21 16:32:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043613021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165362', 'David Blair', NULL, '11-21-19 We just re-enrolled for same plan with Anthem Bronze HSA for $400.38. Dr. Holland is not in any network since Dave lives in Boulder. So, I recommended Dr. John Schutz as a potential for Dave to see and he''s in the Anthem Pathway X network.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-21 16:31:32', '2019-11-21 16:31:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000043613016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044733023', 'Elizabeth Snowden', NULL, '11-21-19 Liz is healthy, no pre-x, 62, exploring all options. Intrigued by this but will email me if/when she wants to proceed. Leaving for 1 week to go to east coast for holiday. Shared the Provider Directed option with her. Nice.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2019-11-21 14:23:48', '2019-11-21 14:23:48'),
